�脢id�f4ef2c4af15b�body�ٖ佐剂本身不是抗原，而是刺激免疫系统、延长抗原暴露并增强炎症反应，从而让疫苗产生更强更持久的抗体应答。٫An adjuvant is not the antigen; it stimulates the immune system, prolongs antigen exposure, and boosts inflammation, yielding a stronger, longer-lasting antibody response.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�f65a9c6991d7�body�ٟ肝脏把葡萄糖转为糖原储存、分解毒素与药物、合成血浆蛋白和胆汁，并通过尿素循环处理氨，是全身代谢的中枢工厂。٫The liver stores glucose as glycogen, breaks down toxins and drugs, makes plasma proteins and bile, and processes ammonia via the urea cycle—a central metabolic factory.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�f9e97c859169�body���前体 mRNA 中的外显子可通过不同组合被保留或切除，一个基因由此产生多种成熟 mRNA 异构体，翻译出结构和功能不同的蛋白质；这是人类蛋白质组复杂度高于基因数量的主要原因。�Exons of a pre-mRNA can be included or skipped in different combinations, yielding multiple mature mRNA isoforms from one gene that translate into proteins with distinct structures and functions—a major reason human proteome complexity exceeds gene count.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�faa9f22bd061�body�ٷ级联中每个活化的酶能激活许多下游分子，信号被逐级放大，使微弱的起始信号产生巨大的细胞反应。这也让机体能快速响应损伤或感染。��In a cascade each activated enzyme activates many downstream molecules, so the signal is amplified at every step, turning a tiny trigger into a large response—letting the body react fast to injury or infection.�ans��src��KAlberts 等,《Molecular Biology of the Cell》第6版,Garland Science,2014�PB. Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell, 6th ed., Garland Science, 2014��id�0186e98faa61�body��d目前已知最早的石器出自肯尼亚Lomekwi 3遗址（约330万年前，早于能人，属独立的Lomekwi工业）；经典的奥杜威（Oldowan）文化约在260万-170万年前出现于东非，通常与能人相关。更精致的阿舍利手斧约176万年前出现，常归因于直立人。用火的最早证据约在100万年前（南非Wonderwerk洞穴的烧焦骨和灰烬），而系统、普遍用火约在40万年前（欧洲多个遗址）。火提供了保暖、防护和烹饪，烹饪提高食物能量密度并缩短消化时间，被认为是驱动脑增大和社会化的关键因素。�
The oldest known stone tools come from Lomekwi 3 in Kenya (about 3.3 million years old, predating Homo habilis, belonging to a distinct pre-Oldowan industry); the classic Oldowan industry appeared in East Africa about 2.6-1.7 million years ago and is usually linked to habilines. More refined Acheulean handaxes appeared around 1.76 million years ago, generally attributed to Homo erectus. The earliest evidence of fire use is about 1 million years old (burnt bones and ash at Wonderwerk Cave, South Africa), with systematic, habitual fire use around 400 thousand years ago (multiple European sites). Fire provided warmth, protection, and cooking; cooking raises the energy density of food and shortens digestion, and is considered a key driver of brain expansion and sociality.�ans��src��kHarmand 等(2015)《Nature》521: Lomekwi 3 石器;Berna 等(2012)《PNAS》109: Wonderwerk 遗址用火。�}Harmand et al. (2015) Nature 521, 310-315 (Lomekwi 3 tools); Berna et al. (2012) PNAS 109(20), E1215-E1220 (Wonderwerk fire).��id�01d38911217b�body���2010年，Svante Pääbo团队发表尼安德特人基因组草图（获2022年诺贝尔生理学或医学奖），显示非洲以外的现代人基因组中含有约1-2%的尼安德特人DNA，证明走出非洲的现代人与尼安德特人发生过混血。丹尼索瓦人基因组（2010年从西伯利亚丹尼索瓦洞穴指骨中测出）显示其基因主要残留在东南亚和大洋洲人群（巴布亚新几内亚人群约含5%）。这些入侵的基因片段影响现代人的免疫系统（如HLA、TLR基因）和高原适应等表型。值得注意的是，尼安德特人的线粒体DNA和Y染色体几乎未在现代人中留下，提示混血主要发生在尼安德特男性与智人女性的方向（或此类谱系受选择淘汰）。�In 2010, Svante Pääbo's team published the Neanderthal genome draft (awarded the 2022 Nobel Prize in Physiology or Medicine), showing that non-African modern humans carry about 1-2% Neanderthal DNA, proof that modern humans leaving Africa interbred with Neanderthals. The Denisovan genome, sequenced in 2010 from a finger bone at Denisova Cave in Siberia, survives mainly in Southeast Asian and Oceanian populations (up to about 5% in Papua New Guineans). These introgressed segments affect modern immunity (e.g., HLA and TLR genes) and phenotypes such as high-altitude adaptation. Notably, Neanderthal mtDNA and Y chromosomes are essentially absent in modern humans, suggesting interbreeding was mainly between Neanderthal males and sapiens females, or that such lineages were selected against.�ans��src��,Science（2010年尼安德特人基因组）�0Science, Green et al. (2010), Neanderthal genome��id�0215cfeed7ac�body��最常用的生物学物种概念认为，物种是能在自然条件下相互交配并产生可育后代的最大种群。地雀的分化典型地体现了异域物种形成：各岛屿之间被海水隔离，不同岛上的种群基因交流被切断，各自积累不同的突变，又因食物不同（种子、仙人掌、昆虫、吸血等）受到不同的选择压力。经过漫长隔离，它们的喙形、取食方式等差异越来越大，最终即使相遇也不能顺利杂交，形成生殖隔离，新的物种就此诞生。�The most common definition, the biological species concept, treats a species as the largest group whose members can interbreed and produce fertile offspring under natural conditions. The finches illustrate allopatric speciation: islands separated by ocean cut off gene flow between populations, so each island's birds accumulated different mutations and faced different selective pressures because food differed, from seeds and cactus to insects and even blood. Over long isolation, differences in beak shape and feeding grew until, even when they met, they could no longer interbreed smoothly, and reproductive isolation made new species.�ans��src�� 《普通生物学》(陈阅增)�General Biology (Chen Yuezeng)��id�0256ba80929c�body���这是 CAM 途径的巧妙设计。白天沙漠高温，气孔若张开会流失大量水分，所以仙人掌白天关闭气孔；到了凉爽的夜晚，气孔张开吸收二氧化碳，并把它固定成苹果酸储存在液泡里。白天气孔关闭时，苹果酸再脱羧释放出二氧化碳，正好供应卡尔文循环合成糖。二氧化碳的“取”与“用”被时间隔开，植物几乎不蒸腾也能完成光合作用，代价是固定同样多的碳需要消耗更多能量。�This is the elegance of CAM photosynthesis. By day the desert is hot, and open stomata would lose huge amounts of water, so cacti close them. On cool nights the stomata open and take in carbon dioxide, which is fixed into malic acid and stored in the vacuole. By day, with stomata shut, the malic acid decarboxylates and releases CO2, feeding the Calvin cycle. Carbon dioxide uptake and use are separated in time, so the plant photosynthesizes with almost no water loss, at the cost of needing more energy to fix the same amount of carbon.�ans��src�� 《普通生物学》(陈阅增)�General Biology (Chen Yuezeng)��id�05946798724d�body��DNA 甲基化、组蛋白修饰等化学标记能在细胞分裂时部分保留，开关基因却不改动碱基序列，并可受营养与环境影响。Bird 在 2002 年综述了 CpG 甲基化如何沉默基因，Wolffe 与 Matzke 1999 年讨论了其可遗传性。�)Marks like DNA methylation and histone modification are partly maintained through cell division, switching genes on or off without altering bases and responding to diet and environment. Bird reviewed how CpG methylation silences genes in 2002; Wolffe and Matzke discussed its heritability in 1999.�ans��src��ZBird 2002 年综述；Wolffe 与 Matzke 1999 年论文；Lodish《分子细胞生物学》�JBird (2002 review); Wolffe & Matzke (1999); Lodish, Molecular Cell Biology��id�06956880fb98�body�ٟHox基因沿胚胎前后轴按顺序排列，决定各体节发育成何种结构，从蝇到人都高度保守，是动物身体蓝图的核心调控基因。٨Hox genes are arrayed along the embryo's head-to-tail axis and specify what each segment becomes; conserved from flies to humans, they are core to the animal body plan.�ans��src��aRichard Dawkins,《The Selfish Gene》Oxford,1976;中译《自私的基因》中信出版社,2012�TR. Dawkins, The Selfish Gene, Oxford University Press, 1976; Chinese ed. CITIC, 2012��id�06c3cca25aba�body��生殖中心分为暗区和亮区：B 细胞在暗区快速分裂，胞苷脱氨酶 AID 在免疫球蛋白可变区引入体细胞高频突变；随后迁移到亮区，与滤泡树突状细胞表面的抗原和滤泡辅助 T 细胞竞争性接触。抗原亲和力高的克隆能捕获更多抗原、获得更强的 T 细胞辅助信号（如 CD40L 与 IL-21），从而被选择性扩增并重新返回暗区继续突变。这种循环相当于活体内的达尔文式定向进化，最终产出高亲和力抗体和记忆细胞。�mGerminal centres are split into a dark zone where B cells divide rapidly while the cytidine deaminase AID introduces somatic hypermutation into immunoglobulin variable regions, and a light zone where the cells compete for antigen displayed on follicular dendritic cells and for help from follicular helper T cells. Clones with higher affinity capture more antigen and receive stronger help signals such as CD40L and IL-21, so they are selectively expanded and cycle back to the dark zone for further mutation. This iterative loop is Darwinian selection inside the body, yielding high-affinity antibodies and memory cells.�ans��src��\Mesin L, Ersching J, Victora GD. Germinal center B cell dynamics. Immunity (2016) 45:471-482�\Mesin L, Ersching J, Victora GD. Germinal center B cell dynamics. Immunity (2016) 45:471-482��id�06d11329101e�body���传统 mRNA 疫苗只递送编码抗原的读框，用完即降解；自扩增 mRNA 用正链 RNA 病毒的复制子，另带复制酶基因，进胞后先造出复制酶，由它大量复制模板，抗原因此表达更久、剂量更低。代价是转录本长得多、纯化更麻烦，复制必经的双链 RNA 也更易触发先天免疫。两者都不进细胞核、不碰基因组，这是它与 DNA 疫苗的分界。�uA conventional mRNA vaccine delivers only the reading frame encoding the antigen, and that transcript is used once before it degrades. Self-amplifying mRNA uses the replicon of a positive-strand RNA virus and carries a replicase gene as well: the cell builds the replicase first, which then copies the template many times, so the antigen lasts longer and a smaller dose suffices. The price is a far longer transcript, fussier purification, and double-stranded RNA intermediates that more easily trigger innate immunity. Neither kind enters the nucleus or touches the genome, and that is where they part company with DNA vaccines.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�0897f671fd03�body���激酶把磷酸基加到目标蛋白上，可改变其形状与活性，从而快速、可逆地开关信号；磷酸酶则去掉磷酸基使其关闭。这种可逆修饰让信号既灵敏又可控。��Kinases add phosphate groups to target proteins, changing their shape and activity to switch signals on; phosphatases remove the phosphate to switch them off. This reversible modification makes signaling both fast and controllable.�ans��src��KAlberts 等,《Molecular Biology of the Cell》第6版,Garland Science,2014�PB. Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell, 6th ed., Garland Science, 2014��id�08cc0cb1516f�body��细菌鞭毛是由鞭毛蛋白构成的旋转螺旋丝，基部有类似马达的基体和质子通道，靠质子动势驱动其像螺旋桨一样旋转，推动菌体前进或翻滚转向。其结构与真核细胞的鞭毛（微管构成、波浪摆动）完全不同。�EA bacterial flagellum is a helical filament of flagellin with a motor-like basal body and proton channel at its base; proton motive force spins it like a propeller to push the cell forward or tumble to change direction. Its design is entirely different from eukaryotic flagella, which are microtubule-based and beat in waves.�ans��src��《微生物学》�Brock Biology of Microorganisms��id�0bac23aea284�body��&经典递质在明确的突触间隙快速、点对点地传递信号；神经调质（如多巴胺、血清素）则由弥散释放，经代谢型受体缓慢而广泛地改变大群神经元的兴奋性与可塑性状态。调质因此更像是「调节背景」，而非传递具体消息。�iClassical transmitters act rapidly and point-to-point across defined synapses, whereas neuromodulators such as dopamine and serotonin are released diffusely and act slowly through metabotropic receptors to broadly shift the excitability and plasticity of neuronal populations. Modulators thus set a regulatory background rather than conveying specific messages.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�0e03e05ca475�body���光反应在类囊体膜上把光能转化为 ATP 和 NADPH 并裂解水放氧，暗反应在基质中利用这两种物质将 CO2 固定为糖类；二者通过质子梯度和能量载体耦合。��Light reactions in the thylakoid membrane convert light to ATP and NADPH and split water releasing oxygen; the dark reactions in the stroma use these to fix CO2 into sugars, the two stages coupled by proton gradients and energy carriers.�ans��src��《生物化学》教材�Lehninger Biochemistry��id�0e3878e17714�body���GPCR被配体结合后，会激活细胞膜内侧的G蛋白，G蛋白再激活或抑制下游效应酶（如腺苷酸环化酶），从而放大并传递信号。约三分之一的西药以GPCR为靶点。��When bound by a ligand, a GPCR activates an intracellular G protein, which then turns downstream effector enzymes (like adenylyl cyclase) on or off, amplifying and passing the signal. Roughly a third of medicines target GPCRs.�ans��src��KAlberts 等,《Molecular Biology of the Cell》第6版,Garland Science,2014�PB. Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell, 6th ed., Garland Science, 2014��id�0f2c8c412636�body���冬眠不是普通的睡觉，而是被主动调低的生理状态：体温设定点下调，心率、呼吸和代谢大幅减速，体温能落到接近环境温度，烧的是入秋前囤下的脂肪。它也不是一觉到春天，中间会周期性短暂醒转，每次醒转都要花掉可观的能量。容易混的是那些每天只降代谢一小段的小型动物，机制相同但持续时间短，一般不叫冬眠。�6Hibernation is not ordinary sleep but a deliberately lowered physiological state: the body's temperature set point drops, heart rate, breathing and metabolism slow sharply, body temperature can fall close to ambient, and the fuel is fat stored before autumn. Nor is it one unbroken sleep until spring—animals briefly arouse now and then, and each arousal burns a substantial amount of energy. The confusing neighbor is the small animal that cuts its metabolism for a short spell each day: same mechanism, much shorter bout, so it is not usually called hibernation.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�0f698cbcb2e4�body�ٱp53在DNA受损时被激活，可暂停细胞周期让DNA修复，或启动凋亡清除无法修复的细胞，从而抑制肿瘤发生。其基因突变常见于多种癌症。٫When DNA is damaged, p53 halts the cycle for repair or triggers apoptosis to remove irreparable cells, suppressing tumors. Mutations in p53 are common across many cancers.�ans��src��KAlberts 等,《Molecular Biology of the Cell》第6版,Garland Science,2014�PB. Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell, 6th ed., Garland Science, 2014��id�102150c69a71�body��U视网膜内含黑视素的神经节细胞把光信息经视网膜下丘脑束传给视交叉上核，使其相位锁定于外界明暗周期。视交叉上核再通过多条通路把时间信号输出：自主神经支配、下丘脑-垂体-肾上腺轴产生的糖皮质激素节律、体温波动以及对进食-活动节律的控制，都能重置外周组织中的同一套时钟基因。由于进食时间是肝脏时钟的强授时因子，白天进食的夜行动物会出现肝脏时钟与视交叉上核相位分离，这解释了不规律进食如何造成组织间的内部失同步。��Melanopsin-containing retinal ganglion cells send light information along the retinohypothalamic tract to the suprachiasmatic nucleus, locking its phase to the external light-dark cycle. The nucleus then broadcasts time through several channels: autonomic innervation, the glucocorticoid rhythm generated via the hypothalamic-pituitary-adrenal axis, body temperature cycles and control of feeding and activity rhythms, all of which can reset the same clock genes in peripheral tissues. Because feeding time is a powerful cue for the liver clock, nocturnal animals fed during the day show hepatic rhythms uncoupled from the suprachiasmatic nucleus, which explains how irregular meal timing creates internal desynchrony between tissues.�ans��src�نMohawk JA, Green CB, Takahashi JS. Central and peripheral circadian clocks in mammals. Annual Review of Neuroscience (2012) 35:445-462نMohawk JA, Green CB, Takahashi JS. Central and peripheral circadian clocks in mammals. Annual Review of Neuroscience (2012) 35:445-462��id�127d41e92298�body���生态位分化指共存的物种在资源利用上产生系统差异：空间分化（同片森林中不同鸟在树冠、树干、地面等不同高度取食）、时间分化（昼夜节律或季节错开活动）、食物分化（取食种子大小、猎物种类不同）、形态分化（达尔文雀喙的大小和形状对应不同食物，加勒比安乐蜥按树干位置、直径和植被类型细分栖息地）。此外，竞争性释放和性状替换（同域分布物种间差异增大）是生态位分化的进化证据。这些分化降低了种间竞争，是解释高多样性共存（如热带雨林）的核心机制。��Niche partitioning means coexisting species systematically differ in resource use: spatial partitioning (birds in the same forest feed at different heights, canopy, trunk, ground), temporal partitioning (activity shifted in time of day or season), food partitioning (different seed sizes or prey types), and morphological partitioning (Darwin's finches differ in beak size and shape for different seeds; Caribbean Anolis lizards subdivide habitats by perch height, diameter, and vegetation type). Competitive release and character displacement, greater divergence where species co-occur, provide evolutionary evidence. Reduced competition through such partitioning is the core mechanism explaining highly diverse coexistence such as in tropical rainforests.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�130f87e54900�body��染色质通过黏连蛋白介导的环挤出在 CTCF 结合位点处停顿，形成拓扑关联结构域，把增强子与目标启动子限制在同一空间隔室内，从而提高有效接触频率。增强子上结合的转录因子与介体复合体一起把 RNA 聚合酶 II 招募到启动子，部分体系还涉及富含内在无序区蛋白的凝聚体，使局部转录因子浓度升高。结构域边界的破坏可让增强子错误劫持邻近基因，这种增强子劫持已在多种发育畸形和肿瘤中被证实。�KCohesin-driven loop extrusion stalls at CTCF sites to create topologically associating domains that confine an enhancer and its target promoter to the same spatial compartment, raising their effective contact frequency. Transcription factors bound at the enhancer work with the Mediator complex to recruit RNA polymerase II to the promoter, and in some systems condensates rich in intrinsically disordered proteins locally concentrate the machinery. Disrupting domain boundaries lets enhancers hijack neighbouring genes, a mechanism documented in developmental malformations and cancers.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�1784d7a5ccc6�body��真社会性指同一物种中繁殖被少数个体垄断、多数成员不育并协作育幼与防御的高度社会组织。裸鼹鼠像蜜蜂一样只有一只"女王"和少数雄鼠繁殖，其余工鼠终生不育、分工挖掘地道，是哺乳动物中少见的真社会案例。�QEusociality is an advanced social system where reproduction is restricted to a few individuals while most members are non-reproductive and cooperate in raising offspring and defense. Like honeybees, naked mole-rats have a single breeding "queen" and a few males; the rest are sterile workers that dig tunnels—a rare case among mammals.�ans��src��aSherman、Jarvis 与 Alexander，《裸鼹鼠生物学》（普林斯顿大学出版社，1991）�aSherman, Jarvis & Alexander, The Biology of the Naked Mole-Rat (Princeton University Press, 1991)��id�17eb4d6ad92e�body��%qPCR在每个扩增循环中同步检测荧光，通过Ct值定量：使用SYBR Green荧光染料（结合双链DNA发光）或TaqMan探针（利用FRET，探针被Taq酶5'到3'外切活性水解后释放荧光）。荧光信号随产物指数增长而增强，达到设定荧光阈值所需的循环数（Ct值）与初始模板拷贝数成反比，模板越多Ct越小。通过与已知浓度标准品作出的标准曲线比较，即可精确定量。若先以RNA为模板用逆转录酶合成cDNA（RT-qPCR），则可检测基因表达水平。��qPCR detects fluorescence at each amplification cycle and quantifies via the cycle threshold: SYBR Green dye, which fluoresces when bound to double-stranded DNA, or a TaqMan probe, a FRET-based probe cleaved by Taq's 5'-to-3' exonuclease activity, reports product accumulation. The number of cycles needed to reach a set fluorescence threshold (Ct value) is inversely proportional to the starting template copy number; more template means a smaller Ct. Comparing against a standard curve from known concentrations gives absolute quantification; using reverse transcriptase to make cDNA from RNA first (RT-qPCR) allows measurement of gene expression.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�1860b5655c6e�body���肾灌注下降时肾脏释放肾素，把血管紧张素原切成血管紧张素 I，再经血管紧张素转化酶（ACE）生成强效缩血管的角 II，升高血压并保钠保水。Guyton 与 Hall 把它列为长期血压调控的核心回路。��Low renal perfusion makes the kidney release renin, cleaving angiotensinogen to angiotensin I, then ACE forms vasoconstrictor angiotensin II, raising pressure and conserving salt and water. Guyton & Hall rank this as the core long-term pressure loop.�ans��src��PGuyton 与 Hall，《医学生理学教科书》（第13版，Elsevier，2016）�HGuyton & Hall, Textbook of Medical Physiology (13th ed., Elsevier, 2016)��id�18a76afe05c0�body�ل生态位是一个物种在环境中的“角色”：它吃什么、被谁吃、何时活动，决定了它如何与环境互动。ُA niche is a species' 'role' in its environment—what it eats, what eats it, and when it is active—defining how it interacts with the world.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�18f89ee5f0d9�body��MHC 分子在细胞表面展示由抗原加工而来的肽段，供 T 细胞识别，相当于「身份展示窗」。MHC I 类向细胞毒性 T 细胞呈递内源抗原，MHC II 类向辅助 T 细胞呈递外源抗原，是启动适应性免疫的关键。�.MHC molecules display peptide fragments from antigen processing on the cell surface for T cells to recognize, acting like identity windows. MHC class I presents endogenous antigens to cytotoxic T cells, and MHC class II presents exogenous antigens to helper T cells, key to launching adaptive immunity.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�1933dd7bdecb�body���C3 为最普遍路径适合温和湿润；C4 在叶肉先固定为四碳化合物再送维管束鞘浓缩 CO2，适应高温强光以减少光呼吸；CAM 植物夜间开孔固定 CO2 白天关闭气孔，适应干旱。�C3 is the common path suiting mild moist climates; C4 first fixes CO2 into four-carbon compounds then concentrates it in bundle-sheath cells to curb photorespiration in hot bright conditions; CAM plants open stomata at night and close them by day to survive arid environments.�ans��src��《植物生理学》教材�Plant Physiology (Taiz)��id�1afd93b2485d�body���胰岛素结合受体后使其自身酪氨酸磷酸化并招募 IRS 蛋白，活化 I 类 PI3K 生成磷脂 PIP3；PIP3 招募 PDK1 与 AKT2 到膜并使 AKT2 被磷酸化激活。AKT2 磷酸化 RabGAP 蛋白 TBC1D4（AS160），解除其对 Rab8a、Rab10 的抑制，使储存 GLUT4 的囊泡沿细胞骨架移动、停靠并与质膜融合，膜上转运体密度上升数倍。肌肉与脂肪组织中该环节的缺陷是胰岛素抵抗的核心表现之一。�BInsulin binding triggers receptor autophosphorylation and recruitment of IRS proteins, activating class I PI3K to generate the lipid PIP3, which brings PDK1 and AKT2 to the membrane where AKT2 is phosphorylated and activated. AKT2 phosphorylates the RabGAP protein TBC1D4, also called AS160, releasing inhibition of Rab8a and Rab10 so that GLUT4 storage vesicles traffic along the cytoskeleton, tether and fuse with the plasma membrane, raising surface transporter density several-fold. Defects at this step in muscle and adipose tissue are a core feature of insulin resistance.�ans��src��aLemmon MA, Schlessinger J. Cell signaling by receptor tyrosine kinases. Cell (2010) 141:1117-1134�aLemmon MA, Schlessinger J. Cell signaling by receptor tyrosine kinases. Cell (2010) 141:1117-1134��id�1b6e27a30e02�body��
候鸟是“多传感器导航系统”。白天它们用太阳的位置和体内生物钟推算方向，夜晚用星座（尤其是北极星附近）导航，还能感知地磁场：眼睛中的隐花色素蛋白可能通过自由基对机制把磁场方向转化为视觉信号，头部、鼻腔也有磁感应结构。此外河流、山脉、海岸线等地理标志和自身记忆也会参与。不同物种侧重不同线索，幼鸟第一年常靠遗传的本能方向飞行，随后在经验中逐步完善路线。�xMigratory birds are multi-sensor navigation systems. By day they steer by the sun's position and their internal clock; by night they use star patterns, especially around Polaris; and they sense Earth's magnetic field, with cryptochrome proteins in the eye possibly converting field direction into a visual signal via a radical-pair mechanism, while structures in the head and nasal area also respond to magnetism. Landmarks such as rivers, mountains and coastlines plus learned memory join in. Different species rely on different cues; first-year birds often fly an inherited compass bearing and refine the route through experience.�ans��src��"Science（鸟类磁感应综述）�'Science (avian magnetoreception review)��id�1bb1878e67cf�body�٣表观基因组编辑用失去切割能力的 Cas 蛋白携带调控因子，在不改动 DNA 字母的前提下开关基因，效果可逆、理论上更安全。٧Epigenome editing uses catalytically dead Cas proteins to carry regulators that switch genes on or off without altering the sequence, reversible and potentially safer.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�1d519ece80b3�body���当神经元受到足够刺激，电压门控钠通道开放使 Na+ 内流、膜快速去极化；随后钾通道开放使 K+ 外流复极，形成一次尖峰。动作电位沿轴突不衰减地传导，其「全或无」特性保证信号可靠传递。�=When a neuron is sufficiently stimulated, voltage-gated sodium channels open and Na+ influx rapidly depolarizes the membrane; then potassium channels open and K+ efflux repolarizes it, producing a spike. The action potential travels along the axon without decay, and its all-or-none nature ensures reliable signaling.�ans��src��《神经科学》�%Principles of Neural Science (Kandel)��id�1ea0e3fd068b�body���基因编辑是用工具（如CRISPR）在基因组特定位置精确修改DNA序列的技术。它能敲除、修正或插入基因，在医学和农业潜力巨大。它也带来伦理和安全上的争议。��Gene editing uses tools like CRISPR to precisely alter DNA at specific genome locations. It can delete, correct, or insert genes, with huge potential in medicine and agriculture. It also raises ethical and safety debates.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�1f3e7d1c8aab�body���基因驱动借助 CRISPR 在杂合个体中把目标等位基因复制到同源染色体上，使子代几乎全部携带该基因，从而让性状在野生群体中快速扩散，也带来生态伦理风险。��A gene drive uses CRISPR to copy the target allele onto the homologous chromosome in heterozygotes, so nearly all offspring inherit it, spreading a trait rapidly through wild populations and raising ecological-ethics concerns.�ans��src��Nature Biotechnology�Nature Biotechnology��id�1fb3363fec33�body��`常用框架是推-拉-阻：上调前体供应形成推力，增强目标途径关键酶或引入高活性异源酶形成拉力，敲除或弱化竞争性支路减少流失。与之配套的是辅因子与能量平衡，例如调整 NADPH 与 NADH 的再生途径以匹配目标反应的还原力需求，以及控制乙酰辅酶 A 与 ATP 的供给。由于中间体积累常带来毒性和代谢负担，工程上还使用动态调控开关、群体感应控制的分阶段表达和途径酶的空间共定位。最后需要在发酵条件下迭代优化并借助基因组尺度模型指导靶点选择。��A common framework is push-pull-block: increase precursor supply to push flux, strengthen key pathway enzymes or add highly active heterologous ones to pull it, and delete or weaken competing branches to block losses. This is paired with cofactor and energy balancing, for instance retuning NADPH and NADH regeneration to match the reductive demand of the target reaction and managing acetyl-CoA and ATP supply. Because accumulating intermediates cause toxicity and metabolic burden, engineers add dynamic regulatory switches, quorum-sensing staged expression and spatial co-localization of pathway enzymes. Finally, targets are refined iteratively under real fermentation conditions with guidance from genome-scale models.�ans��src��cNielsen, Keasling,《Engineering Cellular Metabolism》,Cell,2016 (DOI: 10.1016/j.cell.2016.02.004)�aNielsen, Keasling, 'Engineering Cellular Metabolism', Cell, 2016, DOI: 10.1016/j.cell.2016.02.004��id�2000346ff468�body�ف减数分裂产生染色体减半的精子和卵子，受精后恢复原数，既保证染色体稳定又制造遗传多样性。ٗMeiosis makes sperm and eggs with half the chromosomes; fertilization restores the number, keeping chromosomes stable while creating genetic diversity.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�213cf0130390�body���红皇后假说认为，物种必须不断进化以应对竞争者、猎物和病原体的同步变化，才能维持相对地位。就像红皇后所说，必须不停奔跑才能留在原地。它常用于解释有性繁殖和军备竞赛式进化。�7The Red Queen hypothesis says species must keep evolving just to maintain their relative standing against competitors, prey, and pathogens that are also changing. As the Red Queen put it, one must run constantly just to stay in place. It is often used to explain sexual reproduction and evolutionary arms races.�ans��src��aRichard Dawkins,《The Selfish Gene》Oxford,1976;中译《自私的基因》中信出版社,2012�TR. Dawkins, The Selfish Gene, Oxford University Press, 1976; Chinese ed. CITIC, 2012��id�21625b0c8cdd�body��6嗅觉受体由人类基因组中最大的基因家族之一编码（约400个功能基因），每个嗅觉感觉神经元只表达一种受体，气味分子与受体结合后通过G蛋白激活cAMP信号通路，使神经元发放动作电位。表达同一种受体的神经元把轴突汇聚到嗅球中特定的嗅小球，形成一受体一小球的拓扑图谱。不同气味激活不同受体组合，大脑以组合编码的方式识别海量气味。此外嗅觉神经元是少数能终身再生的感觉神经元，并具有敏锐的浓度分辨能力。��Olfactory receptors are encoded by one of the largest gene families in the human genome (about 400 functional genes). Each olfactory sensory neuron expresses only one receptor; odorant binding activates the G-protein-cAMP pathway and generates action potentials. Neurons expressing the same receptor project their axons to a specific glomerulus in the olfactory bulb, producing a one-receptor-one-glomerulus topographic map. Different odorants activate different combinations of receptors, and the brain decodes countless odors by combinatorial coding. Olfactory neurons are among the few sensory neurons that regenerate throughout life, and the system can resolve small concentration differences.�ans��src�ٜBuck, Axel,《A novel multigene family may encode odorant receptors: A molecular basis for odor recognition》,Cell,1991 (DOI: 10.1016/0092-8674(91)90418-x)ٚBuck, Axel, 'A novel multigene family may encode odorant receptors: A molecular basis for odor recognition', Cell, 1991, DOI: 10.1016/0092-8674(91)90418-x��id�21836ff07d21�body���分子钟利用 DNA 或蛋白质序列以近似恒定的速率积累中性突变，通过比对两个类群的遗传差异来推算它们分开的年代。再用已知年代的化石校准速率，就能为缺乏化石记录的类群构建时间树。�0A molecular clock uses the roughly constant rate at which neutral mutations accumulate in DNA or proteins; by comparing genetic differences between two groups, it estimates when they split. Calibrating the rate with fossils of known age lets researchers build timed trees even for groups lacking fossils.�ans��src��《进化生物学》�Evolution (Futuyma)��id�22281f674b53�body��级联中每一级激酶需要在两个位点被双磷酸化才充分活化，这种多位点需求产生了类似协同结合的超敏性，理论上单级的希尔系数可达 1.7 左右，三级串联后总体响应曲线变得很陡。当磷酸化酶与去磷酸化酶都接近饱和时还会出现零级超敏，进一步锐化阈值。若再叠加下游到上游的正反馈，如卵母细胞成熟中的 Mos-MEK-MAPK 环路，系统就获得双稳态并把渐变刺激转化为全或无的细胞命运决定。�\Each kinase in the cascade must be phosphorylated at two sites for full activation, and this multisite requirement generates ultrasensitivity analogous to cooperative binding, with a single tier reaching an effective Hill coefficient near 1.7 and three tiers in series producing a much steeper overall curve. When kinase and phosphatase both operate near saturation, zero-order ultrasensitivity sharpens the threshold further. Adding feedback from downstream to upstream, as in the Mos-MEK-MAPK loop of oocyte maturation, confers bistability and turns a graded stimulus into an all-or-none fate decision.�ans��src��uHuang CY, Ferrell JE Jr. Ultrasensitivity in the mitogen-activated protein kinase cascade. PNAS (1996) 93:10078-10083�uHuang CY, Ferrell JE Jr. Ultrasensitivity in the mitogen-activated protein kinase cascade. PNAS (1996) 93:10078-10083��id�2473515551e7�body���复眼由许多小眼拼成半球，每个看一小块，合起来视野近360°。仿生“复眼相机”用大量微型透镜阵列，可一次拍极广角、几乎不变形，适合监控、全景和机器人视觉。�A compound eye packs many ommatidia into a hemisphere, each seeing a slice for near-360° view. Biomimetic “compound-eye cameras” use dense micro-lens arrays for ultra-wide, near-distortion-free shots—great for surveillance, panoramas and robot vision.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�249534a9a55c�body���真社会性昆虫如蚂蚁、蜜蜂和白蚁，具有合作育幼、世代重叠和明确分工的繁殖阶层。群体中多数个体不育，专职照顾少数能繁殖的蚁后。这种高度合作在进化上极具优势。�Eusocial insects such as ants, bees, and termites show cooperative brood care, overlapping generations, and a clear reproductive division of labor. Most members are sterile and dedicated to caring for a few reproductive queens. This intense cooperation is a major evolutionary advantage.�ans��src��R吴相钰 等 编,《陈阅增普通生物学》第4版,高等教育出版社,2014�VWu Xiangyu et al., Chen Yuezeng General Biology, 4th ed., Higher Education Press, 2014��id�256ac7926502�body�ل左右脑确有大致侧重：左脑多管语言逻辑，右脑多管空间与面孔识别，但多数任务由两侧协同完成。َThe hemispheres do lean differently—left often handles language and logic, right handles space and faces—but most tasks use both together.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�25750318d1bc�body���显性描述同一基因座等位基因间的关系，而上位效应是一个基因座的基因产物掩盖或修饰另一基因座的表达，例如决定小鼠毛色的多个基因座相互作用，属于基因间的非加性关系。��Dominance describes allele interactions at one locus, whereas epistasis is when one locus masks or modifies the expression of another—such as multiple coat-color loci in mice interacting—representing non-additive inter-gene relationships.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�25eb566ee5e9�body��~基因组是一个生物体内全部遗传信息的总和，包括所有基因和非编码DNA，决定了它的全部潜能。�A genome is the complete set of an organism's genetic information—all genes and non-coding DNA—defining its full potential.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�272cff5210a5�body��MHC I 类分子主要装载由蛋白酶体降解的胞内蛋白多肽，经 TAP 转运进内质网后提呈给 CD8 阳性细胞毒性 T 细胞；MHC II 类分子在内体溶酶体区室装载外源蛋白降解产物，提呈给 CD4 阳性辅助 T 细胞。交叉提呈是树突状细胞把摄取的外源抗原导入 MHC I 通路的能力，使免疫系统即使自身未被病毒感染或未表达肿瘤抗原，也能启动细胞毒性 T 细胞反应。这一机制是治疗性肿瘤疫苗和多数病毒疫苗诱导 CD8 反应的基础。�pMHC class I molecules mainly load peptides from proteasome-degraded cytosolic proteins, delivered into the endoplasmic reticulum by TAP and shown to CD8-positive cytotoxic T cells, whereas class II molecules load fragments of exogenous proteins in endolysosomal compartments for CD4-positive helper T cells. Cross-presentation is the ability of dendritic cells to route internalized exogenous antigen into the class I pathway, so cytotoxic responses can be primed even when the presenting cell is not itself infected or transformed. This route underlies CD8 priming by most viral vaccines and by therapeutic cancer vaccines.�ans��src��mJaneway 等，《免疫生物学：健康与疾病中的免疫系统》（第9版，Garland Science，2016）�gJaneway et al., Immunobiology: The Immune System in Health and Disease (9th ed., Garland Science, 2016)��id�288d21888e8f�body���生态演替是群落随时间逐步更替的过程，可分为原生和次生演替。例如火山岩上从无生命到长出地衣、苔藓，再到草本和森林，是原生演替。森林火灾后的恢复则属于次生演替。�,Ecological succession is the gradual replacement of communities over time, divided into primary and secondary types. On bare volcanic rock, life begins with lichens and mosses, then grasses and eventually forest, an example of primary succession. Recovery after a forest fire is secondary succession.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�297015125776�body�ه免疫系统由白细胞、抗体等组成，能识别并消灭入侵的细菌、病毒，并形成记忆以更快应对再次入侵。ٗThe immune system uses white blood cells and antibodies to identify and destroy invading bacteria and viruses, and remembers them for faster responses.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�2a0c3ea94113�body�ٽ基因驱动在减数分裂时强制把编辑过的等位基因拷贝到同源染色体上，使某基因以接近 100%（而非 50%）的概率传给后代，可用来抑制蚊媒疾病。ٺA gene drive biases inheritance so an edited allele reaches nearly 100% of offspring instead of the expected 50%, potentially suppressing disease-carrying mosquitoes across a population.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�2ef658cc7fcf�body���孤雌生殖的要害不是没有父亲，而是卵子在精子未进入时被激活，启动了本来要靠受精才触发的分裂程序，染色体数目再由减数分裂产物的退回或相互融合补回二倍体。后代基因只出自单一母本，省了求偶开销，蚜虫、竹节虫以及部分蜥蜴和鲨鱼都走这条路。别把它当克隆：补回二倍体的方式决定子女是否相同，重组仍会让同母的子女有差异。�ZThe crux of parthenogenesis is not the absence of a father but the activation of an egg without sperm entering it, switching on the division programme that fertilization would normally trigger, with the chromosome number restored to diploid by retaining or fusing the products of meiosis. The young carry genes from one mother only and skip the cost of courtship, which is why aphids, stick insects and some lizards and sharks take this route. Do not mistake it for cloning: how diploidy is restored decides whether the offspring are alike, and recombination still makes the young of one mother differ.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�3016605c6a9c�body�ل位置细胞在动物到达特定地点时放电，网格细胞提供六边形的空间坐标，二者合作编码位置与导航。�~Place cells fire at specific locations while grid cells provide hexagonal coordinates, together encoding space and navigation.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�302379079ab3�body��T高斯将大草履虫和双小核草履虫混合培养在单一有限资源的培养基中，结果竞争力较弱的大草履虫趋于灭绝，而单独培养时两者都能正常存活，由此提出竞争排斥原理：生态位完全重叠的两个物种不能在同一环境中长期共存。Lotka-Volterra竞争模型给出共存条件：当每个物种的种内竞争强度大于其对另一物种的种间竞争时，两物种可稳定共存。实际群落中物种通过生态位分化（资源分割）弱化竞争，使多样性得以维持，如潮间带藤壶按潮位分层分布。��When Gause cultured Paramecium aurelia and P. caudatum together on a single limited resource, the poorer competitor (P. caudatum) tended to go extinct, though either species alone thrived, leading to the competitive exclusion principle: two species with identical niches cannot coexist indefinitely in the same environment. The Lotka-Volterra competition model shows that coexistence is stable when each species' intraspecific competition exceeds its interspecific effect on the other. In real communities, species reduce competition through niche differentiation (resource partitioning), e.g., barnacles on the shore stratify by tidal level, sustaining diversity.�ans��src��-《普通生物学》(陈阅增) 种间关系�1Nature Education, competitive exclusion principle��id�305c28571076�body�٨Bcl-2家族含促凋亡与抗凋亡成员，它们在线粒体外膜上竞争，决定线粒体外膜通透性，从而控制细胞色素c释放和凋亡是否启动。��The Bcl-2 family has pro- and anti-apoptotic members that compete at the mitochondrial outer membrane, controlling permeability and thereby whether cytochrome c is released to start apoptosis.�ans��src��KAlberts 等,《Molecular Biology of the Cell》第6版,Garland Science,2014�PB. Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell, 6th ed., Garland Science, 2014��id�326af174e029�body��血脑屏障由脑毛细血管内皮细胞间紧密连接及周细胞、星形胶质细胞共同构成，限制大多数大分子、病原体和药物进入脑组织。它保护神经元免受血液波动和毒素干扰，但也给中枢神经药物递送带来挑战。�FThe blood-brain barrier is formed by tight junctions between brain capillary endothelial cells together with pericytes and astrocyte end-feet, restricting most large molecules, pathogens, and drugs from entering brain tissue. It shields neurons from blood-borne fluctuations and toxins but challenges drug delivery to the CNS.�ans��src��《神经科学》�%Principles of Neural Science (Kandel)��id�36c3a83c43e0�body�ٹ检查点由CDK与周期蛋白驱动，在G1/S、G2/M等节点核查DNA是否完整、复制是否完成，不合格就令细胞停滞或进入凋亡，避免把错误传给子细胞。��Checkpoints, driven by CDKs and cyclins, verify DNA integrity and replication completion at points like G1/S and G2/M; if flawed, the cell stalls or dies rather than passing errors to daughters.�ans��src��KAlberts 等,《Molecular Biology of the Cell》第6版,Garland Science,2014�PB. Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell, 6th ed., Garland Science, 2014��id�37ed797034c3�body��实验显示同株根系相遇时不改变生长方向，而异株相遇会回避，表明植物通过根系分泌物的化学指纹识别亲缘。涉及的信号可能包括根际黄酮类与挥发物，以及由自交不亲和相关通路调控的识别机制。�aExperiments show roots of the same plant do not alter growth when meeting, while roots from different individuals avoid each other, indicating plants recognize kinship via chemical fingerprints in root exudates. Candidate signals include rhizosphere flavonoids and volatiles, with recognition partly governed by pathways related to self-incompatibility.�ans��src��iDudley & File,《Kin recognition in an annual plant》,Biology Letters,2007 (DOI: 10.1098/rsbl.2007.0232)�gDudley & File, 'Kin recognition in an annual plant', Biology Letters, 2007, DOI: 10.1098/rsbl.2007.0232��id�37f98120fbb6�body��.固氮酶的铁硫簇和铁钼辅因子会被氧不可逆破坏，但把氮气还原为铵每分子需要十六个 ATP，必须靠类菌体的氧化磷酸化供能，因此需要极低但不为零的氧浓度。根瘤通过皮层的氧扩散屏障把内部游离氧压降到纳摩尔量级，并用高丰度的豆血红蛋白结合氧、以极高的通量把氧输送给类菌体的高亲和力末端氧化酶。此外根瘤菌自身还通过 FixL-FixJ 等氧感应系统在低氧下才诱导固氮基因表达，从而在时空上把耗氧与固氮分开。��The iron-sulfur clusters and iron-molybdenum cofactor of nitrogenase are irreversibly damaged by oxygen, yet reducing one molecule of dinitrogen to ammonium consumes about sixteen ATP that must come from bacteroid oxidative phosphorylation, so the enzyme needs an oxygen level that is very low but not zero. Nodules impose a cortical oxygen diffusion barrier that holds free oxygen in the infected zone at nanomolar levels, while abundant leghemoglobin binds oxygen and delivers it at high flux to high-affinity terminal oxidases of the bacteroid. Rhizobia additionally use oxygen sensors such as FixL-FixJ so that nitrogen fixation genes are induced only under microaerobic conditions, separating respiration from fixation in space and time.�ans��src���Ott T 等,《Symbiotic Leghemoglobins Are Crucial for Nitrogen Fixation in Legume Root Nodules but Not for General Plant Growth and Development》,Current Biology,2005 (DOI: 10.1016/j.cub.2005.01.042)��T. Ott et al., 'Symbiotic Leghemoglobins Are Crucial for Nitrogen Fixation in Legume Root Nodules but Not for General Plant Growth and Development', Current Biology, 2005, DOI: 10.1016/j.cub.2005.01.042��id�38fab03d7754�body���这叫性别逆转，由社会结构和激素调控。例如小丑鱼群里只有最大雌鱼和一只雄鱼繁殖，雌鱼死后，最大的雄鱼会转变为雌鱼；环境信号通过激素重写生殖腺，而非改DNA。��It's sex reversal controlled by social structure and hormones. In clownfish, only the largest female and one male breed; if she dies, the biggest male turns female. Environmental cues rewrite the gonad via hormones, not DNA.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�38feeacd939a�body���关键种虽数量不多，却对群落结构影响巨大；如海獭捕食海胆、保护海带林，一旦消失食物链便崩塌。Paine 在 1969 年《自然》中用移除实验首次定量证明关键种的存在。��A keystone species, though few in number, strongly shapes the community; sea otters eat urchins and protect kelp forests, and removal collapses the food web. Paine first demonstrated this quantitatively by removal experiments in Nature (1969).�ans��src��;Paine 1969 年《自然》论文；Begon 等《生态学》�+Paine (1969, Nature); Begon et al., Ecology��id�3d334375789c�body�ٓ显性基因在杂合时即可表现性状，隐性基因需成对出现才表现；例如两个携带者可能生下表现出隐性病的孩子。�wA dominant allele shows its trait even with one copy, while a recessive allele shows only when both copies are present.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�3d485e3c84e8�body���过度活跃的免疫细胞释放大量促炎细胞因子，引发全身炎症、血管渗漏和多器官衰竭，常见于重症流感和某些冠状病毒感染，是致死的重要原因。��Hyperactivated immune cells release massive pro-inflammatory cytokines, causing systemic inflammation, vascular leakage and multi-organ failure, seen in severe flu and some coronavirus infections and a major cause of death.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�3f872e595584�body��受精卵是最全能的“干细胞”，它反复分裂并逐渐“决定”命运：在分裂和发育中，不同的细胞开启不同的基因、关闭另一些基因，通过转录因子和表观遗传修饰固定各自的表达模式，于是分化成神经、肌肉、皮肤等两百多种细胞。成体干细胞则负责日常更新，比如造血干细胞每天产生数以千亿计的血细胞。分化方向的“锁定”使成体细胞难以互换，这是组织再生和移植中的核心难题。��The fertilized egg is the ultimate totipotent stem cell. As it divides and develops, different cells switch on some genes and silence others; transcription factors and epigenetic modifications lock in each cell's expression pattern, driving differentiation into over two hundred cell types such as neurons, muscle and skin. Adult stem cells handle routine renewal, with bone-marrow stem cells, for instance, producing on the order of a hundred billion blood cells every day. Because differentiation locks cells into their fates, adult cells can hardly swap identities, which is the central challenge in tissue regeneration and transplantation.�ans��src��h《How does a fertilized egg develop?》,Nature Reports Stem Cells,2007 (DOI: 10.1038/stemcells.2007.13)�e'How does a fertilized egg develop?', Nature Reports Stem Cells, 2007, DOI: 10.1038/stemcells.2007.13��id�41a3ebab5280�body���放射性同位素示踪技术（如用碳-14 标记）后来成为研究代谢通路、DNA 复制和医学影像的基石，而射线本身也发展出放疗等医学手段，源头都来自放射化学。پRadioisotope tracing (e.g. carbon-14 labeling) became foundational for studying metabolism, DNA replication and medical imaging, and radiation spawned radiotherapy—roots in radiochemistry.�ans��src��?Curie（居里夫人），《放射性物质研究》（1903）�:Curie, 'Recherches sur les substances radioactives' (1903)��id�4247bfcffea8�body��,定向选择把群体均值推向某极端（如工业黑化让蛾子变黑）；稳定选择保留中间型、淘汰两端（如人类出生体重适中最佳）；分裂选择同时偏好两端、中间型吃亏，可能促成新种形成。三者描述了自然选择塑造性状的不同方式。�PDirectional selection shifts the mean toward one extreme (industrial melanism darkening moths); stabilizing selection keeps the intermediate and culls both ends (optimal human birth weight); disruptive selection favors both extremes over the middle and may spark speciation. They describe different ways natural selection shapes traits.�ans��src��aRichard Dawkins,《The Selfish Gene》Oxford,1976;中译《自私的基因》中信出版社,2012�TR. Dawkins, The Selfish Gene, Oxford University Press, 1976; Chinese ed. CITIC, 2012��id�42b3657bf5f9�body��单细胞祖先通过细胞黏附与分工、并保留遗传同一性，逐步聚成多细胞体；领鞭毛虫等现代近亲显示单细胞与多细胞间的过渡形态。King 等在 2015 年《自然》中报道了近多细胞动物的基因组特征。�Single-celled ancestors gradually formed multicellular bodies via adhesion and division of labor while keeping genetic identity; modern relatives like choanoflagellates show intermediate forms. King et al. reported near-animal genomic features in Nature (2015).�ans��src��2King 等《自然》2015；Campbell《生物学》�-King et al., Nature (2015); Campbell, Biology��id�4465718980b2�body���这些古老类群在地球气候剧变中于多数地区灭绝，却因中国地形复杂、避难所多（如横断山、华中山地）而留存零星种群。水杉曾被认为已灭绝，1940年代才在湖北利川重新发现活植株。�These ancient lineages vanished elsewhere during climate upheavals but survived in scattered refugia thanks to China's complex terrain (Hengduan, central mountains). Metasequoia was thought extinct until living trees were found in Lichuan, Hubei in the 1940s.�ans��src��lHu,《How Metasequoia, the "Living Fossil," Was Discovered in China》,Arnoldia,1998 (DOI: 10.5962/p.251370)�jHu, 'How Metasequoia, the "Living Fossil," Was Discovered in China', Arnoldia, 1998, DOI: 10.5962/p.251370��id�4543b76f234e�body��不同虎鲸族群拥有各自独特的呼叫声和捕猎歌诀，并通过母子代际相传，构成类似“文化”的非基因传统。这种声学方言能帮助族群相互识别、维持社会纽带。研究把它视为动物社会学习的典型案例。�Different orca clans have distinct calls and hunting songs passed from mother to calf, forming non-genetic traditions akin to culture. These acoustic dialects help clans recognize each other and maintain social bonds. Researchers treat it as a flagship case of animal social learning.�ans��src��A尚玉昌,《动物行为学》第2版,北京大学出版社,2010�FShang Yuchang, Animal Behavior, 2nd ed., Peking University Press, 2010��id�456902a53148�body���称它为化工厂，是因为肝细胞同时开着合成与分解两条线：餐后把葡萄糖聚成糖原，空腹时再放回血糖；氨基酸脱下的氨在这里转成尿素；脂溶性毒物经氧化并结合上极性基团，才能随尿或胆汁排走。与化工厂的共同点在于原料和产品都靠血流这条管道进出，细胞只是反应车间。分工要分清：尿素在肝合成却由肾排出，肌糖原储量更大却不能直接补血糖。��It is called a chemical factory because a liver cell runs synthesis and breakdown side by side: after a meal it links glucose into glycogen, and between meals it returns that glucose to the blood; ammonia stripped from amino acids is converted into urea here; fat-soluble toxins are oxidized and then coupled to polar groups so they can leave with urine or bile. The likeness to a factory is that raw materials and products both move through the blood while the cell is only the reaction vessel. Note the division of labour: urea is made in the liver but excreted by the kidney, and muscle stores more glycogen yet cannot directly restore blood sugar.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�45a4027672b0�body���血红蛋白四个亚基结合氧后构象变化提高其余亚基亲和力，使在肺部迅速饱和、在组织中又因构象转变易于释放，呈 S 形氧合曲线，实现高效装载与卸载。ٻBinding of O2 to one subunit induces a conformation that raises the affinity of the others, giving an S-shaped curve that loads O2 rapidly in the lungs and releases it readily in tissues.�ans��src��《生物化学》教材�Lehninger Biochemistry��id�4613a5659c10�body���头足类皮肤布满色素细胞、虹彩细胞和乳头状突起，由神经系统直接控制，可在不到一秒内扩张或收缩色素囊、改变反光与纹理以匹配背景。它们甚至能透过皮肤感光，实现极快的伪装。�=Cephalopod skin is packed with chromatophores, iridophores, and papillae controlled directly by the nervous system, letting them expand or contract pigment sacs and alter reflection and texture in under a second to match the background. They can even sense light through the skin, enabling remarkably fast camouflage.�ans��src��XHanlon 与 Messenger，《头足类行为》（第2版，剑桥大学出版社，2018）�THanlon & Messenger, Cephalopod Behaviour (2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2018)��id�47caf7175ca2�body�ٮ先导编辑借助逆转录酶和一段引导 RNA 模板，可在不切断双链的情况下实现插入、删除以及全部 12 种碱基替换，脱靶更少且更灵活。ٴPrime editing uses a reverse transcriptase and an RNA template to make insertions, deletions, and all 12 base conversions without double-strand breaks, with fewer off-target edits.�ans��src��yAnzalone AV et al. Search-and-replace genome editing without double-strand breaks or donor DNA. Nature (2019) 576:149-157�yAnzalone AV et al. Search-and-replace genome editing without double-strand breaks or donor DNA. Nature (2019) 576:149-157��id�47fae00f0ef0�body��O青蒿素原本依赖从黄花蒿中提取，产量受种植面积和年际波动影响，价格不稳。研究者在酿酒酵母中重构甲羟戊酸途径以增强法尼基焦磷酸供应，引入青蒿的紫穗槐二烯合酶和细胞色素 P450 CYP71AV1 等基因，把发酵产物青蒿酸滴度提高到二十五克每升级别，再经化学光氧化转化为青蒿素。这一工作证明多基因异源途径可以在工业规模上稳定运行，把植物次生代谢产物的供应从农业条件中解耦，也成为后续萜类、生物碱等天然产物生物制造的模板。��Artemisinin was originally extracted from Artemisia annua, so supply and price fluctuated with planting area and season. Researchers rebuilt the mevalonate pathway in Saccharomyces cerevisiae to boost farnesyl pyrophosphate supply, introduced plant genes including amorphadiene synthase and the cytochrome P450 CYP71AV1, and raised fermentation titres of artemisinic acid to the twenty-five grams per litre range before converting it to artemisinin by chemical photooxidation. The work showed that a multigene heterologous pathway can run reliably at industrial scale, decoupling a plant secondary metabolite from agricultural conditions, and it became a template for biomanufacturing of other terpenoids and alkaloids.�ans��src��uPaddon CJ 等. High-level semi-synthetic production of the potent antimalarial artemisinin. Nature (2013) 496:528-532�wPaddon CJ et al. High-level semi-synthetic production of the potent antimalarial artemisinin. Nature (2013) 496:528-532��id�4899037e8a8c�body�ِ钾通道用精确排布的羰基氧原子模拟水合钾离子的大小，只放行钾而排斥较小的钠，靠尺寸与配位实现选择。�|K+ channels mimic the hydration shell with precisely placed oxygens, selecting K+ over smaller Na+ by size and coordination.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�49c021749e18�body���雪豹是高山食物链的顶端捕食者，控制岩羊、北山羊等食草动物数量，间接保护高山植被不被过度啃食。它行踪隐秘、数量稀少，是高山生态健康的“指示物种”。��The snow leopard is an apex predator of alpine chains, controlling herbivores like blue sheep so vegetation isn't overgrazed. Elusive and rare, it's an “indicator species” of alpine ecosystem health.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�4ac13ad2a2b7�body���地方品种是在特定气候土壤中长期驯化形成的，携带适应本地病虫害和气候的独特基因；现代化推广少数高产品种会使这些遗传资源流失，削弱未来育种的缓冲能力。��Landraces are locally adapted over centuries, carrying unique genes for regional pests and climate; promoting a few modern varieties erodes this genetic resource and weakens future breeding resilience.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�4b71721ba1ca�body��体液免疫由 B 细胞分泌抗体在体液中清除胞外病原体；细胞免疫由 T 细胞（尤其细胞毒性 T 细胞）直接识别并杀伤被感染的自身细胞或癌细胞。两者相互配合，分别应对「外面」和「里面」的威胁。�.Humoral immunity relies on B cells secreting antibodies in body fluids to clear extracellular pathogens, while cellular immunity uses T cells, especially cytotoxic T cells, to directly recognize and kill infected or cancerous self-cells. The two arms cooperate against threats outside and inside cells.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�4c132276b582�body���当血容量或血压降低，肾脏释放肾素，启动血管紧张素Ⅱ生成，使血管收缩并刺激醛固酮分泌，促进钠和水重吸收，从而升高血容量与血压。这套激素级联是机体维持循环稳态的核心回路之一。�*When blood volume or pressure drops, the kidneys release renin, initiating angiotensin II formation, which constricts vessels and stimulates aldosterone secretion to boost sodium and water reabsorption, raising blood volume and pressure. This hormonal cascade is central to circulatory homeostasis.�ans��src��IBoron 与 Boulpaep，《医学生理学》（第3版，Elsevier，2017）�>Boron & Boulpaep, Medical Physiology (3rd ed., Elsevier, 2017)��id�4c76db508b48�body��次生代谢物（如生物碱、黄酮、萜类）并非植物生长发育所必需，却在防御草食动物、吸引传粉者、抗逆中扮演关键角色。许多还是药物来源（如青蒿素、吗啡），是植物与环境互作的化学校兵器。�2Secondary metabolites such as alkaloids, flavonoids, and terpenes are not required for basic growth yet play key roles in defense against herbivores, attracting pollinators, and stress tolerance. Many are drug sources, artemisinin, morphine, serving as plants' chemical tools in environmental interactions.�ans��src��《植物学》�Campbell Biology��id�4d7a79091ba6�body��!光系统 II 利用光能从水中夺取电子，经 Kok 循环（放氧复合体）每四次周转放出一分子 O₂，并把质子泵入类囊体腔建立跨膜梯度。Barber 在 2009 年综述了放氧中心的结构机理，Taiz 与 Zeiger 的《植物生理学》作系统讲解。�Photosystem II uses light to pull electrons from water; the Kok cycle (oxygen-evolving complex) releases one O₂ every four turnovers and pumps protons into the thylakoid lumen. Barber reviewed the OEC structure in 2009; Taiz & Zeiger explain it in 'Plant Physiology'.�ans��src��HTaiz 与 Zeiger《植物生理学》；Barber 2009 年《化学评论》�@Taiz & Zeiger, Plant Physiology; Barber (2009, Chemical Reviews)��id�4ef8954a33d2�body��猫有翻正反射能在空中调整姿态四脚着地，且体态较轻、终端速度较低、落地时肌肉松弛可分散冲击；研究确实发现伤情在一定高度内随高度上升而加重，超过某临界后反而略缓，但高楼坠落仍极危险。��Cats have a righting reflex to land feet-first, are light with a lower terminal velocity, and relax muscles to spread impact; studies even show injury risk rises with height then plateaus above a threshold, yet high-rise falls remain very dangerous.�ans��src��6Journal of the American Veterinary Medical Association�JAVMA��id�512d11136693�body��K表面活性物质由Ⅱ型肺泡细胞分泌，主要成分是二棕榈酰磷脂酰胆碱（DPPC）等磷脂和表面活性蛋白，覆盖在肺泡内表面的液膜上，降低液-气界面的表面张力。呼气时肺泡缩小、表面活性物质相对浓度升高，表面张力进一步降低，防止肺泡塌陷（稳定小肺泡）；吸气时张力升高防止过度扩张，并减少呼吸做功。早产儿肺Ⅱ型细胞尚未成熟、缺乏表面活性物质，导致肺泡塌陷和新生儿呼吸窘迫综合征，可通过气管内补充外源表面活性物质治疗。��Pulmonary surfactant, secreted by type II alveolar cells, consists mainly of phospholipids such as dipalmitoylphosphatidylcholine (DPPC) and surfactant proteins. It lines the liquid film on the alveolar surface and lowers surface tension at the air-liquid interface. During expiration the alveoli shrink, the relative surfactant concentration rises, and surface tension falls further, preventing alveolar collapse and stabilizing small alveoli; during inspiration surface tension rises, preventing over-distension, and the work of breathing is reduced. In premature infants whose type II cells are immature, surfactant deficiency causes alveolar collapse and neonatal respiratory distress syndrome, treated by tracheal instillation of exogenous surfactant.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�526e346fb52f�body�ي启动子是位于基因上游的DNA序列，转录因子先结合启动子并招募RNA聚合酶，使其准确定位并开始合成RNA。٘A promoter is a DNA sequence upstream of a gene; transcription factors bind it and recruit RNA polymerase, positioning it precisely to start making RNA.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�52f5af327c64�body��s补体是血浆中的一组酶原蛋白，经三条途径激活：经典途径（IgG/IgM与病原结合后C1q识别）、凝集素途径（甘露糖结合凝集素MBL识别病原表面糖类）、替代途径（病原表面自发低水平激活并被正反馈放大），三者汇合于C3转化酶，形成C5转化酶后启动膜攻击复合物。效应包括：C3b沉积在病原表面调理促进吞噬；C5b-C9膜攻击复合物在革兰阴性菌膜上打孔使其裂解；C3a、C5a等过敏毒素招募并激活吞噬细胞。宿主自身细胞表面有衰变加速因子（DAF）、CD59等调节蛋白防止补体误伤。��Complement is a group of plasma zymogens activated via three routes: the classical pathway (C1q recognizes IgG/IgM bound to pathogens), the lectin pathway (mannose-binding lectin recognizes microbial sugars), and the alternative pathway (spontaneous low-level activation on pathogen surfaces amplified by positive feedback). They converge on C3 convertase, then C5 convertase, and finally the membrane attack complex. Effector functions include: C3b opsonizing pathogens for phagocytosis; C5b-C9 forming membrane attack complexes that lyse Gram-negative bacteria; and the anaphylatoxins C3a/C5a recruiting and activating phagocytes. Host cells carry regulators such as decay-accelerating factor (DAF) and CD59 to prevent self-damage.�ans��src��*《细胞生物学》（免疫学章节）�<Cell Biology (Zhai Zhonghe, et al.), immunology (complement)��id�546137f0873e�body���共生指两个不同物种长期而密切地生活在一起。小丑鱼与海葵是典型：海葵触手的刺细胞一般蜇不到它，通常归因于鱼体表黏液的保护，鱼因此躲开天敌，它的残渣与排泄物又为海葵补上氮素。要分清共生并不等于互利，按双方利弊它分为互利、共栖与寄生，寄生同样算共生；一对关系的性质还会随环境在互利与寄生之间滑动，判断要看双方存活与繁殖是否真的都受益。��Symbiosis is a long-term, close association between members of two different species. Clownfish and sea anemones are typical: the stinging cells of the anemone's tentacles generally fail to fire on the clownfish, usually credited to the protective mucus on its skin, so the fish escapes predators, while its scraps and wastes supply the anemone with nitrogen. Note that symbiosis is not the same as mutual benefit - sorted by who gains and who loses it covers mutualism, commensalism and parasitism, and parasitism is still symbiosis; and a given relationship can slide between mutualism and parasitism as conditions change, so the test is whether survival and reproduction really improve for both.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�58632f297200�body���对这类“耐火/依赖火”植物，火烧会烤裂种皮、溶出抑制发芽的物质，并把竞争者烧光、把灰分（钾磷）当肥料。所以它们演化出“趁火重生”的策略，火是更新的信号而非灾难。��For fire-dependent species, heat cracks seed coats, leaches germination inhibitors, clears competitors and returns ash (potassium, phosphorus) as fertilizer. They evolved to “rebloom through fire”—fire is a regeneration signal, not disaster.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�595119532da9�body��'抗体的多样性主要由V(D)J基因重组产生。B细胞在骨髓发育过程中，免疫球蛋白重链基因的V、D、J基因片段和轻链的V、J片段被RAG1/RAG2重组酶随机剪切并连接，产生数百万到上亿种组合，构成初级抗体库。不同片段的随机组合，加上连接处的多样性（插入/删除核苷酸），使每个B细胞拥有独特的抗体基因。抗原激活后，体细胞高频突变（SHM）和类别转换（从IgM/IgD转为IgG、IgA、IgE）进一步优化抗体的亲和力和效应功能。��Antibody diversity is generated chiefly by V(D)J recombination. As B cells develop in the bone marrow, V, D, and J gene segments of the immunoglobulin heavy chain (and V, J segments of the light chain) are randomly cut and joined by the recombinases RAG1 and RAG2, generating millions to hundreds of millions of combinations, the primary antibody repertoire. Random segment combination plus junctional diversity (nucleotide insertion or deletion) gives each B cell a unique antibody gene. After antigen activation, somatic hypermutation (SHM) and class switching (from IgM/IgD to IgG, IgA, or IgE) further refine affinity and effector function.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�597b71941aef�body��糖皮质激素受体激活后可通过两种模式作用：以二聚体形式结合糖皮质激素反应元件直接反式激活基因，包括糖异生酶 PEPCK 与 G6Pase，从而升高血糖并促进肌肉蛋白分解；也可以单体形式与 NF-κB、AP-1 等炎症转录因子相互抑制，实现抗炎的反式阻遏。此外还存在不依赖转录的快速非基因组作用。抗炎与代谢副作用共用同一受体但依赖不同的作用模式，这是研发选择性受体调节剂以分离两类效应的理论依据。�EThe activated glucocorticoid receptor works in two modes: as a dimer it binds glucocorticoid response elements and transactivates genes including the gluconeogenic enzymes PEPCK and G6Pase, raising blood glucose and promoting muscle protein breakdown; as a monomer it mutually inhibits inflammatory transcription factors such as NF-kappaB and AP-1, producing anti-inflammatory transrepression. Rapid non-genomic actions add a third layer. Because both benefit and metabolic harm run through one receptor but different modes, selective receptor modulators aim to dissociate the two.�ans��src���Sapolsky, Romero & Munck,《How Do Glucocorticoids Influence Stress Responses? Integrating Permissive, Suppressive, Stimulatory, and Preparative Actions》,Endocrine Reviews 21, 55-89,2000 (DOI: 10.1210/edrv.21.1.0389)��Sapolsky, Romero & Munck, 'How Do Glucocorticoids Influence Stress Responses? Integrating Permissive, Suppressive, Stimulatory, and Preparative Actions', Endocrine Reviews 21, 55-89, 2000, DOI: 10.1210/edrv.21.1.0389��id�5a35f3884ad1�body���群落的空间结构指生物在垂直和水平方向上的分层与分布格局。例如森林分乔木层、灌木层和草本层，提高了对光和空间的利用。水平分布则常受土壤、湿度等环境梯度影响。�The spatial structure of a community is how organisms are layered and distributed vertically and horizontally. A forest, for example, has tree, shrub, and herb layers that improve use of light and space. Horizontal patterns are often shaped by gradients like soil and moisture.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�5c2b68a9013d�body���Hox 基因是沿身体前后轴按顺序表达的主调控基因，决定体节身份；其排列和功能的高度保守说明动物身体蓝图共享同一套古老调控模块，微小改变即可产生重大形态演化。�Hox genes are master regulators expressed in order along the anterior-posterior axis, specifying segment identity; their highly conserved arrangement indicates animals share an ancient body-plan toolkit, where small changes yield major morphological evolution.�ans��src��:Gilbert《Developmental Biology》,Sinauer Associates,2010�=Gilbert S.F., Developmental Biology, Sinauer Associates, 2010��id�5c4b124365aa�body���它们缺的不是能量而是矿质养分。酸性泥炭沼里氮和磷极少，根系又弱，叶片便特化成捕虫器：蜜腺与触发毛引虫并困住它，腺体分泌蛋白酶在体外消化虫体，产物以氨基酸、铵盐和磷酸盐被吸收，用于造蛋白质与核酸。捕来的虫等于一笔缓释肥料补贴，能量仍来自光合。边界在代价：捕虫叶光合面积小、建造维护都贵，只有光照足而土壤瘦处才有净收益。��What these plants lack is mineral nutrients, not energy. In acidic peat bogs nitrogen and phosphorus are scarce and roots are too weak to cover the shortfall, so leaves are modified into traps: nectar and trigger hairs lure an insect in and hold it there, glands digest the body outside the plant with enzymes such as proteases, and the products are absorbed as amino acids, ammonium and phosphate to build proteins and nucleic acids. A caught insect is a top-up of slow-release fertilizer, while the energy still comes from photosynthesis. The boundary is cost: trap leaves offer little photosynthetic area and are dear to build and maintain, so the strategy pays only where light is plentiful and soil is poor.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�5c8c82dd4818�body��同源器官源自共同祖先、结构相似但功能可能不同，如人的手臂、蝙蝠的翼和鲸的鳍都由相似骨骼构成，证明亲缘关系。同功器官功能相似却来源不同，如昆虫翅与鸟翼分别独立演化，属于趋同进化的结果。�;Homologous organs come from a common ancestor with similar structure but possibly different functions, human arms, bat wings, and whale flippers share similar bones, evidencing kinship. Analogous organs look alike in function but differ in origin, like insect wings and bird wings, products of convergent evolution.�ans��src��《进化生物学》�Evolution (Futuyma)��id�5c9be67b9a68�body���过氧化物酶体通过氧化酶反应产生过氧化氢等活性氧，并含过氧化氢酶将其分解为水，参与脂肪酸 β 氧化和解毒；功能缺陷会导致脑白质营养不良等疾病。��Peroxisomes generate reactive oxygen species such as H2O2 via oxidase reactions and contain catalase to decompose it, participating in fatty-acid beta-oxidation and detoxification; their defects cause leukodystrophies and other diseases.�ans��src��Annual Review of Cell Biology�Annual Review of Cell Biology��id�5e3c8a6facec�body�٢两者都有：部分来自色素，更多来自鳞片微观结构对光的干涉与衍射（结构色），所以某些角度会变色且颜色鲜亮不褪色。ټBoth: some from pigment, but more from microscopic scale structures causing light interference and diffraction (structural color), so colors shift with angle and stay vivid without fading.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�5e78fb479dbf�body��严格地说，人类不是由今天的猴子或猿演化来的，而是与现代黑猩猩在约600万至800万年前分道扬镳，共同拥有一个早已灭绝的祖先。人科的化石链条包括约400万年前能直立行走的南方古猿（著名的“露西”）、约200万年前的能人和直立人，以及晚近的智人；脑容量逐渐增大，工具和用火出现得越来越早。约30万年前出现的智人最终成为现代人类的直接祖先，这一过程由化石、分子钟和古 DNA 共同证实。�bStrictly speaking, humans did not evolve from today's monkeys or apes; our lineage split from that of chimpanzees about six to eight million years ago, sharing a long-extinct common ancestor. The hominin fossil chain includes the bipedal Australopithecus of about four million years ago (the famous “Lucy”), Homo habilis and Homo erectus around two million years ago, and later Homo sapiens. Brain size grew and tools and fire appeared ever earlier; Homo sapiens, emerging about 300,000 years ago, became the direct ancestor of modern humans, a story confirmed by fossils, molecular clocks and ancient DNA.�ans��src�� 《普通生物学》(陈阅增)�General Biology (Chen Yuezeng)��id�6083d0fbc354�body�ل一个抗体同时抓住肿瘤抗原和 T 细胞受体，像桥梁一样把免疫细胞拉到癌细胞身边，引导局部杀伤。�uOne antibody binds both a tumor antigen and a T-cell receptor, bridging immune cells to cancer for localized killing.�ans��src�كNerisha Chouhan,《Bispecific Antibodies for the Treatment of Cancer》,Materials Highlights,2021 (DOI: 10.2991/mathi.k.210617.001)فNerisha Chouhan, 'Bispecific Antibodies for the Treatment of Cancer', Materials Highlights, 2021, DOI: 10.2991/mathi.k.210617.001��id�611727c0a1e6�body��C4 植物在炎热干旱环境中先用 PEP 羧化酶在叶肉细胞固定 CO2 为四碳化合物，再运至维管束鞘细胞释放供卡尔文循环，从而减少光呼吸损失。这种「CO2 浓缩」机制使玉米、甘蔗等在强光高温下比 C3 植物更高效。�<In hot, dry conditions, C4 plants first fix CO2 into a four-carbon compound in mesophyll cells via PEP carboxylase, then release it in bundle-sheath cells for the Calvin cycle, cutting photorespiration losses. This CO2-concentrating mechanism lets corn and sugarcane outperform C3 plants under strong light and heat.�ans��src��《植物学》�Campbell Biology��id�61e47d63aa72�body���可用“净初级生产力”估算：森林通过光合作用每固定1分子CO2约释放1分子O2。温带森林年固碳约数吨/公顷，折算一平方公里阔叶林夏季一天可释氧数吨，具体取决于叶面积指数、光照和温度。�Use net primary productivity: photosynthesis releases roughly one O2 per CO2 fixed. Temperate forests fix several tonnes of carbon per hectare per year, so a square km of summer broadleaf forest can release tonnes of O2 daily—depending on leaf-area index, light and temperature.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�6362814d23fa�body�ِ表观遗传研究在不改变DNA序列的情况下，化学标记如何开关基因，并可能受环境和生活方式影响而传给后代。ٞEpigenetics studies chemical marks that switch genes on or off without changing the DNA sequence, sometimes influenced by environment and passed to offspring.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�6608ec4647ab�body��被子植物约在1.3亿年前快速辐射，花朵用鲜艳颜色、气味和花蜜吸引昆虫等动物传粉，把"运送花粉"外包给动物，比风媒更高效精准。花结构的特化（如两侧对称花）与传粉者形态协同演化，是经典的互利共生案例。�@Flowering plants radiated roughly 130 million years ago; flowers attract insects and other animals with color, scent, and nectar, "outsourcing" pollen transport to animals far more efficiently than wind. Floral specializations (such as zygomorphic flowers) co-evolved with pollinator shapes, a classic case of mutualism.�ans��src��bCrepet，《被子植物化石记录及其花生物学》，《英国皇家学会会刊B》2018年�nCrepet, "The fossil record of angiosperms and their floral biology," Proceedings of the Royal Society B (2018)��id�6656709b11c1�body���伯格曼定律指出，同一类群的恒温动物在较冷地区往往体型更大，因为较大的身体散热更慢、更易保温。例如北方狼比南方狼更壮硕。这是气候影响体型演化的例子。�&Bergmann's rule states that among warm-blooded species, populations in colder regions tend to be larger because a bigger body loses heat more slowly and retains warmth better. Northern wolves, for example, are bulkier than southern ones. It is an example of climate shaping body size evolution.�ans��src��R吴相钰 等 编,《陈阅增普通生物学》第4版,高等教育出版社,2014�VWu Xiangyu et al., Chen Yuezeng General Biology, 4th ed., Higher Education Press, 2014��id�68d2323d024c�body��
帝王蝶凭借"太阳罗盘"（按太阳位置结合体内生物钟校正方向）和感光的磁罗盘（隐花色素感知地磁场）双重导航，跨代接力飞行数千公里，仍准确抵达墨西哥同一片冷杉林越冬。这是昆虫导航的奇迹。�(Monarch butterflies navigate with a time-compensated sun compass plus a light-sensitive magnetic compass (based on cryptochrome) that senses Earth's field, letting them migrate thousands of kilometers across generations to the very same fir forests in Mexico. It is a marvel of insect navigation.�ans��src��`Guerra、Gegear 与 Reppert，《磁罗盘辅助帝王蝶迁飞》，《自然·通讯》2014年�mGuerra, Gegear & Reppert, "A magnetic compass aids monarch butterfly migration," Nature Communications (2014)��id�69ebd5c3b657�body��逆转录病毒携带逆转录酶，进入宿主细胞后以自身RNA为模板合成DNA，再由整合酶把这段DNA插入宿主染色体，随细胞分裂永久保留。正因为病毒DNA成了宿主基因组的一部分，艾滋病才如此难以根治。�1Retroviruses carry reverse transcriptase that copies their RNA genome into DNA inside the host cell, and an integrase then inserts that DNA into the host chromosome, where it persists permanently through cell division. Because the viral DNA becomes part of the host genome, HIV is especially hard to cure.�ans��src��ZCoffin、Hughes 与 Varmus，《逆转录病毒》（冷泉港实验室出版社，1997）�QCoffin, Hughes & Varmus, Retroviruses (Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory Press, 1997)��id�69f506b22e71�body�ٺMHC I 类把胞内合成或感染产生的肽呈递给 CD8+ 细胞毒性 T 细胞，II 类把吞噬加工的外源肽呈递给 CD4+ 辅助 T 细胞，二者来源与监视路径不同。��MHC class I presents intracellular or infected-cell peptides to CD8+ cytotoxic T cells, while class II presents engulfed exogenous peptides to CD4+ helper T cells, differing in antigen source and surveillance pathway.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�6b70e4fce211�body���它们体内有随月相和潮汐波动的生殖节律，能感知月光强度和海水流量的变化；大潮时水位高、滩涂暴露少、卵被冲走的风险低，于是同步产卵提高后代存活。��They carry lunar/tidal reproductive rhythms, sensing moonlight intensity and water flow. Spring tides bring higher water and less exposed shore, lowering the risk of eggs washing away—so synchronized spawning boosts offspring survival.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�6bfcd4adb1ff�body�٧起始caspase被激活后，切割并激活执行caspase，后者降解细胞骨架与关键蛋白，使细胞皱缩、DNA断裂，最终被吞噬细胞干净清除。٦Initiator caspases activate executioner caspases, which cleave cytoskeletal and key proteins so the cell shrinks, DNA fragments, and is cleanly removed by phagocytes.�ans��src��KAlberts 等,《Molecular Biology of the Cell》第6版,Garland Science,2014�PB. Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell, 6th ed., Garland Science, 2014��id�6cc3013fa846�body���在细胞因子引导下 B 细胞重组恒定区基因，从 IgM 转为 IgG、IgA 或 IgE，保持相同抗原特异性却获得不同组织分布与效应功能如中和、调理或介导过敏。�␀Guided by cytokines, B cells recombine constant-region genes to switch from IgM to IgG, IgA or IgE, keeping the same antigen specificity but gaining distinct tissue distribution and effector functions like neutralization, opsonization or allergy mediation.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�6d031ba290fc�body�� 白化多由控制黑色素的基因突变（如酪氨酸酶基因）导致，使毛发、皮肤和眼睛缺黑色素。神农架湿度大、光照弱、相对隔离，近亲繁殖概率高，使隐性白化基因更易显现，但白熊多为黑熊的个别白化个体而非新物种。�.Albinism usually stems from mutations in melanin genes (e.g. tyrosinase), leaving hair, skin and eyes without pigment. Shennongjia's humid, dim, isolated habitat raises inbreeding odds, letting recessive albino genes show; the “white bears” are mostly albino Asiatic black bears, not a new species.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�6e6ee7182e90�body��&CRISPR是细菌对抗病毒的“免疫记忆”系统：它们把入侵病毒的DNA片段存进自身基因组，再次遇到时由Cas蛋白按片段识别并剪断病毒DNA。人类后来把它改造成精准的基因编辑工具。它本质是细菌与噬菌体长期军备竞赛的产物。�VCRISPR is a bacterial 'immune memory' against viruses: cells store snippets of invading viral DNA in their own genome and, on reencounter, use Cas proteins to recognize and cut the viral DNA by matching those snippets. Humans later turned it into a precise gene-editing tool. It is essentially the product of a long bacterial-virus arms race.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�6f60789a8a12�body���功能性灭绝指物种数量已低到无法在生态中发挥原有作用（如不再传粉、不再被捕食），即使个体尚存，食物链和生态功能已经受损，预警意义更早也更关键。��Functional extinction means numbers are too low for a species to play its ecological role (no longer pollinating or preyed upon); even with individuals alive, food webs and functions are already damaged, giving an earlier and crucial warning.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�6f8071e524b1�body��细菌和古菌都是原核生物，但古菌的细胞膜脂类、细胞壁成分和核糖体 RNA 与细菌差异显著，在演化上更接近于真核生物。许多古菌生活在极端环境（如高温热泉、高盐湖），而细菌分布更为广泛。�Both are prokaryotes, but archaea differ markedly from bacteria in membrane lipids, cell-wall composition, and ribosomal RNA, and are evolutionarily closer to eukaryotes. Many archaea thrive in extremes (hot springs, salt lakes), whereas bacteria are more broadly distributed.�ans��src��e《自然·综述：微生物学》（Nature Reviews Microbiology）；美国微生物学会（ASM）�DNature Reviews Microbiology; American Society for Microbiology (ASM)��id�6f9f89a6b622�body��-基因组印记是一种表观遗传现象：某些基因的表达取决于它们来自父本还是母本，即同一基因的两个等位基因中仅一方被标记并表达。这种亲本来源特异的甲基化标记会影响胚胎发育，印记异常可导致普拉德-威利综合征等疾病。�EGenomic imprinting is an epigenetic phenomenon in which certain genes are expressed depending on whether they came from the father or the mother, only one parental allele is marked and expressed. These parent-of-origin methylation marks affect development, and their disruption causes disorders such as Prader-Willi syndrome.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�70d37e81e42d�body��表观遗传学研究在不改变 DNA 序列的前提下，基因表达如何被可逆地调控。常见的机制包括 DNA 甲基化和组蛋白修饰，它们能开启或关闭基因，并可能受环境、饮食和应激影响，部分变化还能在细胞间甚至代际间传递。�BEpigenetics studies reversible regulation of gene expression without changes to the DNA sequence. Common mechanisms include DNA methylation and histone modification, which switch genes on or off and can be influenced by environment, diet, and stress; some changes are transmitted between cells and even across generations.�ans��src��KAlberts 等,《Molecular Biology of the Cell》第6版,Garland Science,2014�PB. Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell, 6th ed., Garland Science, 2014��id�754e753c4e17�body���单一人工林物种少、食物链短、易爆发病虫害、保土保水能力有限；天然林多物种搭配、层次丰富，更能抗旱、固碳和供养动物。所以造林要讲“混交”和近自然恢复。�Monoculture plantations have few species, short food chains, pest outbreaks and limited soil/water holding; natural forests mix species across layers, better resisting drought, storing carbon and feeding wildlife. Afforestation should favor mixed, near-natural restoration.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�75bca5cfc4ff�body���机体通过中枢耐受（胸腺中T细胞阴性选择、骨髓中B细胞克隆清除）和外周耐受（调节性T细胞Treg、克隆无能、免疫赦免部位）淘汰或抑制对自身抗原反应的淋巴细胞。自身免疫病源于这些机制失效：如分子模拟（A组链球菌蛋白与心肌抗原相似，引发风湿性心脏病）、隐蔽抗原暴露（眼晶状体、精子等免疫赦免部位抗原因创伤释出）、Treg数量或功能缺陷、以及MHC易感基因（如HLA-DR4与类风湿关节炎）。例：1型糖尿病（自身反应性T细胞破坏胰岛β细胞）、Graves病（自身抗体刺激TSH受体）、重症肌无力（抗乙酰胆碱受体抗体阻断神经肌肉接头）。�zThe body eliminates or suppresses self-reactive lymphocytes through central tolerance (negative selection of T cells in the thymus, clonal deletion of B cells in the marrow) and peripheral tolerance (regulatory T cells, anergy, immune-privileged sites). Autoimmune disease arises when these fail, through mechanisms such as molecular mimicry (group A streptococcal proteins resemble cardiac antigens, causing rheumatic heart disease), release of sequestered antigens (immune-privileged antigens like lens and sperm exposed after injury), defects in Treg number or function, and susceptibility MHC alleles (e.g., HLA-DR4 in rheumatoid arthritis). Examples include type 1 diabetes (autoreactive T cells destroy pancreatic beta cells), Graves' disease (autoantibodies stimulate the TSH receptor), and myasthenia gravis (anti-acetylcholine-receptor antibodies block the neuromuscular junction).�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�77e97f0bdd7f�body�ٵ朊病毒是错误折叠的 PrP 蛋白，能把正常 PrP 诱导成同样构象并聚集，造成神经退行性疾病如疯牛病，其遗传信息完全由蛋白质构象传递。��Prions are misfolded PrP proteins that template normal PrP into the same conformation and aggregate, causing neurodegenerative disease like mad-cow disease, with infectivity carried entirely by protein conformation.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�7b63b7e92c03�body��{迁徙是动物随季节大规模移动，通常为了寻找食物、避开严寒或到达繁殖地，如候鸟和角马。ٍMigration is the seasonal long-distance movement of animals to find food, escape cold, or reach breeding grounds, as in birds and wildebeest.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�7d6dc8a21274�body��3血压下降或肾血流减少时，入球小动脉的球旁细胞释放肾素，把肝脏合成的血管紧张素原剪切成血管紧张素I，再由血管紧张素转换酶（ACE）转化为血管紧张素II。血管紧张素II一方面强烈收缩全身小动脉迅速升压，另一方面刺激肾上腺皮质球状带分泌醛固酮，促进远曲小管和集合管重吸收Na+，水随之被重吸收，血容量增加，血压持久升高；它还促进抗利尿激素（ADH）释放，并增强渴觉。该负反馈系统是长期血压调控的核心。��When blood pressure or renal blood flow falls, juxtaglomerular cells of the afferent arteriole release renin, which cleaves liver-derived angiotensinogen into angiotensin I; angiotensin-converting enzyme (ACE) then converts it to angiotensin II. Angiotensin II strongly constricts systemic arterioles, quickly raising pressure, and stimulates the zona glomerulosa of the adrenal cortex to secrete aldosterone, which promotes Na+ reabsorption in the distal tubule and collecting duct; water follows, so blood volume and pressure rise persistently. Angiotensin II also promotes antidiuretic hormone (ADH) release and enhances thirst. This negative-feedback system is central to long-term blood pressure regulation.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�7ddc728e1579�body��抗体是 Y 字形的蛋白质，两臂顶端的可变区能精确匹配特定病原体表面的抗原表位，像钥匙配锁一样结合上去，从而中和病毒、标记细菌让吞噬细胞清除。感染过后，专一识别该病原体的记忆 B 细胞会长期存活，再次遇到时能快速增殖分化成大量抗体工厂。天花的病原体不会大变异，也没有动物宿主，所以一次感染或接种带来的终身免疫让人群再无新病例，世界卫生组织在1980年宣布天花被消灭。�Antibodies are Y-shaped proteins whose variable tips precisely match specific antigen epitopes on a pathogen, like a key in a lock, neutralizing viruses and tagging bacteria for phagocytes to destroy. After an infection, memory B cells that recognize that pathogen survive for years; upon re-exposure they rapidly multiply into antibody factories. Smallpox's virus barely mutates and has no animal reservoir, so lifelong immunity from one infection or vaccination left no new cases anywhere, and the WHO declared smallpox eradicated in 1980.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�7e6d0d866f19�body���水平基因转移指生物把基因直接传给非后代的其他个体，常见于细菌之间。方式包括接合、转化和转导，能让有益基因（如抗药性）快速扩散。它在微生物进化和基因工程中都很重要。�CHorizontal gene transfer is when an organism passes genes directly to another individual that is not its descendant, common among bacteria. Mechanisms include conjugation, transformation, and transduction and let useful genes like drug resistance spread fast. It matters in both microbial evolution and genetic engineering.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�7e70056ede78�body�ه克隆是用一个体细胞的核培育出基因完全相同的个体，不经过两性生殖细胞的结合，因此无遗传重组。َCloning grows a genetically identical individual from one cell's nucleus without combining sperm and egg, so there's no genetic recombination.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�80cf0e2991f2�body���节肢动物必须周期性蜕皮才能长大：脑神经分泌细胞分泌促前胸腺激素（PTTH），刺激前胸腺合成并释放蜕皮激素（蜕皮酮ecdysone），启动旧皮溶解、新皮形成和蜕出。蜕皮结果由保幼激素（JH）决定：JH水平高时蜕皮后仍保持幼虫形态，JH下降后蜕皮进入蛹期，最终在JH近乎消失时羽化为成虫。��Arthropods must molt periodically to grow. Neurosecretory cells of the brain release prothoracicotropic hormone (PTTH), which stimulates the prothoracic gland to produce and release the molting hormone ecdysone, triggering dissolution of the old cuticle and formation of a new one. The outcome of each molt is set by juvenile hormone (JH): high JH keeps the animal in a larval form after molting, declining JH allows molting into the pupa, and when JH is nearly absent the adult emerges.�ans��src��0《动物学》(刘凌云、郑光美) 昆虫纲�9Zoology (Liu Lingyun & Zheng Guangmei), insect physiology��id�814b2fe36d42�body�ٷ某些脂溶性毒物在生物体内难降解并沿食物链逐级富集，每一级捕食者摄入多个下级的累积量，使营养级越高的个体体内浓度呈指数上升。ٹSome lipophilic toxins resist breakdown and accumulate up the food chain; each predator consumes the pooled burden of many prey, so concentration rises sharply at higher trophic levels.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�826cb6035578�body��表观遗传研究在不改变 DNA 序列的前提下，由 DNA 甲基化、组蛋白修饰等化学标记调控基因开关的机制。这些修饰可受饮食、压力等环境因素影响并可能遗传给后代，但不属于 DNA 碱基序列本身的突变。�4Epigenetics studies mechanisms—such as DNA methylation and histone modifications—that switch genes on or off without changing the DNA sequence. Such modifications can be influenced by environmental factors like diet and stress and may be inherited, yet they are not mutations of the base sequence itself.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�82e946bef79c�body���没有谁在“商量”。每一次赛跑中，跑得稍快的个体（无论猎豹还是羚羊）都有更大的机会捕到猎物或逃脱捕食，从而留下更多后代；跑得慢的个体留下后代的概率更小。于是快的基因在双方种群中都被不断积累，双方速度一代代同步提高，就像互相追赶的军备竞赛。这场竞赛的终点受物理学约束——例如肌肉产力和骨架承受力都有限，所以猎豹速度并不会无限增长。��Nobody is agreeing to anything. In every chase, the slightly faster individual, whether cheetah or antelope, is more likely to catch prey or escape, leaving more offspring, while slower individuals reproduce less. Faster genes therefore accumulate in both populations simultaneously, and the two sides get faster together over generations, exactly like an arms race. Physics sets the finish line: muscle power and skeleton strength are limited, which is why cheetahs are not infinitely fast.�ans��src��)Science（捕食者-猎物协同演化）�#Science (predator-prey coevolution)��id�86ed265267ce�body��	非编码 RNA 是不翻译成蛋白质的 RNA 分子，却广泛参与基因调控。例如 tRNA 和 rRNA 参与翻译机器，microRNA 与 siRNA 通过降解或抑制 mRNA 来沉默基因，长链非编码 RNA 则在染色质重塑和发育中发挥调节作用。�&Non-coding RNAs are RNA molecules that are not translated into protein yet broadly regulate genes. tRNA and rRNA are part of the translation machinery, while microRNAs and siRNAs silence genes by degrading or blocking mRNA, and long non-coding RNAs help remodel chromatin and steer development.�ans��src��《分子生物学》�'Molecular Biology of the Cell (Alberts)��id�87778818150a�body��形态发生素由局部源扩散形成浓度梯度，细胞依据接收到的浓度阈值激活不同靶基因组合，从而「读出」自身位置。在果蝇中，双胸复合体沿前后轴的表达受这类梯度调控，决定体节身份并塑造躯干蓝图。�^A morphogen diffuses from a local source to form a concentration gradient, and cells read their position by the threshold at which they activate different target-gene combinations. In Drosophila, expression of the Bithorax complex along the anterior-posterior axis is governed by such gradients, specifying segment identity and shaping the body plan.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�87ab1d2d6985�body��细胞把泛素分子像标签一样共价连接到需要清除的蛋白质上，多聚泛素链被26S蛋白酶体识别并降解成小肽。这套系统清除错误折叠的蛋白、调控细胞周期蛋白，其失灵与帕金森病等多种神经退行性疾病有关。�ECells covalently attach ubiquitin molecules as tags to proteins marked for destruction; a poly-ubiquitin chain is recognized and degraded into peptides by the 26S proteasome. This system clears misfolded proteins and controls cell-cycle regulators, and its failure is linked to neurodegenerative diseases such as Parkinson's.�ans��src��zCiechanover、Hershko 与 Rose（2004年诺贝尔化学奖）；综述见 Alberts 等《细胞的分子生物学》第6版ـCiechanover, Hershko & Rose (Nobel Prize in Chemistry 2004); reviewed in Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell (6th ed.)��id�899e0c8a6590�body�� 群落演替是生态系统在干扰或裸地上随时间有序更替的过程，先锋物种先定居，逐步改善环境后被更复杂的物种取代。可分为初生演替（无土壤裸地）和次生演替（原有土壤保留），最终可能趋向相对稳定的顶极群落。�HSuccession is the orderly, time-ordered replacement of communities after disturbance or on bare ground: pioneer species settle first and modify the environment until more complex species replace them. It ranges from primary (no soil) to secondary (soil retained) succession and may approach a relatively stable climax community.�ans��src��《生态学》�Ecology (Odum)��id�89b95dbbf150�body�ٷ凋亡信号使线粒体外膜通透化，细胞色素 c 释放到胞质并启动凋亡体，激活 caspase 级联导致程序性死亡；Bcl-2 家族蛋白决定膜的通透与否。��Apoptotic signals trigger mitochondrial outer-membrane permeabilization, releasing cytochrome c to assemble the apoptosome and activate the caspase cascade; Bcl-2 family proteins decide membrane permeability.�ans��src��KAlberts 等,《Molecular Biology of the Cell》第6版,Garland Science,2014�PB. Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell, 6th ed., Garland Science, 2014��id�8a94cf4ba54d�body�ٽ贝茨氏拟态是无害物种模仿有毒物种以骗过捕食者，单方受益；缪勒氏拟态是多个有毒物种彼此相似，共同强化捕食者的回避学习，双方受益。��Batesian mimicry is a harmless species imitating a toxic one to deceive predators, benefiting only the mimic; Müllerian mimicry is several toxic species resembling each other to reinforce predator avoidance learning, benefiting all.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�8b6ef21901c1�body���镰刀型贫血由 β-珠蛋白基因突变引起，使红细胞扭曲成镰刀状。2023 年获美国 FDA 批准的疗法（如 exa-cel）通过 CRISPR-Cas9 编辑患者自身造血干细胞，重新激活胎儿血红蛋白基因，从而缓解症状。� Sickle cell disease is caused by a mutation in the beta-globin gene, distorting red blood cells into a sickle shape. Approved by the U.S. FDA in 2023 (e.g., exa-cel), therapy uses CRISPR-Cas9 to edit a patient's own blood stem cells and reactivate fetal hemoglobin genes, easing symptoms.�ans��src��i美国食品药品监督管理局（FDA）2023 年批准公告；《新英格兰医学杂志》（NEJM）�MU.S. FDA approval announcement (2023); New England Journal of Medicine (NEJM)��id�8fad734f0f4b�body��细胞周期由周期蛋白（cyclin）与周期蛋白依赖性激酶（CDK）组成的复合物推动，并受到检验点（如 G1/S、G2/M）监控。p53 等蛋白会在 DNA 损伤时叫停周期，直到修复或诱导凋亡，调控失常常导致癌症。�The cell cycle is driven by complexes of cyclins and cyclin-dependent kinases (CDKs) and monitored by checkpoints such as G1/S and G2/M. Proteins like p53 halt the cycle upon DNA damage until repair or apoptosis is triggered, and loss of this control commonly leads to cancer.�ans��src��《细胞生物学》�'Molecular Biology of the Cell (Alberts)��id�8fb6d092810a�body���脑机接口是在大脑与外部设备之间建立直接通信的技术，可读取神经信号或向脑回送刺激。它帮助瘫痪者用意念控制机械臂，也为治疗神经疾病提供新途径。该领域正快速从实验室走向临床。�:A brain-computer interface builds a direct communication link between the brain and an external device, reading neural signals or sending stimulation back. It lets paralyzed people control a robotic arm by thought and offers new routes to treat neurological disease. The field is moving quickly from lab to clinic.�ans��src��,Nature Biotechnology（神经接口技术）�2Nature Biotechnology (neural interface technology)��id�9014cb70970c�body��硅和碳同族，理论上能形成复杂分子，但硅-硅键在地球常温常湿下不稳定，且硅氧化物是坚硬的固体难以参与代谢循环。目前没有任何证据存在硅基生命，碳基仍是唯一已知生命形式。相关讨论主要停留在假说层面。�\Silicon sits in the same group as carbon and can in principle form complex molecules, but silicon-silicon bonds are unstable under Earth's mild, wet conditions, and silicon oxides are hard solids that do not lend themselves to metabolism. There is no evidence for silicon life; carbon-based remains the only known form. The idea stays hypothetical.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�90f2967ed818�body��(在人类约30亿个碱基对中，真正编码蛋白质的外显子只占约1%–2%，其余近98%为非编码DNA，包含内含子、重复序列和大量调控元件。这些序列并非全是"垃圾DNA"，许多参与基因表达的开关、染色体结构的维持与基因组的稳定性。�SOf the roughly 3 billion base pairs in the human genome, protein-coding exons make up only about 1–2%; nearly 98% is non-coding DNA, including introns, repeats, and a wealth of regulatory elements. Far from being all "junk," much of it controls when and where genes switch on and helps maintain chromosome structure and genome stability.�ans��src��g国际人类基因组测序联盟，《人类基因组的初步测序与分析》，《自然》2001年�vInternational Human Genome Sequencing Consortium, "Initial sequencing and analysis of the human genome," Nature (2001)��id�9268c9b842db�body���细菌分泌并感知小分子信号（自诱导物），当密度升高使信号浓度超过阈值时，全局调控基因被激活，协调生物发光、毒力和生物膜形成等集体行为。��Bacteria secrete and sense small autoinducer signals; once density raises signal above a threshold, global regulons switch on to coordinate collective behaviors like bioluminescence, virulence and biofilm formation.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�92f92d616ad5�body���克隆是用一个体细胞的细胞核替换卵细胞的核，再刺激其发育成胚胎。由于核内DNA来自供体，后代基因与供体几乎相同。著名的多莉羊就是用这种方法诞生的。��Cloning replaces an egg cell's nucleus with that from a body cell, then stimulates it to develop into an embryo. Because the nuclear DNA comes from the donor, the offspring is nearly genetically identical. The famous sheep Dolly was made this way.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�94412053344e�body�ل神经元放电模式复杂且个体差异很大，深度学习能从海量神经活动中拟合出思维到动作的映射关系。فFiring patterns are complex and highly individual, so deep learning fits the mind-to-action mapping from massive neural datasets.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�94a3870cf295�body�٢水流与血流方向相反，使二者在各接触点始终保持氧分压差，鳃部血液能持续从水中摄取氧气，摄氧效率远高于顺流系统。��Water and blood flow in opposite directions, maintaining an oxygen partial-pressure gradient at every contact point so blood keeps extracting O2, achieving far higher uptake than parallel flow.�ans��src��《动物生理学》教材�Animal Physiology (Hill)��id�9670ae7efd1a�body�ي植物会朝刺激方向生长，例如向光性（朝光长）和向地性（根朝下、茎朝上），由生长素分布不均引起。ٕPlants grow toward or away from stimuli—phototropism (toward light) and gravitropism (roots down, shoots up)—driven by uneven auxin distribution.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�96a53325097d�body�ٖ抗生素针对细菌的结构和代谢（如细胞壁合成），而病毒没有这些结构，靠劫持宿主细胞复制，所以抗生素无效。ٜAntibiotics target bacterial structures and metabolism like cell-wall synthesis; viruses lack these and hijack host cells, so antibiotics don't affect them.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�97e1129b8549�body���细胞骨架由微管、肌动蛋白微丝和中间纤维三类蛋白质纤维构成，为细胞提供支撑并参与运动、物质运输和细胞分裂。微管还构成纤毛、鞭毛和纺锤体，驱动细胞形态改变与染色体分离。�The cytoskeleton is made of three protein-fiber systems, microtubules, actin microfilaments, and intermediate filaments, that give the cell support and drive movement, transport, and division. Microtubules also build cilia, flagella, and the spindle that segregates chromosomes.�ans��src��《细胞生物学》�'Molecular Biology of the Cell (Alberts)��id�983adc2dbe0a�body��该假说认为，扰动（如风暴、火灾）过于频繁会不断清除物种，过于稀少则少数竞争强者独占资源，二者都降低多样性。中等频率的干扰为早期与晚期物种都留出空间，防止优势种垄断，从而使物种多样性达到最高。�QThe hypothesis holds that very frequent disturbance wipes species out and very rare disturbance lets competitive dominants monopolize resources—both lower diversity. Moderate disturbance leaves room for both early- and late-successional species, preventing any single strong competitor from excluding the rest and maximizing diversity.�ans��src��FConnell，《热带雨林与珊瑚礁的多样性》，Science 1978年�LConnell, "Diversity in tropical rainforests and coral reefs," Science (1978)��id�98e6fc5941a3�body��!这四个转录因子协同重塑染色质并激活多能性网络核心基因，同时抑制体细胞身份相关程序。它们逐步关闭分化基因、开启 Nanog 等干性基因，最终使表观遗传时钟回拨到类胚胎状态。c-Myc 促进增殖但也是致瘤风险来源。�nThe four transcription factors cooperatively remodel chromatin and activate the core pluripotency network while repressing somatic identity programs. They progressively silence differentiation genes and turn on stemness genes such as Nanog, rewinding the epigenetic clock toward an embryo-like state. c-Myc boosts proliferation but also contributes tumorigenic risk.�ans��src�ٯTakahashi, Yamanaka,《Induction of Pluripotent Stem Cells from Mouse Embryonic and Adult Fibroblast Cultures by Defined Factors》,Cell,2006 (DOI: 10.1016/j.cell.2006.07.024)٭Takahashi, Yamanaka, 'Induction of Pluripotent Stem Cells from Mouse Embryonic and Adult Fibroblast Cultures by Defined Factors', Cell, 2006, DOI: 10.1016/j.cell.2006.07.024��id�9929ccf2fc32�body��^噪声可分为内在与外在两部分：内在噪声源于转录起始、mRNA 降解等在低拷贝数下的随机事件，尤其是启动子的爆发式转录使产物数目服从远离泊松的分布；外在噪声来自细胞间在核糖体、聚合酶数量、细胞周期阶段和体积上的差异，会同时影响多个基因。当下游存在正反馈或阈值型开关时，这些随机差异可被放大并锁定，如枯草杆菌的感受态与芽孢化选择、噬菌体的裂解-溶原决策。噪声因此既是干扰，也是无遗传差异下实现群体分化和风险分摊的机制。��Noise splits into intrinsic and extrinsic components: intrinsic noise arises from the stochastic nature of transcription initiation and mRNA decay at low copy number, and bursty promoters in particular give distributions far from Poisson, while extrinsic noise reflects cell-to-cell differences in ribosome and polymerase abundance, cell-cycle stage and volume that affect many genes together. When downstream positive feedback or a threshold switch exists, such random differences are amplified and locked in, as in competence and sporulation choices in Bacillus subtilis or the lysis-lysogeny decision of phage. Noise is thus both a nuisance and a mechanism for diversifying an isogenic population and hedging risk.�ans��src��~Raj A, van Oudenaarden A. Nature, nurture, or chance: stochastic gene expression and its consequences. Cell (2008) 135:216-226�~Raj A, van Oudenaarden A. Nature, nurture, or chance: stochastic gene expression and its consequences. Cell (2008) 135:216-226��id�9a6e737a52b8�body��,病毒具备遗传信息和演化能力，但不能独立代谢、必须依赖宿主复制，因此处于生命与非生命的边界。支持者认为它们是“寄生性遗传实体”，反对者强调缺少细胞与代谢不符合生命定义。这一争议影响了生命起源和分类研究。�IViruses carry genetic information and evolve, yet cannot metabolize independently and must replicate inside hosts, sitting on the boundary of life. Supporters call them 'parasitic genetic entities'; opponents stress the lack of cells and metabolism disqualifies them. The debate shapes origin-of-life and classification research.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�9a7520fc44c9�body���酶是生物催化剂，能降低反应所需的活化能，使反应在温和条件下快速进行。它们通过活性位点与底物特异性结合，并可在反应后重复使用。温度或pH偏离最适值会使酶失活。� Enzymes are biological catalysts that lower the activation energy a reaction needs, letting it proceed quickly under mild conditions. They bind substrates specifically at their active sites and can be reused after the reaction. Temperatures or pH far from the optimum can inactivate them.�ans��src��KAlberts 等,《Molecular Biology of the Cell》第6版,Garland Science,2014�PB. Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell, 6th ed., Garland Science, 2014��id�9ad9273aa407�body���真社会性物种如蜜蜂和蚂蚁中多数个体不育、专职照顾少数繁殖者并分工协作，亲缘选择使帮助近亲繁殖的收益超过自身繁殖，从而演化出高度利他结构。��In eusocial species like bees and ants most individuals are sterile, caring for few reproductives with division of labor; kin selection makes helping relatives' reproduction outweigh personal reproduction, evolving extreme altruism.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�9ba0832b786e�body��R复制叉通过时旧组蛋白被大致对称地分配到两条子链，新合成的组蛋白由 CAF-1 等伴侣蛋白装配填补空位，形成旧新混合的核小体。带有原有修饰的旧组蛋白充当模板，通过读写偶联机制吸引相应的修饰酶，例如 PRC2 识别 H3K27me3 后在邻近核小体上继续甲基化，SUV39H1 与 HP1 在 H3K9me3 区域自我扩展。DNA 甲基化则依靠 DNMT1 与 UHRF1 识别半甲基化位点快速复原。若这些反馈在分裂后未及时完成，修饰模式可能被稀释或漂移，这正是表观遗传可塑性的来源。��As the fork passes, old histones are distributed roughly symmetrically to both daughter strands while newly made histones are deposited by chaperones such as CAF-1, producing nucleosomes of mixed old and new subunits. Old histones carrying pre-existing marks serve as templates, and read-write coupling recruits the matching enzymes, so PRC2 reading H3K27me3 methylates adjacent nucleosomes and SUV39H1 with HP1 propagates H3K9me3 domains. DNA methylation is restored quickly because DNMT1 with UHRF1 recognizes hemimethylated sites. When these feedback loops lag behind division, marks can be diluted or drift, which is precisely the origin of epigenetic plasticity.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�9c0e55038865�body��激素是由内分泌腺分泌、经血液运输到全身的化学信使，只有带对应受体的靶细胞才能响应。胰岛素属于肽类激素，与细胞膜受体结合后触发细胞内信号链，促使肌肉和脂肪细胞把葡萄糖转运入胞，从而降低血糖。1型糖尿病是免疫系统破坏胰岛B细胞，胰岛素几乎不能分泌；2型糖尿病则是受体对胰岛素不敏感，细胞“听不见命令”。两者都让葡萄糖滞留在血液里，长期高血糖会损伤血管、神经和肾脏。�zHormones are chemical messengers secreted by endocrine glands and carried through the blood; only target cells bearing the matching receptor can respond. Insulin is a peptide hormone: it binds a membrane receptor and triggers an intracellular signaling chain that makes muscle and fat cells transport glucose inside, lowering blood glucose. Type 1 diabetes arises when the immune system destroys the pancreatic beta cells, leaving almost no insulin; type 2 diabetes is insulin resistance, where cells fail to hear the order. In both cases glucose stays in the blood, and chronic high glucose damages blood vessels, nerves and kidneys.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�9c77fb3f498d�body��DNA 聚合酶无法完全复制线性染色体末端（末端复制问题），导致端粒每次分裂丢失 50–200 个碱基；端粒酶以自身 RNA 为模板用逆转录延长端粒，在生殖细胞、干细胞和多数癌细胞中活跃，从而维持染色体稳定。�)The end-replication problem prevents DNA polymerase from copying chromosome ends fully, losing 50–200 bp per division; telomerase uses its intrinsic RNA template to extend telomeres by reverse transcription, staying active in germ cells, stem cells and most cancers to preserve genome stability.�ans��src��KAlberts 等,《Molecular Biology of the Cell》第6版,Garland Science,2014�PB. Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell, 6th ed., Garland Science, 2014��id�9d0e7e7904f3�body�ٽ颈动脉窦和主动脉弓的压力感受器感知血压变化，经神经将信号送到延髓，血压高时减速心率并扩张血管，血压低时则反向调节，数秒内恢复。��Baroreceptors in the carotid sinus and aortic arch sense pressure changes and signal the medulla; rising pressure slows heart rate and dilates vessels, while falling pressure does the reverse, restoring pressure within seconds.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�9d9ee8364536�body��这里地处喜马拉雅抬升带，山脉纵横、海拔落差巨大，形成无数孤立又多样的生境“孤岛”；加上地处热带—温带过渡、受季风影响，物种在此分化并长期隔离演化，催生大量特有种，如大熊猫、珙桐、报春。�8The region sits along the Himalayan uplift with deep gorges and huge elevation gradients, creating isolated yet diverse habitat “islands”. Its tropical–temperate transition and monsoon climate let species diverge and evolve in long isolation, spawning many endemics like the panda, dove tree and primroses.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�9e113f229d8a�body�ل细胞通过表面受体接收激素、神经等化学信号，经内部通路把信息传给基因与机器，从而协调行为。ٞCells receive chemical signals like hormones via surface receptors and pass the message inside through pathways to genes and machinery, coordinating behavior.�ans��src��KAlberts 等,《Molecular Biology of the Cell》第6版,Garland Science,2014�PB. Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell, 6th ed., Garland Science, 2014��id�9e410f4ba49a�body��^研究较清楚的途径有三类：分泌神经活性物质或调控宿主神经递质系统，如寄生蜂向猎物特定神经节注射毒素造成选择性瘫痪；改变宿主的免疫与内分泌状态间接影响脑功能，如弓形虫在脑内形成包囊并伴随多巴胺代谢改变，与啮齿类对猫尿气味的回避减弱相关；直接侵入并重塑运动相关组织，如虫草真菌在蚂蚁体内诱导定型的攀高与咬紧行为以利孢子扩散。判断是否为适应性操纵需要证明该行为提高了寄生物的传播成功率，而非仅是宿主生病的副产物。��Three routes are reasonably well documented: secreting neuroactive compounds or hijacking host neurotransmitter systems, as when a parasitoid wasp injects venom into specific ganglia to cause selective paralysis; altering immune and endocrine state to affect brain function indirectly, as with Toxoplasma cysts in the brain accompanied by changes in dopamine metabolism and reduced rodent aversion to cat odour; and directly invading and remodelling locomotor tissue, as when Ophiocordyceps fungi drive infected ants into stereotyped climbing and biting that favours spore dispersal. Calling such changes adaptive manipulation requires showing that the behaviour raises parasite transmission success rather than being a by-product of illness.�ans��src��sAdamo,《Parasites: evolution’s neurobiologists》,Journal of Experimental Biology,2013 (DOI: 10.1242/jeb.073601)�qAdamo, 'Parasites: evolution’s neurobiologists', Journal of Experimental Biology, 2013, DOI: 10.1242/jeb.073601��id�9e9f8247cee1�body�ف神经递质是神经元之间传递信号的化学分子，如多巴胺关联奖赏与动力，血清素影响情绪与睡眠。هNeurotransmitters are chemical messengers between neurons; dopamine relates to reward and motivation, serotonin affects mood and sleep.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�9f55eac6a445�body��~外来入侵物种是被引入新环境后缺乏天敌、迅速扩散并危害本地生态或经济的物种，如水葫芦。ْAn invasive species is introduced to a new area where, lacking predators, it spreads fast and harms local ecology or economy, like water hyacinth.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�9fcd6e6ec289�body���固氮由根瘤菌等固氮细菌和蓝藻将大气氮转为氨，硝化细菌把氨氧化为硝酸盐，反硝化细菌在缺氧条件下把硝酸盐还原为氮气返回大气，维持全球氮平衡。��Nitrogen fixation is done by rhizobia and cyanobacteria converting N2 to ammonia, nitrifiers oxidize ammonia to nitrate, and denitrifiers reduce nitrate back to N2 under anoxia, together maintaining global nitrogen balance.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�a195020d8228�body���它们形成坚固的内生孢子：把DNA和少量必要物质紧紧包裹、脱水、代谢几乎停止，像按了暂停键。孢子抗热、抗辐射、抗干燥，环境合适时重新吸水苏醒分裂。��They form tough endospores: DNA and essentials are packed tight, dehydrated, metabolism nearly halted—like pressing pause. Spores resist heat, radiation and dryness, reviving and dividing when conditions return.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�a3bf0d587cb1�body���在原核生物中，错配修复蛋白 MutS 识别错配，MutL 与 MutH 协作，由 Dam 甲基化标记区分模板链（已甲基化）与新链（暂未甲基化），从而只切除并修正新链上的错误。�In prokaryotes, MutS recognizes mismatches and MutL/MutH act together; strand discrimination relies on Dam methylation marking the parental template as methylated while the nascent strand is briefly unmethylated, so only the new strand is excised and corrected.�ans��src��Annual Review of Biochemistry�Annual Review of Biochemistry��id�a40d86a9a886�body���细菌分泌胞外聚合物形成附着群落，内部细胞受物理屏障保护而降低药物渗透和免疫清除，并呈现代谢缓慢的持久态，导致慢性感染和耐药增强。��Bacteria embed in self-made extracellular polymeric matrices that limit drug penetration and immune clearance and harbor slow-metabolizing persister cells, driving chronic infection and heightened resistance.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�a456cc26bf51�body���化石记录显示前五次大灭绝由自然灾变造成，而当前物种灭绝速率高出背景值数十到数百倍，主因是人类活动导致的栖息地破坏、气候变化和过度开发。��The fossil record shows five prior mass extinctions from natural catastrophes, yet current extinction rates exceed background levels by tens to hundreds of times, driven mainly by habitat loss, climate change and overexploitation from human activity.�ans��src��EE. O. Wilson,《The Diversity of Life》Harvard University Press,1992�CE. O. Wilson, The Diversity of Life, Harvard University Press, 1992��id�a6148e3a8508�body���粗面内质网上的核糖体合成蛋白质后，内质网负责初步折叠和修饰，例如添加糖链。高尔基体随后进一步加工、分类并包装这些蛋白质，通过囊泡运送到细胞膜、溶酶体或细胞外。�0After ribosomes on the rough endoplasmic reticulum synthesize proteins, the ER handles initial folding and modifications such as adding sugar chains. The Golgi apparatus then further processes, sorts, and packages these proteins, shipping them by vesicles to the membrane, lysosomes, or outside the cell.�ans��src��YAlberts 等《细胞的分子生物学》(Molecular Biology of the Cell, Garland Science)�?Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell (Garland Science)��id�a65428dd3fba�body�٥该学说认为线粒体源自被早期真核细胞吞入并共生的细菌，保留了自己的环形DNA和双层膜，证据包括其分裂方式与细菌相似。ٲThe theory holds that mitochondria came from bacteria engulfed and kept as symbionts by early eukaryotes, retaining circular DNA and double membranes, and dividing like bacteria.�ans��src��aRichard Dawkins,《The Selfish Gene》Oxford,1976;中译《自私的基因》中信出版社,2012�TR. Dawkins, The Selfish Gene, Oxford University Press, 1976; Chinese ed. CITIC, 2012��id�a70c3365ae62�body���基因型是一个人的遗传信息本身，即DNA上携带的基因组合。表型是可观察到的特征，如身高、血型，由基因型与环境共同决定。同卵双胞胎基因型相同，但表型仍可能因环境而略有差异。�Genotype is a person's actual genetic information, the combination of genes carried in DNA. Phenotype is the observable trait, such as height or blood type, shaped by both genotype and environment. Identical twins share a genotype yet may differ slightly in phenotype due to environment.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�a74fc4729752�body��@耐药性是自然选择加水平基因转移的结果。细菌繁殖快、突变不断，只要种群中有一个个体出现耐药突变，抗生素就会把它筛选出来：敏感菌被杀死，耐药菌繁殖扩散。更麻烦的是细菌之间通过质粒等可移动元件交换耐药基因，一种细菌学会的耐药性可以“批发”给其他菌种。滥用和用药不足（如给病毒感染开抗生素、自行停药）都加剧筛选。多重耐药的 MRSA 和碳青霉烯耐药肠杆菌就是典型的超级细菌，能对抗几乎全部常用抗生素。��Resistance is natural selection combined with horizontal gene transfer. Bacteria reproduce quickly and mutate constantly; if even one individual carries a resistance mutation, antibiotics select for it, as sensitive cells die while resistant ones multiply and spread. Worse, bacteria swap resistance genes through mobile elements like plasmids, so one species' resistance can be wholesale-copied to others. Both overuse and misuse, such as antibiotics for viral infections or stopping courses early, intensify the selection. Multidrug-resistant MRSA and carbapenem-resistant Enterobacteriaceae are classic superbugs that defy nearly every common antibiotic.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�a925252d836d�body��j肾脏的基本单位是肾单位，分三步工作。第一，肾小球滤过：血压把血液里的水、小分子（葡萄糖、氨基酸、无机盐、尿素）连同废物压过滤过膜，血细胞和大分子蛋白质被挡住留在血管里。第二，肾小管重吸收：管壁把几乎所有葡萄糖和氨基酸主动运回血液，按身体需要回收大部分水分和无机盐。第三，肾小管分泌：多余的离子、氢离子、药物被主动排进管腔。抗利尿激素和醛固酮根据身体水平衡调整水的重吸收量，最终形成的尿液就是浓缩后的多余水和废物。��The kidney's working unit is the nephron, which does three jobs. First, glomerular filtration: blood pressure pushes water and small molecules, including glucose, amino acids, salts and urea, through the filter membrane, while blood cells and large proteins are held back. Second, tubular reabsorption: the tubule wall actively hauls almost all glucose and amino acids back into the blood and reclaims most water and salts according to the body's needs. Third, tubular secretion: excess ions, hydrogen ions and drugs are actively pumped into the tubule. The hormones ADH and aldosterone tune how much water is reabsorbed, and the final urine is simply the surplus water and waste concentrated together.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�a929a045b8e3�body���内环境稳态指机体通过调节机制把体温、血糖、pH等内部条件维持在相对稳定范围的能力。例如出汗降温、胰岛素调节血糖都是稳态表现。稳态失衡往往意味着疾病。�Homeostasis is the body's ability to keep internal conditions such as temperature, blood sugar, and pH within a stable range through regulatory mechanisms. Sweating to cool down and insulin adjusting blood sugar are examples. Loss of homeostasis often signals disease.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�aa14097f81a2�body��能否放大看物质性质：难降解、脂溶又排不出的污染物（有机氯农药、甲基汞）会长期留在体内。消费者吃下的不只是食物，还有猎物攒的存货，一生摄入远超自身体重，于是浓度沿食物链逐级抬升，顶级捕食者可比周围水体高出成千上万倍。对照来看：能量每级只剩约十分之一，污染物却每级都加。两处易混：生物积累指同一个体对环境的富集，放大指跨营养级上升；水溶性强、易排出的不走这条路。�0Whether a substance magnifies depends on its chemistry: pollutants that resist breakdown, dissolve in fat and are hard to excrete (organochlorine pesticides, methylmercury) stay put in an organism's tissues. A consumer eats not just food but everything its prey had stored, and over a lifetime it ingests far more than its own body weight, so concentrations climb rung by rung until top predators carry levels thousands of times above the surrounding water. Set that against energy in a food chain, which drops to roughly a tenth at each step while the pollutant rises at each step. Two confusions to separate: bioaccumulation is one organism enriching against its environment, biomagnification is the rise across trophic levels; and substances that dissolve in water and are readily excreted do not take this route.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�aa566a613879�body�ه激素是由内分泌腺分泌的化学信使，经血液传遍全身，调节生长、情绪、代谢等，如胰岛素控制血糖。ٔHormones are chemical messengers from glands that travel in blood to regulate growth, mood, and metabolism, such as insulin controlling blood sugar.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�acf84a0eef8f�body��Y负反馈使输出反向抑制自身上游，效果是压缩稳态波动、提高对参数变化的鲁棒性并加快响应，若在反馈回路中引入足够的时间延迟或多步中介，还会产生持续振荡，如 p53-MDM2 振荡与生物钟。正反馈和双负反馈则放大微小差异，在合适参数下形成双稳态与滞后现象，使系统在两个稳定状态间做全或无切换，并对撤除刺激具有记忆。真实网络常把两者耦合：正反馈负责决策的不可逆性，负反馈负责限定幅度与恢复，这种组合是可靠细胞决策的通用设计。��Negative feedback lets output inhibit its own upstream step, which compresses steady-state fluctuations, buys robustness to parameter variation and speeds response, and with sufficient delay or multiple intermediates it produces sustained oscillation, as in p53-MDM2 cycles and circadian clocks. Positive or double-negative feedback amplifies small differences and, in the right parameter range, creates bistability and hysteresis so the system flips all-or-none between states and remembers a stimulus after it is withdrawn. Real networks usually couple both: positive feedback makes a decision irreversible while negative feedback bounds amplitude and permits reset, a generic design for reliable cellular decisions.�ans��src��hBrandman O, Meyer T. Feedback loops shape cellular signals in space and time. Science (2008) 322:390-395�hBrandman O, Meyer T. Feedback loops shape cellular signals in space and time. Science (2008) 322:390-395��id�ad4f2277a10a�body��遗传漂变是指小群体中基因频率因随机偶然事件而改变的现象，与自然选择无关。例如少数个体建立新群体时（奠基者效应），某些基因可能意外增多或减少。它在小种群中对进化的影响尤为显著。�>Genetic drift is the random change in gene frequencies in a small population due to chance events, unrelated to natural selection. For example, when a few individuals found a new group, the founder effect can make some genes unexpectedly rise or fall. Its evolutionary impact is especially strong in small populations.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�ae74dab263a5�body���群体需满足随机交配、无突变、无自然选择、无基因流且群体无限大；任一条件被打破都会导致等位基因频率改变，因此该平衡常被用作检验进化是否发生的零模型。��The population must have random mating, no mutation, no selection, no gene flow and infinite size; violation of any condition shifts allele frequencies, so the equilibrium serves as a null model for detecting evolution.�ans��src��《群体遗传学》教材�Evolutionary Analysis��id�b353ed0ceeb9�body��"周期蛋白依赖性激酶的活性由周期蛋白丰度、CDK 抑制蛋白和磷酸化状态共同决定，而丰度控制的关键是两类泛素连接酶：SCF 复合体降解 CDK 抑制蛋白促进 S 期进入，APC/C 在中后期降解 securin 和 M 期周期蛋白以启动染色体分离与退出分裂。蛋白降解是热力学上不可逆的步骤，配合正反馈和双负反馈构成的开关，使细胞一旦跨过阈值就无法回退。这种设计避免了同一轮 DNA 复制被重复启动，保障基因组只复制一次。�vCyclin-dependent kinase activity is set by cyclin abundance, CDK inhibitor proteins and phosphorylation state, and abundance is governed largely by two ubiquitin ligases: the SCF complex degrades CDK inhibitors to allow S-phase entry, while APC/C destroys securin and mitotic cyclins to trigger chromosome separation and mitotic exit. Proteolysis is thermodynamically irreversible, and combined with positive and double-negative feedback it forms switches that prevent the cell from sliding backwards once a threshold is crossed. This design blocks re-initiation of replication so that the genome is copied exactly once per cycle.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�b35df17566b2�body��)植物没有神经元，但拥有通过维管束与胞间连丝传播的动作电位与系统性信号（如受伤诱导的电信号），可协调防御与生长。植物神经生物学主张用信号网络视角理解这些可塑性，但反对把植物等同于有意识的动物神经系统。�rPlants lack neurons but have action potentials and systemic signals traveling through vascular bundles and plasmodesmata, such as wound-induced electrical waves, that coordinate defense and growth. Plant neurobiology proposes understanding these plastic signaling networks as a framework, while rejecting the notion that plants are conscious animal-like nervous systems.�ans��src��8Nature Plants (2019) 5:1-8，植物长距离信号综述�CNature Plants (2019) 5:1-8, review on long-distance plant signaling��id�b380698475ab�body�ف碳在大气、海洋、生物和岩石间不断流动：植物固碳、动物呼吸与燃烧释放碳，维持地球碳平衡。نCarbon moves among air, ocean, life, and rock: plants fix carbon, respiration and burning release it, keeping Earth's carbon balanced.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�b50c53c55bed�body��人类等哺乳动物拥有肺循环和体循环两套回路：肺循环把缺氧血送到肺换气，体循环把含氧血送往全身。心脏的四个腔室把这两套血流完全分开，提高了供氧效率。这是温血动物维持高代谢的基础。�BMammals like humans have two circuits: pulmonary circulation sends oxygen-poor blood to the lungs, and systemic circulation delivers oxygen-rich blood to the whole body. The heart's four chambers keep these two flows separate, raising oxygen-delivery efficiency. This underpins the high metabolism of warm-blooded animals.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�b5f7438fe03f�body�٥改造后的病毒（如AAV、慢病毒）去掉致病部分、装入正常基因，把治疗基因送入患者细胞以弥补缺陷，用于治疗部分遗传病。٭Engineered viruses (e.g. AAV, lentivirus) are stripped of disease genes and loaded with a normal gene to deliver therapy into patient cells, treating some genetic disorders.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�b732d28bcc9d�body�نEvo-Devo研究基因如何调控胚胎发育，以及这些调控的微小改变如何在演化中产生身体结构的巨大差异。ًEvo-Devo studies how genes control embryo development and how small changes in that control produce big evolutionary body-plan differences.�ans��src��_Jeffery，《洞穴鱼作为演化发育生物学模型系统》，《发育生物学》2001年�iJeffery, "Cavefish as a model system in evolutionary developmental biology," Developmental Biology (2001)��id�b7b691d14947�body���含羞草的运动叫感震性，机制与动物的神经反射类似，但载体不同。触摸引起叶枕（叶柄基部膨大的运动细胞）产生电信号和化学信号，钾离子和水迅速流出，膨压骤降，细胞失水变软，叶片便合拢下垂；十几秒到几十分钟后水分回充，叶片重新张开。植物没有神经元，依靠细胞膨压和电信号组成的本土“快速反应系统”，却能把信号以每秒数厘米的速度传遍整株。�'Mimosa's movement is seismonasty, similar in spirit to a reflex but built differently. Touch triggers electrical and chemical signals in the pulvini, the swollen motor cells at the leaf bases; potassium and water rush out of the cells, turgor pressure collapses, the cells soften and the leaflets fold and droop. Over minutes to tens of minutes water returns and the leaves reopen. Plants have no neurons; they use a home-grown rapid response system based on turgor and electrical signals, yet can conduct the signal at several centimeters per second.�ans��src��PNAS（含羞草运动机制）� PNAS (mimosa movement mechanism)��id�b8bc9569052c�body���冬小麦要经历一段足够长的冬季低温才能在春天正常开花，这种现象叫春化。低温是植物测量季节的“日历”：持续而漫长的冷暴露会抑制 FLC 这类开花抑制基因的表达，并通过表观遗传修饰把这种抑制状态“锁定”，解除对成花基因的封锁。回暖后白昼变长又促进开花；如果冬天太暖，植物会误以为冬天没到，整个春天都不抽穗，收成大减。��Winter wheat needs a long enough spell of winter cold to flower normally the following spring, and this is vernalization. Cold is the plant's seasonal calendar: prolonged chilling silences flowering-suppressor genes such as FLC, and epigenetic marks lock in the silenced state, lifting the block on floral genes. Longer days after warm-up then promote flowering; if winter is too mild, the plant acts as if winter never came and may fail to head all spring, cutting yields sharply.�ans��src��Nature（春化作用研究）�Nature (vernalization research)��id�b93fa15ef53f�body��Sanger法利用2',3'-双脱氧核苷三磷酸（ddNTP）终止DNA链合成：ddNTP缺少3'-羟基，被DNA聚合酶掺入后下一个核苷酸无法连接，合成随即终止。测序反应中按比例混入少量标记的ddATP/ddTTP/ddCTP/ddGTP，与正常dNTP竞争，产生末端分别在A/T/C/G处终止、长度各异的片段库。现代自动化版本用四种不同荧光标记的ddNTP在单管反应中完成，经毛细管电泳按长度分离，激光检测器逐个读出荧光颜色，即得到碱基序列。�RSanger sequencing exploits 2',3'-dideoxynucleoside triphosphates (ddNTPs), which lack a 3'-hydroxyl group: once incorporated by DNA polymerase, no further nucleotide can be added and synthesis stops. A small proportion of labeled ddATP, ddTTP, ddCTP, and ddGTP is included with normal dNTPs, producing a library of fragments terminated randomly at each A, T, C, or G. Modern automated versions use four fluorescently labeled ddNTPs in a single reaction, separate the fragments by capillary electrophoresis by length, and a laser detector reads the color at each position to reveal the sequence.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�ba2026cfe9e0�body�٥电子传递链把电子传给氧，过程中把质子泵出线粒体内膜形成梯度；质子顺梯度经ATP合酶回流，像水流推动涡轮一样合成ATP。ٿThe electron transport chain passes electrons to oxygen and pumps protons out, building a gradient; protons flow back through ATP synthase like water through a turbine, driving ATP synthesis.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�ba8fe548e9ec�body��Z精子先在女性生殖道中获能（capacitation），然后与卵子透明带的ZP3蛋白结合，触发顶体反应释放蛋白水解酶，消化透明带，使精子穿入并接触卵细胞膜。精子融合引发皮质反应：卵子皮质颗粒释放酶类（如ZP2被水解、透明带硬化），使其余精子无法再结合或穿过透明带，这是主要的多精阻断机制；同时卵细胞膜电位变化提供快阻断。多精受精会导致胚胎染色体异常和发育失败。受精还使卵子恢复减数分裂II、释放第二极体，合子的原核融合后开始卵裂。��Sperm undergo capacitation in the female reproductive tract, then bind ZP3 of the zona pellucida, triggering the acrosome reaction: hydrolytic enzymes digest the zona, allowing the sperm to penetrate and contact the oocyte membrane. Sperm fusion triggers the cortical reaction: enzymes released from cortical granules harden the zona (e.g., ZP2 cleavage) so other sperm can no longer bind or pass through; this is the main slow block to polyspermy, with a rapid block from a change in membrane potential. Polyspermy causes chromosomal abnormalities and failed development. Fertilization also resumes meiosis II and expels the second polar body; after pronuclear fusion, cleavage begins.�ans��src��U翟中和 王喜忠 丁明孝,《细胞生物学》第4版,高等教育出版社,2011�HZhai Zhonghe et al., Cell Biology, 4th ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�bio_19_003�body��s印迹基因在精子或卵子形成时被打上亲本特异的DNA甲基化标记,受精后该标记保留而双亲等位基因携带不同的表观遗传状态。沉默通常由差异甲基化区招募CTCF或Polycomb复合体实现,阻断增强子与启动子的沟通。体细胞分裂时DNMT1将甲基化模式照抄到新链,使印迹在个体一生中保持稳定。��Imprinted genes acquire parent-specific DNA methylation marks during sperm or egg formation, and after fertilization the two alleles carry different epigenetic states. Silencing is usually enforced when a differentially methylated region recruits CTCF or Polycomb complexes, blocking enhancer-promoter communication. During cell division DNMT1 copies the methylation pattern onto the new strand, keeping the imprint stable across the lifespan.�ans��src�يBarlow & Bartolomei,《Genomic Imprinting in Mammals》,Cold Spring Harbor Perspectives in Biology,2014 (DOI: 10.1101/cshperspect.a018382)وBarlow & Bartolomei, 'Genomic Imprinting in Mammals', Cold Spring Harbor Perspectives in Biology, 2014, DOI: 10.1101/cshperspect.a018382��id�bio_19_006�body���染色体末端重复序列随每次复制逐渐丢失,过短的端粒失去保护性结构后被识别为DNA双链断裂,激活p53-p21通路使细胞永久退出增殖周期。虽然这限制了组织的再生潜力,但它同时是一道防癌屏障,阻止携带潜在突变的细胞无限分裂。在小鼠模型中强行延长端粒酶活性虽改善组织功能,却也提高某些肿瘤的发生率。�Telomeric repeats erode with each round of replication; once critically short, chromosome ends lose their protective structure and are sensed as double-strand breaks, activating the p53-p21 pathway and permanently withdrawing the cell from proliferation. Although this curbs tissue regenerative capacity, it also acts as an anti-cancer barrier against unlimited division of cells carrying latent mutations. Mouse experiments that forcibly extend telomerase activity improve tissue function yet raise the incidence of some tumors.�ans��src�ٍBernardes de Jesus & Blasco,《Telomerase at the intersection of cancer and aging》,Trends in Genetics,2013 (DOI: 10.1016/j.tig.2013.06.007)ًBernardes de Jesus & Blasco, 'Telomerase at the intersection of cancer and aging', Trends in Genetics, 2013, DOI: 10.1016/j.tig.2013.06.007��id�bio_19_009�body���夜间温度低、湿度高,同样的二氧化碳摄入量伴随的水分流失远小于白天,苹果酸储存的碳白天脱羧供Calvin循环使用。在荒漠和附生植物栖居的树冠等水分极不稳定的环境里,提高单次用水效率比追求最大光合速率更重要。代价是碳同化总量受限,所以CAM植物普遍生长缓慢,这是干旱环境下的合理权衡。��Night air is cool and humid, so each unit of CO2 taken in costs far less water than daytime uptake would; carbon stored as malate is decarboxylated the next day to feed the Calvin cycle. In habitats with highly unreliable water such as deserts or the canopy where epiphytes live, maximizing water-use efficiency matters more than peak photosynthetic rate. The trade-off is a limited total carbon gain, hence generally slow growth — a rational bargain under drought.�ans��src��iWinter, Smith,《Crassulacean Acid Metabolism》,Ecological Studies,1996 (DOI: 10.1007/978-3-642-79060-7)�jWinter and Smith, 'Crassulacean Acid Metabolism', Ecological Studies, 1996, DOI: 10.1007/978-3-642-79060-7��id�bio_19_013�body���高桥和利与山中伸弥经候选基因筛选发现，强制表达Oct4、Sox2、Klf4和c-Myc即可把小鼠成纤维细胞转变为类似胚胎干细胞的克隆。这四个核心调控因子重新打开多能性位点的染色质，关闭谱系特异性程序，并重建自我维持的基因回路。由此获得的诱导多能干细胞使不依赖胚胎的患者特异性疾病建模成为可能。��Takahashi and Yamanaka screened candidate genes and found that forced expression of Oct4, Sox2, Klf4 and c-Myc converts mouse fibroblasts into colonies resembling embryonic stem cells. These master regulators reopen chromatin at pluripotency loci, extinguish lineage-specific programs and rebuild self-sustaining gene circuits. The resulting induced pluripotent stem cells enabled patient-specific disease modeling without using embryos.�ans��src���Takahashi, K. & Yamanaka, S.，《Induction of pluripotent stem cells from mouse embryonic and adult fibroblast cultures by defined factors》，载于《Cell》2006年第126卷第4期，第663–676页。٦Takahashi, K. & Yamanaka, S. (2006). Induction of pluripotent stem cells from mouse embryonic and adult fibroblast cultures by defined factors. Cell, 126(4), 663-676.��id�bio_19_016�body���全基因组调查显示，猎豹经历了远古瓶颈事件以及近代剧烈的数量衰减，基因组中留下大段纯合片段，并伴随精子形态异常等典型近交征象。低遗传多样性削弱了应对气候变化和疫病的适应潜力，而引入外源个体的杂交方案又与亚种纯度保护的主张相冲突。如今基因组数据正为管理性基因流和辅助繁殖项目提供决策依据。��Genome-wide surveys indicate cheetahs passed through ancient bottlenecks followed by a severe recent decline, leaving long homozygous stretches and classic inbreeding signs such as abnormal sperm morphology. Low diversity constrains adaptive potential under climate and disease pressure, yet outcrossing proposals clash with concerns over subspecies purity. Genomic data now guide decisions on managed gene flow and assisted reproduction programs.�ans��src�ْDobrynin, Liu, Tamazian & Xiong,《Genomic legacy of the African cheetah, Acinonyx jubatus》,Genome Biology,2015 (DOI: 10.1186/s13059-015-0837-4)ِDobrynin, Liu, Tamazian & Xiong, 'Genomic legacy of the African cheetah, Acinonyx jubatus', Genome Biology, 2015, DOI: 10.1186/s13059-015-0837-4��id�bio_19_019�body���早期胚胎会对X染色体进行计数，并在每个细胞中随机选定一条使之失活，浓缩成巴氏小体。长链非编码RNA Xist以顺式方式包被被选中的那条染色体，招募Polycomb复合体沉积抑制性的H3K27me3修饰，随后又在启动子CpG岛上加上DNA甲基化。由于沉默状态随细胞分裂被克隆式继承，相邻组织可能表达不同的等位基因，三花猫的毛色便是这种嵌合体的著名例证。��Early embryos count their X chromosomes and randomly select one per cell for inactivation, condensing it into the Barr body. The long noncoding RNA Xist coats the chosen chromosome in cis, recruiting Polycomb complexes that deposit repressive H3K27me3 marks followed by DNA methylation at promoter CpG islands. Because descendants inherit the silenced state clonally, neighboring tissues can express different alleles, famously visible as calico cat coat patterns.�ans��src��mLyon,《Gene Action in the X-chromosome of the Mouse (Mus musculus L.)》,Nature,1961 (DOI: 10.1038/190372a0)�kLyon, 'Gene Action in the X-chromosome of the Mouse (Mus musculus L.)', Nature, 1961, DOI: 10.1038/190372a0��id�bio_20_003�body��o脱落酸与受体PYR/PYL结合后,受体便扣住原本持续压制SnRK2激酶的PP2C磷酸酶。被释放的SnRK2随即磷酸化阴离子通道SLAC1,通道开放驱动保卫细胞钾离子与阴离子外流,膨压骤降,气孔随之收拢。这条从受体经磷酸酶、激酶到通道的线性通路,是植物信号转导中被解析得最完整的范例之一。��Abscisic acid binds its PYR/PYL receptors, which then sequester PP2C phosphatases that otherwise keep SnRK2 kinases suppressed. Freed SnRK2 phosphorylates the SLAC1 anion channel; its opening drives potassium and anion efflux from guard cells, turgor collapses, and the pore closes. This linear chain from receptor through phosphatase and kinase to channel ranks among the most completely resolved signaling pathways in plants.�ans��src��MMa 等鉴定ABA受体PYR1的论文,《Science》2009年第324卷第1064页。�wMa Y et al., Regulators of PP2C phosphatase activity function as abscisic acid sensors, Science 324(5930): 1064 (2009).��id�bio_20_006�body���未连接的动粒上组装出含Mad2、Mad3(BubR1)、Bub3与Cdc20的检查点复合物,Mad2如安全带锁扣般钳住Cdc20使其失活。失去自由Cdc20,后期促进复合物APC/C便无法泛素化securin,分离酶持续被抑,姐妹染色单体间的黏连蛋白得以保全。直到最后一个动粒完成两极连接,检查点信号熄灭,Cdc20获释,细胞才同步踏入后期。��Unattached kinetochores assemble a checkpoint complex containing Mad2, Mad3 (BubR1), Bub3, and Cdc20; Mad2 clamps onto Cdc20 like a seat-belt buckle and holds it inactive. With no free Cdc20, the APC/C cannot ubiquitinate securin, separase remains inhibited, and cohesin holding sister chromatids together stays intact. Only when the final kinetochore achieves bipolar attachment does checkpoint signaling lapse, Cdc20 is released, and the cell commits to anaphase in unison.�ans��src��Musacchio 与 Salmon 的检查点机制权威综述,《Nature Reviews Molecular Cell Biology》2007年第8卷第369–381页。نMusacchio A & Salmon ED, The spindle-assembly checkpoint in space and time, Nature Reviews Molecular Cell Biology 8: 369–381 (2007).��id�bio_20_009�body���抗原漂移是血凝素与神经氨酸酶编码区点突变的逐年累积,免疫压力筛出逃逸株,属于渐进的线性微进化。抗原转变则依托分节段基因组的跨种重配:人流感株与禽流感株共感染同一细胞时,八段基因组随机包装,一步即可产出表面抗原焕然一新的重组毒株。漂移解释季节性流行,转变解释大流行的零星引爆,两者共同迫使疫苗定期换代。�/Antigenic drift is the year-on-year accretion of point mutations in the hemagglutinin and neuraminidase genes, with immune pressure selecting escape variants—a gradual, incremental process. Antigenic shift instead rides on cross-species reassortment of the eight-segmented genome: when human and avian strains co-infect one cell, random segment packaging can deliver, in a single step, a recombinant wearing wholly novel surface antigens. Drift accounts for seasonal epidemics, shift for sporadic pandemics, and together they force periodic vaccine renewal.�ans��src��zWebster 等关于甲型流感病毒进化与生态的长篇综述,《Microbiological Reviews》1992年第56卷第152页。�hWebster RG et al., Evolution and ecology of influenza A viruses, Microbiological Reviews 56: 152 (1992).��id�bio_20_016�body���耐酸菌主要通过三种协同机制应对极端酸性:反向转运蛋白以K+/H+和Na+/H+逆向运输将流入的质子排出胞外;细胞膜富含饱和脂肪酸并带有疏水基团修饰,显著降低质子通透性;外膜蛋白和表面糖链形成缓冲层中和局部酸度。此外,胞内伴侣蛋白可修复少量已发生部分变性的蛋白质。这些机制使 Acidihalobacter prosperus 等菌株能在pH 1–2的酸性矿坑水中完成铁硫氧化代谢。�SAcidophiles counter extreme acidity through three cooperating mechanisms: K+/H+ and Na+/H+ antiporters expel the protons that leak inward; membranes enriched in saturated fatty acids with hydrophobic modifications sharply reduce proton permeability; and outer-membrane proteins plus surface polysaccharides form a buffering layer that neutralizes local acidity. Cytoplasmic chaperones additionally refold the small fraction of proteins that partially unfold. Together these systems let organisms such as Acidihalobacter prosperus run iron- and sulfur-oxidizing metabolism in pH 1–2 mine water.�ans��src��qBaker-Austin C & Dopson M, Life in acid: pH homeostasis in acidophiles, Trends in Microbiology 18(2):55-63 (2010)�qBaker-Austin C & Dopson M, Life in acid: pH homeostasis in acidophiles, Trends in Microbiology 18(2):55-63 (2010)��id�bio_20_019�body��
该模型指出:中性吲哚乙酸可自由扩散进入细胞,而在偏碱的胞质中被解离为阴离子并被滞留;排出则依赖定位于细胞特定侧面的PIN蛋白家族外流转运体。由于各细胞的PIN蛋白不对称分布在质膜上(如根表皮细胞将其置于底端),生长素只能单向流动,形成贯穿组织的运输流。环境信号通过重新定位PIN或调节其转录改变运输方向,从而在向光性、向重力性等反应中建立局部生长素浓度梯度,指导差异生长。�QThe chemiosmotic model holds that neutral indole-3-acetic acid diffuses into cells but dissociates into an anion in the relatively alkaline cytoplasm, trapping it until efflux carriers intervene. Efflux is mediated by PIN-family transporters whose localization on particular faces of each cell—basally in root epidermal cells, for example—channels auxin unidirectionally through the tissue. Environmental cues redirect flow by repositioning PINs or altering their transcription, generating local auxin gradients during phototropism and gravitropism that drive differential cell elongation.�ans��src��dVanneste S & Friml J, Auxin: a trigger for change in plant development, Cell 136(6):1005-1016 (2009)�dVanneste S & Friml J, Auxin: a trigger for change in plant development, Cell 136(6):1005-1016 (2009)��id�bio_21_003�body��c热液喷口喷出的硫化氢等还原性物质成为能量来源:化能合成细菌氧化硫化物固定二氧化碳制造有机物,支撑起不依赖光合作用的生态系统。管蠕虫体内几乎没有消化道,全靠共生的化能细菌提供营养。这类群落的生产力可与浅海珊瑚礁媲美,是海洋生物学的重要发现之一。��Vents discharge reduced compounds such as hydrogen sulfide that serve as an energy source: chemoautotrophic bacteria oxidize sulfide to fix carbon dioxide into organic matter, supporting a food web independent of photosynthesis. Giant tube worms lack a functional gut entirely and depend on symbiotic chemosynthetic bacteria for nutrition. These communities rival shallow coral reefs in productivity, one of the landmark discoveries of marine biology.�ans��src���Corliss 等,《Science》203 卷 (1979) 论文 Submarine thermal springs on the Galápagos Rift;Childress 与 Fisher,《Oceanography and Marine Biology: An Annual Review》第 30 卷 (1992) 热液动物生理学综述٧Corliss et al., Science 203 (1979), 'Submarine Thermal Springs on the Galápagos Rift'; Childress & Fisher, Oceanography and Marine Biology: An Annual Review 30 (1992)��id�bio_21_006�body��;固氮酶遇氧即发生不可逆失活,类菌体必须在接近无氧的环境中才能工作。但根瘤菌的呼吸链又需要氧气来产生驱动固氮所需的大量ATP。豆血红蛋白把游离氧浓度压到纳摩尔级别,同时以结合态向类菌体持续供氧,在保护和供能之间取得平衡。��Nitrogenase is irreversibly inactivated on contact with oxygen, so bacteroids can only operate in a near-anoxic milieu. Yet the respiratory chain of rhizobia still needs oxygen to generate the large ATP supply that nitrogen fixation demands. Leghemoglobin holds free O2 at nanomolar levels while delivering bound oxygen continuously to the bacteroids, reconciling protection with energy supply.�ans��src�٫Appleby C.A., 'Leghemoglobin and Rhizobium Respiration', Annual Review of Plant Physiology, 1984;Dixon & Wheeler, 'Nitrogen Fixation in Plants', Cambridge University PressٸAppleby C.A., 'Leghemoglobin and Rhizobium Respiration', Annual Review of Plant Physiology, 1984; Dixon R.O.D. & Wheeler C.T., 'Nitrogen Fixation in Plants', Cambridge University Press��id�bio_21_009�body���生物发光的能量来自化学反应本身:萤光素在荧光素酶催化下与 ATP 和氧气反应,生成激发态的氧化萤光素,其退激时释放光子,全程不需要外部光源。荧光则是先吸收外来光子进入激发态再重新辐射,一旦停止照射立刻熄灭。所以终年不见光的深海鱼类只能依靠化学发光,而珊瑚等荧光生物的光全部来自环境光。�
Bioluminescence draws energy from the chemical reaction itself: luciferin is oxidized by luciferase together with ATP and oxygen to form excited-state oxyluciferin, which emits a photon as it relaxes, with no external light involved. Fluorescence instead works by absorbing incoming photons and re-radiating them, so it vanishes the moment illumination stops. That is why deep-sea fishes living in permanent darkness depend solely on chemical luminescence, whereas fluorescent corals get all their glow from ambient light.�ans��src�ٻWilson T. & Hastings J.W., 'Bioluminescence: Living Lights, Lights for Living', Harvard University Press;Shimomura O., 'Bioluminescence: Chemical Principles and Methods', World ScientificټWilson T. & Hastings J.W., 'Bioluminescence: Living Lights, Lights for Living', Harvard University Press; Shimomura O., 'Bioluminescence: Chemical Principles and Methods', World Scientific��id�bio_21_013�body��<低温层积期间,胚内的脱落酸被逐步代谢,促进赤霉素合成的基因随之上调,萌发的生理刹车就此松开。这套计时机制防止种子在初秋短暂回暖时提前出苗而遭冻害。只有完整经历冬季低温的个体才会在春季同步萌发,这对幼苗存活率至关重要。��During chilling, abscisic acid in the embryo is progressively catabolized while genes for gibberellin biosynthesis are upregulated, releasing the physiological brake on germination. This timing device stops seedlings from emerging during warm spells in early autumn, when frost would kill them. Only seeds that experience the full winter chill germinate together in spring, which strongly shapes seedling survival.�ans��src�ِFinch-Savage 与 Leubner-Metzger,《Seed dormancy and the control of germination》,New Phytologist,2006 (DOI: 10.1111/j.1469-8137.2006.01787.x)ٌFinch-Savage & Leubner-Metzger, 'Seed dormancy and the control of germination', New Phytologist, 2006, DOI: 10.1111/j.1469-8137.2006.01787.x��id�bio_21_016�body���麻疹病毒抗原高度保守,减毒活疫苗会在体内短暂复制,持续刺激生发中心,产生高亲和力记忆B细胞和能在骨髓中存活数十年的长寿命浆细胞。流感病毒的血凝素和神经氨酸酶则通过抗原漂移快速改变表面表位,原有免疫记忆难以识别新毒株。因此世界卫生组织每年依据全球监测数据预测下一流行季的优势毒株,重新确定疫苗组分。�FMeasles virus keeps a highly conserved antigen profile, and the live attenuated vaccine replicates briefly in the body, sustaining germinal-center reactions that generate high-affinity memory B cells and long-lived plasma cells able to persist in bone marrow for decades. Influenza virus instead alters its hemagglutinin and neuraminidase epitopes rapidly through antigenic drift, so established immune memory struggles to recognize new strains. The World Health Organization therefore redefines vaccine composition annually based on predictions drawn from global surveillance data.�ans��src�٨Plotkin《Vaccines》(第7版,Elsevier)关于保护持久性与记忆B细胞的章节;世界卫生组织全球流感监测与应对体系(GISRS)年度疫苗组分建议��Plotkin's Vaccines (7th ed., Elsevier), chapters on durability of protection and memory B cells; WHO Global Influenza Surveillance and Response System (GISRS) annual composition recommendations��id�bio_22_003�body���报警叫声提高了鸣叫者被捕食的风险，却能提醒附近亲属钻洞避险。汉密尔顿法则指出：当亲缘系数r与收益B的乘积大于成本C（rB>C）时，利他行为会被自然选择保留。谢尔曼的野外观测发现，留守出生地的雌鼠身边多是姐妹和后代，遇险时频繁报警；散居远方、缺乏亲属的雄鼠极少出声，鸣叫率随在场亲属数量上升，与广义适合度预测一致。�An alarm call raises the caller's own risk of predation yet prompts nearby kin to retreat into burrows. Hamilton's rule states that altruism persists when relatedness r times benefit B exceeds cost C (rB>C). Paul Sherman's field observations found that females staying at their birth site, surrounded by sisters and offspring, call frequently during danger, while dispersing males with few relatives nearby rarely call—and calling rates climb with the number of kin present, matching inclusive-fitness predictions.�ans��src��iSherman,《Nepotism and the Evolution of Alarm Calls》,Science,1977 (DOI: 10.1126/science.197.4310.1246)�gSherman, 'Nepotism and the Evolution of Alarm Calls', Science, 1977, DOI: 10.1126/science.197.4310.1246��id�bio_22_006�body���团队以蕈状支原体为起点，先经全基因组转座子诱变筛出必需基因，再化学合成并组装缩减版基因组，多轮“设计—构建—测试”迭代后获得仅约53万碱基对、473个基因的JCVI-syn3.0。其中149个基因虽功能未知却不可删除，因为删除会使细胞停止增殖——生命核心网络仍藏未注释的关键组件；该最小底盘也为按需加装新功能提供了平台。�sStarting from Mycoplasma mycoides, the team first used whole-genome transposon mutagenesis to classify every gene as essential or dispensable for growth, then chemically synthesized and assembled progressively reduced genomes through iterative design-build-test cycles, arriving at JCVI-syn3.0 with about 531 kilobase pairs and only 473 genes. One hundred forty-nine genes stayed despite unknown functions because removing any halted cell proliferation—evidence that life's core network still hides unannotated essential components—and this stripped-down chassis became a platform for installing custom functions on demand.�ans��src�ٓHutchison C.A. III 等《Design and synthesis of a minimal bacterial genome》,Science,2016年第351卷文章号aad6253,DOI:10.1126/science.aad6253وHutchison C.A. III et al., "Design and synthesis of a minimal bacterial genome," Science 351:aad6253 (2016), doi:10.1126/science.aad6253��id�bio_22_009�body���裂褶菌等四极性担子菌由两个复等位基因座决定性别：A座编码同源域转录因子，B座编码信息素及其G蛋白偶联受体。仅当两座等位基因均不同时，交叉的信息素—受体识别才启动双核化发育并形成锁状联合。负频率依赖选择偏爱罕见等位基因，使每个座位积累数百种特异性，自由组合令裂褶菌拥有逾2.8万种交配型，最大化异宗交配、避免近亲衰退。�bIn tetrapolar basidiomycetes such as Schizophyllum commune, sex is governed by two multiallelic loci: the A locus encodes homeodomain transcription factors, while the B locus encodes pheromones and their G-protein-coupled receptors. Only when both loci differ between partners does reciprocal pheromone-receptor recognition trigger dikaryotization with clamp connections. Negative frequency-dependent selection favors rare alleles, letting hundreds of specificities accumulate per locus—together yielding more than 28,000 mating types in S. commune, maximizing outcrossing and averting inbreeding depression.�ans��src�٪Casselton L.A. & Olesnicky N.S.《Molecular genetics of mating recognition in basidiomycete fungi》,Microbiology and Molecular Biology Reviews,1998年第62卷第55-70页ٞCasselton L.A. & Olesnicky N.S., "Molecular genetics of mating recognition in basidiomycete fungi," Microbiology and Molecular Biology Reviews 62:55-70 (1998)��id�bio_22_013�body���关键在胚胎节点的纤毛：它们统一后倾并定向旋转，驱动周围胚外液体形成持续的左向流动。左缘的纤毛感知该信号后启动Nodal级联，使Lefty、Pitx2等基因只在左侧表达，指定心脏环转与内脏定位。驱动蛋白KIF3B为纤毛组装所必需，其突变会让节点纤毛完全缺失、左向流动消失，内脏位置随之镜像反位或随机分布——证明方向性纤毛流本身携带左右轴的原初信息。�UThe key lies in the cilia of the embryonic node: uniformly tilted posteriorly, they rotate in one direction, driving the surrounding extraembryonic fluid in a steady leftward flow. Cilia on the left rim sense this cue and trigger the Nodal cascade, so genes such as Lefty and Pitx2 switch on only on the left, orienting heart looping and organ placement. The kinesin KIF3B is required to assemble cilia at all; mutating it removes the nodal cilia entirely, abolishing leftward flow and randomizing organ situs—proof that directional ciliary flow itself carries primordial left-right information.�ans��src���Nonaka S. 等《Randomization of left-right asymmetry due to loss of nodal cilia generating leftward flow of extraembryonic fluid in mice lacking KIF3B motor protein》,Cell,1998年第95卷第829-837页��Nonaka S. et al., "Randomization of left-right asymmetry due to loss of nodal cilia generating leftward flow of extraembryonic fluid in mice lacking KIF3B motor protein," Cell 95:829-837 (1998)��id�bio_22_016�body���芋螺毒液含数十至上百种小肽，各组分分子小、二硫键密集、构象刚性强，能以极高的亲和力专一识别某种离子通道或受体亚型，例如ω-芋螺毒素MVIIA可选择性阻断N型钙通道。这种精确性使它们既能作神经研究的分子探针，也是理想的药物先导物——源自纹芋螺的镇痛药齐考诺肽已于2004年获批上市。��Cone snail venom holds dozens to over a hundred small peptides. Each conotoxin is tiny, densely cross-linked by disulfide bridges and conformationally rigid, letting it bind one particular ion-channel or receptor subtype with very high affinity: omega-conotoxin MVIIA, for instance, selectively blocks N-type calcium channels. Such precision makes them valuable molecular probes and ideal drug leads; the painkiller ziconotide, derived from Conus magus venom, was approved in 2004.�ans��src��-Olivera等，《Science》第230卷，1985年�!Olivera et al., Science 230, 1985��id�bio_22_020�body���巴西具窍蝮蛇毒液中的缓激肽增强肽可抑制血管紧张素转化酶，延缓扩血管的缓激肽降解。施贵宝的Cushman与Ondetti据此设计出首个口服ACE抑制剂卡托普利（1981年获批）：它阻断血管紧张素Ⅰ向强缩血管的Ⅱ转变，并减少醛固酮释放而降压。毒液为制伏猎物演化出的高选择性酶抑制分子，与人体同源通路契合，是理想的药物先导物。�4Bradykinin-potentiating peptides in Bothrops jararaca venom inhibit angiotensin-converting enzyme, prolonging the action of the vasodilator bradykinin. Building on this, Cushman and Ondetti at Squibb designed captopril, approved in 1981 as the first oral ACE inhibitor: it blocks the conversion of angiotensin I into strongly vasoconstricting angiotensin II and reduces aldosterone release, lowering blood pressure. Venoms evolve highly selective enzyme inhibitors to subdue prey; these often fit homologous human regulatory pathways, making them ideal drug leads.�ans��src���Ondetti MA, Rubin B, Cushman DW：血管紧张素转化酶特异性抑制剂的设计——一类新的口服活性降压药，《Science》1977年第196卷第4288期第441–444页，DOI:10.1126/science.191908��Ondetti MA, Rubin B, Cushman DW. Design of specific inhibitors of angiotensin-converting enzyme: a new class of orally active antihypertensive agents. Science, 1977, 196(4288): 441-444. DOI: 10.1126/science.191908��id�bio_23_006�body���心室切除后，创面先由纤维蛋白凝块封闭；切口边缘的成熟心肌细胞随即去分化、拆散肌节并重新增殖，子代细胞迁移铺满凝块后再分化，重建心肌层与新血管，几乎不留瘢痕。血小板衍生生长因子、视黄酸、神经调节蛋白等信号参与调度。哺乳动物成体心肌细胞基本退出细胞周期，损伤只能由成纤维细胞的瘢痕封堵。��After amputation a fibrin clot seals the wound; mature cardiomyocytes along the cut edge dedifferentiate, disassemble their sarcomeres and start proliferating again. Daughter cells migrate across the clot, then redifferentiate, rebuilding the muscle wall and new vessels with little fibrosis. Signals such as PDGF, retinoic acid and neuregulin orchestrate the program. Adult mammalian cardiomyocytes have largely exited the cell cycle, so injuries are plugged by fibroblast-made scar.�ans��src��:Poss 等：《斑马鱼的心脏再生》，Science，2002�HPoss, Wilson & Keating, 'Heart regeneration in zebrafish', Science, 2002��id�bio_23_009�body��|感光并不只靠眼睛，光信息还能直抵下丘脑深部的脑内光感受器。一次长日照后数小时内，垂体结节部便分泌促甲状腺激素，使基底下丘脑的DIO2上调、DIO3下调，把局部甲状腺素T4转成高活性T3；T3继而激活下丘脑—垂体—性腺轴，推动性腺复苏。这条级联就是鸟类丈量日长的分子季节钟。��Light sensing is not confined to the eyes: photons also reach deep-brain photoreceptors near the hypothalamus. Within hours of a single long day, the pituitary pars tuberalis secretes thyroid-stimulating hormone, raising DIO2 and lowering DIO3 in the mediobasal hypothalamus, which converts local thyroxine (T4) into potent triiodothyronine (T3). T3 then activates the hypothalamic–pituitary–gonadal axis and revives the gonads — a molecular seasonal clock that measures day length.�ans��src��eNakao 等：《光诱导的T4向T3激素转换调控鸟类性腺的光周期反应》，Nature，2008�~Nakao et al., 'Light-induced hormone conversion of T4 to T3 regulates photoperiodic response of gonads in birds', Nature, 2008��id�bio_23_013�body���局部病原侵染后，感病叶中的水杨酸被SAMT酶甲基化为水杨酸甲酯（MeSA）。MeSA脂溶性较强，经韧皮部运抵远端健康组织，由酯酶SABP2水解还原为水杨酸；积累的水杨酸经受体NPR1诱导PR病程相关基因表达并建立预激发状态，使全株在二次侵染时启动更快更广的防御，构成植物系统性免疫的核心长距离信号通路。��After localized infection, salicylic acid in the diseased leaf is methylated by SAMT into methyl salicylate (MeSA). The lipophilic MeSA moves through the phloem to distant healthy tissue, where the esterase SABP2 hydrolyzes it back to salicylic acid; accumulated SA then acts via receptor NPR1 to induce pathogenesis-related genes and establish a primed state, letting the whole plant mount faster and broader defense upon secondary attack — the core long-distance circuit of plant systemic immunity.�ans��src��iPark 等，《Science》2007年烟草SAR中MeSA-SABP2移动信号研究（DOI: 10.1126/science.1147113）ٛPark et al., methyl salicylate is a critical mobile signal for plant systemic acquired resistance, Science 318:113-116 (2007), DOI: 10.1126/science.1147113��id�bio_23_016�body��f果肉常含萌发抑制物并维持高渗透压，黏附的果皮还阻碍水分进入；鸟类的消化去除果肉并轻度磨损种皮，从而打破休眠。同时种子被运离母树，避开亲株附近密集的专一天敌与幼苗竞争（Janzen–Connell效应），萌发率与建群机会同步提高，深刻影响森林更新的空间格局。��Fruit pulp often carries germination inhibitors and keeps seeds in an osmotically stressful environment, while clinging pericarp blocks water uptake. Gut transit strips the pulp and lightly abrades the coat, breaking dormancy; birds also carry seeds away from the parent tree, escaping dense natural enemies and seedling competition near adults (the Janzen–Connell effect). Germination and colonization chances rise together, shaping the spatial pattern of forest regeneration.�ans��src�ّTraveset, A. (1998), Effect of seed passage through vertebrate frugivores guts on germination: a review, Journal of Biogeography 25(3): 473–486ّTraveset, A. (1998), Effect of seed passage through vertebrate frugivores guts on germination: a review, Journal of Biogeography 25(3): 473–486��id�bio_24_019�body��大多数基因父母双方版本等价,但约百分之一的基因带着来源标签(印记),只表达单一亲本副本——在动物界为哺乳类所特有。进化解释是亲本利益的拉锯:父亲一方希望胚胎尽量汲取母体资源(他的基因可能在别的后代身上),母亲一方要平衡本次与未来生育。证据极端干脆:只用父本基因构建的小鼠胚胎长出大胎盘却发育停滞,只用母本基因则胚胎相对大而胎盘发育不良——两套基因组像谈判双方,缺一不可。印记基因出错会导致贝威氏综合征等罕见病,也解释了克隆哺乳动物的诸多困难。��Most genes treat both parental copies equally, but about one percent carry parent-of-origin marks (imprints) expressing only one side — unique to mammals. The evolutionary reading is parental tug-of-war: paternal genes push embryos to extract maximum maternal resources (his genes may ride other offspring), maternal genes balance this litter against future ones. The evidence is stark: mouse embryos with only paternal genomes grow huge placentas but stall, maternally-only ones build big embryos on skimpy placentas — two genomes negotiating, neither optional. Imprint errors cause syndromes like Beckwith-Wiedemann and much of cloning difficulty.�ans��src��|McGrath 与 Solter,《Completion of mouse embryogenesis requires both the maternal and paternal genomes»,Cell 第37卷,1984�zJ. McGrath and D. Solter, Completion of mouse embryogenesis requires both the maternal and paternal genomes, Cell 37, 1984��id�bio_26_009�body���因为端粒上的shelterin复合体把染色体末端伪装成受保护染色质。TRF1与TRF2结合双链TTAGGG重复,POT1覆盖富G的单链3′突出端,再由TPP1、TIN2和RAP1交联成六亚基装置;TRF2抑制ATM信号并推动t环把突出端藏入双链区,POT1阻断ATR招募,二者还遏制非同源末端连接以防端粒互融。TRF2或POT1一旦缺失,裸露末端即刻触发p53依赖的损伤应答与染色体桥接。�FBecause the shelterin complex assembled on telomeric repeats disguises the terminus as protected chromatin. TRF1 and TRF2 bind duplex TTAGGG repeats, POT1 caps the G-rich single-stranded 3-prime overhang, and TPP1, TIN2 and RAP1 cross-link them into a six-subunit apparatus. TRF2 suppresses ATM signaling and drives t-loops that tuck the overhang into duplex DNA, while POT1 blocks ATR recruitment; both also restrain non-homologous end joining so telomeres cannot fuse. Lose TRF2 or POT1 and the naked end instantly triggers a p53-dependent damage response and chromosome bridging.�ans��src�٦Denchi EL与de Lange T论文《Protection of telomeres through independent control of ATM and ATR by TRF2 and POT1》,Nature 2007(洛克菲勒大学de Lange实验室)٢Denchi EL & de Lange T, 'Protection of telomeres through independent control of ATM and ATR by TRF2 and POT1', Nature, 2007 (de Lange lab, Rockefeller University)��id�bio_26_012�body���多巴胺放电量反映实际奖赏减去预期的差值,而非愉悦本身。Schultz在清醒猴的黑质致密部与腹侧被盖区记录:意外获得果汁时多巴胺成簇发放;反复训练后放电前移到预测线索出现的一刻,奖赏如期而至反而不再响应;预期落空时放电跌破基线。三种模式正好实现Rescorla-Wagner学习规则,多巴胺由此作为教学信号驱动突触可塑性与策略更新。�Dopamine firing scales with actual reward minus expectation, not with pleasure itself. Recording in the substantia nigra pars compacta and ventral tegmental area of alert monkeys, Schultz saw bursts to unpredicted juice; after training, activity shifted to the predictive cue and vanished when reward arrived as expected, while omitted rewards drove firing below baseline. These three patterns implement the Rescorla-Wagner rule, letting dopamine act as a teaching signal that drives synaptic plasticity and policy updating.�ans��src�نSchultz W、Dayan P与Montague PR论文《A neural substrate of prediction and reward》,Science 1997(弗里堡大学Schultz实验室)لSchultz W, Dayan P & Montague PR, 'A neural substrate of prediction and reward', Science, 1997 (Schultz lab, University of Fribourg)��id�bio_26_020�body���它把识别事件翻译成基因表达,构成与门电路。synNotch受体结合抗原A后,胞内核心经蛋白酶剪切释放入核,开启针对第二种抗原的CAR基因表达;T细胞只有先被抗原A启动、再遭遇抗原B才执行杀伤,仅表达其中任一抗原的健康组织得以幸免。Roybal等验证这套与门逻辑可清除双抗原阳性肿瘤而不伤单阳细胞,为实体瘤免疫治疗提供控制脱靶毒性的通用框架。�FIt translates recognition events into gene expression, wiring up an AND gate. Once a synNotch receptor binds antigen A, its intracellular core is cleaved, released and enters the nucleus to switch on a CAR directed against a second antigen; the T cell kills only after being primed by antigen A and then meeting antigen B, so tissue expressing either marker alone is left untouched. Roybal and colleagues showed this AND logic clears dual-positive tumors without harming single-positive cells, giving solid-tumor immunotherapy a general blueprint for containing off-target toxicity.�ans��src�٬Roybal KT等论文《Engineering T cells with customized therapeutic response programs using synthetic Notch receptors》,Cell 2016(加州大学旧金山分校Lim实验室)ٴRoybal KT et al., 'Engineering T cells with customized therapeutic response programs using synthetic Notch receptors', Cell, 2016 (Lim lab, University of California, San Francisco)��id�c074b85e86db�body��2微生物暗物质指环境中大量存在却无法在实验室培养、也难以归类的微生物类群，多靠宏基因组测序才被发现。它们可能占据生命之树的许多未知分支，参与碳氮循环却功能成谜。弄清它们有助于理解地球生化循环和新型药物来源。�eMicrobial dark matter refers to abundant environmental microbes we cannot culture in labs or easily classify, found mainly via metagenomic sequencing. They may occupy many unknown branches of the tree of life and drive carbon and nitrogen cycles while their functions stay mysterious. Unraveling them helps explain Earth's biochemistry and new drug sources.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�c1bf35bb36ad�body��产甲烷古菌在缺氧环境（湿地、反刍动物胃、填埋场）中以二氧化碳、氢气或乙酸为底物产生甲烷，是地球甲烷的主要生物来源。它们拥有独特的辅酶F420和甲基辅酶M还原酶，这一代谢使它们明显区别于细菌。�/Methanogenic archaea in oxygen-free settings (wetlands, ruminant stomachs, landfills) produce methane from CO2, H2, or acetate, making them Earth's main biological methane source. They rely on unique coenzyme F420 and methyl-coenzyme M reductase, a metabolism that clearly sets them apart from bacteria.�ans��src��KMadigan 等，《Brock 微生物生物学》（第15版，Pearson，2018）�IMadigan et al., Brock Biology of Microorganisms (15th ed., Pearson, 2018)��id�c2615827333a�body���肾髓质中，亨勒袢与集合管平行逆向流动形成"逆流倍增"：髓质间质由外向内盐浓度递增，集合管在抗利尿激素作用下对水通透，水被高渗间质抽走，从而浓缩尿液、减少水分丢失。�TIn the renal medulla, the loop of Henle and collecting ducts run in parallel counterflow to create a "countercurrent multiplier": the interstitial salt gradient rises from outer to inner medulla, and under antidiuretic hormone the collecting duct becomes water-permeable, letting water be pulled out to concentrate urine and conserve water.�ans��src��PGuyton 与 Hall，《医学生理学教科书》（第13版，Elsevier，2016）�HGuyton & Hall, Textbook of Medical Physiology (13th ed., Elsevier, 2016)��id�c36701ca1246�body��辐射对称（如刺胞动物）身体绕中轴呈辐射状，适合固着或漂浮、从各方向感知环境；两侧对称（绝大多数动物）有前后、左右之分，便于定向运动和头部集中感官，是复杂行为和组织分工演化的基础。�ARadial symmetry, as in cnidarians, arranges the body around a central axis, suiting sessile or drifting life that senses from all sides; bilateral symmetry, in most animals, distinguishes front-back and left-right, enabling directed movement and head-centered senses, the basis for complex behavior and division of labor.�ans��src��《动物学》�Campbell Biology��id�c4b50346eb18�body�ِ微生物组是体表和体内（尤其肠道）的庞大微生物群落，参与消化、免疫和情绪调节，失衡与多种疾病相关。ٙThe microbiome is the vast community of microbes on and in us, especially the gut; it aids digestion, immunity, and mood, and imbalance links to disease.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�c50a5d55e2ea�body��无义突变把原本编码氨基酸的密码子变成终止密码子，使蛋白质在中间被提前截断。细胞拥有"无义介导的mRNA降解"（NMD）这一质控通路，能识别并降解带提前终止密码子的异常转录本，避免积累可能有毒的截短蛋白。�2A nonsense mutation converts a sense codon into a stop codon, truncating the protein prematurely. Cells deploy nonsense-mediated mRNA decay (NMD), a quality-control pathway that detects and degrades transcripts carrying premature stop codons, preventing the buildup of potentially toxic truncated proteins.�ans��src��FWatson 等，《基因分子生物学》（第7版，Pearson，2012）�EWatson et al., Molecular Biology of the Gene (7th ed., Pearson, 2012)��id�c663de13af08�body��#约5.4亿年前寒武纪早期，动物门类在相对短时间内大量出现。可能原因包括大气氧气上升、捕食压力催生硬壳与器官创新、以及发育基因工具包（Hox基因）的成熟让身体蓝图可灵活重组。至今仍是演化生物学的核心谜题。�rIn the early Cambrian about 540 million years ago, animal phyla appeared in a geologically short window. Proposed drivers include rising atmospheric oxygen, predation pressure spurring hard shells and organ innovation, and maturation of the developmental genetic toolkit (Hox genes) allowing flexible body-plan rewiring. It remains a core puzzle of evolutionary biology.�ans��src��aRichard Dawkins,《The Selfish Gene》Oxford,1976;中译《自私的基因》中信出版社,2012�TR. Dawkins, The Selfish Gene, Oxford University Press, 1976; Chinese ed. CITIC, 2012��id�c768b6dae2c3�body��噬菌体是专门感染细菌的病毒，通常把遗传物质注入细菌、利用宿主复制自身，最终裂解细菌释放子代（裂解周期）。也有温和噬菌体把基因整合进宿主染色体随其复制（溶原周期）。噬菌体被研究用于抗菌疗法。�LBacteriophages are viruses that infect bacteria; they usually inject their genetic material, hijack the host to make copies, and lyse the cell to release progeny (lytic cycle). Some temperate phages integrate their genes into the host chromosome and replicate with it (lysogenic cycle). They are studied for antibacterial therapies.�ans��src��《微生物学》�Brock Biology of Microorganisms��id�c819c76c78b6�body��信号转导是细胞接收外部信号（如激素或神经递质）并将其转化为内部反应的过程。信号分子与受体结合后，常通过一系列蛋白激酶的级联放大效应传递信息。这使细胞能协调生长、分裂和代谢等活动。�ZSignal transduction is how a cell receives an external signal, such as a hormone or neurotransmitter, and converts it into an internal response. After a signaling molecule binds its receptor, information is often relayed through a cascade of protein kinases that amplifies the message. This lets cells coordinate growth, division, and metabolism.�ans��src��U翟中和 王喜忠 丁明孝,《细胞生物学》第4版,高等教育出版社,2011�HZhai Zhonghe et al., Cell Biology, 4th ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�c8a184d1229f�body��<CRISPR-Cas9 利用一段引导 RNA（gRNA）识别目标 DNA 序列，并引导 Cas9 酶在该位置切割双链 DNA，使科学家能够敲除或替换特定基因。该技术源自细菌对抗病毒的免疫机制，2012 年由 Doudna 和 Charpentier 团队阐明，二人因此获得 2020 年诺贝尔化学奖。�BCRISPR-Cas9 uses a guide RNA to recognize a target DNA sequence and directs the Cas9 enzyme to cut the DNA there, allowing scientists to knock out or replace specific genes. Derived from a bacterial antiviral immune mechanism, it was elucidated in 2012 by Doudna and Charpentier, who won the 2020 Nobel Prize in Chemistry.�ans��src��m《科学》（Science）期刊 2012 年 Doudna & Charpentier 论文；2020 年诺贝尔化学奖官方公告�PScience (2012), Doudna & Charpentier; Nobel Prize in Chemistry 2020 announcement��id�c91eb538af6a�body��+间断平衡认为，物种在漫长的地质时间里形态相对稳定（停滞），随后在较短时期内发生快速成种与形态改变，而非以恒定的缓慢速度渐变。它强调成种事件本身而非个体变异的累积，是化石中常见"突然出现"现象的一种解释。�NPunctuated equilibrium holds that species stay morphologically stable (stasis) for long spans, then undergo rapid speciation and change in relatively short bursts, rather than changing at a constant slow pace. It emphasizes speciation events over gradual individual change and helps explain the "sudden appearances" common in fossils.�ans��src��dGould 与 Eldredge，《间断平衡：对种系渐变的替代》，《模型古生物学》1972年�WGould & Eldredge, "Punctuated equilibria: an alternative to phyletic gradualism" (1972)��id�c9a2dce2b4fa�body�ه拟态是一种生物模仿另一种生物或环境以获得保护，例如无毒的食蚜蝇长得像有毒的蜜蜂以吓退天敌。ٓMimicry is when one species imitates another or the environment for protection, e.g. harmless hoverflies resemble stinging bees to deter predators.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�c9f6f2e4ac5c�body���树皮内侧的韧皮部承担“向下送粮”的运输：光合产物（糖）从叶片经筛管运往根部等“库”。环割切断了韧皮部，糖无法下运，就大量积存在切口以上的枝条和果实里，果实得到的糖更多，自然更大更甜；而负责向上输水的木质部在树皮内侧更深层，未被损伤，根系仍能靠储存物质存活。若环割过宽且不愈合，根部长期断粮最终会让整棵树枯死，所以生产中只做轻度环割或螺旋割。�>The phloem inside the bark ships sugar downward: photosynthate moves from leaves through sieve tubes to sinks like the roots. Girdling severs the phloem, so sugar can no longer travel down and piles up in the branches and fruits above the cut, giving fruits extra sugar and making them bigger and sweeter. The water-carrying xylem lies deeper, beyond the cut, so it keeps working and the roots survive on stored reserves; if the cut ring is too wide and fails to heal, the roots are starved and the whole tree may die, which is why growers use only a light or spiral girdle.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�cb7d813c2382�body��~维管束是植物体内的“管道系统”，木质部向上运水，韧皮部向下运糖，让高大植物成为可能。�qVascular bundles are the plant's 'plumbing': xylem moves water up, phloem moves sugar down, enabling tall plants.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�cb7d864562d8�body��^碳在光合作用、呼吸作用、分解和燃烧之间循环。植物通过光合作用把空气中的二氧化碳固定进有机物（糖、纤维素），成为木头、粮食的骨架；动物吃植物又把碳带进动物身体，呼吸时把碳以二氧化碳形式还给大气。生物死亡后，分解者把有机碳矿化回二氧化碳。还有一部分碳被沉积物封存，经地质作用变成煤炭、石油，燃烧又把它们释放出来。海洋也是巨大的碳库，吸收大气二氧化碳；人类燃烧化石燃料加速了这个过程，导致大气二氧化碳浓度上升。��Carbon cycles through photosynthesis, respiration, decomposition and combustion. Plants fix atmospheric CO2 into organic molecules, sugars and cellulose, which form the skeleton of wood and grain; animals eat plants and take carbon into their bodies, then return it to the air as CO2 when they breathe. When organisms die, decomposers mineralize the organic carbon back to CO2. Some carbon gets buried in sediments and, over geological time, becomes coal and oil; burning releases it again. The ocean is also a huge carbon reservoir that absorbs CO2 from the atmosphere, and burning fossil fuels has accelerated the flow, raising atmospheric CO2 levels.�ans��src�� 《普通生物学》(陈阅增)�General Biology (Chen Yuezeng)��id�cbddbb02bc9f�body��该轴包括迷走神经传入、肠嗜铬细胞释放的血清素、微生物代谢物（短链脂肪酸、胆汁酸）以及下丘脑-垂体-肾上腺轴激素。菌群可经这些通路影响情绪与认知，而应激激素反过来改变菌群组成，形成闭环。�NThe axis includes vagal afferents, serotonin released by enterochromaffin cells, microbial metabolites (short-chain fatty acids, bile acids) and hypothalamic-pituitary-adrenal axis hormones. Microbes can shape mood and cognition through these routes, while stress hormones in turn alter microbial composition, forming a feedback loop.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�cc2efba241fd�body���基因漂变是指小种群中因随机偶然事件导致某些基因频率波动，与性状是否“有利”无关。它常见于瓶颈效应和奠基者效应，与自然选择“择优”的机制完全不同。�Genetic drift is the random fluctuation of gene frequencies in small populations due to chance events, unrelated to whether a trait is “beneficial.” Seen in bottlenecks and founder effects, it differs entirely from selection's “survival of the fittest” mechanism.�ans��src��R木村资生，《分子进化的中性理论》，剑桥大学出版社，1983。�WM. Kimura, The Neutral Theory of Molecular Evolution, Cambridge University Press, 1983.��id�cc66fb13514b�body��北极食物链又短又陡：海冰上的冰藻是初级生产者，被磷虾等小型甲壳动物吃，再依次传到鱼、海豹，顶端是北极熊。环节少意味着每一级都高度依赖上一级，任何一环受损都会被放大。海冰每年春天融化形成的冰缘正是冰藻暴发和浮游动物聚集的舞台；海冰减少改变光照和水层结构，冰藻产量下降，整条链自下而上“断粮”，北极熊也因觅食平台消失被迫长距离游泳，体况恶化——这就是营养级联。��The Arctic food web is short and steep: ice algae on sea ice are the primary producers, eaten by small crustaceans such as krill, passing up through fish and seals to the top predator, the polar bear. Few links mean each level depends heavily on the one below, so any loss is amplified. The ice edge that forms each spring when sea ice melts is where ice algae bloom and zooplankton gather; as sea ice declines, light and water-column structure change, algal production drops, and the whole chain goes short of food from the bottom up, while polar bears lose their hunting platform, swim farther and lose condition. This bottom-up ripple is a trophic cascade.�ans��src��"Science（海冰与北极生态）�$Science (sea ice and Arctic ecology)��id�cdf224c119aa�body�ٍ设计能特异性结合某蛋白或阻断某通路的小分子，可在不敲除基因的情况下即时扰动信号，定位关键节点。�cSelective small molecules perturb a pathway on demand, pinpointing key nodes without gene knockout.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�ce16074a40f4�body���DNA 甲基化多在 CpG 岛的胞嘧啶上加甲基，招募抑制性蛋白并阻碍转录因子结合，使基因沉默；这类修饰可在细胞分裂中稳定遗传，并受发育和环境因素调控，但不改变碱基序列。�(DNA methylation typically adds a methyl group to cytosine in CpG islands, recruiting repressive proteins and blocking transcription-factor binding to silence genes; such marks are stably inherited through cell division and shaped by development and environment without altering the base sequence.�ans��src��KAlberts 等,《Molecular Biology of the Cell》第6版,Garland Science,2014�PB. Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell, 6th ed., Garland Science, 2014��id�ce6c5fcdb0d1�body��涡虫可凭少量细胞重建全身，蝾螈能再生四肢、尾和晶状体，斑马鱼可修复心脏和鳍，这些都依赖成体干细胞与去分化的细胞重新进入细胞周期。研究再生机制对组织工程和医学修复有重要价值。�,Planarians can rebuild their whole body from tiny fragments, axolotls regenerate limbs, tails, and lenses, and zebrafish repair heart and fins, all relying on adult stem cells and dedifferentiating cells re-entering the cell cycle. Studying regeneration informs tissue engineering and medical repair.�ans��src��《发育生物学》�Developmental Biology (Gilbert)��id�ce9e2d524563�body���分离定律指每个基因都有两份等位基因，在形成配子时成对等位基因彼此分开，每个配子只带其中一份，所以杂合子会产生两种配子，比例约为1:1。自由组合定律指位于不同染色体上的基因在配子形成时互不干扰地组合，这正是减数第一次分裂中期同源染色体随机排列在赤道板、后期同源染色体彼此分开的结果。两定律本质上就是减数分裂的遗传学表述：同源染色体分开带来“分离”，非同源染色体的自由组合带来“独立分配”，而连锁基因因同处一条染色体而不服从自由组合定律。��The law of segregation states that every individual carries two alleles of each gene, and these paired alleles separate when gametes form, so each gamete receives just one copy; a heterozygote therefore produces the two gamete types in roughly a 1:1 ratio. The law of independent assortment says genes on different chromosomes combine independently during gamete formation, a direct outcome of the random orientation of homologous chromosomes at the metaphase I plate and their separation at anaphase I. Both laws are essentially the genetics of meiosis: separation of homologs gives segregation, while the independent shuffle of non-homologous chromosomes gives independent assortment, and linked genes on the same chromosome do not obey the second law.�ans��src�� 《普通生物学》(陈阅增)�General Biology (Chen Yuezeng)��id�cefae6b1a745�body���食物链顶端捕食者的增减会通过逐级捕食压力改变下营养级的数量与行为，甚至重塑植被与地貌。Estes 在 1998 年《科学》中以海獭-海胆-海藻林为例展示了下行控制效应。��Changes in top predators ripple down the food chain, altering the abundance and behavior of lower levels and even reshaping vegetation and landforms—a trophic cascade. Estes showed this top-down control with otters-urchins-kelp in Science (1998).�ans��src��8Estes 1998 年《科学》论文；Paine 关键种研究�-Estes (1998, Science); Paine keystone studies��id�d11aa4fba2d6�body���菌根是植物根系与真菌形成的互利共生结构，约90%的陆生植物都形成菌根。丛枝菌根真菌的菌丝侵入皮层细胞，形成树状丛枝结构，大幅扩大根系吸收面积，为植物提供磷、氮等矿质养分和水分；作为回报，植物把约20%的光合产物（糖类）提供给真菌。菌根还增强植物抗干旱、抗病原菌的能力，是陆地生态系统碳循环的重要环节。��A mycorrhiza is a mutualistic association between plant roots and fungi; about 90% of land plants form mycorrhizae. Arbuscular mycorrhizal fungi grow hyphae into cortical cells, forming tree-like arbuscules that vastly expand the absorbing surface, supplying the plant with phosphorus, nitrogen, and water. In return, the plant transfers roughly 20% of its photosynthates (sugars) to the fungus. Mycorrhizae also improve drought and pathogen resistance and play a major role in terrestrial carbon cycling.�ans��src��-Nature（菌根共生与植物营养综述）�;Nature, review on mycorrhizal symbiosis and plant nutrition��id�d1527f270c65�body���武夷山处在中亚热带，地形垂直变化大，自成一统的湿润山地孕育了极高特有性：大量昆虫、两栖爬行和孑遗植物（如南方铁杉）在此栖息，是东亚生物多样性关键节点。��Wuyi sits in mid-subtropical China with strong vertical terrain, fostering a humid mountain world of high endemism: numerous insects, amphibians, reptiles and relic plants (like southern hemlock). It's a key biodiversity node in East Asia.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�d177807d141a�body��7有丝分裂只分裂一次，把复制好的染色体平均分给两个与母细胞相同的二倍体子细胞，用于生长和修复。减数分裂则连续分裂两次：第一次分裂时同源染色体配对并发生交叉互换，把等位基因重新洗牌，然后成对分开；第二次分裂时姐妹染色单体分开，最终产生四个染色体数目减半的单倍体细胞。只有单倍体的精子和卵子结合才能恢复二倍体，既使染色体数目代代恒定，交叉互换和染色体的随机分配又同时创造了遗传多样性。�QMitosis is one division that gives two diploid daughter cells identical to the parent, serving growth and repair. Meiosis divides twice: in the first division, homologous chromosomes pair, swap segments by crossing over (reshuffling alleles), and then separate; in the second, sister chromatids separate, yielding four haploid cells with half the chromosome number. Only when a haploid sperm fuses with a haploid egg is the diploid number restored, keeping the chromosome count constant across generations, while crossing over and the random assortment of chromosomes generate genetic variety.�ans��src��U翟中和 王喜忠 丁明孝,《细胞生物学》第4版,高等教育出版社,2011�HZhai Zhonghe et al., Cell Biology, 4th ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�d1d9c5e5e2c9�body���长时程增强指特定突触在高频刺激后，其信号传递强度能持续数小时至数天地增强。它依赖NMDA受体介导的钙离子内流和AMPA受体上调，被广泛认为是学习与记忆在细胞层面的关键机制。�&Long-term potentiation (LTP) is a lasting strengthening of synaptic transmission after high-frequency stimulation, persisting for hours to days. It depends on NMDA-receptor-mediated calcium influx and AMPA-receptor upregulation and is widely regarded as a cellular basis of learning and memory.�ans��src��UBliss 与 Lømo，《突触传递的长时程增强》，《生理学杂志》1973年�eBliss & Lømo, "Long-lasting potentiation of synaptic transmission ...," Journal of Physiology (1973)��id�d284f10b933e�body�ٟ下丘脑释放调控激素指挥垂体，垂体再分泌促激素作用于甲状腺、肾上腺、性腺等靶腺，形成层层放大的内分泌指挥链。��The hypothalamus releases controlling hormones to the pituitary, which then secretes tropic hormones acting on target glands like the thyroid, adrenals, and gonads—a layered endocrine command chain.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�d32c349bcb61�body��ZHox基因编码一类含同源框（homeobox）的转录因子，在几乎所有后生动物中成簇排列，染色体上的基因顺序对应其在身体前后轴的表达区域（共线性）：靠近5'端的基因在身体后部表达，3'端的基因在前部表达。它们像区域身份卡，决定每个体节发育出何种结构。突变会使结构出现在错误位置，如果蝇Antennapedia突变让头部该长触角的位置长出腿、Bithorax突变使第三胸节长出第二对翅。Hox基因从果蝇到哺乳动物高度保守，其复制和变异推动了动物体型的演化。��Hox genes encode homeobox-containing transcription factors that are clustered in nearly all metazoans, with their order on the chromosome mirroring their expression domains along the body axis (collinearity): genes at the 5' end are expressed posteriorly, those at the 3' end anteriorly. They act as regional identity cards, specifying what each segment develops into. Mutations place structures in the wrong positions, e.g., the Drosophila Antennapedia mutant grows legs on the head where antennae should be, and Bithorax produces a second pair of wings on the third thoracic segment. Hox genes are highly conserved from flies to mammals, and their duplications and modifications have driven the evolution of animal body plans.�ans��src��KAlberts 等,《Molecular Biology of the Cell》第6版,Garland Science,2014�PB. Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell, 6th ed., Garland Science, 2014��id�d599ab8d7dd9�body���自身免疫性疾病是免疫系统误把自身组织当作外来敌人攻击而导致的疾病。类风湿关节炎、1型糖尿病和红斑狼疮都属于此类。其成因常与遗传、感染和环境因素交织有关。�An autoimmune disease occurs when the immune system mistakenly attacks the body's own tissues as if they were foreign. Rheumatoid arthritis, type 1 diabetes, and lupus are examples. Causes usually involve a mix of genetic, infectious, and environmental factors.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�d5ed2f66df47�body��
胎儿肺尚未通气，血液经三个"分流"绕过肺：卵圆孔让右心房血直接进左心，动脉导管把肺动脉血分流到主动脉，静脉导管绕开肝脏。出生后呼吸启动、阻力改变，这些通道关闭，循环才转为成人模式。�pBecause fetal lungs are not yet aerated, blood bypasses them through three shunts: the foramen ovale sends right-atrial blood straight to the left heart, the ductus arteriosus diverts pulmonary blood to the aorta, and the ductus venosus bypasses the liver. After birth, with breathing and shifted resistances, these close and circulation switches to the adult pattern.�ans��src��PGuyton 与 Hall，《医学生理学教科书》（第13版，Elsevier，2016）�HGuyton & Hall, Textbook of Medical Physiology (13th ed., Elsevier, 2016)��id�d66db5a014f8�body��鱼群没有指挥官，转向是“自组织”涌现出的集体行为。每条鱼只遵守三条局部规则：向身边最近的伙伴靠拢、与太近的鱼保持距离、向身边多数同伴的方向对齐，并通过侧线感知邻居的水流，把信息以约每30毫秒一次的速度在鱼群中传递。任何一条鱼察觉危险先转向，动作沿“信息波”传播，整个鱼群就能在不到一秒内完成集体转向。这种同步让捕食者面对一片模糊的“超级个体”，难以锁定单个目标。�LThe school has no leader; the turn is an emergent, self-organized behavior. Each fish follows three local rules: stay near neighbors, keep a minimum distance, and align with the heading of nearby fish, while its lateral line senses neighbors' water movements, passing information through the group about every 30 milliseconds. When any fish detects danger and turns, the movement spreads as an information wave and the whole school completes a synchronized turn in under a second. This synchrony makes predators face a blurred superorganism and makes it hard to single out any individual.�ans��src��Science（鱼群集体行为）�!Science (fish schooling behavior)��id�d67f04e40ee3�body���多数内分泌轴采用负反馈：当某激素水平过高，会抑制上游腺体（如下丘脑、垂体）继续分泌，使其回落。例如甲状腺激素过多即抑制促甲状腺激素释放，从而把各项指标稳定在正常范围。�Most endocrine axes use negative feedback: when a hormone rises too high, it inhibits upstream glands such as the hypothalamus or pituitary, bringing levels back down. Excess thyroid hormone, for example, suppresses releasing signals so values stay within a normal range.�ans��src��PGuyton 与 Hall，《医学生理学教科书》（第13版，Elsevier，2016）�HGuyton & Hall, Textbook of Medical Physiology (13th ed., Elsevier, 2016)��id�dbd7ae46c2f9�body���间断平衡认为生物进化大多数时间处于稳定状态，物种长期少有变化。在相对短暂的地质时期内，环境剧变会触发快速的物种形成。它与渐进式进化的传统图景形成补充。�Punctuated equilibrium holds that species stay largely stable for most of their history with little change. Over geologically brief intervals, sudden environmental shifts can trigger rapid speciation. It complements rather than replaces the traditional picture of gradual change.�ans��src��aRichard Dawkins,《The Selfish Gene》Oxford,1976;中译《自私的基因》中信出版社,2012�TR. Dawkins, The Selfish Gene, Oxford University Press, 1976; Chinese ed. CITIC, 2012��id�dc82b7406913�body��细胞因子是免疫细胞分泌的小分子信号蛋白，像「传令兵」一样协调炎症反应、细胞增殖与分化。干扰素、白细胞介素和 TNF 等既能动员防御，也可能在失控时造成组织损伤（如细胞因子风暴）。�Cytokines are small signaling proteins secreted by immune cells that act like messengers coordinating inflammation, cell proliferation, and differentiation. Interferons, interleukins, and TNF can mobilize defense but, when uncontrolled, cause tissue damage such as cytokine storms.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�dce567e9579b�body���反转录是某些病毒（如HIV）用自身RNA为模板，由反转录酶合成DNA的过程。这段DNA随后整合进宿主基因组，使病毒能长期潜伏。这也是艾滋病难以根治的原因之一。�Reverse transcription is when certain viruses, such as HIV, use their RNA as a template to make DNA via the enzyme reverse transcriptase. That DNA then integrates into the host genome, letting the virus hide for long periods. It is one reason AIDS is hard to cure.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�dce9665e61a7�body���昆虫脑中的神经分泌细胞分泌促前胸腺激素（PTTH），刺激前胸腺释放蜕皮激素（ecdysone），启动每一次蜕皮。同时，咽侧体（corpora allata）分泌保幼激素（JH）。蜕皮的结果取决于JH浓度：幼虫期JH高，蜕皮后仍是幼虫；末龄幼虫JH下降，蜕皮进入蛹期；JH消失时，蛹蜕皮羽化为成虫。保幼激素类似物（如甲氧普烯methoprene）或蜕皮激素类杀虫剂（如甲氧虫酰肼，为蜕皮激素受体激动剂）可破坏这一调控，被用作昆虫生长调节型杀虫剂，对变态过程敏感的害虫高效而对哺乳动物毒性低。��Neurosecretory cells in the insect brain release prothoracicotropic hormone (PTTH), which stimulates the prothoracic gland to secrete ecdysone and trigger each molt. Meanwhile, the corpora allata produce juvenile hormone (JH). The outcome of each molt depends on JH concentration: with high JH the larva molts into another larval instar; when JH drops in the final instar, molting produces a pupa; when JH is essentially absent, the pupa molts into the adult. Juvenile hormone analogs (e.g., methoprene) or ecdysone-agonist insecticides (e.g., methoxyfenozide, an ecdysone receptor agonist) disrupt this regulation and are used as insect growth regulators, effective against metamorphosing pests with low mammalian toxicity.�ans��src��3《动物学》(刘凌云、郑光美) 昆虫生理�9Zoology (Liu Lingyun & Zheng Guangmei), insect physiology��id�ddb8df056062�body�٩MHC分子把细胞内的肽段呈递到表面：MHC I呈递内源蛋白（如病毒感染标志）给CD8细胞毒T细胞，MHC II呈递外源抗原给CD4辅助T细胞。��MHC molecules display peptide fragments on the cell surface: MHC I presents internal proteins (e.g. viral flags) to CD8 cytotoxic T cells, MHC II presents external antigens to CD4 helper T cells.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�de0369ed937a�body���木村资生在 1968 年提出，大多数分子水平的突变是中性的，其频率主要由随机漂变而非自然选择决定，因此进化速率大致恒定。它补充而非否定自然选择，解释了大量同义替换的积累。�"Kimura proposed in 1968 that most molecular mutations are neutral and their frequencies drift randomly rather than being driven by selection, so the molecular clock ticks roughly steadily. It complements rather than denies selection, explaining the accumulation of synonymous substitutions.�ans��src��G木村资生 1968 年《自然》论文；Lewontin《进化生物学》�4Kimura (1968, Nature); Lewontin, population genetics��id�de9d82f3d247�body���高海拔紫外线强、氧气薄、风大、生长季短。植物贴地生长可减少风寒、保水；动物（如藏野驴、鼠兔）体小紧凑、毛厚、血红蛋白携氧力强，都是对低温低氧的适应。��High altitude means intense UV, thin oxygen, strong wind and short growing seasons. Plants hug the ground to escape wind and save water; animals (wild ass, pika) are compact with thick fur and oxygen-rich blood—adaptations to cold and hypoxia.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�dec2d3e1c27e�body��病原体感染后，免疫细胞（如巨噬细胞）释放白细胞介素-1 等致热因子，它们作用于下丘脑的体温调节中枢，把“设定温度”调高，身体于是通过肌肉颤抖产热、皮肤血管收缩减少散热，体温升到新标准。中度发热能抑制部分病原体繁殖、加快免疫细胞活化和抗体生成，总体上利大于弊。但体温过高（如超过39℃）会损伤细胞和器官，对幼儿还可能导致热性惊厥，所以高热仍需积极降温。�9After infection, immune cells such as macrophages release pyrogens like interleukin-1, which act on the hypothalamus's thermostat and raise the set point. The body then shivers to produce heat and constricts skin vessels to save it, climbing to the new target. A moderate fever slows some pathogens and speeds up immune activation and antibody production, so on balance it helps; but very high temperatures, above about 39 degrees Celsius, damage cells and organs and can trigger febrile seizures in young children, which is why high fever still needs active treatment.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�dedad8b09f53�body�ٖ线粒体拥有环状的线粒体DNA，能自我部分复制，这支持内共生学说——线粒体起源于被远古真核细胞吞入的细菌。٭Mitochondria carry their own circular DNA and partly self-replicate, supporting the endosymbiotic theory that they originated from bacteria engulfed by ancestral eukaryotes.�ans��src��KAlberts 等,《Molecular Biology of the Cell》第6版,Garland Science,2014�PB. Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell, 6th ed., Garland Science, 2014��id�e13e26ea9d42�body��)细胞凋亡是由基因调控的、有序的「程序性死亡」，细胞会收缩、碎裂成被邻近细胞清理的小体，不引发炎症。坏死则是外伤、中毒等导致的被动、无序死亡，常伴随内容物外泄和炎症反应。凋亡对发育和组织更新不可或缺。�TApoptosis is a genetically programmed, orderly form of cell death in which the cell shrinks and breaks into fragments cleared by neighbors without causing inflammation. Necrosis is passive, disordered death from injury or toxins, often leaking contents and triggering inflammation. Apoptosis is essential for development and tissue renewal.�ans��src��《细胞生物学》�'Molecular Biology of the Cell (Alberts)��id�e474e9f1ee6e�body�ي共同祖先是多种生物在演化树上的“分叉点”——人、黑猩猩和猴子都可追溯到同一个远古灵长类祖先。يA common ancestor is the branching point on the tree of life; humans, chimps, and monkeys trace back to the same ancient primate ancestor.�ans��src��aRichard Dawkins,《The Selfish Gene》Oxford,1976;中译《自私的基因》中信出版社,2012�TR. Dawkins, The Selfish Gene, Oxford University Press, 1976; Chinese ed. CITIC, 2012��id�e5d606ce049a�body���长时程增强指高频刺激突触后，该突触的传递效率持续数小时至数天的增强，最先在海马被Bliss和Lømo（1973）发现。其机制：突触前释放谷氨酸，激活突触后AMPA受体使膜去极化，Mg2+脱离NMDA受体，Ca2+大量流入突触后细胞，激活CaMKII等激酶，磷酸化并插入更多AMPA受体（早期LTP），并通过激活CREB等转录因子促进新蛋白合成、形成新突触（晚期LTP），实现持久增强。LTP的诱导和维持依赖海马，与空间记忆（如莫里斯水迷宫）和行为记忆高度相关，是记忆存储于突触连接改变这一假说的核心证据。�LTP is a long-lasting (hours to days) increase in synaptic strength following high-frequency stimulation, first described in the hippocampus by Bliss and Lømo (1973). Mechanistically, presynaptic glutamate activates postsynaptic AMPA receptors, depolarizing the membrane; Mg2+ leaves the NMDA receptor, allowing Ca2+ to flood the postsynaptic cell and activate kinases such as CaMKII, which phosphorylates and inserts more AMPA receptors (early LTP). Late LTP involves CREB-driven gene transcription, protein synthesis, and formation of new synapses, making the potentiation persistent. LTP induction requires the hippocampus and correlates with spatial memory (e.g., the Morris water maze) and behavioral memory, providing key evidence that memories are stored in changes of synaptic connections.�ans��src���Bliss 与 Lømo,《Long‐lasting potentiation of synaptic transmission in the dentate area of the anaesthetized rabbit following stimulation of the perforant path》,The Journal of Physiology,1973 (DOI: 10.1113/jphysiol.1973.sp010273)��Bliss and Lømo, 'Long‐lasting potentiation of synaptic transmission in the dentate area of the anaesthetized rabbit following stimulation of the perforant path', The Journal of Physiology, 1973, DOI: 10.1113/jphysiol.1973.sp010273��id�e5fda15598ee�body�ِ回声定位是发出声音并听回声来判断物体位置和距离，蝙蝠和齿鲸（如海豚）都用它夜间或水下“看”世界。٘Echolocation sends sounds and listens for echoes to judge distance and location; bats and toothed whales like dolphins use it to 'see' in dark or water.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�e6502996785e�body���花的结构与传粉者形成了高度特异的共演化：虫媒花（如兰科植物）颜色鲜艳、有香味或花蜜，花瓣形态适应特定昆虫，如蜂兰花模拟雌蜂吸引雄蜂为其授粉；鸟媒花多为红色、无香而蜜量丰富；风媒花则花粉量大、柱头羽毛状而花被退化。这种传粉综合征使传粉更精确高效，也推动了开花植物的辐射演化。�%Flower structure and pollinators show highly specific co-evolution: insect-pollinated flowers (e.g., orchids) are colorful, scented, or nectar-producing, with petal shapes fitted to particular insects; bee orchids mimic female bees to attract males for pollination. Bird-pollinated flowers tend to be red, scentless, and nectar-rich; wind-pollinated flowers produce abundant pollen, have feathery stigmas, and reduced perianths. These pollination syndromes make pollination more precise and efficient and drove the adaptive radiation of angiosperms.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�e69a31e06ba3�body��-2020 年两项独立研究发现，激活下丘脑中特定的神经元群可诱导小鼠进入体温和代谢率大幅下降的类冬眠状态：一项工作定位到下丘脑视前区表达 Adcyap1 的神经元，另一项发现下丘脑前部的兴奋性神经元集群可维持数天的低体温低代谢。这说明蛰伏并非被动的低温结果，而是由中枢主动下调体温设定点驱动的调控程序，且相关环路在非冬眠物种中依然保留。该发现为医学诱导低代谢用于器官保护和急救提供了神经靶点。��Two independent studies in 2020 showed that activating specific hypothalamic neuron populations drives mice into a hibernation-like state with sharply lowered body temperature and metabolic rate: one identified Adcyap1-expressing neurons in the preoptic area, the other a cluster of excitatory neurons in the anterior hypothalamus able to sustain days of hypothermia and hypometabolism. Torpor is therefore not a passive consequence of cooling but an actively regulated programme in which the brain lowers the temperature set point, and the circuitry is retained even in non-hibernators. The finding offers neural targets for medically induced hypometabolism in organ protection and critical care.�ans��src���Hrvatin S 等. Neurons that regulate mouse torpor. Nature (2020) 583:115-121; Takahashi TM 等. A discrete neuronal circuit induces a hibernation-like state in rodents. Nature (2020) 583:109-114��Hrvatin S et al. Neurons that regulate mouse torpor. Nature (2020) 583:115-121; Takahashi TM et al. A discrete neuronal circuit induces a hibernation-like state in rodents. Nature (2020) 583:109-114��id�e7b75774d3c6�body�ٽ他在 1866 年把论文发表在地方性刊物，用当时不被理解的遗传因子和数学统计解释性状，直到 1900 年才被三位植物学家重新发现并确立其地位。٩His 1866 paper appeared in a local journal, using then-unfamiliar hereditary factors and statistics; it was rediscovered and established only in 1900 by three botanists.�ans��src��《遗传学》�(Genetics: A Conceptual Approach (Pierce)��id�e7c040c6dc24�body��许多植物通过感知昼夜长短（光周期）来决定开花时机：长日照植物在白昼超过临界值才开花，短日照植物则相反，日中性植物不受明显影响。这由叶片中的光敏色素接收信号、经激素传达到顶端分生组织调控。�,Many plants time flowering by sensing day length: long-day plants bloom once days exceed a critical length, short-day plants do the opposite, and day-neutral plants are little affected. Leaf phytochromes receive the signal and relay it via hormones to the shoot apical meristem to regulate flowering.�ans��src��《植物学》�Campbell Biology��id�e7e7ed735feb�body��7CRISPR-Cas9 由两部分组成：一段能与目标 DNA 互补配对的向导 RNA，和一个切割 DNA 的 Cas9 核酸酶。向导 RNA 带着 Cas9 找到基因组里大约20个碱基的目标位点（还需要 PAM 序列确认），Cas9 随即切断两条 DNA 链。细胞修复断裂时如果走非同源末端连接，往往产生小的缺失或插入导致基因失活；如果同时提供一段供体模板，细胞就会用同源重组把想要的序列精确写入。它便宜、快速、可编程，但脱靶切割和伦理问题仍是应用中的关注点。�cCRISPR-Cas9 has two parts: a guide RNA that base-pairs with the target DNA, and the Cas9 nuclease that cuts it. The guide RNA escorts Cas9 to a site of roughly 20 bases in the genome (confirmed by a PAM sequence), and Cas9 then cuts both strands. If the cell repairs the break by non-homologous end joining, small insertions or deletions usually appear and knock the gene out; if a donor template is provided, the cell can copy the desired sequence in precisely through homology-directed repair. It is cheap, fast and programmable, though off-target cuts and ethical questions remain concerns in real-world use.�ans��src�� Nature（CRISPR 综述，2020）�Nature (CRISPR review, 2020)��id�ea6b0a8b6e1b�body��科学家已描述约十几万种真菌，但估计真实种类可能超过200万，大多尚未被发现。它们包括酵母菌、霉菌、大型真菌和与水生环境相关的壶菌等。真菌在物质循环和共生网络中扮演不可替代的角色。�About 100,000-plus fungal species have been described, yet estimates suggest over two million may exist, mostly undiscovered. They include yeasts, molds, macrofungi, and chytrids of aquatic habitats. Fungi play irreplaceable roles in nutrient cycling and symbiotic networks.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�ec362a0a7798�body��钠钾泵每消耗一个 ATP，就把三个钠离子泵出细胞、两个钾离子泵入，维持细胞膜内外约 -70 mV 的静息电位。这种离子梯度是神经元产生动作电位、传递信号的前提，也是许多物质继发性主动运输的能量来源。�The sodium-potassium pump uses one ATP to move three Na+ out and two K+ in, maintaining the roughly -70 mV resting potential across the membrane. This ion gradient is the basis for the action potential that lets neurons signal and powers much secondary active transport.�ans��src��PGuyton 与 Hall，《医学生理学教科书》（第13版，Elsevier，2016）�HGuyton & Hall, Textbook of Medical Physiology (13th ed., Elsevier, 2016)��id�ed51a07c26a4�body���哺乳动物雌性有两条 X、雄性一条，为避免 X 连锁基因剂量翻倍，雌性在发育早期随机让一条 X 染色体失活形成巴氏小体，称为 X 失活。Lyon 在 1961 年提出这一机制，由 Xist 长链 RNA 介导。��Female mammals have two X chromosomes and males one; to avoid doubling X-linked gene dose, females randomly silence one X into a Barr body early in development, called X-inactivation. Lyon proposed this in 1961, mediated by the Xist long RNA.�ans��src��;Lyon 1961 年论文；Alberts《细胞的分子生物学》�3Lyon (1961); Alberts, Molecular Biology of the Cell��id�f06b18450d65�body���DNA序列像字母，表观遗传像“批注”：甲基化、组蛋白修饰等能开关基因而不改字母顺序。饥荒、压力等环境可改变这些标记，并可能延续一两代，但大多不永久改写代码本身。�The DNA sequence is the letters; epigenetics are the “annotations”—methylation and histone marks switch genes on/off without altering letters. Famine or stress can shift these marks and possibly persist a generation or two, yet rarely rewrite the code permanently.�ans��src��KAlberts 等,《Molecular Biology of the Cell》第6版,Garland Science,2014�PB. Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell, 6th ed., Garland Science, 2014��id�f10d8906b98c�body��木村资生提出的中性学说认为，分子水平上大部分突变是中性的，既不有利也不有害，其频率变化主要由随机遗传漂变决定，而非自然选择。它补充而非否定选择学说，解释了分子进化速率的相对恒定。�<Motoo Kimura's neutral theory holds that most mutations at the molecular level are neutral, neither beneficial nor harmful, so their frequencies change mainly by random genetic drift rather than selection. It complements rather than rejects selection and explains the relatively constant rate of molecular evolution.�ans��src��《进化生物学》�Evolution (Futuyma)��id�f1f81c05cea0�body���经典方法利用胚胎干细胞（ES细胞）的同源重组：构建靶向载体，其中目的基因外显子被新霉素抗性基因（neo）替换，同源臂外侧连有HSV-tk基因。载体电转入ES细胞后，发生同源重组的细胞把neo整合进靶位点而丢失tk；用G418筛选（获得neo）加更昔洛韦负筛选（排除随机插入、保留tk的细胞）即得到正确重组的克隆。将阳性ES细胞显微注射入囊胚，形成含两种细胞来源的嵌合体小鼠，经生殖系传递获得杂合子，再交配得到纯合敲除小鼠。该技术由Capecchi、Smithies等建立，获2007年诺贝尔生理学或医学奖，现多被CRISPR-Cas9替代。�PThe classic approach relies on homologous recombination in embryonic stem (ES) cells: a targeting vector replaces an exon of the gene of interest with a neomycin resistance gene (neo), with a herpes simplex virus tk gene placed outside the homology arms. After electroporation, cells that undergo homologous recombination integrate neo at the target locus and lose tk; positive selection with G418 plus negative selection with ganciclovir (killing random-integrants that retain tk) isolates correctly recombined clones. Injected into blastocysts, these ES cells produce chimeric mice, which transmit the mutation through the germline to give heterozygotes, and intercrossing yields homozygous knockouts. Established by Capecchi, Smithies, and others (2007 Nobel Prize in Physiology or Medicine), the method has largely been replaced by CRISPR-Cas9.�ans��src��*Nature（Capecchi 等基因打靶研究）�.Nature, gene targeting in embryonic stem cells��id�f208b69ae7df�body�ٟ动作电位抵达突触前膜，触发钙离子内流、释放神经递质到突触间隙，递质结合后膜受体，把信号转为电信号继续传播。��An action potential reaches the presynaptic terminal, triggering calcium influx and release of neurotransmitters into the gap; they bind postsynaptic receptors, converting the signal back to electrical flow.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�f33a288574f9�body��内共生学说认为，早期真核细胞吞噬了自由的细菌和蓝藻却未消化，而是与之形成互利共生，最终演化为线粒体和叶绿体。证据包括它们拥有自己的环状 DNA、双层膜和独立复制方式，与自由原核生物高度相似。�KThe endosymbiotic theory proposes that early eukaryotic cells engulfed free bacteria and cyanobacteria but did not digest them, forming a partnership that evolved into mitochondria and chloroplasts. Evidence includes their own circular DNA, double membranes, and independent replication, all reminiscent of free-living prokaryotes.�ans��src��《进化生物学》�Evolution (Futuyma)��id�f33c0456b4df�body�ٜ从化石致密骨或牙齿中提取极少量、高度降解的DNA，用测序与污染控制比对，重建古人类基因组，揭示亲缘与迁徙史。ٺTiny, heavily degraded DNA is pulled from dense bone or teeth, sequenced under strict contamination control, and compared to reconstruct ancient genomes and reveal kinship and migration.�ans��src��,Science（2010年尼安德特人基因组）�0Science, Green et al. (2010), Neanderthal genome��id�f3cf21c16c6b�body���生态位描述一个物种在环境中的角色与地位，包括它吃什么、被谁吃、何时活动以及如何利用资源，而不只是它住在哪里。竞争排斥原理认为两个物种难以长期占据完全相同的生态位。�A niche describes a species' role and position in its environment, what it eats, what eats it, when it is active, and how it uses resources, not merely where it lives. The competitive exclusion principle holds that two species cannot occupy exactly the same niche indefinitely.�ans��src��《生态学》�Ecology (Odum)��id�f5453a920ab1�body���癫痫是大脑神经元异常、过度同步放电引起的慢性疾患，表现为反复发作的抽搐或意识改变。病因可为遗传、脑损伤或感染等多种因素。抗癫痫药物可控制多数患者的发作。�	Epilepsy is a chronic disorder of abnormally excessive, synchronized neuronal firing, causing recurrent seizures with convulsions or altered consciousness. Causes include genetics, brain injury, and infection. Anti-epileptic drugs control seizures in most patients.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�f796fb9a264f�body���有丝分裂产生两个遗传相同的体细胞，用于生长和修复。减数分裂只发生在生殖细胞，经两次分裂产生四个染色体减半的配子，以保证受精后染色体数目稳定。前者保复制，后者保多样。�Mitosis makes two genetically identical body cells for growth and repair. Meiosis occurs only in germ cells, yielding four chromosome-halved gametes through two divisions, keeping chromosome number stable after fertilization. One preserves copies, the other creates diversity.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�f7d1fbd273e3�body���多数竹子是一次性开花植物：多年积累后同步开花结实，耗尽体内储藏资源而枯死；这种同步大量结实在进化上可能是一种用数量淹没种子捕食者的策略。ټMost bamboos are monocarpic: after years of storage they flower and seed synchronously, exhausting reserves and dying; the mass seeding may be an evolutionary predator-saturation strategy.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�f8c581a323f0�body���把血离心，上层约 55% 是淡黄色的血浆，主要是水，溶着营养、激素、抗体和废物；下层约 45% 是有形成分，其中红细胞占绝大多数，白细胞和血小板只薄薄一层。红细胞靠血红蛋白运氧，白细胞管免疫，血小板参与止血。两个易混点：血小板不是完整细胞，只是细胞质脱落的碎片；成熟红细胞反过来主动丢掉细胞核，好腾出地方装血红蛋白。�4Spin blood in a centrifuge and the top about 55% is pale yellow plasma, mostly water with nutrients, hormones, antibodies and wastes dissolved in it; the bottom about 45% is formed elements, overwhelmingly red cells, with white cells and platelets as only a thin film. Red cells carry oxygen on hemoglobin, white cells run immunity, platelets start clotting. Two points people mix up: a platelet is not a complete cell but a shed fragment of cytoplasm, while the mature red cell goes the other way and deliberately discards its nucleus to make room for hemoglobin.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�f8fd2cf1e166�body���关键种是对群落结构影响远大于其数量比例的物种，如海獭控制海胆、保护海带林。一旦关键种消失，食物网会剧烈重组甚至崩溃，尽管它在总生物量中占比很小。�!A keystone species has an outsized effect on community structure relative to its abundance, sea otters, for instance, control sea urchins and protect kelp forests. Remove it and the food web can reorganize or collapse dramatically, even though it forms only a small share of total biomass.�ans��src��《生态学》�Ecology (Odum)��id�fa5ce506c0bd�body��与亲子垂直传递不同，水平基因转移是生物间跨谱系直接交换 DNA，细菌常借此获得耐药或代谢基因，显著加速适应。Ochman 在 2000 年分析了它在细菌基因组演化中的份额，Campbell 的教材将其列为演化的重要机制。�"Unlike vertical inheritance, horizontal gene transfer moves DNA directly between lineages; bacteria use it to acquire resistance or metabolic genes, speeding adaptation markedly. Ochman quantified its share in bacterial genomes in 2000; Campbell treats it as a major evolutionary mechanism.�ans��src�ًOchman 等,《Lateral gene transfer and the nature of bacterial innovation》,Nature,2000 (DOI: 10.1038/35012500)；Campbell《生物学》مOchman et al., 'Lateral gene transfer and the nature of bacterial innovation', Nature, 2000, DOI: 10.1038/35012500; Campbell, Biology��id�fdfbaeceb67b�body���长时程增强指反复协同的电活动使突触传递持续增强，被认为是学习与记忆的细胞基础。Bliss 与 Lømo 在 1973 年于海马首次记录到这一现象，Kandel 后续用海兔证明其可塑性机制。�Long-term potentiation is a lasting strengthening of synaptic transmission after repeated coincident activity, taken as the cellular basis of learning and memory. Bliss and Lømo first recorded it in the hippocampus in 1973; Kandel later proved the plasticity mechanism in Aplysia.�ans��src��?Bliss 与 Lømo 1973 年论文；Kandel《神经科学原理》�:Bliss & Lømo (1973); Kandel, Principles of Neural Science��id�fe55cb5ca5e5�body��动物的身体布局可分为辐射对称、两侧对称和不对称等类型。水母呈辐射对称，能从多个方向感知环境；大多数动物为两侧对称，有了明确的前后和左右。对称方式反映了不同的运动和生活方式。�#Animal body plans include radial, bilateral, and asymmetric types. Jellyfish show radial symmetry and sense the environment from many directions, while most animals are bilaterally symmetric with clear front-back and left-right axes. The symmetry reflects different movement and life styles.�ans��src��R吴相钰 等 编,《陈阅增普通生物学》第4版,高等教育出版社,2014�VWu Xiangyu et al., Chen Yuezeng General Biology, 4th ed., Higher Education Press, 2014��id�fe68c804ec98�body���光周期现象指植物根据昼夜长短的变化来启动开花、休眠等发育过程。短日照植物在白天变短时开花，长日照植物则相反。这帮助植物在合适季节繁殖。��Photoperiodism is when plants use changes in day length to trigger developmental events like flowering or dormancy. Short-day plants flower as days grow shorter, while long-day plants do the opposite. This helps plants reproduce in the right season.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�01b4bdc347cc�body���基因分析表明，真菌与动物的亲缘关系比与植物更近，二者同属后鞭毛生物分支，大约在十多亿年前分家。植物则更早分出。所以蘑菇在演化树上其实比树木“更像动物”。�Genetic analysis shows fungi are more closely related to animals than to plants; both sit in the opisthokont branch and split over a billion years ago, while plants diverged earlier. So in the tree of life a mushroom is evolutionarily 'more like an animal' than a tree is.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�0776ac1cc7d3�body�٢昙花原产热带干旱环境，夜间开放可避开烈日减少水分流失，并依赖蛾类等夜间传粉者，因此演化出短促的夜间开花习性。ٜNative to hot dry habitats, it blooms at night to avoid water loss in harsh sun and to attract moth pollinators, evolving a brief nocturnal flowering habit.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�0ad6030bc66d�body��蛋白质语言模型在海量未标注序列上做自监督学习，把残基共现规律编码为「语言」表征，使模型隐式捕捉进化约束与结构偏好。这种表征可零样本预测突变效应与远程同源，弥补传统比对在孤儿基因上的不足。�rProtein language models are self-supervised on vast unlabeled sequences, encoding residue co-occurrence patterns as linguistic representations that implicitly capture evolutionary constraints and structural preferences. Such representations enable zero-shot prediction of mutation effects and remote homology, compensating for traditional alignment gaps on orphan genes.�ans��src��8Nature (2023) 616:722-727，ESM-2 研究（Lin et al.）�3Nature (2023) 616:722-727, ESM-2 study (Lin et al.)��id�0bd64de62716�body�ٷ植物没有神经系统，它们靠细胞膨压的快速变化和动作电位（离子流）实现运动，与动物的神经机制完全不同，却同样能感知和响应刺激。ٻPlants have no nervous system; they move via rapid turgor changes and action potentials (ion flows), a mechanism entirely different from animal nerves yet still able to sense and respond.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�13ecbcad06e2�body���线粒体DNA是细胞质中环状的少量DNA，只通过母亲遗传给后代。它编码呼吸链的部分蛋白，突变与多种代谢病相关。因其母系传递，常用于追踪人类迁徙祖先。�Mitochondrial DNA is a small circular DNA in the cytoplasm, inherited only from the mother. It encodes some respiratory-chain proteins, and its mutations relate to metabolic diseases. Because it passes maternally, it is used to trace human ancestral migration.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�141f9e5a7f90�body���多巴胺是一种与愉悦和动机相关的神经递质。当获得食物、成就等奖励时，大脑释放多巴胺，强化再次行为的欲望。过度激活这条通路也与成瘾有关。��Dopamine is a neurotransmitter tied to pleasure and motivation. When we get rewards like food or achievement, the brain releases dopamine, reinforcing the urge to repeat the behavior. Over-activating this pathway is also linked to addiction.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�1aefc8c11c43�body�ٴ就地保护在原栖息地建立自然保护区维持生态过程；迁地保护把物种移入动物园、植物园或种子库等人工环境作为备份，二者互为补充。ٽIn-situ conservation protects species in their natural habitat and ecological context; ex-situ moves them to zoos, botanic gardens or seed banks as a backup—the two complement each other.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�1bb2fdddfd6b�body���骨骼肌收缩会挤压包裹其中的静脉，配合单向瓣膜把血液推向心脏，这称为“肌肉泵”。运动越多，泵作用越强，下肢血液回流越快。久卧不动则回流减慢，易形成血栓。�Skeletal muscle contraction squeezes the veins running through them, and with one-way valves pushes blood toward the heart—the 'muscle pump'. More movement means stronger pumping and faster return from the legs. Prolonged immobility slows return and raises clot risk.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�28eaefbd2bf4�body���入侵物种在新环境中缺少天敌，会快速繁殖并抢占本地物种的资源。它们可能改变食物链、传播疾病并造成经济损失。防控入侵是生态保护的重要课题。��Invasive species lack natural enemies in new habitats, so they multiply fast and seize resources from natives. They can alter food chains, spread disease, and cause economic loss. Controlling them is a major conservation task.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�2a30a6e3ba44�body���顶级掠食者控制草食动物数量，防止植被被过度啃食，从而维护整个食物网的稳定。它们消失常引发连锁崩溃，即营养级联效应。保护它们等于保护生态结构。��Top predators control herbivore numbers, preventing overgrazing and stabilizing the whole food web. Their loss often triggers cascade collapse, a trophic cascade. Protecting them protects the ecosystem's structure.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�2deaf4627dd6�body���华蕉是三倍体，染色体不成套导致不育、不能靠种子繁殖，只能靠吸芽或组培克隆；遗传高度单一使它对抗黄叶病（香蕉枯萎病）等病害极为脆弱。ٸThe Cavendish is triploid and sterile, so it cannot seed and is cloned via suckers or tissue culture; its genetic uniformity makes it extremely vulnerable to diseases like Panama wilt.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�2e05644b8f9a�body���愈合早期新血管和肉芽组织生长会释放组胺等介质刺激神经末梢，同时干燥结痂牵拉周围皮肤，二者共同造成瘙痒；过度抓挠可能撕裂新生组织。��Early healing grows new vessels and granulation tissue that release histamine and other mediators stimulating nerve endings, while a drying scab tugs the skin—both cause itch; scratching can tear new tissue.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�311841827a87�body��古老基因指可追溯至最后共同祖先、在现今众多谱系中仍保留的核心基因，而化石基因是已失活但残留在基因组中的遗迹。通过系统发育与比较基因组重建这些序列，可推断早期细胞的代谢与遗传机器雏形。�*Ancient genes are core genes traceable to the last common ancestor and retained across many lineages, while fossil genes are inactivated relics retained in genomes. Reconstructing these sequences via phylogenetics and comparative genomics infers the metabolism and genetic machinery of early cells.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�357144ed9474�body�ٙ昆虫的眼与脊椎动物的眼睛虽外观不同，却共享 Pax6 等关键调控基因，说明复杂器官可源于同一个古老的遗传模块。ًFly and vertebrate eyes differ in form yet share core regulators like Pax6, suggesting complex organs arose from an ancient genetic module.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�3716804670fb�body���慢阻肺是一组以持续气流受限为特征的肺部疾病，主要包括慢性支气管炎和肺气肿。长期吸烟或空气污染是主因，患者常慢性咳嗽、咳痰和活动后气促。它通常不可逆，但戒烟可延缓进展。�0COPD is a group of lung diseases marked by persistent airflow limitation, mainly chronic bronchitis and emphysema. Long-term smoking or air pollution is the main cause; patients have chronic cough, sputum, and breathlessness on exertion. It is mostly irreversible, but quitting smoking slows progression.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�3bbcefa4d682�body�ٻ他们在 1838–1839 年提出一切动植物都由细胞构成、细胞是生命的基本单位，后来补入所有细胞来自已有细胞，统一了人们对生物结构的认识。ٽIn 1838–1839 they proposed all plants and animals are made of cells and the cell is the unit of life; later amended that all cells come from existing cells, unifying biological structure.�ans��src��U翟中和 王喜忠 丁明孝,《细胞生物学》第4版,高等教育出版社,2011�HZhai Zhonghe et al., Cell Biology, 4th ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�3f55439fae1e�body���鲨鱼皮覆盖着细小的齿状鳞片（肤齿），能引导水流、抑制乱流（涡流）形成，从而减少摩擦阻力。泳衣用类似的沟槽纹理降低水阻，但国际泳联后来限制了这类装备。��Shark skin is covered with tiny tooth-like denticles that channel flow and suppress turbulent eddies, cutting friction. Swimsuits used similar grooves to reduce drag, later restricted by swimming's governing body.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�441120f30271�body��#亲缘选择理论说，动物会牺牲自身繁殖去帮助近亲传递共同基因。蜜蜂姐妹间基因相似度高于它们与后代的相似度，因此工蜂帮母亲（女王）养育妹妹，比自己产卵更能“传播基因”。这就是“广义适合度”的核心逻辑。�@Kin selection says animals may sacrifice their own reproduction to help relatives pass shared genes. Bee sisters are more genetically similar to each other than to their own offspring, so workers help the mother queen raise sisters, spreading genes better than breeding themselves. This is the core of inclusive fitness.�ans��src��A尚玉昌,《动物行为学》第2版,北京大学出版社,2010�FShang Yuchang, Animal Behavior, 2nd ed., Peking University Press, 2010��id�4c2dee6c1383�body���是的。炮制能通过加热、水飞、加辅料降低毒性（如附子减毒）、改变药性、便于保存或增强某类成分溶出。这是经验化学：在不懂分子结构时，靠反复实践调控药效与安全性。�Yes. Processing with heat, water, or adjuvants lowers toxicity (e.g. prepared aconite), shifts properties, aids storage or boosts extraction of active compounds. It was empirical chemistry—tuning efficacy and safety by practice long before molecular science.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�5257292bc719�body�ف它提供像搭扣一样快速、特异的连接反应，能在活细胞内给蛋白或糖装上荧光标签来追踪其行踪。�nIt provides fast, specific snap-like reactions to label proteins or sugars with reporters inside living cells.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�54ecca6efa81�body���淋巴系统收集组织间隙中漏出的组织液，过滤后通过淋巴管回流入静脉。它既维持体液平衡，又借助淋巴结清除病原体。淋巴液最终汇入锁骨下静脉，重新进入血液循环。�The lymphatic system collects tissue fluid that leaks out of capillaries, filters it, and returns it via lymphatic vessels to the veins. It maintains fluid balance and, with lymph nodes, clears pathogens. Lymph finally joins the subclavian veins and re-enters blood circulation.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�5fd1726d37b7�body��嗜盐古菌生活在极高盐度的盐湖或盐场，靠一种叫细菌视紫红质的蛋白把阳光直接转成能量，不用叶绿素。大量这种蛋白让它们的细胞膜呈紫红色，并能制造ATP。这是除光合作用外的另一种光获能方式。� Halophilic archaea live in very salty lakes or salterns and use a protein called bacteriorhodopsin to turn sunlight directly into energy without chlorophyll. Crowds of this protein tint their membranes purple-red and make ATP. It is an alternative light-energy strategy to photosynthesis.�ans��src��4Nick Lane,《The Vital Question》Profile Books,2015�2Nick Lane, The Vital Question, Profile Books, 2015��id�6245959b4395�body�ٷ湿地像肾脏一样过滤和净化水流，能截留泥沙、吸收多余营养和污染物。它还能调蓄洪水、为大量物种提供栖息地。因此被誉为地球之肾。��Like kidneys, wetlands filter and purify water, trapping sediment and absorbing excess nutrients and pollutants. They also buffer floods and host abundant species. Hence they are called the Earth's kidneys.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�66ac938e3c88�body�� 捕食者与猎物、寄生虫与宿主之间互相施加选择压力，一方的“武器”升级会逼对方也升级，形成循环。例如瞪羚越跑越快，猎豹也越跑越快；宿主发展免疫，病毒不断变异逃避免疫。这属于红皇后假说下的持续对抗。�APredators and prey, or parasites and hosts, impose selection on each other; when one side upgrades its 'weapon', the other must too, creating a loop. Example: gazelles and cheetahs both evolve greater speed; hosts develop immunity while viruses mutate to escape it. This is the Red Queen dynamic of relentless escalation.�ans��src��aRichard Dawkins,《The Selfish Gene》Oxford,1976;中译《自私的基因》中信出版社,2012�TR. Dawkins, The Selfish Gene, Oxford University Press, 1976; Chinese ed. CITIC, 2012��id�6889e8d2683e�body���站立时血液需克服重力回流心脏，主要靠静脉瓣膜和腿部肌肉挤压。久站使瓣膜长期受压、功能减弱，血液淤积在下肢静脉，导致肿胀和静脉扩张迂曲。活动小腿肌肉有助于促进回流。� When standing, blood must return to the heart against gravity, relying on venous valves and leg-muscle pumping. Long standing weakens the valves over time, letting blood pool in leg veins and causing swelling and twisted, enlarged veins. Moving the calf muscles helps promote return flow.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�6900dbb559eb�body�ٲ抽取患者T细胞，基因改造使其表达识别肿瘤抗原的嵌合抗原受体（CAR），扩增后回输，使其精准杀伤癌细胞，对部分血液癌效果显著。��A patient's T cells are engineered to express a chimeric antigen receptor (CAR) that recognizes tumor antigens, expanded, and reinfused to precisely kill cancer cells—effective in some blood cancers.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�69f54c0cfa5a�body���更年期是女性卵巢功能衰退、雌激素水平下降导致月经永久停止的阶段。常伴随潮热、情绪波动等症状。它是生殖衰老的自然过程，多发生在45到55岁。��Menopause is the stage when ovarian function declines and estrogen falls, ending menstruation permanently. It often brings hot flashes and mood swings. It is a natural part of reproductive aging, usually around ages 45 to 55.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�6cfb0c4b2082�body���转座子是可从基因组一处移动到另一处的 DNA 序列，通过剪切-粘贴或复制-粘贴机制改变位置，既能促进基因组重排和进化，也可能插入关键基因引起突变或疾病。��Transposons are DNA sequences that move from one genomic location to another via cut-and-paste or copy-and-paste mechanisms, driving genomic rearrangement and evolution while potentially disrupting genes and causing disease when inserted.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�77c55a74d403�body��#有性繁殖通过基因重组产生多样性，让后代更能应对变化的环境和寄生虫，代价是需要找配偶。理论模型认为，当环境多变或寄生虫压力大时，两性系统带来的遗传刷新收益超过其成本。这解释了有性繁殖为何广泛存在。�RSexual reproduction creates diversity through gene recombination, helping offspring cope with changing environments and parasites, at the cost of finding mates. Theory holds that when conditions are variable or parasite pressure is high, the genetic refresh benefit of two sexes outweighs the cost. This explains why sex is so widespread.�ans��src��aRichard Dawkins,《The Selfish Gene》Oxford,1976;中译《自私的基因》中信出版社,2012�TR. Dawkins, The Selfish Gene, Oxford University Press, 1976; Chinese ed. CITIC, 2012��id�7f3ffb9fd8c1�body���先导编辑利用融合逆转录酶的 nickase Cas9 与一种特殊 pegRNA，后者同时携带引导序列和编码预期编辑的逆转录模板。Cas9 在靶链切开单链后，逆转录酶以 pegRNA 的模板合成含所需突变的 DNA flap，再经细胞修复将修正整合进基因组，可在不引入双链断裂的情况下实现小片段插入、删除和所有 12 种碱基转换。��Prime editing uses a nickase Cas9 fused to reverse transcriptase together with a prime editing guide RNA (pegRNA) that carries both a targeting spacer and a reverse-transcription template encoding the desired edit. After Cas9 nicks one strand, the reverse transcriptase synthesizes a DNA flap containing the change from the pegRNA template, and cellular repair integrates it, enabling insertions, deletions and all 12 base-to-base conversions without double-strand breaks.�ans��src��yAnzalone AV et al. Search-and-replace genome editing without double-strand breaks or donor DNA. Nature (2019) 576:149-157�yAnzalone AV et al. Search-and-replace genome editing without double-strand breaks or donor DNA. Nature (2019) 576:149-157��id�8042fd018dfb�body���传统味觉地图并不准确：舌面各区域都能感知全部五种基本味觉，只是灵敏度略有差异；味觉由味蕾中 G 蛋白偶联受体介导，鲜味由谷氨酸受体识别。��The classic taste map is inaccurate: all tongue regions detect all five basic tastes with only slight sensitivity differences; taste is mediated by G-protein-coupled receptors in taste buds, with umami sensed by glutamate receptors.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�80f41ec5ba16�body��该理论提出岛屿物种数由迁入率与灭绝率的平衡决定，并随岛屿面积增大而升高、随与大陆距离增大而降低。面积通过提供更大生境与更低灭绝率起作用，隔离度则抑制迁入，二者共同设定平衡物种数。�HThe theory holds that island species richness is set by the balance of immigration and extinction rates, increasing with island area and decreasing with distance from the mainland. Larger area lowers extinction via more habitat, while greater isolation suppresses immigration; together they define an equilibrium species number.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�82eada4f8361�body��5一些寄生虫会分泌化学物质改变宿主的大脑和行为，以完成自己的生命史。例如寄生蚂蚁的真菌让蚂蚁爬到高处死死咬住叶脉，方便真菌孢子散播；弓形虫让老鼠不怕猫，更易被猫吃下从而进入终宿主。这种现象被称为“行为操控”。�VSome parasites secrete chemicals that change the host's brain and behavior to complete their life cycle. For example, a fungus infecting ants makes them climb high and clamp onto a leaf vein so spores disperse; Toxoplasma makes rodents unafraid of cats so they get eaten, reaching the cat final host. This is called 'behavioral manipulation.'�ans��src�هEd Yong,《I Contain Multitudes》Ecco/HarperCollins,2016;中译《我包罗万象》(郑李译),后浪丨北京联合出版公司,2019�~Ed Yong, I Contain Multitudes, Ecco/HarperCollins, 2016; Chinese ed. (Zheng Li tr.), Beijing United Publishing (Houlang), 2019��id�84d601e829b5�body���MVP 估计一个种群长期存活所需的最小规模，需同时考虑随机的环境、灾害与种群统计波动，以及近交和遗传漂变导致的适应力丧失。常用种群活力分析（PVA）模拟不同情景下的灭绝概率。�VMVP estimates the smallest population size needed for long-term survival, accounting for random environmental, catastrophic and demographic fluctuations as well as loss of adaptive potential from inbreeding and genetic drift. Population viability analysis (PVA) is commonly used to simulate extinction probabilities under different scenarios.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�8a89c342e0a6�body���碳在大气、生物和岩石间不断循环：植物光合作用固定二氧化碳，动物呼吸和燃烧释放它。海洋和土壤是重要的碳库。人类活动排放过量碳，扰乱了自然平衡。��Carbon cycles among atmosphere, life, and rocks: plants fix carbon dioxide by photosynthesis, while respiration and burning release it. Oceans and soils are major carbon stores. Human emissions overload the natural balance.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�8d7adf845c71�body�ه通过杂合度、近交系数和有效种群大小来评估；近交会让有害的隐性等位基因暴露，降低幼体存活率。ُHeterozygosity, inbreeding coefficient, and effective population size reveal how inbreeding exposes deleterious recessives and lowers survival.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�8fdbd61ab7aa�body���树开花招来传粉昆虫，昆虫又吸引食虫鸟和蜘蛛；落花落果喂养地面动物和微生物；树洞给鸟和昆虫安家。一棵树就是许多物种的食堂、旅馆和车站。��Blossoms draw pollinators; pollinators attract insect-eating birds and spiders; fallen flowers and fruit feed ground animals and microbes; hollows house birds and insects. One tree is a cafeteria, hotel and station for many species.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�91ab44b5d24d�body��CCAR-T 通过病毒载体把编码嵌合抗原受体的基因导入患者 T 细胞，该受体将肿瘤识别域与 T 细胞激活域人工拼接，使细胞无需 MHC 提呈即可识别表面抗原。这种「即插即用」的受体设计正是合成生物学模块化装配思路的体现，已用于血液肿瘤治疗。��In CAR-T therapy, a viral vector introduces a gene encoding a chimeric antigen receptor into a patient's T cells; the receptor artificially fuses a tumor-recognition domain with T-cell activation domains so cells detect surface antigens without MHC presentation. This plug-and-play receptor design reflects synthetic biology's modular assembly and is already used against blood cancers.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�93489862d439�body���会。菌群通过“肠—脑轴”：产生神经递质（如血清素前体、GABA）、调节炎症并影响迷走神经。不同菌偏好不同养分，会微妙地改变宿主食欲；压力也会反过来改变菌群，形成循环。�Yes. The microbiome uses the gut–brain axis—making neurotransmitters (serotonin precursors, GABA), shaping inflammation and signaling via the vagus nerve. Different bacteria prefer different nutrients and subtly steer appetite; stress flips back and reshapes the flora.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�971f9d459846�body��NGS 将 DNA 打断为海量片段并并行扩增，测序时每掺入一个荧光标记核苷酸就成像一次，数百万簇同时读取。借助高覆盖度与质量值过滤，单碱基错误可被统计校正，在低成本高通量下保持可用准确性。�+NGS fragments DNA into massive parallel amplicons and images each incorporated fluorescent nucleotide, reading millions of clusters simultaneously. High coverage combined with quality-score filtering statistically corrects per-base errors, preserving usable accuracy at low cost and high throughput.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�9d9a6012ae8b�body�ٷ端粒是染色体末端的保护帽，每次细胞分裂都会缩短一点。当端粒过短，细胞停止分裂进入衰老。端粒长度被视为细胞老化的“生物钟”。��Telomeres are protective caps at chromosome ends that shorten a bit each cell division. When too short, the cell stops dividing and ages. Telomere length is seen as a biological clock of cellular aging.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�a75c7b29e6d9�body��7系统首先由 sgRNA 引导 Cas9 蛋白通过 PAM 序列识别靶 DNA 并解旋形成 R-loop。随后 Cas9 的两个核酸酶结构域 HNH 与 RuvC 分别在两条链上切开磷酸二酯键，产生双链断裂。细胞随后通过非同源末端连接或同源定向修复引入插入缺失或精确替换。��The system first uses a single-guide RNA to direct Cas9 to the target DNA, where the PAM sequence enables strand separation and R-loop formation. Cas9's two nuclease domains, HNH and RuvC, then cleave opposite DNA strands to create a double-strand break. The cell subsequently repairs the break by non-homologous end joining or homology-directed repair, yielding indels or precise edits.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�a8bea71c93f0�body���能量金字塔以图形显示每一营养级可用的能量随层级升高而减少。底层生产者能量最多，顶层掠食者最少。它解释为何高营养级生物个体少、体型大却数量有限。��The energy pyramid shows available energy shrinking at higher trophic levels. The base of producers holds the most energy; top predators the least. It explains why higher-level organisms are fewer and limited in number despite large size.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�adbcb9c71cbb�body���衰老细胞停止分裂却持续存在，并分泌促炎物质影响周围。DNA损伤累积、线粒体功能下降，使组织修复变慢。这些过程共同导致机体功能逐渐衰退。��Aging cells stop dividing yet persist, secreting inflammatory substances that affect neighbors. DNA damage accumulates and mitochondrial function declines, slowing tissue repair. Together these drive gradual loss of function.�ans��src��uLópez-Otín, Blasco, Partridge, Serrano 等,《The Hallmarks of Aging》,Cell,2013 (DOI: 10.1016/j.cell.2013.05.039)�ZLópez-Otín et al., 'The Hallmarks of Aging', Cell, 2013, DOI: 10.1016/j.cell.2013.05.039��id�b162434f9da0�body��遗传多样性低意味着有害突变难以被清除、近交衰退加剧，种群对环境变化的适应潜力下降。研究者通过等位酶、微卫星或全基因组测序估计杂合度与有效种群大小，把遗传健康纳入灭绝风险评估。�aLow genetic diversity means deleterious mutations are harder to purge and inbreeding depression worsens, lowering a population's adaptive potential to environmental change. Researchers estimate heterozygosity and effective population size via allozymes, microsatellites or whole-genome sequencing to include genetic health in extinction-risk assessment.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�b81a0c322a29�body���谷氨酸是天然存在的氨基酸，游离谷氨酸能激活舌头上的鲜味受体；海带、番茄、奶酪中本就富含，味精只是把这种鲜味浓缩提纯，并非有害物质。��Glutamate is a natural amino acid; free glutamate activates umami receptors on the tongue. It is naturally rich in kombu, tomatoes and cheese, and MSG simply concentrates that taste, not a harmful additive.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�bc0e21c3e83d�body�و它们能在单个分子水平观察酶折叠、DNA 解旋和蛋白构象变化，揭示群体平均信号所掩盖的动力学细节。ٍThey watch enzyme folding, DNA unwinding, and conformational changes one molecule at a time, exposing kinetics hidden by population averages.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�bf938e67f5db�body���在美国发现的一株蜜环菌通过地下菌丝连成一片，覆盖约9.6平方公里，估计年龄上千岁，被认为是地球上最大的单体生物之一。它靠菌丝网络不断扩张并分解木材，默默统治着整片林地。�A honey fungus in the US connects through underground hyphae across about 9.6 square kilometers, estimated thousands of years old, among the largest single organisms on Earth. It expands via mycelial networks, decomposing wood and quietly dominating the woodland.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�bio_26_004�body��{给T细胞装上识别CD19的嵌合抗原受体。采集患者外周血T细胞,用病毒载体转入由CD19单链抗体片段、铰链跨膜区和CD3ζ加4-1BB共刺激域拼成的CAR,体外扩增后回输体内;CAR绕过MHC限制直接结合瘤细胞表面CD19,交联后激活内源性杀伤与增殖程序,持续清除B系肿瘤,代价是常伴发细胞因子释放综合征。��It grafts a CD19-directed chimeric antigen receptor onto T cells. A patient's peripheral blood T cells receive, via viral vector, a CAR built from a CD19 single-chain antibody fragment fused to hinge/transmembrane segments plus CD3-zeta and 4-1BB costimulatory domains, then are expanded ex vivo and reinfused. Binding surface CD19 without MHC restriction triggers native killing and proliferation programs that keep clearing B-lineage tumor, at the frequent price of cytokine release syndrome.�ans��src�٥Porter DL等论文《Chimeric antigen receptor-modified T cells in chronic lymphoid leukemia》,New England Journal of Medicine 2011(宾夕法尼亚大学June团队)٩Porter DL et al., 'Chimeric antigen receptor-modified T cells in chronic lymphoid leukemia', New England Journal of Medicine, 2011 (June lab, University of Pennsylvania)��id�bio_26_010�body���关键是直接电子探测相机与统计三维重构算法的结合。直接探测器逐帧记录单电子事件,信噪比远超胶片与CCD,低剂量成像保住高频信息;软件用最大似然法对数十万颗粒做二维分类与三维精修,校正辐射损伤导致的各向异性衰减,把玻璃态冰中的样品收敛为近原子级密度图。2013年Liao等据此解出3.4埃的TRPV1通道结构,无需结晶即阐明其离子选择性与门控基础,宣告冷冻电镜黄金时代的到来。��Direct electron detection cameras combined with statistical three-dimensional reconstruction algorithms. Direct detectors record individual electron events frame by frame, lifting signal-to-noise far beyond film and CCDs, while low-dose imaging preserves high-frequency information. Maximum-likelihood software sorts hundreds of thousands of particles into 2D classes and refines the 3D map, correcting the anisotropic falloff caused by radiation damage, until specimens held in vitreous ice yield near-atomic density maps. In 2013 Liao and colleagues solved the 3.4-angstrom TRPV1 channel without crystals, explaining its ion selectivity and gating and opening the cryo-EM golden age.�ans��src�٢Liao M等论文《Structure of the TRPV1 ion channel determined by electron cryo-microscopy》,Nature 2013(加州大学旧金山分校Julius与程亦凡实验室)ْLiao M et al., 'Structure of the TRPV1 ion channel determined by electron cryo-microscopy', Nature, 2013 (Julius and Cheng labs, UC San Francisco)��id�bio_26_014�body���血凝素上的抗原漂移持续产生逃逸既有抗体的新变异。Smith等用血凝抑制数据构建抗原地图,把毒株按抗体交叉反应的距离排入二维空间,H3N2亚型由此显露出沿一条主轴逐年推进的轨迹;群体免疫不断淘汰旧谱系,携带全新抗原表位的克隆获得传播优势后席卷全球,上一季疫苗随即失效,世界卫生组织因此每年依据这类抗原图更新推荐毒株。�7Antigenic drift on hemagglutinin keeps generating variants that escape established antibodies. Building maps from hemagglutination-inhibition data, Smith and colleagues placed strains in two dimensions by antibody cross-reaction distance, revealing H3N2 creeping forward along a single main axis year after year. Herd immunity continuously retires old lineages; once clones bearing novel antigenic epitopes gain a transmission edge they sweep the globe and last season's vaccine loses its grip, which is why WHO refreshes recommended strains annually using such maps.�ans��src�٣Smith DJ等论文《Mapping the antigenic and genetic evolution of influenza virus》,Science 2004(美国国立卫生研究院与伦敦WHO流感参考研究中心)��Smith DJ et al., 'Mapping the antigenic and genetic evolution of influenza virus', Science, 2004 (US National Institutes of Health and WHO Collaborating Centre for Reference and Research on Influenza, London)��id�bio_26_017�body���因为抗体压力只可能在少数既躲开免疫又不损功能的位点上起效。Starr等对受体结合域做深度突变扫描,测遍数千种氨基酸替换对折叠与ACE2结合的影响,发现绝大多数替换破坏结构或丧失亲和力,可用的逃逸突变屈指可数;流行株遂在全球范围反复独立拾取同款突变:N501Y加强受体结合,E484K、L452R削弱抗体识别,趋同演化由此产生。�EBecause antibody pressure can only act at the handful of sites where a mutation dodges immunity yet spares function. Deep mutational scanning of the receptor-binding domain by Starr and colleagues measured thousands of amino-acid substitutions for effects on folding and ACE2 binding, showing that most wreck the structure or drop receptor affinity and leaving very few usable escape changes. Circulating lineages worldwide therefore pick up the same mutations independently: N501Y tightens ACE2 engagement while E484K and L452R blunt antibody recognition, and convergence follows.�ans��src���Starr TN等论文《Deep mutational scanning of the SARS-CoV-2 receptor binding domain reveals constraints on folding and ACE2 binding》,Cell 2020(弗雷德·哈金森癌症研究中心Bloom实验室)��Starr TN et al., 'Deep mutational scanning of the SARS-CoV-2 receptor binding domain reveals constraints on folding and ACE2 binding', Cell, 2020 (Bloom lab, Fred Hutchinson Cancer Research Center)��id�c2f93d9f864a�body��水平基因转移指细菌之间不靠繁殖而直接交换基因，如通过质粒传递耐药基因。这让抗生素耐药性能在不同菌种间快速扩散，甚至出现“超级细菌”。它是微生物演化快于多细胞生物的重要原因。�0Horizontal gene transfer is the direct exchange of genes between bacteria without reproduction, such as passing drug-resistance genes on plasmids. It lets antibiotic resistance spread quickly across species, producing 'superbugs.' It is a major reason microbes evolve faster than multicellular organisms.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�c4ad5f08c2e2�body���高原空气稀薄、氧气分压低，身体一时难以获得足够氧气，出现头痛、气短和乏力。为代偿，身体会加快呼吸、增加红细胞生成。缓慢上升并充分适应可减轻症状。�At high altitude the air is thin and oxygen partial pressure is low, so the body briefly fails to get enough oxygen, causing headache, breathlessness, and fatigue. To compensate, breathing speeds up and red cell production increases. Ascending slowly helps the body adapt.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�c4fdb441eb4f�body���肠道菌群是居住在消化道内的数以万亿计的微生物群落。它们帮助消化纤维、合成某些维生素并训练免疫系统。菌群失衡与肥胖、炎症甚至情绪问题相关。��The gut microbiome is the trillions of microbes living in the digestive tract. They help digest fiber, synthesize some vitamins, and train the immune system. Imbalance is linked to obesity, inflammation, and even mood issues.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�c616ecca4be2�body��同源异型突变使身体某一体节长出本属于另一体节的结构（如果蝇长出额外翅膀或腿代替触角），说明 Hox 基因以「位置指令」方式指定体节命运。这种整段替换揭示发育蓝图是模块化的，并可用少量主控基因重排。�?Homeotic mutations cause one body segment to develop structures belonging to another, such as a fly growing an extra wing or legs in place of antennae, showing Hox genes act as positional commands specifying segment fate. Such whole-segment substitutions reveal a modular body plan rewirable by a few master regulators.�ans��src��:Gilbert《Developmental Biology》,Sinauer Associates,2010�=Gilbert S.F., Developmental Biology, Sinauer Associates, 2010��id�c889ffb76db4�body�ل顶级捕食者数量的变化会层层向下影响食草动物和植物，例如狼的回归让河流两岸的植被得以恢复。�qPredator changes ripple down to herbivores and plants, as when wolves returned and restored riverside vegetation.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�caf22cbe5a98�body���不同细胞更新速度差异很大：肠道上皮几天一换，皮肤约几周，红细胞约120天。而心肌细胞和多数神经元几乎终身不更替。这种差异反映了各组织的功能需求。��Cell renewal rates vary widely: gut lining renews in days, skin in weeks, red cells in about 120 days. Heart muscle cells and most neurons rarely renew in a lifetime. This reflects each tissue's functional needs.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�cc5766b6cdec�body�ٱ蜡样芽孢杆菌的耐热芽孢在米饭蒸煮后依然存活，米饭在室温下存放会大量繁殖并产呕吐毒素，之后即使再加热也难以完全破坏毒素。٭Heat-resistant Bacillus cereus spores survive cooking; rice left at room temperature lets them multiply and make an emetic toxin that reheating often fails to fully destroy.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�cc5f6005db61�body���下丘脑视交叉上核是主钟，受光线（尤其晨光）校准，指挥全身激素（如皮质醇、褪黑素）起伏。熬夜、蓝光和三餐不定时会给它错误信号，让钟“走慢或走乱”，表现为失眠、白天困。��The suprachiasmatic nucleus is the master clock, set by light (especially morning) and driving hormones like cortisol and melatonin. Late nights, blue light and irregular meals send wrong signals, desyncing the clock—insomnia, daytime drowsiness.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�ceb98ecb955f�body�َHox 基因负责指定体节的身份，突变会错误地开启别处的发育程序，把触角位置变成腿、把平衡棒变成翅膀。�uHox genes assign segment identity; mutations misactivate programs so legs replace antennae and halteres become wings.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�d6307dc1b83c�body���记忆形成依赖海马体把短期印象转为长期存储，并分散到大脑皮层。关键在于神经元之间突触连接的强化，即“长时程增强”。反复回想和睡眠能巩固这些连接。�Memory formation relies on the hippocampus converting short-term impressions into long-term storage distributed across the cortex. The key is strengthening synapses between neurons, called long-term potentiation. Rehearsal and sleep consolidate these connections.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�dcbb02e7a024�body���绿茶不发酵、白茶微发酵、黄茶轻发酵、乌龙茶半发酵、红茶全发酵、黑茶后发酵；所谓发酵实为茶多酚的酶促氧化，氧化程度决定转化产物的构成，从而带来颜色、涩感和香气的系统差异。�1Green is unoxidized, white barely oxidized, yellow lightly so, oolong partially, black fully, and dark tea post-fermented by microbes; 'fermentation' in tea is really enzymatic oxidation of polyphenols, and its degree sets the product mix behind the systematic differences in color, astringency and aroma.�ans��src��9陈宗懋 主编,《中国茶经》,上海文化出版社�[Chen Zongmao (ed.), Zhongguo Chajing (China Tea Classic), Shanghai Culture Publishing House��id�e0dab3be1af7�body���这叫表型可塑性：叶子根据光照、风、湿度实时调整结构（向光面更厚、叶绿体更多），是同一套基因在不同环境下的表达，并非像动物记忆那样“记住”过去，而是随时适应环境。��It's phenotypic plasticity: leaves adjust structure (thicker, more chloroplasts on the lit side) to light, wind and humidity—the same genes expressed differently by environment. Not “memory” like animals, but continuous adaptation.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�ec1f871181c3�body���ATP 依赖的染色质重塑复合物通过滑动、弹出或重组核小体改变 DNA 在组蛋白上的包裹方式，使转录因子更易或更难结合启动子，从而在不改变序列的前提下调控转录。��ATP-dependent remodeling complexes slide, evict or restructure nucleosomes to alter how DNA is wrapped around histones, making promoters more or less accessible to transcription factors and thereby regulating transcription without sequence change.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�eed4359f77ba�body���豆科植物根部分泌信号吸引根瘤菌进入，形成根瘤供其居住。根瘤菌用固氮酶把空气中的氮气变成植物能用的氨，植物则提供糖和安居环境。这种共生减少了化肥需求，是天然氮肥厂。� Legume roots secrete signals that invite rhizobia in, forming nodules as their home. The bacteria use nitrogenase to convert atmospheric nitrogen into ammonia the plant can use, while the plant supplies sugars and shelter. This symbiosis cuts fertilizer need—a natural nitrogen factory.�ans��src�هEd Yong,《I Contain Multitudes》Ecco/HarperCollins,2016;中译《我包罗万象》(郑李译),后浪丨北京联合出版公司,2019�~Ed Yong, I Contain Multitudes, Ecco/HarperCollins, 2016; Chinese ed. (Zheng Li tr.), Beijing United Publishing (Houlang), 2019��id�eeed50530b29�body���基因表达是基因中的信息被读取并合成蛋白质的过程，即细胞“使用”基因指令。同一套基因组在不同细胞中表达不同，才分化为肌肉、神经等。调控表达是发育和健康的关键。�Gene expression is the process of reading a gene's information to make proteins—the cell 'using' its instructions. The same genome is expressed differently in various cells, giving rise to muscle, nerve, and more. Controlling expression is key to development and health.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�f0a9407be5dc�body���自身免疫病是免疫系统误把自身组织当异物攻击，如类风湿或红斑狼疮。病因与遗传易感和环境触发（感染、激素等）有关。治疗多靠抑制过度免疫反应。�Autoimmune disease occurs when the immune system mistakenly attacks the body's own tissues, as in rheumatoid arthritis or lupus. Causes involve genetic susceptibility and environmental triggers like infection or hormones. Treatment often suppresses the overactive response.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�f228c2fc7f56�body���先天免疫是与生俱来的快速防线，如皮肤、吞噬细胞和炎症反应，不针对特定病原。获得性免疫则通过接触抗原后产生特异性抗体和记忆细胞，反应较慢但更精准持久。两者互补构成完整防御。�Innate immunity is the built-in rapid defense—skin, phagocytes, inflammation—not specific to any pathogen. Adaptive immunity, after encountering an antigen, makes specific antibodies and memory cells; slower but precise and lasting. The two complement each other for full defense.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�f6dbccdcd828�body���演化残迹是祖先有用、后代退化但仍残留的结构，如鲸的后腿骨、人的尾椎和智齿、洞穴鱼退化的眼。它们说明物种保留了演化历史的“草稿”，并非为当前功能而存在。�Evolutionary vestiges are structures useful to ancestors but reduced and leftover in descendants, such as whale hind-leg bones, the human tailbone and wisdom teeth, and cavefish shrunken eyes. They show species retain drafts of evolutionary history, not features built for current use.�ans��src��aRichard Dawkins,《The Selfish Gene》Oxford,1976;中译《自私的基因》中信出版社,2012�TR. Dawkins, The Selfish Gene, Oxford University Press, 1976; Chinese ed. CITIC, 2012��id�f8623323bd95�body���神经递质是神经元之间传递信号的化学分子，如多巴胺、血清素和谷氨酸。它们在突触释放后作用于受体，影响情绪、运动和认知。药物常通过调节递质来治疗疾病。�Neurotransmitters are chemical molecules that carry signals between neurons, such as dopamine, serotonin, and glutamate. Released at synapses, they act on receptors and influence mood, movement, and cognition. Many drugs treat disease by tuning these messengers.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�fb5b168bf3e4�body���他用鹅颈瓶把煮沸的培养液与空气灰尘隔开：若瓶颈完好液体久放不腐败，一旦接入灰尘便很快变质，证明微生物来自已有微生物而非自发产生。��With swan-neck flasks he separated boiled broth from airborne dust: intact necks kept it sterile, but adding dust spoiled it, proving microbes come from other microbes, not spontaneous generation.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�fd6f6888096c�body��J许多陆地植物根系与丛枝菌根真菌形成共生，真菌菌丝像网络连接不同植株，能传递糖分、氮磷甚至警报信号。被啃食的植株可通过菌丝向邻居发出化学警示，使其提前启动防御。这类“木维网”现象在森林中研究较多，但共享规模和意义仍有争论。�xMany land plants form symbioses with arbuscular mycorrhizal fungi whose hyphae link different individuals, transporting sugars, nitrogen, phosphorus, and even warning signals. A grazed plant can send chemical alerts through the hyphae so neighbors preactivate defenses. The 'wood wide web' is well studied in forests, though the scale and importance of sharing remain debated.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�0e7f9ad17dac�body�ٓ从患者血液中取出 T 细胞，用病毒载体装上识别肿瘤抗原的嵌合抗原受体，扩增后回输体内，专门杀伤癌细胞。٣T cells are harvested, equipped with a viral-vector-borne chimeric antigen receptor against tumor antigens, expanded, and infused back to kill cancer specifically.�ans��src��mJaneway 等，《免疫生物学：健康与疾病中的免疫系统》（第9版，Garland Science，2016）�gJaneway et al., Immunobiology: The Immune System in Health and Disease (9th ed., Garland Science, 2016)��id�264c93c01b0d�body�م裸露的 mRNA 易被酶降解且难以进入细胞，LNP 既保护它又帮助其进入细胞质释放，是递送的关键技术。�uNaked mRNA is fragile and entry-poor; LNPs protect it from enzymes and ferry it into the cytoplasm, solving delivery.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�36bbf3d43f1a�body�ٜ从氨基酸序列直接预测三维结构长期是难题，深度学习已能以接近实验的精度给出结构，极大加速了药物和功能研究。ٗPredicting 3D structure from sequence was long unsolved; deep learning now achieves near-experimental accuracy, accelerating drug and function studies.�ans��src�ٍJumper, Evans, Pritzel, Green,《Highly accurate protein structure prediction with AlphaFold》,Nature,2021 (DOI: 10.1038/s41586-021-03819-2)ًJumper, Evans, Pritzel, Green, 'Highly accurate protein structure prediction with AlphaFold', Nature, 2021, DOI: 10.1038/s41586-021-03819-2��id�699dfd9c1b38�body���酸奶常用的发酵菌（如保加利亚乳杆菌）多在肠道中过路而不长期定植；益生菌则强调某株菌在宿主内能定植或明确发挥健康功能，二者定义和证据标准不同。��Common yogurt starters like Lactobacillus bulgaricus are mostly transient in the gut; probiotics are defined by a specific strain that colonizes or clearly benefits the host, with different evidentiary standards.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�6d095533b911�body�ٓ它用单细胞技术为人体每种组织绘制所有细胞类型的分子身份证和空间位置，目标是绘出完整的人体细胞地图。ٝIt uses single-cell technology to map every cell type's molecular identity and location across human tissues, aiming for a complete cellular map of the body.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�bio_26_019�body���它把结构的破坏与重建学成了先验知识。Watson等将图像扩散模型改造成蛋白质设计引擎:训练时对真实主链坐标逐步加噪,神经网络学习逆转每一步,生成时便从纯噪声出发逐级去噪出全新主链,再以RoseTTAFold类工具检验能否折叠;相较依赖手工规则与片段拼装的Rosetta方案,它能按对称性、结合基序等条件定向生成,实验成功率提升约一个数量级。��It learns the breaking and rebuilding of structures as prior knowledge. Watson and colleagues turned an image diffusion model into a protein-design engine: during training, noise corrupts real backbone coordinates step by step and the network learns to reverse each step; at generation time it starts from pure noise and denoises brand-new backbones, whose foldability is then screened with RoseTTAFold-class predictors. Compared with Rosetta pipelines built on hand rules and fragment assembly, it generates on demand under conditions such as symmetry or specified binding motifs, lifting experimental success rates by roughly an order of magnitude.�ans��src�َWatson JL等论文《De novo design of protein structure and function with RFdiffusion》,Nature 2023(华盛顿大学蛋白质设计研究所)ٜWatson JL et al., 'De novo design of protein structure and function with RFdiffusion', Nature, 2023 (Institute for Protein Design, University of Washington)��id�e5c4460f6381�body�٣面对混合样本里大量碎片化的 DNA，分箱按序列组成和覆盖度把片段归到各自的微生物基因组，重建无需培养的单菌基因组。�zBinning groups fragments by composition and coverage to reconstruct individual genome bins without culturing each microbe.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�f8ccb5bae08b�body���它们主要靠继承自亲代的“种群记忆”和嗅觉、地磁、日月星辰及地形线索导航，迁徙路线世代相传；产羔地的高原草甸食物丰富、天敌较少，是长期自然选择固定的行为。��They navigate using inherited “population memory” plus smell, geomagnetism, celestial cues and terrain; the route passes down generations. The lambing grounds offer rich food and fewer predators—a behavior fixed by natural selection.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�024e34e471a2�body��p系外行星是围绕太阳系以外恒星运行、不绕太阳公转的行星，迄今已确认超过5000颗。�[An exoplanet orbits a star other than the Sun; more than 5,000 have been confirmed to date.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�0460ac5aa0c2�body��科学界普遍认为约6600万年前一颗约10公里宽的小行星撞击今墨西哥尤卡坦半岛，引发了恐龙等大量生物灭绝。撞击扬起的尘埃遮蔽阳光，导致全球变冷和光合作用中断。这一撞击坑被称为希克苏鲁伯。�GMost scientists agree that about 66 million years ago an asteroid roughly 10 kilometers wide hit what is now the Yucatan Peninsula in Mexico, causing the mass extinction of the dinosaurs and many other species. Dust from the impact blocked sunlight, cooling the globe and halting photosynthesis. The crater is called Chicxulub.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�04b611caae83�body���太阳本身发出的光接近白色，其表面温度约5500摄氏度。由于地球大气对蓝光的散射强于红光，我们看到的太阳常偏黄，尤其在接近地平线时更显橙红。��The Sun actually emits nearly white light, with a surface temperature around 5,500 degrees Celsius. Earth's atmosphere scatters blue light more strongly than red, so the Sun often looks yellow to us, and even more orange near the horizon.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�066615ee9c5e�body��f太阳系有八大行星，按照离太阳从近到远的顺序是：水星、金星、地球、火星、木星、土星、天王星和海王星。其中前四颗体积小、密度高，被称为类地行星；后四颗体积庞大、主要由气体或冰组成，被称为巨行星。冥王星在2006年被国际天文学联合会重新归类为矮行星。��The Solar System has eight planets, ordered by distance from the Sun: Mercury, Venus, Earth, Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, and Neptune. The first four are small and rocky and are called terrestrial planets, while the last four are large bodies made mostly of gas or ice and are called giant planets. Pluto was reclassified as a dwarf planet by the International Astronomical Union in 2006.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�09f54edfef47�body�٢不一样。南半球能看到北极星看不到的南十字座、大小麦哲伦云，而北半球常见的北斗七星在南纬较高处就沉到地平线下。ٙNo. The South sees the Southern Cross and Magellanic Clouds invisible from the North, while the Big Dipper sinks below the horizon at southern latitudes.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�0b44d4a277b6�body���大质量恒星核心温度更高、核聚变更剧烈，燃料消耗远快于小质量恒星，因此虽燃料更多却往往只活几百万到几千万年，而小质量恒星可燃烧上千亿年。��Massive stars burn much hotter and faster, consuming fuel far quicker than low-mass stars; despite having more fuel they live only millions of years, while low-mass stars shine for hundreds of billions.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�0da81f1c0025�body���恒星靠核心的核聚变自己发光发热，比如太阳；行星不会发光，只是反射恒星的光，像地球。简单说，恒星是自己会亮的大火球，行星是被照亮的小石头或气球。�A star shines under its own power through core nuclear fusion, like the Sun, while a planet makes no light of its own and only reflects a star's light, like Earth. Simply put, a star is a big ball of fire that glows by itself, and a planet is a lit-up rock or gas ball.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�0dbfdca74373�body�٨彗星含水和多种有机分子（如氨基酸前体、甲醛），被视为地球早期水和有机物的可能输送者，支持了“生命原料天降”假说。��Comets carry water and many organic molecules (amino-acid precursors, formaldehyde) and are seen as possible deliverers of Earth's early water and organics, supporting the 'life ingredients from space' idea.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�14387a212abc�body�ٽ三者起初都含二氧化碳与水，地球因板块与生命锁住碳并保有液态水；金星失控温室使海洋蒸发，火星因弱磁场和弱引力让大气被太阳风剥离。��All three started with CO2 and water; Earth locked carbon via plate tectonics and life and kept liquid water, Venus suffered runaway greenhouse evaporation, and Mars lost its air to solar wind because of weak magnetic field and gravity.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�1626a724df8e�body��␀流星雨是地球穿过彗星留下的尘埃带时，大量尘埃高速冲入大气燃烧形成的现象。因为透视效果，这些流星看起来都从天空中的同一个点（辐射点）散开。著名的例子有每年8月的英仙座流星雨。�A meteor shower occurs when Earth passes through the dust trail left by a comet and lots of particles burn up in the atmosphere. Due to perspective, the meteors appear to radiate from a single point in the sky called the radiant. A famous example is the Perseids every August.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�168f3e0dedac�body��7事件视界望远镜（EHT）通过联合全球多台射电望远镜进行甚长基线干涉，首次直接拍摄到星系 M87 中心超大质量黑洞的“阴影”与周围发光环的图像。这是人类首次“看见”黑洞视界附近的景象，验证了广义相对论在极端引力下的预言。�VThe Event Horizon Telescope combined radio dishes worldwide via very-long-baseline interferometry to directly image, for the first time, the shadow and glowing ring around the supermassive black hole in galaxy M87. It was the first time humanity “saw” the region near a black hole's horizon, testing general relativity in extreme gravity.�ans��src��<事件视界望远镜合作组（EHT，2019，M87* 成像）�:Event Horizon Telescope Collaboration (2019, M87* imaging)��id�191f85e113b1�body�٢宜居不仅要求液态水温度，还要合适的大气压、磁场、大气成分与恒星活动；综合这些的“宜居性”比单纯宜居带更严格。��Habitability needs not just liquid-water temperature but suitable atmospheric pressure, magnetic field, atmospheric composition and stellar activity; true habitability is stricter than the simple habitable zone.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�1bcdcd0aca49�body��5土星环主要由无数水冰颗粒构成，夹杂少量岩石碎屑，单个颗粒从微米到数米不等。关于其年龄长期存在争论：传统观点认为它们与土星同龄（约45亿年），而卡西尼号对环质量的测算显示它们可能相对年轻（约1亿年），但尚无定论。�WSaturn's rings are made mostly of countless water-ice particles mixed with a little rocky debris, ranging from microns to meters across. Their age is debated: traditionally thought to be as old as Saturn (~4.5 billion years), but Cassini mass measurements suggest they could be much younger (~100 million years), though this remains unsettled.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�20ad94d02215�body�ف土星环几乎全由无数冰粒和岩石碎块组成，大小从微米到数米不等，在阳光下反射出明亮的光环。٪Saturn's rings are made almost entirely of countless ice particles and rock fragments ranging from micrometers to meters across, which reflect sunlight into bright rings.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�2124a03db8b6�body�ٟ标准烛光是已知真实亮度的天体（如造父变星、Ia 型超新星），由观测到的明暗反推距离，是丈量宇宙尺度的核心工具。��A standard candle is an object of known intrinsic brightness (like Cepheids or Type Ia supernovae); comparing its apparent dimness to true brightness gives distance—a core tool for cosmic measuring.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�26f15d8a23d5�body��高山上空气稀薄、水汽少，大气更稳定，能减少光线的吸收和抖动，让星星看起来更清楚。远离城市还能避开光污染，使暗弱的天体也能被看见。因此世界大型光学望远镜多建在干燥的高原或火山顶。�High mountains have thin, dry, stable air that reduces absorption and wobble of light, making stars appear sharper. Being far from cities also avoids light pollution so faint objects are visible. That is why major optical telescopes are built on dry plateaus or volcano tops.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�2d082106ed30�body��一般来说，更大的口径能收集更多光、看清更暗更细的目标，因此更有优势。但大气湍流、光学误差和成本也会限制实际效果。现代大望远镜往往配合自适应光学和干涉技术来发挥大口径的潜力。�,Generally, a larger aperture collects more light and resolves fainter, finer targets, so it has advantages. But atmospheric turbulence, optical errors, and cost also limit real performance. Modern large telescopes pair big apertures with adaptive optics and interferometry to realize their potential.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�2edefe99624e�body�ٙ由于温度介于行星与恒星之间，褐矮星大气可凝结出硅酸盐尘云、乃至铁云和刚玉云，使其亮度与颜色随自转而变。��Because their temperatures sit between planets and stars, brown-dwarf atmospheres can condense silicate dust clouds and even iron or corundum clouds, making their brightness and color change as they rotate.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�2fab4a5dae40�body��离太阳最近的恒星系统是约4.24光年外的半人马座阿尔法三星系统，其中最近的单颗恒星是比邻星（Proxima Centauri）。比邻星是一颗又小又暗的红矮星，肉眼无法直接看见。它也是已知离我们最近的系外行星的母星。�
The nearest star system to the Sun is Alpha Centauri, about 4.24 light-years away, and the closest single star within it is Proxima Centauri. Proxima is a small, dim red dwarf invisible to the naked eye. It is also the host star of the nearest known exoplanet to us.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�328934ca7114�body��日食发生在新月时，月球跑到太阳和地球之间，挡住太阳光。月食发生在满月时，地球位于太阳和月球之间，地球的影子投到月球上。日食只在地球上狭窄的带状区域可见，月食则半个地球夜半球都能看到。�UA solar eclipse happens at new moon when the Moon passes between the Sun and Earth and blocks sunlight. A lunar eclipse happens at full moon when Earth lies between the Sun and Moon and casts its shadow onto the Moon. A solar eclipse is visible only along a narrow path, while a lunar eclipse can be seen across half the night side of Earth.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�3327581aaf3b�body�ً截至近年统计，木星已确认卫星超过 90 颗，是太阳系中卫星最多的行星之一，其中多数很小且轨道奇特。فAs of recent counts, Jupiter has over 90 confirmed moons, among the most of any planet, though most are tiny with unusual orbits.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�337267d6bb34�body�ِ彗星接近太阳时，冰质表面受热升华，喷出气体和尘埃，被太阳风与辐射压推向后方，形成背离太阳的彗尾。ٮAs a comet nears the Sun, its icy surface sublimates and releases gas and dust, which solar wind and radiation pressure sweep backward into a tail pointing away from the Sun.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�33b63e275091�body��系外行星大气是包裹在行星固体或液态表面之外的气体层，成分可能包括氢、氦、水蒸气、二氧化碳等。大气决定了行星表面的温度与是否可能宜居。通过星光穿过大气时的吸收特征，天文学家能推断其组成。�IAn exoplanet atmosphere is the gas layer enveloping a planet's solid or liquid surface, possibly containing hydrogen, helium, water vapor, carbon dioxide, and more. The atmosphere sets the surface temperature and habitability potential. By studying how starlight is absorbed passing through it, astronomers infer its composition.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�33fb2dc4dce8�body��u恒星核心在极高温度和压力下把氢聚变成氦，释放出巨大能量，这就是恒星光芒的来源。كIn a star's core, extreme heat and pressure fuse hydrogen into helium, releasing enormous energy—that is what makes a star shine.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�3681cebe8ae6�body�ل它是一台在地球大气层外工作的望远镜，避开大气抖动拍出清晰深空照片，帮助人类看见遥远星系。�sIt's a telescope above the atmosphere that avoids blur to take sharp deep-space images, revealing distant galaxies.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�374b45c3aacd�body�ٙ小行星带位于火星与木星轨道之间，聚集了数百万颗岩石和金属碎块，是太阳系形成时未能合并成行星的残余物质。ټThe asteroid belt lies between Mars and Jupiter and holds millions of rocky and metallic fragments—leftover material from the Solar System's formation that never coalesced into a planet.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�376ec93890fb�body��r星图是把天上恒星位置画在平面上的“地图”，帮助人们辨认星座和找到想看的天体。�rA star chart is a 'map' of star positions on a flat page, helping people identify constellations and find targets.�ans��src��<Terence Dickinson,《NightWatch》第4版,Firefly Books,2006�nT. Dickinson, NightWatch: A Practical Guide to Viewing the Universe, 4th ed., Firefly Books, 2006; Chinese ed.��id�3a82784920c4�body�ٽ彗星靠近太阳时，太阳风与辐射压把蒸发的气体和尘埃往后吹，形成两条尾（离子尾直指背阳、尘埃尾略弯），所以尾巴总朝远离太阳的方向。ٵNear the Sun, solar wind and radiation pressure blow vaporized gas and dust backward, forming tails (a straight ion tail and a curved dust tail) that always point away from the Sun.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�3ad9b441a583�body��黑洞本身没有实体表面，但可以用事件视界的半径来衡量它的“大小”。恒星级黑洞的视界半径只有几公里到几十公里，而超大质量黑洞的视界可达数亿公里。质量越大，黑洞的视界范围也越大。�%A black hole has no material surface, but its “size” is measured by the radius of its event horizon. Stellar-mass holes have horizons only a few to tens of kilometers across, while supermassive holes can span hundreds of millions of kilometers. The larger the mass, the larger the horizon.�ans��src�ٗ史瓦西 1916 年球对称引力场解与事件视界半径 R=2GM/c²；卡罗尔与奥斯特利《现代天体物理学导论》广义相对论章节ٚSchwarzschild (1916) solution and the event-horizon radius R=2GM/c²; Carroll & Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, general relativity chapter��id�3c336378b810�body�ف太阳是地球光和热的来源，驱动天气、洋流与植物光合作用，几乎支撑了地球上所有生命与能量。َThe Sun provides Earth's light and heat, driving weather, ocean currents, and photosynthesis—supporting nearly all life and energy on Earth.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�49b0649b8a8b�body���火星表面富含氧化铁，也就是我们熟悉的铁锈，使土壤和岩石呈现红橙色。风把红橙色的尘埃吹遍全球，连天空都泛着淡淡的红色。这一特征让火星被称为『红色星球』。��Mars is rich in iron oxide, the familiar rust that gives its soil and rocks a red-orange color. Winds spread this dust across the whole planet, even tinting the sky a pale red. This is why Mars is called the 'Red Planet'.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�4b01d4f5cd0f�body�ٜ费米在伽马波段巡天，探测脉冲星、伽马暴、活动星系核以及潜在的暗物质信号，是多信使天文中的关键电磁波设备。پFermi surveys the sky in gamma rays, detecting pulsars, gamma-ray bursts, active galactic nuclei and possible dark-matter signals—a key electromagnetic instrument for multi-messenger work.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�4b0e35bcc899�body��水星几乎没有真正的大气层，只有极稀薄、不断逃逸又被补充的『外逸层』，主要成分是氧、钠、氢等。由于水星质量小、引力弱且离太阳近，气体很容易被太阳风剥离。这使得水星表面昼夜温差极大。�IMercury has essentially no real atmosphere, only an extremely thin 'exosphere' of oxygen, sodium and hydrogen that constantly escapes and is replenished. Because Mercury is small, weakly gravitational and close to the Sun, gases are easily stripped away by the solar wind. This leaves its surface with extreme temperature swings.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�4dd858e4b16f�body�٦近地小行星轨道接近地球，撞击可造成区域甚至全球灾难；DART任务已成功用撞击改变Dimorphos的轨道，验证动能偏转防御可行。��Near-Earth asteroids have orbits near Earth and impacts can cause regional or global catastrophe; the DART mission successfully shifted Dimorphos's orbit by impact, proving kinetic deflection defense works.�ans��src�ٲJewitt 与 Luu《Discovery of the Kuiper Belt》（1993，Nature）；Oort《The structure of the cloud of comets》（1950，Bulletin of Astron. Institutes of the Netherlands）�qJewitt & Luu, Discovery of the Kuiper Belt (1993, Nature); Oort, The structure of the cloud of comets (1950, BAN)��id�55e7bd808bb2�body��彗星是结冰的脏雪球，靠近太阳时表面的冰受热升华成气体和尘埃。太阳风和辐射压力把这些物质推离彗星，形成背向太阳的彗尾，有时还分出尘埃尾和离子尾。彗星越靠近太阳，尾巴就越长越亮。�jComets are dirty snowballs of ice that, when near the Sun, release gas and dust as their surface ices sublimate. Solar wind and radiation pressure push this material away from the comet, forming tails that point away from the Sun, sometimes splitting into a dust tail and an ion tail. The closer a comet gets to the Sun, the longer and brighter its tail becomes.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�578371e30de4�body�ٺ流星体是太空中飘浮的岩石或金属碎块。当它闯入地球大气、因摩擦发光划过夜空时，那一刻的光迹叫流星。若残骸落到地面，就称为陨石。��A meteoroid is a rock or metal fragment drifting in space. When it plunges into Earth's atmosphere and glows from friction, the streak of light is called a meteor. If debris survives and lands on the ground, it is called a meteorite.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�57843e6b1c1b�body��
奥林匹斯山是火星上的盾状火山，高度约22公里，是地球珠穆朗玛峰的两倍多。它的底座直径超过600公里，是太阳系已知最高的火山。火星低重力和缺乏板块运动，使这样巨大的火山得以缓慢堆积形成。�Olympus Mons is a shield volcano on Mars about 22 kilometers high, more than twice the height of Mount Everest. Its base spans over 600 kilometers, making it the tallest known volcano in the solar system. Mars's low gravity and lack of plate tectonics let such a giant build up slowly.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�5d4384e4fdd1�body���多信使天文学同时用电磁波、引力波、中微子和宇宙线等多种“信使”来研究同一天体事件，能获得单一渠道无法得到的全貌。2017年的双中子星并合GW170817是这一领域的里程碑。�Multi-messenger astronomy studies the same cosmic event with several 'messengers' at once—electromagnetic light, gravitational waves, neutrinos and cosmic rays—revealing a fuller picture than any one channel alone. The 2017 neutron-star merger GW170817 was its landmark.�ans��src��ALIGO/Virgo 合作组与全球望远镜联测（2017，GW170817）�=LIGO/Virgo Collaboration & global telescopes (2017, GW170817)��id�5e058fcf87ea�body���太阳黑子是太阳光球层上温度较低、看起来较暗的区域，因局部强磁场抑制了对流散热而形成。黑子温度约4000摄氏度，比周围约5500摄氏度的光球略低。黑子数量会随太阳活动周期增减。�BSunspots are cooler, darker patches on the Sun's photosphere, formed where strong local magnetic fields suppress the convection that carries heat outward. They have a temperature of about 4000 degrees Celsius, lower than the surrounding photosphere at about 5500 degrees. Their number rises and falls with the solar cycle.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�5ebc0b4c98a8�body��u叫星团，是同一时期诞生、彼此靠引力松散聚集的一群恒星，如昴星团（七姊妹星团）。�fThey're star clusters—groups of stars born together and loosely bound by gravity, like the Pleiades.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�5f1744ec3c9e�body��Y是苏联于1957年发射的“斯普特尼克1号”，它开启了人类太空时代。�TIt was Sputnik 1, launched by the Soviet Union in 1957, opening the human space age.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�5fda162e1e8f�body���是的。爱因斯坦在1916年基于广义相对论场方程推导出弱场下的引力波解，但他一度怀疑其能否被探测。直到2015年LIGO才首次直接探测到双黑洞并合产生的引力波，印证了百年前的理论。�%Yes. In 1916 Einstein derived gravitational wave solutions from the weak-field limit of general relativity, though he later doubted they could ever be detected. The first direct detection came in 2015 when LIGO observed waves from a binary black hole merger, confirming the century-old theory.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�621368e6de9f�body��1608年荷兰眼镜匠汉斯·利伯希等人率先造出可放大远处物体的折射望远镜，次年伽利略将其指向天空并作出系列发现。望远镜的发明彻底改变了人类对宇宙的认识。后来牛顿又发明了反射望远镜。�2In 1608 Dutch spectacle makers such as Hans Lippershey built the first refracting telescopes that magnified distant objects, and the next year Galileo turned one skyward with landmark discoveries. The telescope revolutionized humanity's view of the universe. Newton later invented the reflecting telescope.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�667eb87711f1�body��这是潮汐锁定的结果：地球对月球的引力在月球上引起形变和摩擦，长期拖慢了月球的自转。最终月球自转周期和它的公转周期变得一致，都是约27.3天。于是我们在地球上始终只能看到月球的正面。��This is tidal locking: Earth's gravity creates bulges and friction in the Moon that slowly braked its spin. Eventually the Moon's rotation period matched its orbital period, both about 27.3 days. So from Earth we always see only the Moon's near side.�ans��src��f默里与德莫特《太阳系动力学》(Murray & Dermott, Solar System Dynamics) 关于潮汐锁定�9Murray & Dermott, Solar System Dynamics, on tidal locking��id�670846740c91�body�ِ把星光按波长展开成光谱，亮暗吸收线对应特定元素和分子，借此可知天体的化学组成、温度、密度与磁场。ٽSpreading starlight into a spectrum, the bright and dark lines correspond to specific elements and molecules, revealing an object's chemical makeup, temperature, density and magnetic field.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�68d747acd345�body��Y太阳系约形成于46亿年前，由一团坍缩的星际气体尘埃云凝聚而成。�iThe solar system formed about 4.6 billion years ago from a collapsing cloud of interstellar gas and dust.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�690e2de96576�body��W科学家通过宇宙微波背景和星系运动测算，宇宙年龄约为138亿年。�zFrom the cosmic microwave background and galaxy motions, scientists estimate the Universe is about 13.8 billion years old.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�696adbc3c251�body���金星表面的大气压约为地球的92倍，相当于地球深海约900米处的压力。如此高压加上约465摄氏度的高温，使金星表面环境极为恶劣。苏联的『金星』系列探测器曾短暂在表面工作并传回数据。�(The surface pressure on Venus is about 92 times that of Earth, comparable to the pressure roughly 900 meters deep in Earth's oceans. Combined with temperatures near 465 degrees Celsius, the surface is extremely hostile. The Soviet Venera probes briefly operated on the surface and sent back data.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�69ae4975a411�body��在远离光污染的黑暗夜空，肉眼大约能看到3000到6000颗星星，具体取决于视力、视野和季节。因为地球挡住了一半天空，同一时刻通常只能看到其中约一半。城市里由于光污染，能看到的星往往只有几十颗。�Under a dark sky far from light pollution, the naked eye can see roughly 3,000 to 6,000 stars, depending on eyesight, view, and season. Since Earth blocks half the sky, you typically see only about half at any moment. In cities, light pollution reduces this to only a few dozen.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�6a426b310356�body���地球表面约71%被海洋覆盖，液态水对阳光中的蓝光散射和反射较强。大气分子也会散射短波的蓝光，使地球边缘呈现蓝色光晕。因此地球在太空中看起来是一颗蓝白相间的『蓝色弹珠』。�About 71 percent of Earth's surface is covered by oceans, and liquid water strongly scatters and reflects the blue part of sunlight. Air molecules also scatter short-wavelength blue light, giving the planet a blue rim. So from space Earth appears as a blue-and-white 'blue marble'.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�6aa930690b19�body��$大多数系外行星是通过间接方法（如凌星和视向速度）发现的，因为它们的星光相比恒星极其微弱。但直接成像技术已能拍到少数远离恒星、年轻且明亮的巨行星。未来如极大望远镜和掩星 Coronagraph 将提升直接成像能力。�.Most exoplanets are found indirectly via transits or radial velocity because their light is extremely faint next to the star. Direct imaging has nevertheless captured a few young, bright giant planets far from their stars. Future extremely large telescopes and coronagraphs will improve direct imaging.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�6af184e47c47�body��{类地行星是具有岩石固体表面的行星，如水星、金星、地球和火星，它们相对小巧、密度高。�qTerrestrial planets have solid rocky surfaces, like Mercury, Venus, Earth, and Mars—relatively small and dense.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�6d2bae44dd97�body�ٯ国际空间站是多个国家合作建造、在距地约400公里轨道运行的大型载人航天器，自2000年起一直有宇航员驻留，用于微重力科学实验。ٖThe ISS is a large, multinational crewed spacecraft orbiting about 400 km up; since 2000 astronauts have lived there conducting microgravity research.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�6d9bb616e34a�body�ه大红斑是一个已持续数百年的巨型反气旋风暴，比地球还大，由木星内部热量驱动，而非靠太阳加热。ٛThe Great Red Spot is a giant anticyclonic storm that has lasted centuries, larger than Earth, driven by Jupiter's internal heat rather than solar heating.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�6e27e8778680�body��"1992年天文学家发现了围绕脉冲星运转的行星，1995年又确认了首颗绕类太阳恒星飞马座51运行的行星。这开启了系外行星研究的新时代，相关发现者因此获得2019年诺贝尔物理学奖。此后探测技术飞速发展，发现数量激增。�+In 1992 astronomers found planets orbiting a pulsar, and in 1995 they confirmed the first planet around a Sun-like star, 51 Pegasi. This opened a new era of exoplanet research, earning the discoverers the 2019 Nobel Prize in Physics. Detection techniques then advanced rapidly, and the count soared.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�6ff2ca14ab90�body��)星星看起来明暗不同，既取决于它本身的发光能力（光度），也取决于它离我们有多远。本身很亮但极遥远的星，可能看起来和一颗较近的暗星差不多亮。天文学家用视星等描述看起来的亮度，用绝对星等描述真实发光能力。�$Stars appear bright or dim depending both on their intrinsic luminosity and on their distance from us. A very luminous but extremely distant star can look as bright as a fainter nearby one. Astronomers use apparent magnitude for how bright it looks and absolute magnitude for its true output.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�7016f5954798�body�ٙ脉冲星就是快速自转的中子星，磁极发射的射电束随自转扫过地球，像灯塔一样产生规律脉冲，周期可精确至毫秒。٪A pulsar is a rapidly spinning neutron star whose magnetic poles emit radio beams that sweep past Earth like a lighthouse, producing regular pulses timed to milliseconds.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�7155da10f520�body�ٔ银河系是一个直径约10万光年的棒旋星系，包含约1000亿到4000亿颗恒星，太阳位于距离中心约2.7万光年的旋臂上。٦The Milky Way is a barred spiral about 100,000 light-years across with 100–400 billion stars; the Sun sits on a spiral arm about 27,000 light-years from the center.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�741d6e56e833�body��银河系是本星系群的一员，本星系群还包括仙女座星系、三角座星系等约八十个星系。本星系群又属于更大的室女座超星系团（本超星系团）。再往上，这些结构共同组成了拉尼亚凯亚超星系团。�The Milky Way is a member of the Local Group, which also includes the Andromeda Galaxy, the Triangulum Galaxy, and about eighty others. The Local Group in turn belongs to the larger Virgo Supercluster. On even larger scales these structures form the Laniakea Supercluster.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�74472f0f6150�body��o哥白尼提出日心说，认为地球和其他行星都绕着太阳转，揭开了现代天文学的序幕。�hCopernicus proposed the heliocentric model—Earth and planets orbit the Sun—opening modern astronomy.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�76313f77f328�body�ټ是的。2022年EHT发布了人马座A*（Sagittarius A*）的图像，确认这个约400万太阳质量的黑洞与M87一样拥有明亮环与阴影，只是变化更快、更难成像。ٷYes. In 2022 the EHT released an image of Sagittarius A*, the ~4-million-solar-mass black hole, confirming a bright ring and shadow like M87's, but faster-varying and harder to image.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�76a9de388a7d�body���在望远镜出现之前，人类用肉眼和简单仪器（如浑仪、星盘）记录恒星位置、行星运动和日月食。许多文明据此制定历法并导航。这些早期观测留下了宝贵的天象记录。�Before telescopes, people used the naked eye and simple instruments such as armillary spheres and astrolabes to record star positions, planetary motions, and eclipses. Many civilizations built calendars and navigated by them. These early observations left valuable astronomical records.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�7a588407c82d�body���火星有两颗小卫星，火卫一和火卫二，外形都很不规则，像被引力捕获的小行星。火卫一较大且离火星很近，正以每年约2厘米的速度缓慢螺旋下落。它们都很小，表面布满撞击坑。��Mars has two small, irregularly shaped moons, Phobos and Deimos, looking like captured asteroids. Phobos is the larger and orbits so close that it is slowly spiraling inward by about 2 centimeters per year. Both are tiny and heavily cratered.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�7e75c937c42e�body��n伽利略在17世纪初把望远镜指向天空，发现了木星的四颗大卫星和月面上的环形山。�nIn the early 1600s Galileo turned a telescope skyward, discovering Jupiter's four big moons and lunar craters.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�7fdfdff077e2�body�ٟ金星凌日是金星从太阳前方掠过的现象，历史上天文学家通过多地观测凌日时刻的视差，推算出天文单位（日地距离）。پA Venus transit is Venus passing in front of the Sun; historically, observers at different locations timed the transit to derive parallax and thus the astronomical unit (Earth-Sun distance).�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�819ea27240fb�body�٧宇宙古老又巨大、理应充满文明，但至今没有确凿的外星信号，物理学家费米由此发问'他们都在哪儿？'——这就是费米悖论。٠The universe is old and vast and should teem with civilizations, yet we see no convincing alien signals; Fermi asked 'Where is everybody?'—that's the paradox.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�828e597adb2d�body�ٹ分为经典柯伊伯带天体（圆轨道）、共振天体（如与海王星2比3共振的冥族天体）和散射盘天体（轨道被扰动伸长），反映不同动力学历史。��They divide into classical KBOs (round orbits), resonant objects (like Pluto's 2:3 resonance with Neptune) and scattered-disk objects (stretched, perturbed orbits)—each reflecting a different dynamical history.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�84339043d5be�body��i恒星是由引力聚集、靠核心核聚变发光发热的庞大气体球，太阳就是一颗恒星。�wA star is a massive ball of gas held together by gravity that shines via nuclear fusion in its core; the Sun is a star.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�84444d7ace68�body��8太阳是距离地球最近的一颗恒星，也是太阳系的中心天体。它主要由氢和氦组成，通过核心的核聚变反应把氢变成氦并释放出巨大的光和热。太阳的质量约占整个太阳系总质量的99.86%，其引力把八大行星和其他天体束缚在各自的轨道上。��The Sun is the closest star to Earth and the central body of the Solar System. It is composed mainly of hydrogen and helium, and it releases enormous light and heat through nuclear fusion in its core, where hydrogen is converted into helium. The Sun accounts for about 99.86% of the total mass of the Solar System, and its gravity keeps the eight planets and other bodies in their orbits.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�848b1ac50198�body�ِ星系是由恒星、气体、尘埃和暗物质在引力下聚集而成的庞大系统，比如我们的银河系就包含上千亿颗恒星。كA galaxy is a vast system of stars, gas, dust, and dark matter bound by gravity; our Milky Way holds hundreds of billions of stars.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�87806e715a4c�body�ٖ射电望远镜接收天体发出的无线电波而非可见光，常用巨大抛物面天线，能探测氢原子、脉冲星和宇宙微波背景。٢A radio telescope receives radio waves rather than visible light, often using huge dish antennas, to detect hydrogen, pulsars and the cosmic microwave background.�ans��src��<Terence Dickinson,《NightWatch》第4版,Firefly Books,2006�nT. Dickinson, NightWatch: A Practical Guide to Viewing the Universe, 4th ed., Firefly Books, 2006; Chinese ed.��id�879bc30ec316�body�ٙ恒星靠核心的核聚变把氢聚变成氦并释放能量，这与化学燃烧完全不同，不需要氧气，能量来自质量亏损（E=mc²）。��Stars shine via nuclear fusion in their cores, turning hydrogen into helium and releasing energy—nothing like chemical fire, needing no oxygen, with energy coming from mass converted to energy (E=mc²).�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�8c60368ce860�body��这是一个常见误解。黑洞的引力遵循和普通天体一样的规律，只有在非常靠近视界时引力才极端。如果太阳突然变成同质量黑洞，地球轨道并不会改变，只是失去阳光。只有足够靠近，物质才会被拉入黑洞。�5This is a common misconception. A black hole's gravity follows the same rules as any other body, becoming extreme only very close to the horizon. If the Sun suddenly became a same-mass black hole, Earth's orbit would not change, we would just lose sunlight. Matter is pulled in only when it gets close enough.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�946a47df2217�body��&没有传统意义上的边界。我们能观测到的极限是“可观测宇宙”，由光自大爆炸以来走过的距离决定，半径约465亿光年。超出这一范围的区域之光尚未到达我们，并非宇宙的真正尽头。宇宙整体可能远比可观测部分大得多。�QThere is no edge in the usual sense. The limit we can observe is the “observable universe,” set by the distance light has traveled since the Big Bang, about 46.5 billion light-years in radius. Regions beyond simply have light that has not reached us yet, not a true end. The whole universe may be far larger than the observable part.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�95fb10d3b21c�body��#火箭依靠动量守恒，也就是牛顿第三定律工作：它向后高速喷出气体，气体给火箭一个向前的反作用力。太空是真空并不影响这一过程，因为推进不依赖空气，只依赖喷出物质本身。这正是火箭比飞机更适合航天的原因。�$A rocket works by conservation of momentum, Newton's third law: it ejects gas backward at high speed and the gas pushes the rocket forward. Vacuum does not matter, because propulsion relies on the expelled mass, not on surrounding air. That is why rockets, not airplanes, are suited to space.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�96439355c8f1�body��如果把宇宙的总质能看作100%，普通物质（恒星、气体、我们）只占约5%，暗物质约占27%，其余约68%是暗能量。也就是说我们熟悉的物质只是宇宙的“少数派”。这一配比来自对微波背景和星系运动的综合测量。�;Treating the universe's total mass-energy as 100 percent, ordinary matter—stars, gas, us—is only about 5 percent, dark matter about 27 percent, and dark energy the remaining 68 percent. The matter we know is thus the minority. This budget comes from combined microwave-background and galaxy-motion measurements.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�980c1f6777af�body�٢韦布在红外波段工作，而高红移星系的光被拉长到红外，加上大口径和高灵敏度，它能捕捉到宇宙仅几亿岁时的微弱光芒。��Webb observes in infrared, where high-redshift galaxy light is stretched, and with a large aperture and high sensitivity it catches faint light from when the universe was only a few hundred million years old.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�981699c58a6c�body�٥地球绕日公转时，近处恒星相对遥远背景会显出微小位移，半年视角差越大说明距离越近，视差角是距离（秒差距）的倒数。��As Earth orbits the Sun, nearby stars shift slightly against distant backgrounds; a larger half-year parallax angle means a closer star, with distance in parsecs equal to the reciprocal of the angle in arcseconds.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�981f456811f6�body��银河系是一个棒旋星系，由数千亿颗恒星、气体、尘埃和暗物质组成，整体像一个带旋臂的大圆盘。太阳系位于距中心约2.7万光年的一个旋臂上。从侧面看它是一条横贯夜空的朦胧光带，所以叫银河。�[The Milky Way is a barred spiral galaxy made of hundreds of billions of stars, gas, dust, and dark matter, shaped like a great disk with spiral arms. Our Solar System sits on a spiral arm about 27,000 light-years from the center. Seen from the side, it appears as a hazy band of light across the night sky, which is why it is called the Milky Way.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�9a44931b8f8d�body��u光波是电磁振荡在空间中传播，而引力波是时空本身的抖动，能穿透物质几乎不被阻挡。٪Light waves are electromagnetic oscillations traveling through space, while gravitational waves are jiggles of spacetime itself, passing through matter almost unhindered.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�9a4b91109688�body���地球大气以氮和氧为主、厚度适中且支持液态水与生命。许多系外行星大气则可能是氢氦主导、极度高温或高压，甚至布满矿物云。不同恒星辐照和行星质量造就了极为多样的行星大气类型。�CEarth's atmosphere is nitrogen- and oxygen-rich, moderately thick, and supports liquid water and life. Many exoplanet atmospheres are instead hydrogen-helium dominated, extremely hot or high-pressure, and may be covered in mineral clouds. Different stellar irradiation and planet masses produce great atmospheric diversity.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�9b522b1f652f�body���望远镜在 17 世纪初由荷兰眼镜匠等人改进并普及，伽利略是首批把它指向星空的人之一。有了它，人们看到了月球上的坑、木星的卫星，以及银河其实由无数恒星组成。��The telescope was improved and popularized by Dutch spectacle makers in the early 1600s, and Galileo was among the first to point it at the sky. With it people saw craters on the Moon, moons of Jupiter, and that the Milky Way is made of countless stars.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�9cf7c2d061ae�body�ٟ暗能量不是物质，而是一种驱动宇宙加速膨胀的未知能量，约占宇宙总能量的七成；它与只提供引力的暗物质完全不同。ټDark energy is not matter but an unknown energy driving the universe's accelerated expansion, making up about 70% of its energy budget—quite different from gravity-providing dark matter.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�9e2f108df398�body�ٰ韦布主要观测红外光，自身热量会淹没信号，因此主镜与仪器被遮阳板冷却到约零下233摄氏度（40开尔文），仅靠被动辐射即可维持。٧Webb observes mostly infrared, so its own heat would drown the signal; a sunshield cools the mirror and instruments to about -233°C (40 K) by passive radiation alone.�ans��src��vGardner J. P. et al., The James Webb Space Telescope, Space Science Reviews 123 (2006), DOI: 10.1007/s11214-006-8315-7�vGardner J. P. et al., The James Webb Space Telescope, Space Science Reviews 123 (2006), DOI: 10.1007/s11214-006-8315-7��id�a15ece29660c�body���有。只要行星拥有大气，就可能出现风、云、风暴和温度变化等天气现象。例如热木星上的超强风和矿物云，以及类地行星上可能的水循环。天气的剧烈程度取决于行星温度、自转和大气成分。�"Yes. Any planet with an atmosphere can show weather such as winds, clouds, storms, and temperature variations. Hot Jupiters exhibit extreme winds and mineral clouds, while Earth-like planets may have water cycles. The intensity depends on temperature, rotation, and atmospheric composition.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�a30097e972b5�body��木星和土星是气态巨行星，主要由氢和氦组成，不含固态表面。它们在太阳系形成早期位于较冷的外区，能够捕获大量气体，因此质量迅速增长。木星的质量是地球的300多倍，土星也超过地球95倍。�Jupiter and Saturn are gas giants made mainly of hydrogen and helium with no solid surface. In the cold outer solar system during formation they could capture huge amounts of gas, so their masses grew rapidly. Jupiter is more than 300 times Earth's mass, and Saturn over 95 times.�ans��src��RPollack 等 1996 年《Icarus》核吸积模型；NASA 关于气态巨行星形成�OPollack et al. (1996, Icarus) core-accretion model; NASA on gas-giant formation��id�a7ac29ba9120�body��月球本身不发光，我们看到的月光是它反射的太阳光。随着月球绕地球转动，它被太阳照亮的一面以不同角度朝向地球，于是出现新月、上弦、满月、下弦等月相变化。一个完整的朔望月约29.5天。�The Moon does not shine by itself; the moonlight we see is reflected sunlight. As the Moon orbits Earth, the sunlit half faces us at changing angles, producing new moon, first quarter, full moon and last quarter. A full lunar cycle, the synodic month, lasts about 29.5 days.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�a7cc208de59f�body�٤由近及远串联多把“尺子”：视差测近星、造父变星标定邻近星系、Ia超新星推到遥远宇宙，每层校准下一层以测哈勃常数。��It chains 'rulers' from near to far: parallax for nearby stars, Cepheid variables to calibrate neighbor galaxies, Ia supernovae out to the distant Universe—each calibrating the next to measure the Hubble constant.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�a7eaced4d433�body��望远镜用大镜片或天线收集比人眼多得多的光，再把光线汇聚、放大，使遥远暗淡的天体变得可见。它还能把光分解成光谱，告诉我们天体由什么构成。没有望远镜，人类无法了解银河系之外的世界。�7A telescope uses large lenses or antennas to gather far more light than the human eye and then focuses and magnifies it, making distant faint objects visible. It can also split light into a spectrum that reveals what an object is made of. Without telescopes we could not study the universe beyond the Milky Way.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�a92adc69002b�body���根据深空巡天的统计，可观测宇宙中星系的数量估计在两千亿个左右。每个星系平均含有数百亿颗恒星，因此恒星总数远超地球上沙粒的数量。随着望远镜更灵敏，这个数字仍在不断修正。�!Deep-field surveys suggest there are on the order of 200 billion galaxies in the observable universe. Each typically holds tens of billions of stars, so the total number of stars vastly exceeds Earth's grains of sand. As telescopes become more sensitive, this estimate keeps being revised.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�ab1f362b9778�body��#黑洞是宇宙中引力极强、连光都无法逃出的区域，由大量物质被压缩到极小空间形成。它的边界叫事件视界，一旦越过就再也无法返回。黑洞本身不可见，但可以通过它吸入物质发出的辐射和对其周围天体的影响来发现。�fA black hole is a region of such intense gravity that not even light can escape, formed when a large amount of matter is squeezed into a tiny space. Its boundary is called the event horizon, beyond which nothing can return. Black holes are invisible themselves, but we detect them through the radiation of infalling matter and their effects on nearby bodies.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�ab9e083b86dd�body�ٽ悟空号在太空中精确测量高能电子和伽马射线能谱，试图捕捉暗物质粒子湮灭或衰变产生的异常信号，因为暗物质不发光却占宇宙质量大部分。ټWukong precisely measures high-energy electron and gamma-ray spectra in space to catch anomalies from dark-matter annihilation or decay; dark matter is invisible yet dominates cosmic mass.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�abb0ea986853�body�ٴ它是由无数遥远、不可分辨的并合与早期宇宙过程叠加成的引力波“白噪声”，像宇宙的背景海啸，脉冲星计时与未来探测器都可探测。پIt is the 'white noise' of gravitational waves from countless unresolved mergers and early-Universe processes, a background ocean of ripples detectable by pulsar timing and future detectors.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�ac913373b505�body�ٓ太阳风（带电粒子流）和辐射压力把彗星的气体与尘埃吹向外侧，离子尾几乎笔直背向太阳，尘埃尾则略弯曲。٧The solar wind and radiation pressure blow the comet's gas and dust outward; the ion tail points nearly straight away from the Sun while the dust tail curves slightly.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�astro_24_005�body���两个因素叠加。其一,凌星要求行星轨道恰好侧向我们,轨道越小对齐概率越大(地球随机视角下仅约0.5%,近日行星可达百分之几);其二,确认行星至少要看到两次同深度、同周期的遮挡,周期越短,同样观测时长里重复越多、越易核实。开普勒卫星连拍四年,因此收获大量热木星与超级地球——它们未必代表宇宙常态,而是这种方法的舒适区,统计时需专门修正该选择效应。�@Two factors stack. Geometrically, a transit requires the orbit to be edge-on within a narrow tilt window; the smaller the orbit, the higher that probability (Earth's is about 0.5 percent at random orientation, close-in planets reach several percent). Observationally, confirming a planet needs at least two matching dips, so shorter periods give more repeats per year of watching. Kepler's four-year stare therefore harvested hot Jupiters and super-Earths — not necessarily the galactic norm but this method's comfort zone, a selection effect statisticians must correct for.�ans��src��dWinn,《Exoplanet Transits and Occultations》,收录于 Exoplanets,University of Arizona Press,2010�aJ. N. Winn, Exoplanet Transits and Occultations, in Exoplanets, University of Arizona Press, 2010��id�astro_24_006�body��-太阳系几乎全部质量集中在太阳,按开普勒-牛顿规律,越远的行星转速越慢(水星47公里每秒,海王星仅5.4);鲁宾与福特在1970年代测量仙女座等星系却发现,气体与恒星的转动速度到可见边缘依旧平直不坠。若只算发光物质,这些天体早该离心飞散。最经济的解释是存在大量不发光但贡献引力的暗物质,包裹成比可见盘大得多的晕;宇宙学今测得暗物质约占物质总量的八成五。平直自转曲线因此是暗物质最早、最直观的证据之一。�kIn the solar system nearly all mass sits in the Sun, so Kepler-Newton mechanics slows outer planets — Mercury orbits at 47 km/s, Neptune at 5.4. When Rubin and Ford measured Andromeda-class galaxies in the 1970s, gas and stars kept flat orbital speeds beyond the visible edge; counting starlight alone, such bodies should have flown apart. The economical fix is dark matter — non-luminous yet gravitational — forming a halo far larger than the visible disk; cosmology now credits it with about eighty-five percent of all matter. Flat rotation curves remain the earliest, most visceral link in that evidence chain.�ans��src�ٮV. C. Rubin 与 W. K. Ford Jr.,《Rotation of the Andromeda Nebula from a Spectroscopic Survey of Emission Regions》,The Astrophysical Journal 159,1970 (DOI: 10.1086/150317)٬V. C. Rubin and W. K. Ford Jr., 'Rotation of the Andromeda Nebula from a Spectroscopic Survey of Emission Regions', The Astrophysical Journal 159, 1970, DOI: 10.1086/150317��id�astro_24_010�body��.1967年贝尔在射电数据里发现间隔1.337秒的规整脉冲,一度被猜成外星信号,最终确认是快速自转的中子星:大质量恒星坍缩把太阳级质量压进城市大小的球体,角动量守恒把自转加速到毫秒级,磁场随之压缩增强万亿倍。磁轴与自转轴通常不重合,沿磁极喷出的射电束像探照灯扫过地球,每转一圈收到一次闪光。中子星惯量巨大又近乎无摩擦,自转周期稳定胜过原子钟,毫秒脉冲星因而成为检验引力波与低频时间基准的天然实验室。��In 1967 Jocelyn Bell found perfectly regular 1.337-second pulses in radio data — briefly suspected as alien beacons — later understood as a spinning neutron star: a collapsed core packing solar-scale mass into a city-sized sphere whose spin, conserved from collapse, reaches millisecond periods while the magnetic field is amplified a trillionfold. Because magnetic and rotation axes misalign, radio beams from the magnetic poles sweep past Earth like searchlights, one flash per turn. Enormous moment of inertia plus near-frictionless interiors make periods steadier than atomic clocks long-term, turning millisecond pulsars into natural laboratories for gravitational-wave tests and low-frequency timing standards.�ans��src��UHewish 等,《Observation of a Rapidly Pulsating Radio Source»,Nature 第217卷,1968�SA. Hewish et al., Observation of a Rapidly Pulsating Radio Source, Nature 217, 1968��id�astro_26_001�body��l暗能量是驱动宇宙加速膨胀的均匀成分,约占当前宇宙总能量密度的68%。1998年Riess与Perlmutter领导的两个团队以Ia型超新星为标准烛光,发现遥远的超新星比减速宇宙预期的更暗,说明膨胀正在加速;此后宇宙微波背景、重子声学振荡和大尺度结构测量又从独立途径证实了这一图像。�Dark energy is a smooth component driving the accelerated expansion of the universe, making up about 68 percent of its current total energy density. In 1998 the teams led by Adam Riess and Saul Perlmutter used type Ia supernovae as standard candles and found remote ones fainter than a decelerating universe would allow, showing the expansion is speeding up; cosmic microwave background, baryon acoustic oscillation and large-scale-structure measurements have since confirmed this picture through independent channels.�ans��src�ٞRiess 等,1998年,The Astronomical Journal,116卷1009页;Perlmutter 等,1999年,The Astrophysical Journal,517卷565页:Ia 型超新星揭示宇宙加速膨胀ٖRiess et al. 1998, AJ, 116, 1009; Perlmutter et al. 1999, ApJ, 517, 565 - Observational evidence for the accelerating universe from type Ia supernovae��id�astro_26_005�body���因为它的核心目标——早期宇宙星系、恒星育婴房和冷天体——主要在红外发光。宇宙膨胀把最遥远星系的光拉伸到近红外;红外线又能穿透尘埃帷幕看清恒星形成区;原行星盘等低温结构同样在红外明亮。为此韦布配备6.5米镀金分段主镜与大型遮阳板,在日地第二拉格朗日点冷却到约40K运行。��Because its core targets, galaxies of the early universe, stellar nurseries and cold objects, shine chiefly in infrared. Cosmic expansion stretches light from the most distant galaxies into near-infrared wavelengths, infrared pierces dusty veils to reveal star-forming regions, and cool structures such as protoplanetary disks glow there as well. Webb therefore carries a gold-coated 6.5-meter segmented primary and a large sunshield, running cooled to about 40 kelvin at Sun-Earth Lagrange point 2.�ans��src��vGardner J. P. et al., The James Webb Space Telescope, Space Science Reviews 123 (2006), DOI: 10.1007/s11214-006-8315-7�vGardner J. P. et al., The James Webb Space Telescope, Space Science Reviews 123 (2006), DOI: 10.1007/s11214-006-8315-7��id�astro_26_008�body���这是星际尘埃的消光与红化:尘埃吸收并散射星光使恒星变暗,而散射效率随波长变短而增强,蓝光比红光损失更多,恒星颜色因而偏红。改正时先用同谱型的近距恒星作参照或用红外测光估计色余E(B-V),再依消光曲线逐波段扣除损失;由于长波段几乎不受影响,红外与射电是窥探尘埃背后的首选窗口。�0This is the extinction and reddening caused by interstellar dust: grains absorb and scatter starlight, dimming stars, and scatter short wavelengths more efficiently than long ones, so blue light is lost more than red and stars appear too red. To correct, astronomers estimate the color excess E(B-V) using nearby reference stars of the same spectral type or infrared photometry, then remove the per-band losses along an extinction curve; since long wavelengths slip through almost untouched, infrared and radio windows are the favored ways to peer behind dust.�ans��src��WL. Spitzer 所著 Physical Processes in the Interstellar Medium,Wiley 出版社,1978年�MLyman Spitzer Jr., Physical Processes in the Interstellar Medium, Wiley, 1978��id�astro_26_011�body���最直接的证据来自恒星轨道:近红外自适应光学与干涉测量跟踪到一群恒星围绕看不见的人马座A*运转,S2星每十六年掠过一次近心点,速度高达每秒七千余公里;由开普勒第三定律推算,这个引力焦点集中着约四百万倍太阳质量,又被约束在百余天文单位的狭小范围内,如此高的致密度排除了暗星团等替代解释,唯有一个超大质量黑洞最为合理。Genzel 与 Ghez 因此获得2020年诺贝尔物理学奖。��The decisive evidence comes from stellar orbits. Infrared adaptive optics and interferometry have traced dozens of stars racing around an invisible radio source, Sagittarius A*: the star S2 sweeps through pericenter every sixteen years at more than seven thousand kilometres per second on a clean Keplerian ellipse. Kepler's third law pins about four million solar masses inside a region about a hundred astronomical units across, far too dense for any hidden cluster of dark remnants and leaving a supermassive black hole as the only sensible reading. Genzel and Ghez shared the 2020 Nobel Prize in Physics for exactly this decades-long campaign.�ans��src���GRAVITY 合作组,2018年,Astronomy & Astrophysics,615卷L159号:S2星轨道近心点的引力红移探测;R. Genzel、F. Eisenhauer 与 S. Gillessen,2010年,Reviews of Modern Physics,82卷3121页:银河系中心大质量黑洞与核星团�GRAVITY Collaboration 2018, A&A, 615, L159 - Detection of the gravitational redshift in the orbit of the star S2; R. Genzel, F. Eisenhauer & S. Gillessen 2010, Reviews of Modern Physics, 82, 3121 - The Galactic Center massive black hole and nuclear star cluster��id�astro_26_014�body��喷流是原恒星摆脱多余角动量的出口:坍缩气体携带分子云的自转向中心坠落,若不把这些角动量送走,物质就会转得过快而难以继续吸积。磁化星盘沿缠绕的磁力线把部分气体甩出,旋转又将其准直成狭窄的双极喷流,带走绝大部分角动量,外层物质才得以持续落向星盘与恒星;喷流还在母云中犁出空腔、注入湍流,反过来调节恒星形成的节奏。猎户座等恒星形成区里的 HH 天体链,正是喷流撞击周围气体的发光痕迹。�xJets are the outlet through which protostars shed surplus angular momentum: infalling gas carries the parent cloud's spin, and without an exit it would whirl too fast to keep accreting. A magnetized disk flings part of the gas along wound-up field lines, and rotation collimates it into twin narrow jets that ferry away most of the angular momentum, so outer material can keep settling onto disk and star. Carving cavities and injecting turbulence into the natal cloud, the jets also throttle further star formation; chains of Herbig-Haro objects in Orion and other star-forming regions glow wherever they slam into surrounding gas.�ans��src���A. Frank 等人,2014年,Annual Review of Astronomy and Astrophysics,52卷171页:从恒星到云的喷流与外流;J. Bally,2016年,Annual Review of Astronomy and Astrophysics,54卷491页:原恒星外流��A. Frank et al. 2014, Annual Review of Astronomy and Astrophysics, 52, 171 - Jets and outflows from star to cloud; J. Bally 2016, Annual Review of Astronomy and Astrophysics, 54, 491 - Protostellar outflows��id�astro_26_018�body���这些微米级颗粒主要由碳、硅、镁、铁等耐熔元素凝结而成,大多诞生于渐近巨星支恒星的外层大气与超新星抛出的致密团块,进入星际空间后还会裹上冰幔继续长大。它们功劳不小:颗粒表面是氢原子两两结合成氢分子的主要催化车间;遮挡紫外辐射,替寒冷分子云保住低温;吸饱星光再以红外辐射释放,助星云散热坍缩成恒星。�BThese micron-scale grains condense chiefly from refractory elements such as carbon, silicon, magnesium and iron, most born in the outer atmospheres of asymptotic-giant-branch stars and in dense knots of supernova ejecta, later growing icy mantles in interstellar clouds. Their services are considerable: grain surfaces are the main workshop where hydrogen atoms pair off into molecular hydrogen; they block ultraviolet photons, keeping cold molecular clouds frigid; having swallowed starlight they reradiate it in the infrared, helping nebulae shed heat and collapse into stars.�ans��src���B. T. Draine,2011年,书 Physics of the Interstellar and Intergalactic Medium,Princeton University Press;T. Henning,2010年,Annual Review of Astronomy and Astrophysics,48卷21号:Cosmic SilicatesټB. T. Draine 2011, Physics of the Interstellar and Intergalactic Medium, Princeton University Press; T. Henning 2010, Annual Review of Astronomy and Astrophysics, 48, 21 - Cosmic Silicates��id�b5019a682740�body�ٺ闭环系统回收并再生水、氧气和食物（如用植物和微生物处理废水与二氧化碳），尽量减少从地球补给，是长期太空驻留和火星任务的必备。��A closed-loop system recovers and regenerates water, oxygen and food (using plants and microbes to process waste and CO2), minimizing resupply from Earth—essential for long stays and Mars missions.�ans��src���Jain, Bandyopadhyay,《Intelligent Integration of Moxie and Bio Regenerative Life Support System for Closed-Loop Habitat Sustainability on Mars》,Space Bioastronautics, Space Medicine, Life Support Systems,2025 (DOI: 10.52202/080556-0011)��Jain, Bandyopadhyay, 'Intelligent Integration of Moxie and Bio Regenerative Life Support System for Closed-Loop Habitat Sustainability on Mars', Space Bioastronautics, Space Medicine, Life Support Systems, 2025, DOI: 10.52202/080556-0011��id�b6822039865d�body���会。辐射引力波的系统会损失轨道能量，导致双天体逐渐靠近并最终并合，这是LIGO观测到的信号来源。脉冲双星PSR B1913+16的轨道衰减就与广义相对论预言的引力波能耗高度吻合。�#Yes. A system radiating gravitational waves loses orbital energy, causing the binary to spiral inward and eventually merge—the source of LIGO signals. The orbital decay of the pulsar binary PSR B1913+16 matches general relativity's predicted gravitational-wave energy loss remarkably well.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�b82d604de2d3�body�ل望远镜用镜片或天线收集比眼睛多得多的光，并把远处的景象放大、变亮，让我们看见遥远的天体。وTelescopes gather far more light than our eyes with lenses or dishes and magnify and brighten distant scenes, revealing faraway objects.�ans��src��<Terence Dickinson,《NightWatch》第4版,Firefly Books,2006�nT. Dickinson, NightWatch: A Practical Guide to Viewing the Universe, 4th ed., Firefly Books, 2006; Chinese ed.��id�b88b7bfe43a9�body�ّ12个朔望月约354天，比回归年短11天；为使农历月份与季节对应，约每19年加7个闰月，让平均年份贴近太阳年。ٖTwelve lunar months total about 354 days, 11 short of a solar year; to keep months aligned with seasons, about 7 leap months are added every 19 years.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�b95636cbe10a�body��o双星系统由两颗相互绕转的恒星组成，银河系中超过半数恒星属于双星或多星系统。يA binary system consists of two stars orbiting each other; more than half the stars in the Milky Way belong to binary or multiple systems.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�b9595db5461c�body�ٯ星星位置相同，但连线与故事各异：希腊人看猎户，中国人把相近星群划入'参宿'和'白虎'，因纽特人则按极地生活看出驯鹿与海豹。ٰThe stars are the same, but the lines and stories differ: Greeks saw Orion, Chinese grouped them into Shen and the White Tiger, and Inuit saw caribou and seals from polar life.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�b993b23dfdc2�body��2019年4月，事件视界望远镜合作组发布了 M87 星系中心超大质量黑洞的首张图像，呈现出一个明亮的吸积环环绕中心暗影。这是人类历史上第一次“看见”黑洞。2022年又发布了银河系中心人马座A*的图像。�;In April 2019, the Event Horizon Telescope Collaboration released the first image of the supermassive black hole in galaxy M87, showing a bright accretion ring around a central dark shadow. It was the first time humans “saw” a black hole. In 2022 they released an image of Sagittarius A* at our galaxy's center.�ans��src��NEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration 2019, ApJL 875, L1；2022, ApJL 930, L12�OEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration 2019, ApJL, 875, L1; 2022, ApJL, 930, L12��id�bac5fbb13076�body�ل红矮星是质量较小、表面较冷、发光暗弱的恒星，占银河系恒星的绝大多数，寿命可长达上万亿年。مA red dwarf is a small, cool, dim star that makes up the vast majority of stars in the Milky Way and can live for trillions of years.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�be6a321de597�body��太阳核心温度高达约1500万摄氏度，氢原子核在此聚变成氦核，损失的极小质量按质能方程转化为巨大能量。这些能量以光和热的形式从内部传到表面并向太空辐射。每秒约有6亿吨氢参与这种核聚变反应。�/At the Sun's core, temperatures reach about 15 million degrees Celsius, where hydrogen nuclei fuse into helium and the tiny lost mass becomes enormous energy via E=mc2. This energy travels outward as light and heat and radiates into space. About 600 million tons of hydrogen undergo fusion every second.�ans��src��y贝特（Bethe）,《Energy Production in Stars》,Physical Review,1939 (DOI: 10.1103/physrev.55.103)；NASA 太阳物理�kBethe, 'Energy Production in Stars', Physical Review, 1939, DOI: 10.1103/physrev.55.103; NASA solar physics��id�c2dd90373b55�body�ً太阳目前约46亿岁，正处于中年；它还能稳定燃烧约50亿年，之后会膨胀成红巨星，最终留下一颗白矮星。ٞThe Sun is about 4.6 billion years old; it will shine stably for roughly another 5 billion years before swelling into a red giant and ending as a white dwarf.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�c58f4f12780f�body��月球几乎没有大气和地质活动，数十亿年来被小行星和彗星撞击留下的坑洼都保存了下来。没有风雨侵蚀和板块运动去抹平它们，因此撞击坑密集而清晰。通过统计坑的密度还能推测月球表面的年龄。�2The Moon has almost no atmosphere or geological activity, so craters left by asteroid and comet impacts over billions of years are preserved. With no weather erosion or plate tectonics to erase them, the craters remain sharp and dense. Counting crater density even helps estimate the age of lunar surfaces.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�c63dfc0c9154�body�٣一颗中子星把约一个太阳的质量塞进直径仅约 20 公里的球里，一茶匙物质在地球上重达数亿吨，是除黑洞外最致密的天体。ٺA neutron star packs about one solar mass into a sphere only ~20 km across; a teaspoon of it would weigh hundreds of millions of tons on Earth—the densest object short of a black hole.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�c809330fc266�body�ټ地球自转略不规律且长期变慢，原子钟定义的一天比地球自转快一点点，所以偶尔在6月或12月末加（或减）一秒，让协调世界时(UTC)跟上地球。پEarth's rotation is irregular and slowing, so atomic-clock days run slightly ahead; occasionally a second is added (or removed) at the end of June or December to keep UTC in step with Earth.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�c8d6e25b87c4�body�ٱ火卫一（Phobos）和火卫二（Deimos）都很小，自身引力不足以把自己拉成球形，因此呈现土豆状的不规则形态，可能源自小行星被俘获。ُPhobos and Deimos are small, with gravity too weak to pull them into spheres, so they look like lumpy potatoes; they may be captured asteroids.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�caf34daa545b�body���反照率衡量行星反射阳光的比例；高反照率（如冰覆盖）使行星更冷，低反照率（如深色岩石）吸收更多热量，是判断行星温度与宜居的关键参数。��Albedo measures the fraction of sunlight a planet reflects; high albedo (ice cover) keeps it cooler, low albedo (dark rock) absorbs more heat—a key parameter for temperature and habitability.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�cc795af8ebe5�body���暗物质是不发光、不吸收光、只通过引力显现的物质，星系旋转曲线、引力透镜和宇宙微波背景都证明它远多于普通物质，但其粒子本质仍是未解之谜。��Dark matter neither emits nor absorbs light and shows up only through gravity; rotation curves, gravitational lensing, and the CMB prove it outweighs ordinary matter, yet its particle nature remains unknown.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�cf87c4fb7edc�body�ٴ19 世纪天文学家发现天王星轨道偏离预测，推断外侧有未知行星的引力扰动，勒维耶用数学算出位置，伽勒据此在 1846 年观测到海王星。��In the 19th century, observed deviations in Uranus's orbit implied an unseen perturbing planet; Le Verrier computed its position mathematically, and Galle observed Neptune in 1846 based on that prediction.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d194dd708f01�body���土星环主要由无数冰块和岩石碎屑构成，大小从微米级的尘埃到数米甚至更大的冰块都有。这些物质在土星赤道面上绕其高速旋转，因反射阳光而显得明亮。环的整体厚度通常只有几十米。�Saturn's rings are made of countless chunks of ice and rock debris, ranging from micron-sized dust to blocks meters across. These particles orbit rapidly in Saturn's equatorial plane and shine by reflecting sunlight. The rings are usually only tens of meters thick overall.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d24eccfdfad9�body���不会。黑洞的引力范围和普通天体相同，只有在非常靠近时才会表现出极端效应。它们不会主动四处游荡吞噬星系，反而会随宇宙膨胀彼此远离。即便蒸发也需极长时间，不会威胁整个宇宙。�=No. A black hole's gravity behaves like that of any normal object at a distance, showing extreme effects only very close in. They do not roam about swallowing galaxies, and cosmic expansion actually drives them apart. Even their evaporation would take an extraordinarily long time and poses no threat to the universe.�ans��src��m霍金 1974 年《自然》论文 'Black hole explosions?' 关于黑洞蒸发；NASA 黑洞常见误解说明�_Hawking, 'Black hole explosions?', Nature (1974) on black hole evaporation; NASA black hole FAQ��id�d25491131383�body�ٴ主要分为碳质（C型，富含水和有机物、最暗）、硅质（S型，岩石金属）和金属（M型，富铁镍）三类，反映它们形成于太阳系不同位置。��Main types are carbonaceous (C-type, water- and organic-rich, darkest), silicaceous (S-type, rocky-metallic) and metallic (M-type, iron-nickel), reflecting where they formed in the Solar System.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d5cd82e5f125�body�٩主要源包括双黑洞并合、双中子星并合、中子星-黑洞并合，以及超新星不对称爆发和宇宙学随机背景，不同源有不同波形特征。��Main sources are binary black-hole mergers, binary neutron-star mergers, neutron-star–black-hole mergers, asymmetric supernovae, and a cosmological stochastic background—each with distinct wave signatures.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�d6dc68c4081b�body��星表是系统记录天体位置、亮度和其他参数的列表或数据库，是天文学研究的基础资料。从古代星官图到现代数字巡天（如依巴谷、盖亚），星表不断扩充和精确化。天文学家借助星表来比对和发现天体变化。�SA star catalog is a systematic list or database recording celestial positions, brightness, and other parameters—fundamental reference material for astronomy. From ancient star charts to modern digital surveys like Hipparcos and Gaia, catalogs keep growing and improving in precision. Astronomers use them to compare and discover changes.�ans��src��pvan Leeuwen,Astrophysics and Space Science 333:29 (2007);Gaia 合作组,Astronomy and Astrophysics 649:A1 (2021)�yvan Leeuwen, Astrophysics and Space Science 333, 29 (2007); Gaia Collaboration, Astronomy and Astrophysics 649, A1 (2021)��id�d756361bfbdb�body��u大质量恒星燃料耗尽时会剧烈爆炸成超新星，亮度可短暂超过整个星系，之后留下遗迹。�fA massive star out of fuel can explode as a supernova, briefly outshining a galaxy, leaving a remnant.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�d7a90fe4a14f�body�ي彗星中心是冰与尘埃组成的彗核，靠近太阳时蒸发形成彗发和背向太阳的彗尾，常分为尘埃尾和离子尾。٢A comet has an icy-dust nucleus; near the Sun it vaporizes to form a coma and a tail pointing away from the Sun, typically split into a dust tail and an ion tail.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�da45a8f2b7a0�body���太空中有近乎不间断的阳光，太阳能板可以把光能直接转成电能，为卫星长期供电。太空接近真空且没有天气遮挡，光伏效率稳定可靠。少数深入太阳系外、阳光微弱的探测器才会改用核电池。�/In space sunlight is nearly continuous, so solar panels convert light directly into electricity to power a satellite for years. The near-vacuum and lack of weather make photovoltaic power steady and reliable. Only probes that travel far from the Sun, where sunlight is weak, switch to nuclear batteries.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�dd909a8e9d95�body�ٹ地球静止轨道在赤道上空约3.6万公里、周期24小时，卫星看似不动，适合通信；太阳同步轨道让卫星总在同一地方时过赤道，适合对地观测。��Geostationary orbit sits ~36,000 km over the equator with a 24-hour period so the satellite appears fixed, good for communications; a sun-synchronous orbit always crosses the equator at the same local time, ideal for Earth observation.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�df2f42240961�body�ٓ白矮星是中小质量恒星死亡后的致密残骸，体积像地球却拥有太阳级质量，靠电子简并压力支撑而不再核聚变。ٚA white dwarf is the dense remnant of a low-to-medium mass star, Earth-sized but Sun-mass, supported by electron degeneracy pressure and no longer fusing.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�e0589a4d7a8c�body��国际空间站是一个在地球低轨道运行的大型载人空间站，由多国合作建造和维护，自1998年开始组建。它绕地球一圈约90分钟，是宇航员长期生活和做科学实验的地方。它也是人类目前在太空最大的合作工程。�\The International Space Station is a large crewed station in low Earth orbit, built and maintained through international cooperation, with assembly begun in 1998. It circles Earth about every 90 minutes and serves as a home where astronauts live and run science experiments. It is the largest human cooperative engineering project in space to date.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�e239ddedd711�body��国际空间站运行在约400公里高的近地轨道上，大约每90分钟绕地球一圈。这个高度仍在稀薄的大气层内，因此空间站需要定期点火抬升轨道以抵消阻力。从地面用肉眼有时能看到它像一颗缓慢移动的亮星划过夜空。�=The International Space Station orbits at about 400 kilometers above Earth, circling the planet roughly every 90 minutes. This altitude is still inside the thin upper atmosphere, so the station periodically fires thrusters to counter drag. From the ground it can sometimes be seen by eye as a slow-moving bright star.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�e35f1c9271b4�body��目前已在宜居带内发现一些大小接近地球、可能由岩石构成的行星，例如开普勒-452b被称为地球表亲。但要确认它们是否真正类似地球，还需要知道大气、水和是否适宜生命。这样的精确研究仍在进行中。�Astronomers have found some planets near Earth's size, likely rocky and in habitable zones, such as Kepler-452b, nicknamed Earth's cousin. Confirming whether they truly resemble Earth requires knowing their atmosphere, water, and habitability. Such precise studies are still under way.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�e436a8358750�body��太阳是一颗光谱型为G型的黄矮星（G2V），正处于稳定的“主序星”阶段，靠核心氢核聚变发光。�aThe Sun is a G-type main-sequence star (G2V, a yellow dwarf), stably fusing hydrogen in its core.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�e5613c2413b3�body��恒星的核心温度极高、压力极大，使氢原子核聚变成氦原子核，这个过程会释放出巨大能量。能量以光和热的形式向外传播，最终从恒星表面辐射到太空。只要核心还有足够的氢，恒星就能持续燃烧数十亿年。�+Deep inside a star, the core is so hot and pressurized that hydrogen nuclei fuse into helium, releasing enormous energy. This energy travels outward as light and heat and is radiated from the star's surface into space. As long as the core has enough hydrogen, a star can shine for billions of years.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�e9b8857a87e8�body�٦快速射电暴是毫秒级的明亮射电闪，多数来自遥远星系、来源不明；部分会重复爆发，少数（如FRB 121102）被定位到特定星系。��A fast radio burst is a millisecond flash of bright radio light, mostly from distant galaxies with unknown origin; some repeat, and a few like FRB 121102 have been pinned to specific galaxies.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�eb0e6e9e30a7�body�� 引力波对空间的拉伸极其微小，经过地球时引起的长度变化只有质子直径的千分之一量级。因此需要数公里长的干涉臂和极敏感的激光设备才能测出。即便如此，信号也常被环境噪声淹没，需要精巧的隔振与数据处理。�3Gravitational waves stretch space by an exceedingly tiny amount—only about a thousandth of a proton's diameter when passing Earth. Detecting this needs kilometer-long interferometer arms and extremely sensitive lasers. Even then, signals are buried in noise, requiring careful isolation and data analysis.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�eb941dbdcdd8�body�٫金星在地球内侧绕日运行，只能在日出前或日落后出现在太阳附近，当它跑在太阳前面时是昏星、落在后面时是晨星，来回交替。ٮVenus orbits inside Earth's path, so it only appears near the Sun after sunset or before dawn; whether it leads or trails the Sun makes it an evening or morning star in turn.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�ec0749897348�body��_当一颗质量约为太阳二十倍以上的恒星耗尽核燃料时，核心会在自身引力下急剧坍缩，形成恒星级黑洞。在星系中心，气体和恒星的长期吸积还能造就质量达数百万至数十亿太阳质量的超大质量黑洞。此外，极小质量的原初黑洞也可能诞生于宇宙极早期的密度涨落。��When a star roughly twenty times the Sun's mass exhausts its nuclear fuel, its core collapses catastrophically under its own gravity to form a stellar-mass black hole. At galactic centers, long-term accretion of gas and stars builds supermassive black holes of millions to billions of solar masses. Tiny primordial black holes may also have formed from density fluctuations in the very early universe.�ans��src�ك卡罗尔与奥斯特利《现代天体物理学导论》(An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics) 恒星演化与致密天体章节قCarroll & Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, chapters on stellar evolution and compact objects (black hole formation)��id�eda051233517�body��f轨道是物体以足够高的横向速度绕另一天体做曲线运动时形成的路径。卫星并非不掉下来，而是以约每秒8公里的速度持续『下落』，只是地球表面也在它脚下同步弯曲，于是它永远落不到地面。这就像水平抛出的石头，速度越快落点越远，快到一定程度就绕地球转圈了。��An orbit is the path an object follows when it moves sideways fast enough to curve around another body. A satellite is not failing to fall; it is constantly 'falling' at about 8 kilometers per second while Earth's surface curves away beneath it, so it never reaches the ground. Like a stone thrown horizontally, the faster it goes the farther it lands, and beyond a certain speed it circles the Earth.�ans��src��e牛顿《自然哲学的数学原理》中的『牛顿大炮』思想实验；NASA 轨道力学说明�sNewton's cannonball thought experiment in Principia (A Treatise of the System of the World); NASA orbital mechanics��id�ee9cc9be57dc�body���太阳质量的约73%是氢，约25%是氦，其余2%为氧、碳、铁等较重元素。这种以氢氦为主的组成与宇宙整体的元素丰度基本一致。太阳本质上是一颗由等离子体构成的大质量气态恒星。�8About 73 percent of the Sun's mass is hydrogen and about 25 percent is helium, with the remaining 2 percent made of heavier elements like oxygen, carbon and iron. This hydrogen-helium dominance matches the overall elemental abundance of the universe. The Sun is essentially a massive gaseous star made of plasma.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�efaa8e9d0872�body�٠大碰撞假说认为，约 45 亿年前一颗火星大小的天体（常称忒伊亚）撞击早期地球，抛出的物质在轨道上聚集形成了月球。ٵThe giant-impact hypothesis holds that about 4.5 billion years ago a Mars-sized body (often called Theia) struck the early Earth, and debris from the impact coalesced into the Moon.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�f18178a8424c�body��u那是星云，由气体和尘埃组成，有的是恒星诞生的摇篮，有的是恒星死亡后抛出的物质。�gThey are nebulae of gas and dust—some are stellar nurseries, others material cast off by dying stars.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�f257ab391dda�body�٨前景恒星及其行星偶然掠过背景恒星时，引力像透镜一样短暂增亮；行星会造成额外的小扰动，能在极远距发现类地质量行星。��When a foreground star and its planet chance to pass in front of a background star, gravity acts like a lens and briefly brightens it; the planet adds a small extra wiggle, revealing even Earth-mass planets at great distances.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�f5913da5d0ab�body���根据宇宙学标准模型和普朗克卫星的观测，宇宙年龄约为138亿年。这一数字来自对膨胀速率和物质组成的反推。不同独立方法（如最年老恒星年龄）也都与此相符。�From the standard cosmological model and Planck satellite observations, the universe is about 13.8 billion years old. The figure comes from extrapolating backward using expansion rates and composition. Independent methods, such as the ages of the oldest stars, agree with it.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�fa356c0cf14a�body���大爆炸是指约138亿年前宇宙从一个极热极密的状态开始膨胀与冷却的起源事件。它并非空间中某个点的爆炸，而是空间本身的膨胀。此后物质、星系和生命才逐步在冷却中形成。�"The Big Bang refers to the origin event about 13.8 billion years ago when the universe began expanding and cooling from an extremely hot, dense state. It was not an explosion at a point in space but the expansion of space itself. Matter, galaxies, and life subsequently formed as it cooled.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�1366753fb07f�body��哈勃在1920年代提出用形态分类的哈勃序列，把星系分为椭圆星系、旋涡星系（含棒旋）和不规则星系。椭圆星系形似椭球、恒星形成活动少，旋涡星系有明显的盘和旋臂。这套形态分类至今仍是描述星系的基础框架。�EIn the 1920s Hubble proposed the Hubble sequence, classifying galaxies by shape into ellipticals, spirals (including barred spirals), and irregulars. Ellipticals look like ellipsoids with little star formation, while spirals have a disk and arms. This morphological scheme remains the basic framework for describing galaxies.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�1909dba4d83b�body��)木星质量巨大，其强大的引力会把许多原本可能飞向地球内部太阳系的彗星和小行星甩偏或捕获。这种引力清扫作用显著减少了撞击地球的危险天体数量。不过木星有时也会把天体送入内太阳系，因此它既是盾牌也是搅动者。�`Jupiter is so massive that its strong gravity deflects or captures many comets and asteroids that might otherwise head toward the inner Solar System. This gravitational sweeping greatly reduces the number of dangerous impactors reaching Earth. However, Jupiter can also occasionally send objects inward, so it acts both as a shield and as a disturbant.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�2a029e33c3b5�body��&根据宇宙微波背景和星系巡测的观测，我们所处的宇宙空间在大尺度上几乎是平坦的，即三角形的内角和约为180度。这与暴胀理论和密度参数接近临界值相符。如果空间正曲率为闭、负曲率为开，宇宙的整体命运也会不同。�]Observations of the cosmic microwave background and galaxy surveys show that on large scales our universe is nearly flat, meaning the angles of a triangle sum to about 180 degrees. This matches inflation theory and a density parameter close to the critical value. Positive or negative curvature would imply closed or open cosmic fates, respectively.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�5754dc232f99�body��2火星距离远，单程就要数月，往返加停留可能长达数年，需要大量食物、水和氧气并可靠循环。太空中和火星表面的强辐射会危害健康，着陆时稀薄大气又不足以充分减速，使登陆极其危险。这些难题使载人火星任务至今尚未实现。�fMars is so far that a one-way trip takes months, and a round trip with stay could last years, demanding large, reliably recycled supplies of food, water, and oxygen. Intense radiation in space and on the surface threatens health, and the thin atmosphere gives too little braking for easy landing. These challenges keep crewed Mars missions unrealized so far.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�5bc5f2e9b6d9�body��恒星的结局取决于质量：小质量恒星（如太阳）最终膨胀成红巨星，再抛掉外层形成行星状星云，留下白矮星。质量更大的恒星会爆炸为超新星，核心坍缩成中子星或黑洞。质量越大，结局往往越剧烈。�BA star's fate depends on its mass: low-mass stars like the Sun eventually swell into red giants, shed their outer layers as planetary nebulae, and leave white dwarfs. More massive stars explode as supernovae, leaving neutron stars or black holes at their cores. The greater the mass, the more violent the end typically is.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�5fe5d4149680�body��#最主要的来源是致密双星系统的并合，包括双黑洞、双中子星以及黑洞与中子星的组合。双中子星并合还会伴随短伽马射线暴并抛洒金等重元素。此外，超新星不对称爆发和快速自转的形变中子星也会产生较弱的引力波。�AThe strongest sources are mergers of compact binaries: binary black holes, binary neutron stars, and black hole-neutron star pairs. Binary neutron-star mergers also produce short gamma-ray bursts and forge heavy elements like gold. Asymmetric supernovae and deformed, rapidly spinning neutron stars emit weaker waves too.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�72c6cfc44c5e�body��!2006年国际天文学联合会规定，行星必须清空其轨道附近的其他天体。冥王星虽然绕太阳运行且近似球形，但未能清空柯伊伯带中众多类似天体，因此被归为矮行星。这一决定反映了对太阳系外缘小天体群体认知的深化。�WIn 2006 the IAU ruled that a planet must have cleared its orbital neighborhood of other bodies. Pluto orbits the Sun and is roughly round, but it has not cleared the many similar objects in the Kuiper Belt, so it was classed as a dwarf planet. The decision reflected deeper understanding of the small-body population in the outer Solar System.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�caf8956911af�body��"霍金辐射是斯蒂芬·霍金提出的理论：由于量子涨落，黑洞视界附近会不断产生粒子对，其中一个落入黑洞、另一个逃逸，使黑洞缓慢损失能量。黑洞因此并非完全黑，而是会极其缓慢地蒸发。质量越小的黑洞蒸发越快。�UHawking radiation, proposed by Stephen Hawking, arises from quantum fluctuations near the horizon that continually produce particle pairs, one of which falls in and the other escapes, causing the black hole to slowly lose energy. Thus a black hole is not perfectly black but evaporates extremely slowly. Smaller black holes evaporate faster.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�dc24ec41e04f�body��3地球大气会吸收和扭曲许多波段的光，还会造成恒星闪烁、降低分辨率，使地面观测受限。太空望远镜在大气层之上工作，能接收被大气挡住的红外、紫外、X射线等，并获得不受扰动的高清晰图像。哈勃和韦伯望远镜就是典型例子。�6Earth's atmosphere absorbs and distorts many wavelengths and causes twinkling that lowers resolution, limiting ground observations. A space telescope operates above the atmosphere, capturing infrared, ultraviolet, and X-rays blocked below, and gets undisturbed sharp images. Hubble and Webb are prime examples.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�e2ada9bea3aa�body��$主流候选是一种称为弱相互作用大质量粒子（WIMP）的假想粒子，它们只通过引力和弱核力作用。其他候选包括轴子、惰性中微子，以及由原始黑洞构成的可能性。全球多个地下实验和粒子对撞机正在努力寻找它们的踪迹。�8The leading candidate is a hypothetical weakly interacting massive particle (WIMP) that feels only gravity and the weak nuclear force. Others include axions, sterile neutrinos, and the possibility of primordial black holes. Underground experiments and particle colliders worldwide are hunting for traces of them.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�f971f27d212a�body��/干涉测量把多台分开的望远镜接收到的光波精确合成，相当于造出一台口径等于望远镜间距的巨型虚拟望远镜。它能突破单台望远镜的分辨率极限，看清极细微的结构，例如事件视界望远镜就是用全球射电天线阵列拍下黑洞照片。�bInterferometry precisely combines light waves from several separated telescopes, effectively creating a giant virtual telescope whose aperture equals the spacing between them. It surpasses the resolution limit of any single telescope and reveals extremely fine detail; the Event Horizon Telescope used a global radio array to image a black hole this way.�ans��src��NEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration 2019, ApJL 875, L1；2022, ApJL 930, L12�OEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration 2019, ApJL, 875, L1; 2022, ApJL, 930, L12��id�fe7f685c9b51�body��$韦伯是哈勃的继任者，主镜直径6.5米，专门在红外波段观测，能看穿尘埃并探测极遥远、极早期宇宙的星系。它还能分析系外行星大气中的水分子、二氧化碳等成分。2021年底发射后，它大幅刷新了我们对早期宇宙的认识。�KWebb is the successor to Hubble, with a 6.5-meter mirror observing mainly in infrared, able to see through dust and detect extremely distant, early-universe galaxies. It can also analyze molecules like water and carbon dioxide in exoplanet atmospheres. After its late-2021 launch it greatly reshaped our view of the early universe.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�3d2442da41ed�body���超级地球指质量介于地球与海王星之间（约 1–10 倍地球质量）、多半是岩质或富水成分的行星。它们在本星系中并不存在，却在系外非常常见，是研究行星形成与大气的重要样本。�Super-Earths are planets with masses between Earth's and Neptune's (roughly 1–10 Earth masses), mostly rocky or water-rich in composition. They do not exist in our Solar System but are very common among exoplanets, making them key samples for studying planet formation and atmospheres.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�3fb192995865�body��当行星从恒星前方经过时，会遮挡一小部分星光，使恒星亮度出现周期性微小下降。通过测量这种规律变暗的深度和周期，可以推算出行星的大小和轨道周期。开普勒任务正是用这种方法确认了数千颗系外行星。�1When a planet passes in front of its star, it blocks a tiny fraction of the light and produces a periodic small dip in brightness. Measuring the depth and timing of these dimmings reveals the planet's size and orbital period. The Kepler mission used exactly this method to confirm thousands of exoplanets.�ans��src��gBorucki 等《Kepler planet-detection mission》（2010，Science）；NASA 开普勒（Kepler）任务�TBorucki et al., Kepler planet-detection mission (2010, Science); NASA Kepler mission��id�417ad581d314�body���银河系是一个棒旋星系，具有中央棒状结构和多条旋臂，直径约 10 万光年，包含上千亿颗恒星。我们太阳系位于其中一条旋臂外缘，距银心约 2.7 万光年。�The Milky Way is a barred spiral galaxy with a central bar and several spiral arms, about 100,000 light-years across and containing hundreds of billions of stars. Our Solar System sits in the outer part of one arm, roughly 27,000 light-years from the Galactic center.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�a1e859139258�body���1609 年后伽利略观测到四颗像恒星的点规律地绕木星转动，即伽利略卫星（Io、Europa、Ganymede、Callisto）。这表明并非所有天体都绕地球转，动摇了地心说、支持了日心说。�After 1609 Galileo saw four star-like points orbiting Jupiter in regular fashion — the Galilean satellites Io, Europa, Ganymede and Callisto. Their motion showed that not everything circles the Earth, undermining the geocentric model and supporting the heliocentric one.�ans��src��8伽利略《星际信使》（Sidereus Nuncius，1610）�(Galileo Galilei, Sidereus Nuncius (1610)��id�astro_24_019�body��R颜色就是温度计:猎户座参宿四泛红(约3500度),天狼星蓝白(约9900度),规律与烧铁块相同——越热越蓝。把恒星按颜色(表面温度)与光度画在一张图上即赫罗图,1900年代初期赫茨普龙与罗素各自发现恒星并不随机散布,九成挤在从暗红到亮蓝的对角主序带上——那是稳定燃烧氢的中年期;右上方聚集着膨胀降温的巨星,左下方是熄火收缩的白矮星。恒星一生就沿着这张图移动:主序越长越久,离开主序便进入快进的晚年。读懂它等于拿到了恒星级谱与寿命表。��Color is a thermometer: Betelgeuse glows red (about thirty-five hundred kelvin), Sirius blue-white (near ten thousand), the same rule as heated iron — hotter means bluer. Plotting stars by color (surface temperature) against luminosity yields the Hertzsprung-Russell diagram, found independently in the early 1900s: stars scatter not randomly but with ninety percent crowded along the diagonal main sequence — stable hydrogen-burning middle age; swollen cooled giants sit upper right, shrunken white dwarfs lower left. A star's lifetime is movement across this chart: main sequence lasts longest, then late stages run fast. Reading it hands you stellar genealogy plus life expectancy.�ans��src��_Böhm-Vitense,《Introduction to Stellar Astrophysics》第1卷,Cambridge University Press,1989�^E. Böhm-Vitense, Introduction to Stellar Astrophysics Vol.1, Cambridge University Press, 1989��id�01557d9c744a�body�ٴ金星自转极慢，转一圈约需243个地球日，而它绕太阳一圈只要225个地球日。它还是自东向西反着转的，所以在金星上太阳会从西边升起。��Venus turns extremely slowly, needing about 243 Earth days for a single spin, while it circles the Sun in only 225 Earth days. It also rotates backwards, so on Venus the Sun rises in the west.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�09881b1fa623�body���地球自转轴倾斜约23.4度，公转过程中两个半球轮流更正对阳光。北半球朝向太阳时，那里是夏天，同一时刻南半球受到的是斜射阳光，正处于冬天。半年之后情况刚好互换。�Earth's axis is tilted about 23.4 degrees, so as the planet orbits the Sun the two hemispheres take turns leaning toward the light. When the north leans sunward it has summer, while the south receives slanting light and has winter. Half a year later the situation is exactly reversed.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�0bf650531b90�body�ٺ过去一百多年的观测显示，大红斑一直在变小、变得更圆，内部风速却略有增加。它可能在未来某一天解体，但科学家还无法预测具体时间。��Records from the past century show the Great Red Spot shrinking and growing rounder, even as its inner winds speed up slightly. It may break apart some day, though scientists cannot yet predict when.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�2cf926d1a90b�body���光年是距离单位，表示光在真空中走一年的路程，约9.46万亿公里。用它来量恒星之间的距离，比用公里方便得多。离太阳最近的恒星比邻星大约在4.2光年之外。�A light-year measures distance, not time: it is how far light travels in a year, roughly 9.46 trillion kilometres. That makes it far more convenient than kilometres for star distances. Proxima Centauri, the nearest star to the Sun, lies about 4.2 light-years away.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�3268153b0109�body���极遥远星系发出的光在膨胀的宇宙中被拉长，抵达我们时已变成红外线。红外线还能穿过尘埃云，让人看清里面正在形成的恒星。为了不被自身热量干扰，这台望远镜必须保持极低温。�Light from the most distant galaxies is stretched by cosmic expansion and arrives here as infrared. Infrared also passes through dust clouds, revealing the young stars forming inside them. To avoid being swamped by its own heat, the telescope must be kept extremely cold.�ans��src��vGardner J. P. et al., The James Webb Space Telescope, Space Science Reviews 123 (2006), DOI: 10.1007/s11214-006-8315-7�vGardner J. P. et al., The James Webb Space Telescope, Space Science Reviews 123 (2006), DOI: 10.1007/s11214-006-8315-7��id�3d52340a7a27�body���照片上显示的不是黑洞本身，而是它周围被加热到发光的气体，以及中央那片黑色阴影。2019年，事件视界望远镜把分布在全球的射电望远镜联合起来观测，得到了第一张这样的图像。��The image does not show the black hole itself but the glowing hot gas swirling around it, with a dark shadow at the centre. In 2019 the Event Horizon Telescope linked radio dishes across the globe to capture the first such picture.�ans��src��XEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration, ApJL 875, L1 (2019), doi:10.3847/2041-8213/ab0ec7�nEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration, ApJL 875, L1 (2019), doi:10.3847/2041-8213/ab0ec7 (first image of M87*)��id�49a08fa89010�body�٭印度很早就用27（或28）'月站'(nakshatra)跟踪月亮，并精确算出交点月、恒星年；其数学通过阿拉伯传入，影响了后来的伊斯兰历算。��India early used 27–28 lunar stations (nakshatra) to track the Moon and computed the nodal month and sidereal year precisely; its math later reached and influenced Islamic astronomy via Arabia.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�4eaae1ccd3f6�body�٘行星凌星前后恒星光谱出现微小差别，来自穿过行星大气的光，借此在WASP-39b、K2-18b等大气中探测到水蒸气等分子。��Starlight spectra differ slightly before and during a planet's transit because light passes through its atmosphere, letting us detect molecules like water vapor in WASP-39b, K2-18b and others.�ans��src�ٗSeager 与 Sasselov,《Theoretical Transmission Spectra during Extrasolar Giant Planet Transits》,The Astrophysical Journal,2000 (DOI: 10.1086/309088)ٓSeager & Sasselov, 'Theoretical Transmission Spectra during Extrasolar Giant Planet Transits', The Astrophysical Journal, 2000, DOI: 10.1086/309088��id�51aa4359aae0�body���月球进入地球本影后，唯一能照到它的阳光都要先穿过地球大气。大气把蓝光散射掉，又把红光折射到月面上，于是月亮呈现暗红色。这也是它常被称作血月的原因。�Once the Moon moves into Earth's shadow, the only sunlight reaching it has passed through our atmosphere. The air scatters blue light away and bends red light onto the lunar surface, leaving the Moon a dim coppery red. That is why people call it a blood moon.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�60d7e5eee982�body���两者都绕太阳运行，也都被自身引力压成近似球形，关键差别在于有没有清空轨道附近的小天体。冥王星、谷神星和鸟神星都没做到这一点，所以归入矮行星。��Both orbit the Sun and both are rounded by their own gravity, but a planet must also have swept its orbital neighbourhood clear. Pluto, Ceres and Makemake have not managed that, so they are classed as dwarf planets.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�72f838b7f6bc�body���由于地轴倾斜，夏季极圈以内的地区整天都处在被阳光照到的一侧，太阳整夜不落，这就是极昼。半年后同一地区整天位于背光一侧，于是出现极夜。纬度越高，极昼极夜持续得越久。�<Because Earth's axis is tilted, in summer places inside the polar circles stay on the sunlit side all day long, so the Sun never sets and daylight lasts through the night. Half a year later the same places sit on the shaded side all day and the polar night begins. The higher the latitude, the longer each one lasts.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�72fb75257ad9�body���月球比地球小得多，它投在地面上的本影直径通常只有一两百公里。随着月球和地球运动，这小小的影子扫出一条狭长路径，只有路径内的人才能看到全食。附近的人只能看到日偏食。�)The Moon is far smaller than Earth, so the dark inner shadow it casts on the ground is usually only one or two hundred kilometres wide. As the Moon and Earth move, that small shadow sweeps a long narrow track, and only people inside it see totality. Everyone nearby sees a partial eclipse instead.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�7af3f95e2e45�body���观测发现环上的物质正缓慢落向土星，这个过程被称为环雨。按目前速度，光环可能在一亿年左右的尺度上明显变淡。对人类来说，这仍然是极其漫长的时间。��Measurements show ring material slowly raining down onto Saturn, a process nicknamed ring rain. At the present rate the rings could fade noticeably over something like a hundred million years. On human timescales that is still almost forever.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�7d6fa2bfd90d�body���地球绕太阳公转，夜晚背向太阳的那片天区一年之中不断改变。冬夜正对着的星空，到了夏天恰好被白昼的太阳挡在后面。所以猎户座是冬季夜空的主角，夏天则轮到天蝎座。�As Earth travels around the Sun, the patch of sky on our night side keeps shifting through the year. The region we face on winter nights ends up behind the daytime Sun in summer. That is why Orion dominates winter evenings while Scorpius takes over in summer.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�92f6dd3869d3�body���火星的两极和地下藏着大量水冰，探测车还在岩石里找到过古代液态水留下的矿物痕迹。今天火星表面气压太低、温度太冷，液态水很难长期存在。��Mars holds plenty of water ice at its poles and underground, and rovers have found minerals that only form in ancient liquid water. Today the surface is too cold and the air pressure too low for liquid water to last.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�a3a74d0ee199�body�ٺ观测发现遥远星系都在远离我们，而且越远的退行得越快，说明空间本身在膨胀。上世纪末对遥远超新星的研究还表明，这种膨胀正在加速。��Distant galaxies are all moving away from us, and the farther one is the faster it recedes, which shows that space itself is expanding. Studies of faraway supernovae in the late 1990s revealed that the expansion is even speeding up.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�c6a81f771681�body���小行星主要由岩石和金属构成，大多在火星与木星之间的小行星带运行。彗星含有大量冰和尘埃，多来自太阳系外围，轨道又长又扁。它们靠近太阳时，冰会升华成气体和尘埃。�Asteroids are made mainly of rock and metal and mostly circle in the belt between Mars and Jupiter. Comets contain a lot of ice and dust, usually come from the outer Solar System, and follow long stretched orbits. When they near the Sun, their ice turns straight into gas and dust.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�d04db6a3db80�body���巨大的气体尘埃云在自身引力下坍缩，核心越挤越热。温度升到约一千万摄氏度时，氢开始聚变成氦，恒星就被点亮。剩下的物质常常围成盘，日后凝聚成行星。�A giant cloud of gas and dust collapses under its own gravity, and the core grows hotter as it is squeezed. Once it reaches around ten million degrees Celsius, hydrogen fuses into helium and the star switches on. Leftover material often settles into a disc that later builds planets.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�dabaad55a58d�body���太阳系形成时内圈温度很高，只有岩石和金属能凝结，所以水星到火星都是小而致密的岩石世界。外圈足够冷，冰和气体也能聚集，行星因此长得又大又轻。木星和土星就以氢和氦为主。�0When the Solar System formed, the inner region was hot and only rock and metal could condense, so Mercury through Mars became small, dense worlds. Farther out it was cold enough for ice and gas to gather, letting planets grow huge and light. That is why Jupiter and Saturn are mostly hydrogen and helium.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�e02c272efe3e�body�ٺ阿拉伯学者保存并发展了希腊天文学，建造大天文台、编制精确星表（如《托莱多表》），发明平面星盘，并最早用代数方法处理天文计算。��Islamic scholars preserved and advanced Greek astronomy, built great observatories, compiled precise star tables (e.g., the Toledo Tables), invented the planispheric astrolabe, and applied algebra to astronomy.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�f80be68022ed�body���失重会让肌肉萎缩、骨密度下降，体液上涌还可能影响视力。宇航员因此每天要锻炼约两小时来减缓变化。太空辐射也比地面强很多，是长期任务的重要风险。�Weightlessness weakens muscles and thins bones, and fluid shifting toward the head can affect eyesight. Astronauts therefore exercise around two hours a day to slow these changes. Space radiation is also much stronger than on the ground, a major risk for long missions.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版天文分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�ZTen Thousand Whys: Astronomy volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�fdf142f00bb9�body���火箭向后高速喷出燃烧后的气体，按照牛顿第三定律获得同样大小的向前推力。它推的是自己喷出的物质，并不需要外面的空气。真空中还没有阻力，飞行反而更省燃料。�A rocket hurls burning gas backwards at high speed and, by Newton's third law, receives an equal push forwards. It pushes against the mass it throws out, not against outside air. In a vacuum there is no drag either, so the flight is actually more efficient.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�05accc2703a1�body�ٓ月球的引力会把海水往它那一侧拉，形成一天里的涨潮和退潮。太阳的引力也帮了一点忙，所以潮水有大有小。ٳThe Moon's gravity tugs seawater toward its side, producing the daily rise and fall of the tides. The Sun pulls a little as well, which is why some tides are stronger than others.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�05e4644403dd�body�ٟ地球磁场外有银河宇宙射线和太阳粒子事件，能损伤DNA、增加癌症风险；深空任务需用水、聚合物或磁场屏蔽加以防护。ٿBeyond Earth's magnetic field, galactic cosmic rays and solar particle events can damage DNA and raise cancer risk; deep-space missions need shielding with water, polymers or magnetic fields.�ans��src���Francis A. Cucinotta, Myung‐Hee Y. Kim, Lei Ren,《Evaluating shielding effectiveness for reducing space radiation cancer risks》,Radiation Measurements,2006 (DOI: 10.1016/j.radmeas.2006.03.011)��Francis A. Cucinotta, Myung‐Hee Y. Kim, Lei Ren, 'Evaluating shielding effectiveness for reducing space radiation cancer risks', Radiation Measurements, 2006, DOI: 10.1016/j.radmeas.2006.03.011��id�07583f7809b3�body��~在黑洞强大的潮汐力下，你会被拉伸成细长形状（意大利面化），越过事件视界后便无法返回。ٗUnder a black hole's strong tidal forces you would be stretched into a thin strand (spaghettified), and once past the event horizon there is no return.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�0ebf1f7e7753�body�ٖ地球绕太阳一周约365.24天，每4年多出约1天，所以每隔几年在2月加一天（2月29日）成为闰年，让日历和季节同步。ْEarth takes about 365.24 days to orbit the Sun, so roughly every 4 years we add a leap day (Feb 29) to keep the calendar in step with the seasons.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�0f991fb4d561�body�٥小行星带看似密集，其实天体之间相距极远，碰撞罕见；其轨道相对稳定，只有少数受扰动才进入内太阳系成为近地小行星。��Although the belt looks crowded, its objects are vastly spaced apart and collisions are rare; orbits are fairly stable, and only a few perturbed objects enter the inner solar system as near-Earth asteroids.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�1031a3f92ff6�body�ه不一样。超新星是恒星毁灭性的终结爆炸，新星则是白矮星表面氢的周期性爆发，恒星本身仍然存在。ٓNo. A supernova is a star's catastrophic final explosion, while a nova is a periodic surface outburst of hydrogen on a white dwarf, which survives.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�130e425e2e84�body�ٳ因为月亮离我们非常远（约38万公里），我们走路移动的距离相比它太短，视角几乎不变，所以不论怎么走它都仿佛停在原处跟着我们。ٞThe Moon is very far (~380,000 km), so our walking distance is tiny compared to it; its viewing angle barely changes, so it seems to follow us wherever we go.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�18bf90e82994�body�ٶ在'天人感应'观念下，日食、彗星、流星等被视为上天对帝王的警示，因此历代都设专职机构观测记录天象，既为编制历法也为占卜吉凶。��Under the belief that heaven reflected human affairs, eclipses, comets and meteors were seen as warnings to rulers, so each dynasty kept official astronomers both for calendar-making and for omens.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�1b8ad603c8b7�body�ٖ火箭向下喷出高速气体，气体反过来把火箭往上推（作用力与反作用力），只要推力大于重力就能不断加速升空。ّA rocket blasts gas downward, and the gas pushes the rocket upward (action and reaction); when thrust beats gravity it keeps accelerating upward.�ans��src��e国务院新闻办公室《2021中国的航天》白皮书：中国长征运载火箭发展（2022）�^SCIO white paper 'China's Space Program: A 2021 Perspective': Long March launch vehicles, 2022��id�1e8d7d95dbd7�body�ٍ火星车是降落在火星表面的无人小车，带着相机和仪器巡视、拍照并分析岩石土壤，寻找水和生命的线索。ٌA Mars rover is an unmanned buggy on Mars that drives around with cameras and instruments to study rocks, soil, and signs of water and life.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�228515039b81�body�ف黑洞是引力极强、连光都无法逃逸的天体，其边界叫事件视界，内部隐藏着一个密度无限的奇点。ٝA black hole is an object with gravity so strong that not even light escapes; its boundary is the event horizon, hiding a singular point of infinite density.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�27677b0c8f58�body�ٟ彗星大多来自太阳系外缘的柯伊伯带和奥尔特云，当它们被扰动飞向太阳时，冰物质受热蒸发，形成明亮的彗发和尾巴。ٟComets mostly come from the Kuiper Belt and Oort Cloud at the solar system's edge; when nudged toward the Sun, their ice vaporizes into a bright head and tail.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�2cc1f2dbe541�body��)地球与太阳的距离恰到好处，使表面能保持液态水，这被称为宜居带。它还有富含氧气的大气层、保护我们免受辐射的磁场，以及调节气候的海洋。这些条件的组合在已知行星中非常罕见，所以至今我们只确认地球上有生命。�tEarth sits at just the right distance from the Sun to keep liquid water on its surface, a region called the habitable zone. It also has an oxygen-rich atmosphere, a magnetic field that shields us from harmful radiation, and oceans that help regulate climate. This combination is rare among known planets, which is why Earth is the only world confirmed to host life so far.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�2ece3a0e9dac�body�ٛ二十八宿是把月亮和行星运行的黄道带分成28个天区，作为坐标参照，类似西方的黄道星座，是中国星官体系的基础。��The Twenty-Eight Mansions divided the zodiac belt into 28 sky zones used as coordinate markers for the Moon and planets—analogous to Western zodiac constellations and foundational to China's star-official system.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�2f8d189aebb0�body�٢太阳系以太阳为中心，包含八大行星、矮行星、卫星、小行星带、柯伊伯带天体和彗星等。太阳质量占整个太阳系的99.86%。ٽThe Solar System is centered on the Sun and includes eight planets, dwarf planets, moons, the asteroid belt, Kuiper Belt objects and comets. The Sun alone holds 99.86% of the system's mass.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�301e4b37fa70�body�ٍ卫星飞得非常快，向前的速度让它在下落时刚好绕过地球的弧面。它其实一直在坠落，却永远落不到地面。٠A satellite moves forward so fast that as it falls it keeps curving around the bend of the planet. It really is always falling, yet it never reaches the ground.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�30dc22594d2e�body�٥北极星几乎正对着地球自转轴的北端，地球转动时它看起来几乎不动。其他星星则围着它慢慢转圈，所以人们靠它辨认方向。��Polaris sits almost exactly above the northern end of Earth's spin axis, so it barely seems to move as our planet turns. The other stars appear to circle slowly around it, which makes Polaris handy for finding north.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�3c54e5851ad7�body�ْ地球绕太阳公转的速度约每秒30公里，比子弹快得多。因为身边没有可以对比的参照物，我们一点也感觉不到。٦Earth races around the Sun at about 30 kilometres every second, far faster than a bullet. We never feel it because there is nothing nearby to compare our motion with.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�3e1a2637ef06�body�٥宇航服为宇航员提供氧气和合适的气压，同时挡住极端温度和高速飞来的微小颗粒。头盔上镀金的面罩还能过滤刺眼的阳光。��A spacesuit supplies oxygen and the right pressure while shielding an astronaut from extreme temperatures and fast-moving specks of debris. Its gold-coated visor also filters the blinding sunlight.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�4097a23cd22f�body���大红斑是木星上一场持续了至少三百年的巨型反气旋风暴，比地球还大。朱诺号与哈勃太空望远镜的长期观测显示，它的横向尺寸正在缓慢缩小，尽管其成因（为何如此长寿）仍是研究课题。�The Great Red Spot is a giant anticyclonic storm on Jupiter that has persisted for at least three centuries and is larger than Earth. Long-term Juno and Hubble observations show its width is slowly shrinking, though why it lasts so long remains an active research topic.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�42b8a42790a2�body��`小行星带位于火星和木星轨道之间，聚集了成千上万块岩石和金属碎块。�rThe asteroid belt lies between the orbits of Mars and Jupiter, filled with countless rocky and metallic fragments.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�47e45cd31a77�body��c太阳的直径约140万公里，大约是地球的109倍，质量约占整个太阳系的99.86%。�uThe Sun is about 1.4 million km across—roughly 109 Earths wide—and holds about 99.86% of the solar system's mass.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�51aacede1762�body�ٔ月相是月球被太阳照亮的部分从地球看去形状的变化，如新月、上弦月、满月、下弦月，大约每29.5天循环一次。نMoon phases are the changing shape of the sunlit part we see—new, first quarter, full, last quarter—cycling about every 29.5 days.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�54786e840ebf�body�٧太空望远镜是发射到太空中、避开地球大气干扰的望远镜，如哈勃和詹姆斯·韦布望远镜，能拍到更清晰、更遥远的宇宙图像。ِA space telescope is launched above the atmosphere to avoid distortion—like Hubble and JWST—capturing clearer, deeper views of the universe.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�609ac3d5af64�body��`因为地球不停地自转，朝向太阳的一面是白天，背向太阳的一面是黑夜。�\Earth spins on its axis, so the side facing the Sun has day and the opposite side has night.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�61faf3a1b0bc�body���郭守敬是元代天文学家，主持编订《授时历》，一年长度精确到365.2425天，与现行公历相当；他还创制简仪、高表等仪器，并主持大规模四海测验。��Guo Shoujing was a Yuan-dynasty astronomer who led the Shoushi Calendar with a year of 365.2425 days—matching today's Gregorian calendar—and built instruments like the simplified armilla, conducting a vast geodetic survey.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�644113141f64�body�ٓ他们钻进固定在舱壁上的睡袋，把自己绑好，免得睡着后到处飘。站上没有真正的黑夜，很多人要戴眼罩挡光。ٴThey zip into sleeping bags fixed to the wall and strap themselves in so they do not drift while asleep. There is no real night up there, so many wear eye masks to block the light.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版天文分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�ZTen Thousand Whys: Astronomy volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�6e0f79ca3ba1�body�ٟ木星的卫星很多，已经确认的有九十多颗，其中最大的四颗用小望远镜就能看到。木卫二的冰壳下面可能藏着一片海洋。٭Jupiter has many moons, more than ninety confirmed, and the four largest can be spotted with a small telescope. One of them, Europa, may hide an ocean beneath its icy shell.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�6ef69abf53d6�body��o嫦娥是中国探月工程的系列任务，用绕月、落月、采样返回等方式一步步探测月球。�oThe Chang'e program is China's lunar exploration series, stepping through orbiting, landing, and sample return.�ans��src��G国务院新闻办公室《2021中国的航天》航天白皮书，2022�^State Council Information Office: China's Space Program: A 2021 Perspective, white paper, 2022��id�706123ff1769�body�ل入门建议先买一副好的双筒望远镜，轻便易用、视野广，适合认星座和看流星；再考虑天文望远镜。ُBeginners should start with good binoculars—light, easy, wide-field, great for constellations and meteors—before an astronomical telescope.�ans��src��<Terence Dickinson,《NightWatch》第4版,Firefly Books,2006�nT. Dickinson, NightWatch: A Practical Guide to Viewing the Universe, 4th ed., Firefly Books, 2006; Chinese ed.��id�70e2874237dd�body�ٱ大约138亿年前，宇宙从极热极密的状态开始迅速膨胀，慢慢冷却出气体、恒星和星系。它不是炸弹那样的爆炸，而是空间本身在变大。��About 13.8 billion years ago the universe began expanding from an extremely hot, dense state and cooled into gas, stars and galaxies. It was not a bomb-like blast but space itself stretching out.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�76712f9296ed�body�ٮ银河系是我们所在的巨大星系，由上千亿颗恒星以及大量气体和尘埃组成，外形像带旋臂的圆盘。太阳只是里面一颗很普通的恒星。ټThe Milky Way is the huge galaxy we live in, made of hundreds of billions of stars plus gas and dust, shaped like a disc with spiral arms. Our Sun is just one very ordinary star inside it.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�78454ac02eda�body�ٍ天气好时它像一颗安静移动、不闪烁的亮星，几分钟横穿夜空；用航天追踪App或网站可查到当地过境时间。ْOn a clear night it looks like a steady, non-twinkling bright star gliding across in minutes; tracking apps and websites list local flyover times.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�7f44809e11cf�body�٥水星几乎没有大气层，白天吸到的热量很快就跑掉了，夜里冷得能结冰。金星有厚厚的大气把热量锁住，平均温度反而更高。��Mercury has almost no atmosphere, so the heat it soaks up by day escapes quickly and its nights turn freezing. Venus keeps its heat locked in under a thick atmosphere, which makes it hotter on average.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�7f91f1d8a09c�body���彗星是带着冰和尘埃的脏雪球，靠近太阳时冰被晒化，喷出气体和尘埃形成发光的大气（彗发）和被太阳风吹出的长尾巴。离太阳越远，尾巴就越短甚至消失。��A comet is a dirty snowball of ice and dust; when it nears the Sun the ice sublimates, releasing gas and dust that form a glowing coma and a long tail blown out by the solar wind. Farther from the Sun the tail shrinks and can vanish.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�8bf08471953c�body��r城市的路灯和广告牌把夜空照亮，这种光污染淹没了暗星，只留下最亮的几颗和月亮。�zStreetlights and signs brighten the sky; this light pollution drowns faint stars, leaving only the brightest and the Moon.�ans��src��<Terence Dickinson,《NightWatch》第4版,Firefly Books,2006�nT. Dickinson, NightWatch: A Practical Guide to Viewing the Universe, 4th ed., Firefly Books, 2006; Chinese ed.��id�92a07ab9d667�body�ٟ浑天说认为天像鸡蛋壳包着大地，张衡改进并制造的浑天仪用水力驱动，能演示恒星每日东升西落，是早期的天球模型。��The Huntian theory viewed the sky as a sphere enclosing Earth like an egg's shell; Zhang Heng improved the water-powered armillary sphere that simulated the daily rotation of stars—an early celestial globe.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�93a3e2ebe754�body�ّ太阳已经发光约46亿年，核心的氢还够用大约50亿年。之后它会膨胀成红巨星，最后留下一颗白矮星慢慢变冷。��The Sun has been shining for about 4.6 billion years and has roughly 5 billion years of hydrogen left. After that it will swell into a red giant and finally leave a slowly cooling white dwarf.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�96564c5c49b8�body�ٟ月球和太阳的引力把面向它们一侧的海水拉高形成涨潮，地球另一侧也因离心效应出现涨潮，于是一天通常有两次高潮。١The Moon and Sun's gravity pulls seawater up on the near side, and a bulge also forms on the far side from centrifugal effect, giving about two high tides a day.�ans��src��>章节 Earth Tides,Agnew,Treatise on Geophysics(Elsevier),2007�?Agnew D.C., Earth Tides, Treatise on Geophysics, Elsevier, 2007��id�abb5be4306c0�body��l1969年，美国阿波罗11号任务把阿姆斯特朗和奥尔德林送上月球，是人类首次登月。�cIn 1969, NASA's Apollo 11 landed Armstrong and Aldrin on the Moon—the first crewed lunar landing.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�astro_25_010�body��3那些黑斑叫太阳黑子,是太阳表面温度稍低的区域(也有四千多度),因为比周围暗才显黑。黑子多的时候太阳更活跃,可能喷出带电粒子流扰动地球,让指南针乱摆、极光变亮,严重时影响电网和卫星。科学家每天观测它们做空间天气预报。�HThose spots are sunspots — regions slightly cooler (still four thousand degrees!) appearing dark against brighter surroundings. Spot-rich times mean active Sun flinging charged particles that wiggle compasses, brighten auroras and sometimes trouble power grids and satellites. Scientists watch daily to forecast space weather.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版天文分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�ZTen Thousand Whys: Astronomy volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�b376c6d82313�body�ٓ月球比地球小得多，表面引力只有地球的六分之一左右。用同样的力气蹬地，人就能跳得更高，落下来也更慢。٬The Moon is much smaller than Earth, so its surface gravity is only about one sixth as strong. With the same push off the ground, you rise higher and come down more slowly.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�b6a57dc25e33�body�ٰ天问一号一次任务实现'绕、着、巡'：环绕火星、祝融号火星车着陆乌托邦平原并巡视探测，使中国成为第二个成功着陆火星的国家。٦Tianwen-1 accomplished orbiting, landing and roving in one mission: its Zhurong rover touched down on Utopia Planitia, making China the second nation to land on Mars.�ans��src��_国务院新闻办公室《2021中国的航天》白皮书：天问一号行星探测（2022）�ZSCIO white paper 'China's Space Program: A 2021 Perspective': Tianwen-1 Mars mission, 2022��id�b8b98ce1e5a0�body��e真空中的光速约为每秒30万公里，是宇宙中所有信息和物质运动的极限速度。�zLight in vacuum travels about 300,000 km per second—the ultimate speed limit for information and matter in the Universe.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�c050b59e2f69�body�ٞ古人把天上临近的亮星连成图案，赋予人物或动物名字方便记忆和导航，现代天文学则把全天划分为88个官方星座区域。ٱAncient people linked nearby bright stars into shapes named for heroes or animals to aid memory and navigation; modern astronomy divides the sky into 88 official constellations.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�c8cb494968cc�body��{北斗是中国建成的全球卫星导航系统，用卫星信号为手机、车辆和船只提供定位和授时服务。وBeidou is China's global satellite navigation system, using satellites to provide positioning and timing for phones, vehicles and ships.�ans��src��n国务院新闻办公室《2021中国的航天》白皮书：北斗卫星导航系统建设与应用（2022）�\SCIO white paper 'China's Space Program: A 2021 Perspective': BeiDou navigation system, 2022��id�c9dc2bf47cd2�body�ٷ阳光被空气分子散射，蓝光波短更容易被散射到四面八方（所以天是蓝的）；傍晚阳光斜穿厚大气，蓝光被散射殆尽，剩下红光直达眼睛。٣Air molecules scatter short blue light in all directions (blue sky); at dusk sunlight crosses thick air, blue is scattered away and red remains to reach your eyes.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�cb476ff8d1da�body�ٜ国际空间站的氧气由电解水产生，水则来自回收的汗水、尿液和冷凝水，经多重过滤净化后循环使用，回收率超过90%。ٮThe ISS makes oxygen by electrolyzing water, and its water comes from recycled sweat, urine and condensate, purified through multiple filters and reused—over 90% recovered.�ans��src�٨Bagdigian, Cloud, Bedard,《Status of the Regenerative ECLSS Water Recovery and Oxygen Generation Systems》,SAE Technical Paper Series,2006 (DOI: 10.4271/2006-01-2057)٦Bagdigian, Cloud, Bedard, 'Status of the Regenerative ECLSS Water Recovery and Oxygen Generation Systems', SAE Technical Paper Series, 2006, DOI: 10.4271/2006-01-2057��id�cbfadf85d49d�body�ل地球自西向东自转，不同经度看到太阳升起的时间不同，于是按经度划分时区，每15度大约差1小时。ٍEarth rotates eastward, so different longitudes see sunrise at different times; time zones are set by longitude, about 1 hour per 15 degrees.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d48a75500b4e�body��金星表面温度高达约465°C，超过水星，主要原因是其浓厚的大气层几乎全部由二氧化碳构成，并伴随大量硫酸云，形成极强的温室效应。阳光能透入加热地表，但热量难以以红外辐射形式逸出，使热量不断积累。�.Venus has a surface temperature of about 465 °C, hotter than Mercury, because its thick atmosphere is almost entirely carbon dioxide with sulfuric-acid clouds, producing an extreme greenhouse effect. Sunlight heats the surface, but the heat cannot easily escape as infrared radiation, so it builds up.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d4b35818197e�body��e登过。1969年阿波罗11号首次把宇航员送上月球，之后共有12人曾在月面行走。�lYes. Apollo 11 first landed astronauts on the Moon in 1969, and twelve people have since walked its surface.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d5a0fa271a65�body���星系是由引力绑在一起的上千亿颗恒星、气体、尘埃和暗物质组成的大集合，比如我们的银河系。可观测宇宙里估计约有 2 万亿个星系，其中大多极其遥远。��A galaxy is a vast collection of hundreds of billions of stars, gas, dust and dark matter bound together by gravity, like our own Milky Way. The observable universe is estimated to contain about two trillion galaxies, most of them extremely distant.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�dc84e368b524�body���大爆炸理论说，宇宙在约 138 亿年前从一个极热、极密的状态开始膨胀并冷却，并不是从一个小点炸进早已存在的空间里。随着膨胀，物质、恒星和星系才一点点成形。�The Big Bang theory holds that the universe began expanding and cooling from an extremely hot, dense state about 13.8 billion years ago, rather than exploding from a point into pre-existing space. Matter, stars and galaxies took shape gradually as that expansion proceeded.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�dd42136fb592�body�٨月球自转一圈和绕地球一圈用的时间一样长，这种情况叫潮汐锁定。于是它总把同一面朝着地球，另一面要靠探测器才能看到。��The Moon takes exactly as long to spin once as it does to circle Earth, a situation called tidal locking. That keeps the same face turned toward us, so spacecraft are needed to see the far side.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�dd538e44ca08�body�ٙ月球绕地球的轨道是椭圆，离地球近时看起来稍大、远时稍小；另外靠近地平线时因参照物错觉，也会显得特别大。ٚThe Moon's orbit is elliptical, so it looks slightly bigger when nearer and smaller when farther; near the horizon, an illusion also makes it seem larger.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�e2b205505e3e�body���按国际天文学联合会的规定，行星要绕着太阳运行，自身引力把它压成接近球形，还要清空轨道附近的其他小天体。三条都满足，才算真正的行星。��The International Astronomical Union says a planet must orbit the Sun, be round because of its own gravity, and have cleared other small bodies from its orbit. Only an object that meets all three rules counts.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�e4d763c4b845�body�ٓ因为月球几乎没有大气和地质活动来抹平痕迹，数十亿年来小行星和彗星撞击留下的坑洞都被完好保留了下来。َThe Moon has almost no atmosphere or geology to erase marks, so craters from billions of years of asteroid and comet impacts remain preserved.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�e6abec33ab1e�body��n1969年，美国宇航员尼尔·阿姆斯特朗乘阿波罗11号率先踏上月球，成为登月第一人。�vIn 1969, American astronaut Neil Armstrong stepped onto the Moon aboard Apollo 11, becoming the first person to do so.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�e84916596c7c�body�ٮ国际天文学联合会新定义行星须清空其轨道附近区域，而冥王星未能做到，且柯伊伯带中还有类似大小天体，于是它被归为矮行星。پThe IAU redefined a planet as something that has cleared its orbital neighborhood; Pluto has not, and similar-sized bodies exist in the Kuiper Belt, so it was reclassified as a dwarf planet.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�e9bf5be64033�body�٢火星经常刮沙尘暴，有的大到笼罩整个星球，能持续好几个星期。那里的空气很稀薄，所以风虽然吹得远，力气却不算大。٩Mars has frequent dust storms, and some grow large enough to cover the whole planet for weeks. Its air is very thin, so the wind travels far but does not push very hard.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�f59574554a48�body�ٓ它是元代郭守敬主持建造的观星与测影建筑，利用高表在夏至、冬至测量日影长短，用来定节气和回归年长度。ٮBuilt under Guo Shoujing in the Yuan dynasty, this observatory used a tall gnomon to measure solar shadow lengths at solstices, determining solar terms and the tropical year.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�f900a2aab5ea�body�٠它是宇宙约 38 万岁时释放的第一缕光，随膨胀冷却到约 -270℃ 的微波背景，其细微温度涨落记录了宇宙最初的密度结构。��It is the first light released when the universe was about 380,000 years old, now cooled by expansion to microwave background at about -270°C; its tiny temperature fluctuations record the universe's earliest density structure.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�01b17093a47c�body�ٙ土星平均密度约 0.69 g/cm³，比水还小，如果有一个足够大的水池，土星理论上会浮起来——它主要由轻质气体构成。ٙSaturn's average density is about 0.69 g/cm³, less than water, so in a large enough pool it would theoretically float; it is made mostly of light gases.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�02df8bd4add6�body��流星是太空中的小石头进入地球大气时摩擦发光形成的光迹，我们通常叫它流星或许愿星。如果这块石头没有完全烧掉，落到地面上，我们就叫它陨石。所以流星是天上一闪而过的光，陨石是掉到地上的石头。�3A meteor is the streak of light made when a small space rock burns up by friction in Earth's atmosphere, often called a shooting star. If the rock survives and lands on the ground, we call it a meteorite. So a meteor is a flash of light in the sky, while a meteorite is a rock that has fallen to the ground.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�06e8dc085c74�body�ه流星是太空里的尘埃或小石块闯入地球大气，高速摩擦发热发光划过夜空，并不是真正的星星掉下来。�|A meteor is dust or a small rock from space entering our atmosphere and glowing from friction; it's not a real star falling.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�0a1abeab92ba�body��i太阳系有八颗行星：水星、金星、地球、火星、木星、土星、天王星和海王星。�[There are eight planets: Mercury, Venus, Earth, Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, and Neptune.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�0ec3df271782�body��h不一定，多在12月21日或22日，偶尔在23日，取决于当年回归年长度和时差安排。�jNot always—usually Dec 21 or 22, occasionally 23, depending on the tropical year length and timekeeping.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�0f0810d8ba6e�body�ٷ流星是太空里的小尘埃或小石块闯入大气层燃烧发出的光，也就是我们看到的「流星」。如果没烧完掉到地面上，剩下的石头就叫做陨石。��A meteor is a bit of dust or rock from space that burns up as it enters the atmosphere, producing the streak of light we see. If a piece survives and lands on the ground, the remaining rock is called a meteorite.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�1135e47f2a0c�body��{太阳抛出的带电粒子被地球磁场引向两极，撞入高层大气使气体发光，就形成了五彩的极光。قCharged particles from the Sun are funneled by Earth's magnetic field to the poles, exciting atmospheric gases to glow as auroras.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�164e1ec42264�body�ٴ月球没有大气和板块运动来抹平表面，所以亿万年来被陨石撞击留下了大量环形山。地球上的坑则大多被风化、流水和板块运动抹去了。��The Moon has no atmosphere or plate tectonics to erase its surface, so billions of years of meteorite impacts left countless craters. On Earth, most craters have been worn away by weather, rivers, and tectonics.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�1fed899e2f79�body���是的！天文学家已经在其他恒星周围发现了上千颗系外行星，其中一些位于宜居带，温度刚好可能让水保持液态。它们离我们太远、暂时看不清表面，但我们知道它们确实存在。��Yes! Astronomers have found thousands of exoplanets around other stars, and some lie in the habitable zone where temperatures could let water stay liquid. They are too far away to see clearly yet, but we know they are really there.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�20f21bda25d3�body�ٖ地球大气会扭曲、吸收和阻挡星光，太空望远镜避开大气干扰，能拍到更清晰、更宽波段的图像，如哈勃和韦伯。ٚEarth's atmosphere distorts, absorbs and blocks starlight; space telescopes avoid this and capture sharper, wider-wavelength images, like Hubble and Webb.�ans��src��<Terence Dickinson,《NightWatch》第4版,Firefly Books,2006�nT. Dickinson, NightWatch: A Practical Guide to Viewing the Universe, 4th ed., Firefly Books, 2006; Chinese ed.��id�29126dbad867�body�ٱ太阳系有八颗行星，从靠近太阳的水星、金星、地球、火星，到外面的木星、土星、天王星、海王星。木星最大，比地球大很多很多。ٴThe Solar System has eight planets, from Mercury, Venus, Earth and Mars close to the Sun, out to Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus and Neptune. Jupiter is the biggest, far larger than Earth.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�2a1eb152889d�body�ي地球是目前已知唯一拥有生命和液态水海洋的行星。它离太阳的距离不远不近，温度刚好让水保持液态。ِEarth is the only planet known to harbor life and vast oceans of liquid water. Its distance from the Sun is just right for water to stay liquid.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�2b0c24ef0cd5�body��~星星一直挂在天上，只是太阳太亮，把它们的光盖住了。太阳落下去以后，我们又能看见它们。�|The stars never leave; the Sun is simply so bright that its light hides them. Once the Sun goes down, we can see them again.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�2b9c6e3fbca3�body��~有的，宇航员在月球上走过，留下了一排排脚印。月球上没有风也没有雨，脚印能留很久很久。َYes, astronauts walked there and left rows of footprints behind. With no wind or rain on the Moon, those prints can stay for a very long time.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�3421adfa8c86�body��p火星上的奥林帕斯山是太阳系最高的火山，高约 22 公里，约为珠穆朗玛峰的近三倍。مOlympus Mons on Mars is the tallest volcano in the solar system, rising about 22 km—nearly three times the height of Mount Everest.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�3c65b3c56956�body�ي土星的光环是数不清的冰块和石块，绕着土星一起转。它们大多像雪球那么小，也有几块像房子那么大。ٜSaturn's rings are countless chunks of ice and rock circling the planet together. Most pieces are as small as snowballs, though a few are as big as a house.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�3cdbb9fd6d75�body�٥星光穿过地球动荡、冷热不均的大气层时被折射得忽明忽暗，就像隔着热水汽看灯光；行星因为是个小圆面，反而不太眨眼。ٓStarlight bends through Earth's turbulent, uneven air, flickering like a light seen through heat haze; planets show a disc, so they hardly twinkle.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�3e114e087056�body�ف太阳就是一颗星星，只不过它离我们很近，看起来又大又亮。晚上的小星星其实都是很远的太阳。هThe Sun really is a star, just a very close one, so it looks big and bright. The little stars at night are suns that are far, far away.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�426ab1856fd1�body�ً木星是太阳系中最大的行星，它的体积能装下超过1300个地球。它是一颗气态巨行星，主要由氢和氦组成。ٔJupiter is the largest planet in the solar system; more than 1,300 Earths could fit inside it. It is a gas giant made mostly of hydrogen and helium.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�4b4d1b79836e�body�ه望远镜用大镜片或大镜子收集很多光，再把光聚到一起。光变多了，远处的星星就看起来更亮更清楚。٘A telescope uses a big lens or mirror to gather lots of light and bring it together. With more light collected, distant stars look brighter and sharper.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�503aac9c96c5�body��{星座是古人把天空中相邻亮星连成的图案，用来辨认方向和季节，并不是星星真的挤在一起。ٓConstellations are patterns people drew by connecting nearby bright stars to navigate and track seasons; the stars are not actually close together.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�5cccf28e1321�body��星星本身不会眨眼，是地球大气层的流动让星光在到达我们眼睛前不断折射、晃动，看起来就一闪一闪的。离地平线越近，穿过的大气越厚，星星就眨得越厉害。如果用太空望远镜看，星星就不眨了。�.Stars do not actually blink; it is Earth's moving atmosphere that bends and wobbles their light before it reaches our eyes, making them appear to twinkle. Near the horizon the light passes through more air, so stars twinkle more strongly there. Seen from a space telescope, stars do not twinkle at all.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�5d4bd1a27696�body�ٓ月亮自己不发光，我们看到的亮面是它被太阳照亮的部分；随着月亮绕地球转动，亮面朝向我们的多少在变化。�zThe Moon doesn't shine by itself; we see the sunlit part. As it orbits Earth, the amount of lit surface facing us changes.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�5d7a72ee0e8a�body��s哈雷彗星的轨道周期约 76 年，是人类最早确认周期性的彗星，下次预计在 2061 年回归。ٌHalley's Comet has an orbital period of about 76 years and was the first comet recognized as periodic; it is expected to return around 2061.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�66b2892f4839�body��u他们用星星辨别方向、安排农时（看北斗指向定季节），并记录日食彗星等来推测吉凶。قThey used stars to find direction, schedule farming by the Big Dipper's seasonal pointing, and record eclipses or comets as omens.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�6a1ef2710953�body�ن主流假说认为，约45亿年前一颗火星大小的天体撞上早期地球，溅出的物质在轨道上聚集形成了月球。٣The leading theory holds that about 4.5 billion years ago a Mars-sized body struck the early Earth, and debris from the impact coalesced in orbit to form the Moon.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�74953692bf87�body��u空间站是一座绕着地球飞的太空房子，宇航员住在里面做实验。它一天能绕地球十几圈。ْA space station is a home in space that circles Earth while astronauts live and work inside. It loops around our planet about sixteen times a day.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�7d0bb0023ba0�body��l地球是一个大圆球，从太空看是蓝蓝的、圆圆的。它的腰部还稍微鼓出来一点点。�dEarth is a big ball that looks round and blue from space. It bulges just a little around its middle.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�8272895d5010�body��r我们还不知道，但宇宙中有无数行星，科学家正在寻找像地球一样温暖、有水的世界。�yWe don't know yet, but with countless planets in the Universe, scientists are hunting for warm, watery worlds like Earth.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�8451725b28d9�body��u那是一小块太空里的沙石冲进空气，摩擦得发热发亮。它不是星星，只是一道亮亮的光。ْIt is a tiny piece of space rock or dust heating up and glowing as it rushes into our air. It is not a star at all, just a bright streak of light.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�878562dfccd9�body�ٔ金星浓密的二氧化碳大气造成极强的温室效应，把热量牢牢锁住，表面温度约 465℃，比离太阳更近的水星还高。��Venus's dense carbon-dioxide atmosphere creates a runaway greenhouse effect that traps heat efficiently, raising its surface to about 465°C—hotter than Mercury despite being farther from the Sun.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�8ef91983c320�body��f月亮很远，坐火箭要飞三天左右才能到。不过它已经是离地球最近的天体了。�rThe Moon is far away; a rocket needs about three days to get there. Even so, it is our closest neighbour in space.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�8efeba61de45�body��x因为地球是歪着身子绕太阳转的，不同地区在不同时候接收阳光的多少不同，就有了四季。قEarth is tilted as it orbits the Sun, so different places get more or less sunlight at different times, creating the four seasons.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�9414b226960e�body�ٽ星星本身不闪，是它们穿过地球大气层时，流动的空气把光线弯来弯去，我们看上去就一闪一闪了。在太空里的望远镜看星星，它们是不闪的。��Stars don't actually flicker; as their light passes through Earth's atmosphere, moving air bends it this way and that, so to us they appear to twinkle. Seen from a telescope in space, stars do not twinkle.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�99504b75f577�body�ٛ地球自转让太阳依次照亮各地，为免都用同一时刻造成混乱，人们按经度把地球分成24个时区，每差15度大致差1小时。٠Earth's rotation brings sunlight to places in turn; to avoid confusion, the world is split into 24 time zones roughly 15° apart, each about one hour different.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�9fdec7119be7�body��~月亮不会自己发光，它像镜子一样把太阳的光反射给我们。我们看到的月光，其实是太阳的光。�}The Moon makes no light of its own; it reflects sunlight to us like a mirror. The moonlight we see is really the Sun's light.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�a821bb0e1b2e�body��u地球有一种看不见的力叫引力，一直轻轻把我们往下拉。所以我们能稳稳地站在地面上。�{Earth pulls on us with an invisible force called gravity, holding us gently down. That is why we stay firmly on the ground.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�a858396d6707�body�ٖ空间站和里面的人一起绕着地球不停地往下掉，就像一直在下落。大家掉得一样快，就感觉不到重量，飘起来了。ٗThe station and everyone inside are falling around Earth together, again and again. Because they fall at the same rate, they feel weightless and float.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�astro_25_001�body���太阳没有搬家,是我们的地球在转圈圈!地球像陀螺一样自转,你转到背对太阳的那一面时,太阳就在地球另一边照亮别人了。等你转回朝向太阳,新的一天就开始啦。٭The sun never moves away — Earth spins like a top! When your side turns away from the sun it lights up people on the other side. Spin back around and hello, brand-new day.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版天文分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�ZTen Thousand Whys: Astronomy volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�astro_25_002�body���没有人咬月亮!月亮自己不发光,靠反射太阳光发亮。它绕地球转,被照亮的面有时全朝我们,是圆月;有时只露一条边,是弯月。像手电筒照皮球,角度不同,亮面大小就不同。��Nobody bites the Moon! It shines by reflecting sunlight. As it circles Earth we see different lit amounts — full circle sometimes, thin sliver other times. Like shining a flashlight on a ball from different angles.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版天文分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�ZTen Thousand Whys: Astronomy volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�astro_25_003�body���会飘走哦!太空里没有重量,水不会乖乖待在杯子里,而是变成一颗颗亮晶晶的水球到处飞。宇航员用密封袋子插吸管喝,或者张嘴去追水球——像小鱼吃虫子一样好玩!��It floats away! With no weight in space, water refuses cups and turns into shiny floating balls. Astronauts sip from sealed pouches with straws or chase the balls mouth-first — fun as a fish catching bugs.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版天文分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�ZTen Thousand Whys: Astronomy volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�astro_25_005�body���多得数不清!光银河系就有上千亿颗星星。白天它们没消失,是太阳太亮把星光盖住了,就像白天开灯看不出亮。等太阳落山、天空变黑,星星就一颗颗出来眨眼啦。��Too many to count! Our Milky Way alone holds hundreds of billions of stars. By day they never leave — the sun is just too bright, drowning starlight like lamps lost in daylight. When the sun sets and skies darken, stars come out blinking one by one.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版天文分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�ZTen Thousand Whys: Astronomy volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�b67a59321763�body��u那是一场超级大风暴，名字叫大红斑，已经刮了好几百年。这场风暴比整个地球还要宽。ٌIt is a giant storm called the Great Red Spot, and it has been spinning for hundreds of years. The storm is even wider than our whole Earth.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�b82b7a284bb6�body��c太阳的直径约139万公里，可以装下约130万个地球，是太阳系里最大的天体。فThe Sun is about 1.39 million km across and could hold roughly 1.3 million Earths—it is the largest object in the Solar System.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�bba4af30ddff�body�ف太空几乎是空的，没有空气帮忙把声音送过来，所以什么也听不到。宇航员要靠无线电互相说话。�Space is almost empty, and without air to carry sound there is nothing to hear. Astronauts talk to each other by radio instead.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�c1eae18b5db2�body���最大的卫星是绕着木星转的木卫三（Ganymede），它甚至比水星还大一点点。它是唯一一颗自己拥有磁场的卫星，表面既有亮亮的老冰，也有暗暗的撞击坑。��The largest moon is Ganymede, which orbits Jupiter, and it is even a bit larger than Mercury. It is the only moon known to have its own magnetic field, with a surface of bright old ice and dark impact craters.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�c7fadb241101�body�ٓ因为地球一直在自转，转到朝向太阳的一面就是白天，转到背向太阳的一面就是黑夜。太阳本身一直都在发光。ِEarth constantly spins on its axis, so the side facing the Sun has daytime and the side turned away has night. The Sun itself is always shining.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�caa08de5911d�body�ِ天文学家重新定下了行星的规矩，冥王星太小，轨道旁边还有很多小伙伴挤在一起。于是大家改叫它矮行星。َAstronomers agreed on new rules for planets, and Pluto is small with many icy neighbours sharing its path. So now it is called a dwarf planet.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d082969172ef�body�ٍ月亮离我们非常远，你走一点点路相对它的角度几乎不变，所以无论怎么走它都像停在原处、跟着你移动。لThe Moon is so far away that walking a little changes its angle hardly at all, so it seems to stay put and 'follow' you as you move.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�d545d56a08f1�body�٠欧空局的罗塞塔号于2014年环绕并登陆67P彗星，第一次在彗星旁仔细分析它的气体和尘埃，发现里面有复杂有机物和水冰。ٙESA's Rosetta orbited and landed on comet 67P in 2014, analyzing its gas and dust up close for the first time and finding complex organics and water ice.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d5b18f510cdc�body�٢地球绕太阳一周约365.24天，每四年补一天（2月29日）来对齐季节；但整百年份须被400整除才闰，所以并非严格的四年一闰。٤A year is ~365.24 days, so we add a day (Feb 29) every four years to stay aligned; but century years leap only if divisible by 400, so it's not strictly every four.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d5c7781045f2�body��x他们吃装在密封小袋里的食物，还要把袋子夹住，免得饭菜飘走。喝水要用带吸管的水袋。فThey eat food from sealed pouches and clip everything down so it cannot float away. Drinks come in bags they sip through a straw.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�d7c916e75865�body��W不是。可观测宇宙里就有数千亿个星系，每个都包含亿万颗恒星。�`No. The observable Universe holds hundreds of billions of galaxies, each with billions of stars.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�ead67a6caf3f�body��{国际空间站是绕地球运行的大型实验室，宇航员在上面做失重、生物和材料等各类科学实验。�vThe ISS is a large lab orbiting Earth where astronauts run experiments on weightlessness, biology, materials and more.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�ebf629635295�body�٨月亮本身反射太阳光，只要它和太阳不在完全相反的方向、且天空不太亮，肉眼就能在白天找到它，尤其上弦前后在下午常见。٤The Moon just reflects sunlight; when it's not opposite the Sun and the sky isn't too bright, you can spot it by day—common in the afternoon around first quarter.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�fbc57b548699�body��h会。约50亿年后太阳将膨胀成红巨星，最终收缩为一颗白矮星，慢慢冷却变暗。كYes. In about 5 billion years the Sun will swell into a red giant and finally shrink into a white dwarf that slowly cools and dims.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�feed1dea92b4�body��l当月球运行到太阳和地球之间，挡住太阳光时，地球上一部分地区就会看到日食。�|A solar eclipse happens when the Moon passes between the Sun and Earth and blocks the Sun's light for some regions on Earth.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�002d355b202c�body���太阳风带来的带电粒子被地球磁场引导到两极上空，与高层大气中的氧、氮原子碰撞使其激发。这些原子回到基态时放出红、绿、蓝等颜色的光，形成极光。因此极光多出现在高纬度地区。�ICharged particles from the solar wind are steered by Earth's magnetic field toward the poles, where they collide with oxygen and nitrogen atoms in the upper atmosphere and excite them. As those atoms return to lower energy they emit red, green and blue light, forming auroras. That is why auroras appear mainly at high latitudes.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�01a0ca80af49�body��旋涡星系拥有旋转的盘状结构和明显的旋臂，恒星形成仍在活跃进行，富含气体和尘埃。椭圆星系则呈椭球状，几乎不含冷气体，恒星较年老，基本停止造星。这种形态差异反映了它们不同的形成与并合历史。�<Spiral galaxies have a rotating disk with distinct arms where star formation is still active, rich in gas and dust. Elliptical galaxies are ellipsoidal, nearly devoid of cold gas, with older stars and little ongoing star formation. The morphological difference reflects their distinct formation and merger histories.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�03606e9575d8�body���光谱学把星光分解成不同波长，从中可读取天体的化学组成、温度、视向速度和磁场等信息。没有光谱，就几乎无法判断遥远天体到底是什么。它是现代天体物理诊断的基石。�Spectroscopy splits starlight into wavelengths, revealing a body's chemical composition, temperature, radial velocity, and magnetic field. Without spectra, we could hardly tell what distant objects actually are. It is the cornerstone of modern astrophysical diagnosis.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�04324f7b5bdc�body�ٖ月球被地球潮汐锁定，自转周期与公转周期相同，所以始终以同一面朝向地球，背面直到 1959 年才被探测器拍到。ټThe Moon is tidally locked to Earth, with its rotation period equal to its orbital period, so the same face always points toward us; the far side was first photographed by a probe in 1959.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�0463dcfb9cd4�body���当彗星靠近太阳时，冰受热升华，喷射出气体和尘埃，并在太阳风和辐射压作用下形成指向背离太阳的彗尾。一颗彗星往往同时拥有尘埃尾和离子尾。��As a comet nears the Sun, its ice sublimates and releases gas and dust, which the solar wind and radiation pressure push into tails pointing away from the Sun. A comet often shows both a dust tail and an ion tail.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�0503f1ad526e�body��]无线电波能穿透星际尘埃云，让天文学家看到光学望远镜被遮挡的恒星形成区、冷气体和分子云。射电波段还带来了许多划时代的发现，比如1967年发现的脉冲星、1965年发现的宇宙微波背景，以及遥远类星体。500米口径的FAST和智利的ALMA阵列都专门在这一波段工作。�yRadio waves pass through interstellar dust clouds, letting astronomers see star-forming regions, cold gas, and molecular clouds that visible light cannot get through. The radio window also brought landmark discoveries: pulsars in 1967, the cosmic microwave background in 1965, and distant quasars. China's 500-metre FAST dish and the ALMA array in Chile both work in this band.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�056ed1ebaa9f�body��+2015年9月，LIGO科学合作组首次直接探测到来自约13亿光年外两个黑洞合并产生的引力波，信号编号为GW150914。这一发现证实了爱因斯坦的百年预言，并打开了观测宇宙的全新窗口。相关三位科学家因此获得2017年诺贝尔物理学奖。�[In September 2015 the LIGO Scientific Collaboration made the first direct detection of gravitational waves from two merging black holes about 1.3 billion light-years away, event GW150914. The discovery confirmed Einstein's century-old prediction and opened a new window on the universe. Three scientists won the 2017 Nobel Prize in Physics for it.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�05caf2e19922�body��:地球同步卫星的轨道周期恰好等于地球自转周期（约24小时），在赤道上空且轨道圆形时，它相对地面某点几乎不动，这就是地球静止卫星。通信、气象和电视广播卫星常放在这种轨道上，便于地面天线固定对准。它们距地面约3.6万公里。�PA geosynchronous satellite has an orbital period equal to Earth's rotation (about 24 hours); if it is circular and over the equator, it stays nearly fixed above one ground point, called geostationary. Communications, weather, and broadcast satellites use this orbit so dishes can aim steadily. They sit about 36,000 km above the ground.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�06741767487c�body���当行星凌星时，部分星光会穿过其大气边缘，特定波长的光被大气成分吸收，留下「指纹」。通过对比凌星前后光谱，就能推断是否存在水、二氧化碳等分子。��During a transit, some starlight passes through the planet's atmospheric edge, where specific wavelengths are absorbed by its gases, leaving a "fingerprint." Comparing spectra before and during transit reveals molecules like water or carbon dioxide.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�08b0e5226dc7�body�ٮ恒星寿命差别极大：质量越大的恒星燃烧越快、寿命越短，例如太阳约能活100亿年，而质量是太阳几十倍的恒星可能只活几百万年。ٿStellar lifetimes vary hugely: more massive stars burn faster and die sooner—the Sun will live about 10 billion years, while stars dozens of times heavier may last only a few million years.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�095f5f09e9c1�body���卫星高速运动使钟因狭义相对论变慢，又因离地心远、引力弱使钟因广义相对论变快，二者叠加每天差约38微秒，不修正定位会每天漂移约10公里。��A satellite's speed slows its clock (special relativity) while weaker gravity speeds it (general relativity); the net ~38 microseconds/day must be corrected or positioning drifts ~10 km daily.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�09f6d75ff8b8�body���会的。哈勃太空望远镜的观测与模拟显示，仙女座星系正以约每秒110公里的速度向银河系靠近，两者预计在约40至50亿年后发生并合，最终形成一个更大的椭圆状星系。��Yes. Hubble observations and simulations show Andromeda is approaching the Milky Way at about 110 km/s, and the two are expected to merge in roughly 4–5 billion years, eventually forming a larger elliptical-like galaxy.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�09f852eee20c�body��1998年对遥远 Ia 型超新星的观测发现它们比预期暗，说明宇宙在加速膨胀，这一发现获诺贝尔奖。此后宇宙微波背景、重子声学振荡和星系团计数等多种独立证据都指向同一结论。加速被认为由暗能量驱动。�RIn 1998, observations of distant Type Ia supernovae found them dimmer than expected, implying accelerated expansion—work awarded the Nobel Prize. Since then, independent evidence from the cosmic microwave background, baryon acoustic oscillations, and cluster counts all point the same way. The acceleration is attributed to dark energy.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�0a7163358b98�body�ٍ星系聚成星系团，再连成纤维状和墙状的宇宙网，中间是几乎空旷的巨洞，这是物质在引力下演化的结果。ٜGalaxies group into clusters and link into filamentary walls of the cosmic web, separated by near-empty voids—the result of matter evolving under gravity.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�0afb08f3c1ee�body��;卡西尼号燃料即将耗尽，若任其漂流可能撞上可能有地下海的土卫二或泰坦，带来地球生物污染的风险。科学家因此让它主动冲入土星大气焚毁，这被称为『大决战』。这样既保护了可能孕育生命的卫星，又获得了最后一批大气探测数据。�DWith its fuel nearly gone, Cassini might have drifted into Enceladus or Titan, moons that may hide subsurface oceans, risking contamination by Earth life. Scientists instead sent it plunging into Saturn's atmosphere to burn up, the 'Grand Finale'. This protected possibly habitable moons and gathered final atmospheric data.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�0b7f6412f651�body���太阳风是太阳外层大气持续向外吹出的带电粒子流，主要由质子和电子组成，速度通常在每秒数百公里。它充满整个日球层，既塑造了地球的磁层，也是空间天气扰动的主要来源。�4The solar wind is a continuous stream of charged particles, mainly protons and electrons, blown outward from the Sun's outer atmosphere at typical speeds of hundreds of kilometers per second. It fills the entire heliosphere, shapes Earth's magnetosphere, and is the main source of space-weather disturbances.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�0bf968ef2a99�body�ٷ在大爆炸后约三分钟，宇宙冷却到能进行核反应，主要合成了氢、氦以及极少量锂，这一比例与今天观测高度吻合，是宇宙学的有力证据。ٹAbout three minutes after the Big Bang, the cooling universe fused mainly hydrogen, helium, and trace lithium; this predicted ratio matches observations and strongly supports cosmology.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�0ca9ef4be00b�body��光谱仪把天体光按波长展开成光谱，其中暗的吸收线与亮的发射线对应特定原子或分子。通过识别谱线与测量其位移（红移/蓝移），天文学家能确定天体的化学成分、温度、运动速度和磁场等物理性质。�HA spectrograph spreads an object's light into a spectrum by wavelength, where dark absorption and bright emission lines correspond to specific atoms or molecules. By identifying those lines and measuring their shifts, red or blue, astronomers determine the object's chemical composition, temperature, motion, and magnetic field.�ans��src��HGray《恒星光球的观测与分析》（Cambridge University Press）�WGray, The Observation and Analysis of Stellar Photospheres (Cambridge University Press)��id�0ce2c1b221a1�body��K太阳核心的氢核聚变释放巨大能量，以光和热向外辐射。�AFusion of hydrogen in the core radiates energy as light and heat.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�0eb8d5121eb3�body���[Fe/H] 等于恒星的铁氢对数丰度减去太阳的铁氢对数丰度，是以太阳为基准的相对值。负值表示比太阳更贫金属。它用于刻画恒星年龄、星系化学演化与星族差异。��[Fe/H] is the iron-to-hydrogen abundance of a star minus that of the Sun on a log scale; negative values mean more metal-poor. It traces stellar age, galactic chemical evolution, and population differences.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�0f5011a0c1b8�body��_因为它们同时具备生命所需的液态水、能量和化学原料。冰壳下的海洋被潮汐加热保持在液态，避免了恶劣的太空辐射直接轰击水面；土卫二喷出的羽流还能让探测器在轨道上就取样分析。加上火星古代湖泊的遗迹，这些海洋卫星目前是寻找地外生命最现实的候选。��Because they combine the liquid water, energy, and chemistry life needs. Tidal heating keeps their subsurface oceans liquid, and the thick ice shields the water from harsh space radiation; Enceladus even vents plumes that a spacecraft can sample from orbit. Together with the relics of ancient Martian lakes, these ocean moons are currently the most practical candidates in the search for life beyond Earth.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�101e453977e4�body�� 金星曾可能有过液态水海洋，但强烈的太阳辐射使水汽蒸发进入大气。水蒸气本身就是强温室气体，进一步升温又蒸发更多水，最终海洋全部蒸发，二氧化碳也大量释放，形成今天的极热世界。这被称为失控温室效应。�/Venus may once have had liquid-water oceans, but intense solar radiation evaporated the water into the air. Water vapor is itself a strong greenhouse gas, so warming released even more, until the oceans boiled away and huge amounts of carbon dioxide built up. This is called a runaway greenhouse effect.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�10c8ca6fac3a�body���约 6600 万年前，一颗直径约 10 公里的天体撞击今天墨西哥的尤卡坦半岛，形成直径约 180 公里的希克苏鲁伯陨石坑。撞击抛出的尘埃遮天蔽日，引发撞击冬季，导致包括恐龙在内约四分之三的物种灭绝；1980 年科学家在白垩纪-古近纪界线地层中发现全球性的铱异常，正是小行星撞击留下的标志。��About 66 million years ago, a body roughly 10 km across struck what is now the Yucatan Peninsula in Mexico, forming the about 180 km Chicxulub crater. The impact lofted dust that blocked sunlight, triggering an impact winter that killed about three-quarters of species, including the non-avian dinosaurs; the discovery of a worldwide iridium anomaly in the Cretaceous-Paleogene boundary layer in 1980 provided the key evidence for an asteroid.�ans��src��&Science（阿尔瓦雷斯等，1980）�Science (Alvarez et al., 1980)��id�118cc8aa093c�body��热木星接受恒星的强烈辐射，高层大气被加热到极高温度，部分轻气体（主要是氢）获得足够动能挣脱行星引力而流失。这种流体动力逃逸可改变行星的质量与成分。观测上常通过莱曼α的蓝移吸收来探测这种逃逸。�;Hot Jupiters receive intense stellar radiation; their upper atmospheres heat to extreme temperatures so light gases, mainly hydrogen, gain enough energy to escape the planet's gravity. This hydrodynamic escape can alter the planet's mass and composition. It is often detected via blueshifted Lyman-alpha absorption.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�11a52ed605ee�body���返回舱以每秒约7.8公里的高速冲入大气，与空气剧烈摩擦并压缩空气，使前端温度骤升到上千摄氏度。这主要靠激波加热而非单纯摩擦。特殊防热材料会烧蚀牺牲自己，保护舱内的人和仪器。�"A returning capsule plunges into the atmosphere at about 7.8 km/s, and compression plus friction heat its front to over a thousand degrees Celsius. The heating is mainly from shock compression, not simple friction. Ablative heat shields sacrifice themselves to protect crew and instruments.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�12b9d37364f8�body�ٮ星系团产生的透镜弯曲程度远超可见物质能解释的范围，多出的弯曲只能由看不见的暗物质提供质量，由此可绘制暗物质的分布图。ٗGalaxy clusters bend light far more than their visible matter allows; the excess must come from invisible dark matter, letting us map its distribution.�ans��src��bClowe 等人,2006年,《天体物理学报》648卷 L109 页(子弹星系团直接证实暗物质)�RClowe et al. 2006, ApJ, 648, L109 (Bullet Cluster direct evidence for dark matter)��id�14e07ff8a61f�body��	旋臂是旋涡星系中恒星和气体相对密集的弯曲条带，像风车叶片一样从中心伸出。银河系主要有英仙臂、盾牌-半人马臂等数条大旋臂。旋臂并非固定结构，而是恒星和气体在密度波中聚集形成的波纹。�?Spiral arms are curved bands where stars and gas are relatively dense, extending from a galaxy's center like the blades of a pinwheel. The Milky Way has several major arms such as the Perseus and Scutum-Centaurus arms. The arms are not fixed structures but density waves where stars and gas bunch up like a traffic jam.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�153dd257b4a4�body��'按2006年定义，行星必须：绕太阳公转、自身重力使其呈近似球形、并已清空轨道附近的其他天体。太阳系中满足这三条的只有水星、金星、地球、火星、木星、土星、天王星、海王星八颗。矮行星因未清空轨道而不在此列。�Since 2006 a planet must orbit the Sun, be nearly round under its own gravity, and have cleared its orbital neighborhood. Only Mercury, Venus, Earth, Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus and Neptune meet all three. Dwarf planets fail the last test and are excluded.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�156749974515�body��G如果暗能量保持恒定（宇宙学常数），宇宙将永远加速膨胀，星系彼此远离，最终进入寒冷稀薄的热寂状态。若暗能量增强，可能发生大撕裂把星系甚至原子撕碎；若减弱，引力或使宇宙重新收缩为大坍缩。目前的观测更支持持续加速膨胀的图景。�iIf dark energy stays constant (a cosmological constant), the universe will expand forever, galaxies drift apart, and it ends in a cold, dilute heat death. If dark energy strengthens, a big rip could tear apart galaxies and even atoms; if it weakens, gravity might reverse expansion into a big crunch. Current observations favor continued accelerating expansion.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�16318243c9a4�body��星座是人类把天空中看起来相近的恒星连成的图案，便于辨认和记忆方向。现代天文学把整个天球划分为88个官方星座，作为确定天体位置的区域。同一星座里的恒星其实常常相距很远，只是从地球看方向接近。�xA constellation is a pattern formed by connecting stars that appear close together in the sky, used by humans to identify and remember directions. Modern astronomy divides the entire sky into 88 official constellations that serve as regions for locating objects. Stars in the same constellation are often very far apart in reality, merely appearing near each other from Earth.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�1656184f1237�body���人体中的碳、氧、铁等重元素都来自恒星内部的核聚变与超新星爆炸，再经星际物质汇聚形成地球和生命，所以构成我们的原子确实诞生于星辰。ٺThe carbon, oxygen and iron in our bodies were forged by stellar fusion and supernovae, then gathered via interstellar matter into Earth and life—so our atoms truly were born in stars.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�16dc6f532d28�body�ٜ引力波是时空本身的涟漪，由黑洞或中子星等致密天体加速运动产生，以光速向外传播，由爱因斯坦广义相对论预言。��Gravitational waves are ripples in spacetime itself, produced by accelerating compact objects like black holes or neutron stars, traveling at light speed—predicted by Einstein's general relativity.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�1761d5a19db7�body��D陨石按成分主要分为石陨石、铁陨石和石铁陨石三类，其中石陨石又可分为球粒陨石和非球粒陨石。球粒陨石含有太阳系早期形成的毫米级球粒，几乎没有经历过母体加热改造，保留着 45.6 亿年前太阳系起源的物质，因此被认为是最原始的陨石。�}Meteorites fall into three main classes by composition, stony, iron and stony-iron, with stony meteorites further split into chondrites and achondrites. Chondrites contain millimeter-sized chondrules from the early solar system and have undergone almost no parent-body heating, preserving material from 4.56 billion years ago, so they are regarded as the most primitive meteorites.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�1934f325c1a5�body��费米气泡是银河系中心上下对称、延伸约 25000 光年的巨大伽马射线与射电辐射结构。费米伽马射线空间望远镜在对全天巡天数据中剔除已知弥漫背景后意外发现，暗示数百万年前中心曾发生剧烈能量释放事件。�;The Fermi bubbles are huge, bilaterally symmetric gamma-ray and radio structures extending ~25,000 light-years above and below the Galactic Center. Fermi discovered them serendipitously after subtracting known diffuse backgrounds from all-sky data, suggesting a violent energy-release episode millions of years ago.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�198e823cc6f4�body�ٱ就像救护车靠近时声音变尖、远离时变低，光波在源远离时波长被拉长为红移、靠近时压短为蓝移，借此可知天体退行或接近的速度。پLike a siren's pitch dropping as it leaves, light from a receding source is stretched to red (redshift) and from an approaching one compressed to blue (blueshift), revealing speed of motion.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�1a04632127ce�body���JWST是红外空间望远镜，口径约6.5米，专长于穿透宇宙尘埃并观测极高红移的早期星系。它能解析系外行星大气透射光谱，并拍摄恒星形成区的精细结构。它是哈勃在红外波段的强力继任者。�JWST is an infrared space telescope with a 6.5-meter mirror, specialized in piercing cosmic dust and observing very high-redshift early galaxies. It resolves exoplanet transmission spectra and fine structures of star-forming regions. It is Hubble's powerful infrared successor.�ans��src��vGardner J. P. et al., The James Webb Space Telescope, Space Science Reviews 123 (2006), DOI: 10.1007/s11214-006-8315-7�vGardner J. P. et al., The James Webb Space Telescope, Space Science Reviews 123 (2006), DOI: 10.1007/s11214-006-8315-7��id�1a46da135255�body��A流星雨的来源是彗星：彗星在轨道上剥离出大量尘埃碎片，形成沿轨道分布的碎片流，地球每年在同一时间穿过该碎片流，碎片进入大气高速燃烧形成流星雨。因为地球在固定的轨道位置穿过碎片流，所以流星雨每年都在大致相同的日期出现。�qMeteor showers come from comets, which shed streams of dust grains along their orbits. Each year Earth passes through the same debris stream at the same orbital location; grains burn up in the atmosphere at high speed, producing the shower. Because Earth crosses the stream at a fixed orbital position, a given shower returns at about the same calendar date every year.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�1d6b0cf1e3e2�body��5冰巨星指天王星与海王星，与以氢氦为主的气态巨行星不同，它们主要由水、氨、甲烷等「冰」物质与岩石核心构成。它们体积小于木星土星，但拥有浓密甲烷大气而呈蓝绿色，且天王星以近直角「躺着」自转，磁场也明显偏离中心。�^The ice giants are Uranus and Neptune; unlike the hydrogen-helium gas giants, they are built mainly from ices such as water, ammonia, and methane atop rocky cores. Smaller than Jupiter and Saturn, they have dense methane atmospheres giving a blue-green hue, and Uranus rotates nearly on its side while possessing a markedly off-center magnetic field.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�1f068ee5e42a�body��当太阳、月球和地球大致排成一线（朔或望）时，太阳和月球的引潮力叠加，形成潮差最大的大潮。而在上弦、下弦时两者相互垂直，引潮力部分抵消，形成小潮。因此大潮约每半个月出现一次。�When the Sun, Moon and Earth line up near new or full moon, their tidal forces add together and produce the largest tidal range, called spring tides. At first and last quarter they sit at right angles and partly cancel, giving neap tides. So spring tides come about every two weeks.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�2007f9c7b041�body�ٴ泰坦拥有浓厚氮气大气和液态甲烷湖泊与河流，是太阳系中除地球外唯一表面有稳定液体的天体，被视为研究前生命化学的天然实验室。ٹTitan has a thick nitrogen atmosphere and lakes and rivers of liquid methane—the only body besides Earth with stable surface liquids—making it a natural lab for prebiotic chemistry.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�21ef1f8e7695�body���当太阳核心的氢耗尽后，它会膨胀成一颗红巨星，外层大幅扩张并可能吞没水星、金星乃至地球轨道。最终外层物质会以行星状星云形式抛散，留下一颗地球大小的白矮星。��When the Sun exhausts the hydrogen in its core, it will swell into a red giant, expanding so far that it may engulf Mercury, Venus, and possibly Earth's orbit. Its outer layers will later be shed as a planetary nebula, leaving an Earth-sized white dwarf.�ans��src��Y恒星结构与演化标准模型（Kippenhahn & Weigert，《恒星结构与演化》）�8Standard stellar evolution models (Kippenhahn & Weigert)��id�231dcacf1ee9�body��|大爆炸后的极早期宇宙经历了快速膨胀的暴涨时期；最初几分钟内，质子和中子合成出氢、氦和微量锂。约38万年后宇宙冷却到可以形成原子，光得以释放，留下微波背景。随后物质在暗物质的引力下聚集，约一两亿年后诞生了第一批恒星，138亿年后的今天，星系早已连成庞大的宇宙网。��The very early universe went through inflation, a burst of rapid expansion; in the first few minutes protons and neutrons fused into hydrogen, helium, and a trace of lithium. About 380,000 years later the universe cooled enough for atoms to form and light was set free, leaving the microwave background. Matter then clumped under the gravity of dark matter, the first stars lit up around 100 to 200 million years in, and 13.8 billion years later galaxies are strung into a vast cosmic web.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�2384425a81b2�body��5双黑洞并合是指两颗相互绕转的黑洞因引力波辐射损失轨道能量而螺旋靠近、最终融合为一颗更大黑洞的过程。该过程会以引力波形式释放出相当于数个太阳质量对应的能量，被 LIGO/Virgo 等探测器以激光干涉方式记录为「啁啾」信号。�pA binary black hole merger is the process in which two orbiting black holes spiral inward as they lose orbital energy to gravitational radiation and finally coalesce into a single larger black hole. The event releases energy equivalent to several solar masses as gravitational waves, recorded by detectors such as LIGO/Virgo as a chirp signal via laser interferometry.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�255b37b2d2fa�body���不同滤光片只透过特定波段的光，测得的星等组合（色指数如 B−V）反映恒星温度与红化。标准滤光系统使全球望远镜的测光可相互校准与比较，是恒星测光与变星监测的基础。�&Different filters pass only specific wavelength bands; magnitude combinations (color indices like B−V) reveal temperature and reddening. Standard filter systems let photometry from telescopes worldwide be calibrated and compared—the basis of stellar photometry and variable-star monitoring.�ans��src��pBessell,《UBVRI passbands》,Publications of the Astronomical Society of the Pacific,1990 (DOI: 10.1086/132749)�nBessell, 'UBVRI passbands', Publications of the Astronomical Society of the Pacific, 1990, DOI: 10.1086/132749��id�259739b738d6�body��地球外核是高温液态的铁镍，因热量对流和地球自转产生环流，形成类似发电机的效应，称为地磁发电机。它产生包裹地球的磁层，偏转太阳风、保护大气和生命。磁场还会缓慢漂移甚至偶发倒转。�,Earth's outer core is hot liquid iron and nickel whose convection, combined with Earth's rotation, acts like a dynamo and generates the magnetic field. It creates a magnetosphere that deflects the solar wind and shields the atmosphere and life. The field also drifts slowly and occasionally reverses.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�25fea25a550c�body��D19世纪天文学家发现天王星的实际轨道偏离了牛顿引力计算的预期。法国人勒维耶和英国人亚当斯分别独立推算出，必定存在一颗更外侧的未知行星在扰动天王星。1846年，天文学家根据计算位置果然找到了海王星，这是天体力学的一次伟大胜利。�[In the 19th century astronomers noticed that Uranus deviated from the orbit predicted by Newtonian gravity. Working independently, Le Verrier in France and Adams in Britain calculated that an unknown outer planet must be perturbing Uranus. In 1846 astronomers found Neptune exactly where the calculations pointed, a triumph of celestial mechanics.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�27b78deeacf4�body�ٜ近地小行星是轨道接近地球的小天体，既可能因撞击带来威胁，也蕴含水和金属资源，是未来探测与防御的重点对象。ٰNear-Earth asteroids have orbits close to Earth's; they pose impact risk but also hold water and metal resources, making them key targets for exploration and planetary defense.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�29d209488c17�body�ٚ地球自转轴倾斜约23.5度，绕日时不同地区受太阳照射角度和时长随季节变化，造成冷暖交替；离太阳远近不是主因。٭Earth's axis tilts ~23.5°; as it orbits, sunlight angle and day length change through the year, causing warm and cold seasons—distance from the Sun is not the main cause.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�2a9af861b1e4�body�ٮ大爆炸理论认为宇宙约138亿年前从一个极热极密的状态膨胀而来。它能解释星系退行、宇宙微波背景辐射和轻元素丰度等观测事实。��The Big Bang theory holds that the universe expanded from an extremely hot, dense state about 13.8 billion years ago. It explains the recession of galaxies, the cosmic microwave background, and the abundances of light elements.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�2dbe6d8742c0�body���火星表面有大量干涸的河床、三角洲和只有流水才能形成的圆形卵石，探测器还在地下发现了水冰。矿物如赤铁矿和黏土也需要在有水环境中生成。这些都说明火星过去比现在温暖湿润。�Mars shows dried-up river channels, deltas and rounded pebbles that only form in flowing water, and probes have found water ice underground. Minerals like hematite and clay also need water to form. Together they show Mars was once warmer and wetter than today.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�2dfce215c525�body��J两方面的影响都存在。木星庞大的引力会偏转一些长周期彗星和小行星的轨道，把它们甩出内太阳系，减少地球被撞的概率；但反过来，它同样能把天体弹向地球方向，增加撞击风险。具体效果取决于天体的来源和轨道，科学家至今没有统一的定论。�TIt does both. Jupiter's immense gravity deflects some long-period comets and asteroids, flinging them out of the inner Solar System and lowering Earth's impact odds; conversely, it can also sling objects toward us, raising the risk. The net effect depends on an object's origin and orbit, and scientists still have no single settled answer.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�2e330f208dfb�body��~近地小行星富含水冰（可拆成火箭燃料）、铁镍金属和铂族贵重金属，是未来太空资源的候选。�~Near-Earth asteroids hold water ice (for fuel), iron-nickel metals and platinum-group metals—candidates for space resources.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�2e8281114017�body�ٓ取决于月球离地球的远近：近时月盘能完全遮住太阳成日全食；远时月盘偏小，太阳边缘留一圈亮环成日环食。�yIt depends on the Moon's distance: when near, it fully covers the Sun (total); when far, a bright ring remains (annular).�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�2f0fc2118452�body��有。木卫一的火山活动比地球还剧烈，不断喷发硫和二氧化硫；金星上的大型盾状火山可能仍偶尔活动。火星的奥林匹斯山虽已沉寂，但表明火星历史上曾有过强烈火山作用。火山是行星演化的重要标志。�-Yes. Jupiter's moon Io is even more volcanically active than Earth, erupting sulfur and sulfur dioxide; Venus has huge shield volcanoes that may still erupt occasionally. Mars's Olympus Mons is dormant but shows the planet was once violently volcanic. Volcanoes are key markers of planetary evolution.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�2fed3861c4b0�body�ٺ近距离超新星释放的强烈宇宙射线和伽马射线会破坏臭氧层、增加辐射，可能引发生物大灭绝，但目前已知近邻恒星都没有即将爆发的迹象。ٿA nearby supernova's intense cosmic rays and gamma rays could damage the ozone layer and raise radiation, possibly causing mass extinctions, but no known neighboring star is about to explode.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�30a728b41efc�body��活动星系核是星系中心区域因超大质量黑洞吸积而异常明亮的核，可释放出超越整个星系恒星总光度的能量。其表现形式包括类星体、耀变体和赛弗特星系等。喷流和辐射会显著影响其宿主星系的演化。�8An active galactic nucleus is the unusually bright core of a galaxy powered by accretion onto a supermassive black hole, emitting energy that can outshine all its stars combined. Manifestations include quasars, blazars, and Seyfert galaxies. Its jets and radiation strongly influence the host galaxy's evolution.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�3112ec47ecda�body��-根据霍金在1974年的推导，黑洞视界附近量子效应会令其缓慢辐射粒子，称为霍金辐射。这个过程使黑洞质量逐渐减小，理论上最终会完全蒸发。不过对于恒星级黑洞，蒸发所需时间远超当前宇宙年龄，因此现实中几乎不可观测。�iFollowing Hawking's 1974 derivation, quantum effects near the horizon cause a black hole to emit particles, known as Hawking radiation. This gradually reduces its mass and, in principle, can evaporate it completely. For stellar-mass holes, however, evaporation would take far longer than the present age of the universe, so it is effectively unobservable today.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�318718e8f248�body��几乎每一个大型星系的中心都潜伏着一颗超大质量黑洞，其质量可达数百万到数十亿个太阳。例如银河系中心的人马座A*约为四百三十万太阳质量。这些黑洞通过吸积周围物质并与宿主星系共同演化。�$Nearly every large galaxy hosts a supermassive black hole at its center, with masses from millions to billions of suns. Sagittarius A*, at the heart of the Milky Way, is about 4.3 million solar masses. These holes grow by accreting surrounding material and co-evolve with their host galaxies.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�327900794131�body��	Ia 型超新星来自白矮星接近钱德拉塞卡极限的热核爆炸，峰值光度较均匀，且光变宽度与峰值亮度存在 Phillips 关系可校正。经校正后它们可作为标准烛光，用于测量遥远星系距离并发现宇宙加速膨胀。�.Type Ia supernovae arise from thermonuclear explosions of white dwarfs near the Chandrasekhar limit, with fairly uniform peak luminosity; the width–luminosity Phillips relation allows correction. Calibrated, they serve as standard candles to measure distant galaxies and reveal accelerated expansion.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�3515607a41d6�body�ٓ红巨星是恒星晚期的膨胀阶段：核心的氢耗尽后，外层膨胀、表面变冷而呈红色，体积可膨胀到原来的上百倍。ٮA red giant is a late stage in a star's life: after its core hydrogen is used up, the outer layers expand and cool to red, swelling to over a hundred times its original size.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�3623964df0a0�body��r叫“天宫”，由天和核心舱及多个实验舱组成，长期有航天员驻留开展太空科学工作。�xIt's called Tiangong, built from the Tianhe core module and labs, with astronauts stationed long-term for space science.�ans��src��G国务院新闻办公室《2021中国的航天》航天白皮书，2022�^State Council Information Office: China's Space Program: A 2021 Perspective, white paper, 2022��id�369a69f16e26�body��{它用可变形镜面实时抵消大气湍流造成的抖动，让地面望远镜也能接近太空望远镜的清晰度。�|It uses a deformable mirror to cancel atmospheric turbulence in real time, letting ground telescopes approach space clarity.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�3961873b25cb�body��$泰坦是土星最大的卫星，也是太阳系中唯一拥有浓厚大气的卫星，大气以氮为主，表面还有液态甲烷形成的湖泊和河流。它的环境类似早期地球，被认为可能具备孕育生命的条件。探测器『卡西尼-惠更斯』曾登陆其表面。�Titan is Saturn's largest moon and the only moon with a thick atmosphere, mainly nitrogen, and it has lakes and rivers of liquid methane on its surface. Its environment resembles early Earth and may offer conditions for life. The Cassini-Huygens mission even landed a probe there.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�3a3762fb87b9�body�ٞ月球样品能帮助测定月球年龄、火山活动历史，并验证'月球晚期重轰炸'等关键假说，是仅靠遥感无法获得的直接证据。ٟLunar samples reveal the Moon's age, volcanic history and test key ideas like the Late Heavy Bombardment—direct evidence remote sensing alone cannot provide.�ans��src��e国务院新闻办公室《2021中国的航天》白皮书：嫦娥工程月球采样返回（2022）�ZSCIO white paper 'China's Space Program: A 2021 Perspective': Change-5 sample return, 2022��id�3a43560178a3�body���宜居带是恒星周围温度适中、允许液态水存在于行星表面的区域，离恒星太近会沸腾、太远会冻结。地球正位于太阳的宜居带内。寻找地外生命时，科学家常优先考察宜居带中的岩质行星。�The habitable zone is the region around a star where temperatures allow liquid water on a planet's surface, not so close it boils nor so far it freezes. Earth sits inside the Sun's habitable zone. In the search for life, scientists prioritize rocky planets in this zone.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�3aca5371e459�body��J类地系外行星一般指质量与半径接近地球、由岩石构成、且位于宿主恒星宜居带内的行星。这类行星被认为最可能具备液态水与适宜表面环境，是搜寻地外生命的首要目标，但「类地」描述的是物理规模与轨道位置，不等于确认存在生命或适宜大气。��An Earth-like exoplanet generally means a rocky planet with mass and radius close to Earth's and orbiting within its star's habitable zone. Such planets are considered the most likely to host liquid water and a suitable surface environment, making them the primary targets in the search for life, though Earth-like describes physical size and orbit, not a confirmed living or habitable atmosphere.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�3b6509e2f42c�body��S仙女座星系（M31）是距离银河系最近的大型旋涡星系，约 250 万光年，两者同属本星系群，并在相互吸引。计算表明约 40 亿年后仙女座星系将与银河系发生碰撞并合，最终形成一个更大的椭圆星系，届时太阳系可能被抛向星系外围，但恒星相撞的概率很低。�mAndromeda (M31) is the nearest large spiral galaxy, about 2.5 million light-years away; both belong to the Local Group and are gravitationally approaching each other. Simulations show the two will merge in about 4 billion years, forming a larger elliptical galaxy; the solar system may be flung to the outer regions, but direct stellar collisions are very unlikely.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�3ceb100e4293�body��&火星探测车是落在火星表面、可移动的科学实验室，能在不同地点钻取岩石、分析土壤成分并拍照传回地球。它们帮助人类寻找火星曾经有水的证据，以及是否可能存在过生命。好奇号和毅力号是目前最先进的火星车代表。�Mars rovers are mobile science labs that land on Mars and drive around to drill rocks, analyze soil, and send back photos. They help us find evidence that Mars once had water and assess whether life could have existed. Curiosity and Perseverance are the most advanced rovers to date.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�3d006d7f17f1�body�ٙ迄今尚未发现确凿的地外生命证据，但在火星、木卫二、土卫二等地点找到过可能适宜的条件，搜寻仍在积极进行。٫No conclusive evidence of extraterrestrial life exists yet, but Mars, Europa, Enceladus, and others show possibly habitable conditions, and the search is actively ongoing.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�3d50bb60c921�body�ٺ主要通过射电望远镜监听可能的人工窄带信号（如SETI），并分析系外行星大气是否含氧气、甲烷等'生物标志'气体，寻找非自然的化学痕迹。ٿMainly by radio telescopes listening for artificial narrowband signals (SETI) and by analyzing exoplanet atmospheres for biosignature gases like oxygen or methane—unnatural chemical traces.�ans��src�٘Catling, Krissansen-Totton, Kiang & Crisp,《Exoplanet Biosignatures: A Framework for Their Assessment》,Astrobiology,2018 (DOI: 10.1089/ast.2017.1737)ٖCatling, Krissansen-Totton, Kiang & Crisp, 'Exoplanet Biosignatures: A Framework for Their Assessment', Astrobiology, 2018, DOI: 10.1089/ast.2017.1737��id�3d7c0c643507�body�ي月球重力只有地球的约六分之一，身体很轻，加上笨重的航天服，小步跳跃反而比正常走路更稳当省力。�|The Moon's gravity is about one-sixth of Earth's and the spacesuit is bulky, so hopping is steadier and easier than walking.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�3dbab7d92224�body���少数位于宜居带、大小和地球相近的系外行星（如比邻星b、TRAPPIST-1系统行星）条件相对有利，但距离极其遥远，目前只能推测其是否具备适宜环境。ٲA few Earth-sized planets in habitable zones (like Proxima b and TRAPPIST-1 planets) look promising, but they are extremely distant; we can only speculate about their conditions.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�3e1627adeaae�body���气态巨行星以氢和氦等气体为主，没有明显的固态表面，内部在高压下气体可能变成液态金属氢。木星和土星是典型代表，体积质量都远大于地球。它们通常拥有强大的磁场和众多卫星。�Gas giants are dominated by hydrogen and helium with no clear solid surface; under high pressure the gas can become liquid metallic hydrogen inside. Jupiter and Saturn are classic examples, far larger and more massive than Earth. They usually have strong magnetic fields and many moons.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�3e95a46ec7c4�body�ٝ银河系是一个棒旋星系，直径约10万光年，包含约1000亿至4000亿颗恒星。我们从内部看，它像一条横贯夜空的明亮光带。ٴThe Milky Way is a barred spiral galaxy about 100,000 light-years across, holding some 100 to 400 billion stars. Seen from inside, it appears as a bright band across the night sky.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�3f32c4c7cf0a�body�ل木星、土星、天王星、海王星等都有极光，它们源自各自磁场与太阳风或卫星火山粒子的相互作用。َJupiter, Saturn, Uranus, and Neptune also have auroras, driven by their magnetic fields interacting with solar wind or moon-related particles.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�40dc83e90f52�body���同一时刻不同经度的地方时不同；带着已知标准时的钟出海，比对当地正午（或恒星位置）与钟面时间差，就能算出所在经度，这正是航海钟的用处。��At one instant, local time differs by longitude; carrying a clock set to standard time, you compare local noon (or star positions) with the clock to compute longitude—the purpose of the marine chronometer.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�41ec6a6943e4�body�ْ天王星自转轴倾斜约 98°，几乎横躺在轨道面上，一般认为是在形成早期被一个地球大小的天体猛烈撞击所致。٭Uranus's spin axis is tilted about 98°, nearly lying in its orbital plane; this is thought to result from a violent collision with an Earth-sized body early in its history.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�44a21b0a0e4d�body��%1998年两个团队通过观测遥远超新星发现，它们比预期更暗，说明宇宙膨胀不仅没减速反而在加快。这一意外结果指向某种排斥性的暗能量在起作用，并因此获得2011年诺贝尔物理学奖。此后多项独立观测都证实了加速膨胀。�In 1998 two teams found distant supernovae dimmer than expected, meaning expansion is speeding up rather than slowing. The surprise pointed to a repulsive dark energy and won the 2011 Nobel Prize in Physics. Many independent observations since have confirmed the acceleration.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�478681041e6d�body��,暗星云是浓密冰冷的星际气体尘埃云，其中的尘埃会吸收和散射背后恒星及星云的光，因此在明亮的背景下呈现剪影般的黑暗。马头星云正是这样一块位于猎户座的致密尘埃云，它挡住了背后红色发射星云的光，形成马头形状。�KA dark nebula is a dense, cold cloud of interstellar gas and dust whose dust absorbs and scatters light from stars and nebulae behind it, appearing as a dark silhouette against a bright background. The Horsehead is exactly such a dense dust cloud in Orion, blocking the light of the red emission nebula behind it to form its shape.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�48bf426aefff�body�٢太阳核心核聚变会同时产生中微子，它们几乎不与物质作用、瞬间穿过太阳和地球，因此携带着核心正在聚变的直接证据。٬Solar fusion produces neutrinos that barely interact and stream straight through the Sun and Earth, carrying direct evidence that fusion is happening in the core right now.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�4ab4b419bc6e�body��8金星表面温度高达约465摄氏度，是太阳系中最热的行星。它的大气层几乎全是二氧化碳，并覆盖着厚厚的硫酸云，形成了极强的温室效应，使得热量无法散逸。尽管金星离太阳不如水星近，其温室效应却把表面加热到足以熔化铅的程度。�nVenus has a surface temperature of about 465 degrees Celsius, making it the hottest planet in the Solar System. Its atmosphere is almost entirely carbon dioxide with thick clouds of sulfuric acid, producing a runaway greenhouse effect that traps heat. Although Venus is farther from the Sun than Mercury, this greenhouse effect heats its surface enough to melt lead.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�4b1d62f003e9�body�ٷ引力让暗物质和普通物质聚集成纤维状的墙、节点和空洞，星系沿这些纤维分布，整体像一张巨大的三维网，这是宇宙大尺度结构的标志。ٿGravity gathers dark and ordinary matter into filamentary walls, nodes, and voids, with galaxies strung along the filaments like a vast 3D web—the signature of cosmic large-scale structure.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�4b82f243b339�body���现代秒长由铯-133 原子基态两个超精细能级之间跃迁所对应的辐射 9,192,631,500 个周期定义，全世界通过原子钟联网保持协调世界时(UTC)，再按经度划分时区得到本地时间。��The modern second is defined by 9,192,631,500 cycles of the radiation corresponding to the hyperfine transition of the cesium-133 ground state; atomic clocks worldwide keep UTC, and time zones offset it by longitude.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�4c9d6d4e5c39�body�ٟ夏天夜空朝向银河系中心方向，密集的恒星与星云尽收眼底；冬天朝向银盘边缘，恒星较稀疏，所以夏季星更密集明亮。ٛIn summer the night side faces the Milky Way's center, rich with stars and nebulae; in winter it faces the disk's edge, sparser—so summer looks starrier.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�4e40410bd7a0�body��B月球引力太小，留不住气体分子，大气早已散逸。�+Its weak gravity let gases escape long ago.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�4eddd91d585e�body�ٱ盖亚以极高精度测量超过十亿颗恒星的位置、视差、自行和亮度，绘制出最详尽的银河系三维地图，刷新了我们对银河系结构的认识。��Gaia measures positions, parallaxes, proper motions, and brightness for over a billion stars with extreme precision, building the most detailed 3D map of the Milky Way and reshaping our view of its structure.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�502d76324d8a�body��r比邻星约4.2光年远，化学火箭需上万年；要实用必须靠更先进推进或接近光速的设想。لProxima Centauri is ~4.2 light-years away; chemical rockets would take tens of thousands of years, so advanced propulsion is needed.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�527531d39bb2�body��\EHT 将横跨地球的多架射电望远镜用甚长基线干涉（VLBI）合成一架口径相当于地球直径的虚拟望远镜，在 1.3 毫米波长观测 M87 星系中心黑洞与银心人马座 A 星。亮环来自吸积盘光在强引力下的引力透镜，中心暗区即为黑洞阴影——事件视界附近光子捕获区的投影。�nThe EHT linked radio telescopes across Earth via very-long-baseline interferometry into a virtual telescope the size of the planet, observing the M87 central black hole and Sagittarius A* at 1.3 mm. The bright ring is gravitationally lensed disk emission; the central dark region is the black-hole shadow—the projection of the photon-capture zone near the horizon.�ans��src��9EHT 合作组（M87 与银心成像论文，ApJ 专刊）�XEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration (M87 and Sgr A* imaging papers, ApJ special issue)��id�531393f89fc7�body��引力波让我们能用一种全新的方式聆听宇宙，直接观测黑洞并合这类看不见的事件。它独立于光，可以穿透尘埃和物质，带来电磁波无法提供的信息。与望远镜结合，引力波开启了多信使天文学的新时代。�9Gravitational waves let us listen to the universe in a wholly new way, directly observing invisible events like black-hole mergers. Independent of light, they penetrate dust and matter, delivering information no electromagnetic wave can. Combined with telescopes, they opened the era of multi-messenger astronomy.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�53365dcb0015�body��i土卫六是太阳系里唯一拥有浓密大气层的卫星，地表气压约为地球的1.5倍，主要成分是氮气。它离太阳很远、温度极低，甲烷在表面以液态存在，形成了类似地球水循环的甲烷循环，有雨、有河、有湖。惠更斯探测器2005年降落其表面时，就拍到了被甲烷河流切割过的地貌。��Titan is the only moon in the Solar System with a thick atmosphere, its surface pressure about 1.5 times Earth's and composed mainly of nitrogen. Far from the Sun and bitterly cold, methane exists as a liquid there, driving a methane cycle like Earth's water cycle, complete with rain, rivers, and lakes. When the Huygens probe landed on its surface in 2005, it photographed terrain carved by methane rivers.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�5353fae05cf9�body�ِ因为岁差让恒星相对天极和春分点缓慢移动，几千年来方向已偏移；这反而帮考古学家推算建筑的建造年代。٨Precession slowly shifts stars relative to the pole and equinox over millennia, so alignments no longer match—which actually helps archaeologists date the structures.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�54f245f2e51f�body��Y水星离太阳很近，白昼正对太阳的一面温度可超过400摄氏度，而夜晚背阴面可降至零下170摄氏度左右。它几乎没有大气层来储存和传导热量，加上自转缓慢，导致一个昼夜漫长，表面热量迅速散失。这种极端温差使水星成为太阳系中表面气候最严酷的行星之一。��Mercury is very close to the Sun, so its dayside can exceed 400 degrees Celsius while its nightside drops to about minus 170 degrees Celsius. It has almost no atmosphere to store and redistribute heat, and its slow rotation makes each day and night very long, allowing surface heat to escape quickly. These factors make Mercury one of the most thermally extreme worlds in the Solar System.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�5604f3efff72�body�٨通过分析谱线周期性的蓝移与红移，多普勒效应能测出恒星沿视线方向的运动速度，用于发现系外行星、双星和星系内的运动。٣Periodic blue- and red-shifts in spectra let the Doppler effect measure line-of-sight velocity, used to find exoplanets, binary stars, and internal galaxy motions.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�561cf669fb51�body�ٜ以流星看似发出的方向（辐射点）所在的星座命名：辐射点在英仙座就叫英仙座流星雨，在双子座就叫双子座流星雨。�nThey are named after the constellation containing the radiant—the point from which meteors appear to stream.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�56bc6164fcd0�body��TRAPPIST-1是一颗距地球约40光年的超冷红矮星，周围有7颗大小接近地球的岩石行星，其中数颗位于宜居带。这些行星彼此靠得很近，从某颗行星表面甚至能看到邻星如月亮般大。它是最重要的系外行星研究目标之一。�,TRAPPIST-1 is an ultracool red dwarf about 40 light-years away with seven Earth-sized rocky planets, several in the habitable zone. The planets are so close together that from one you could see a neighbor as large as the Moon in the sky. It is among the most important targets for exoplanet research.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�58540a896774�body��8太阳风中的带电粒子沿地球磁力线被引导到两极附近的高空，与氧、氮原子碰撞并使其激发，原子回到基态时放出特定波长的光，形成极光。因为磁力线在两极汇聚，所以带电粒子主要进入极区大气，极光也因此集中出现在高纬度地区。��Charged particles from the solar wind are guided by Earth's magnetic field lines into the upper atmosphere near the poles, where they collide with and excite oxygen and nitrogen atoms; as the atoms return to their ground state they emit light of specific wavelengths, creating auroras. Because field lines converge at the poles, particles enter mainly in polar regions, so auroras concentrate at high latitudes.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�588c9d27f14f�body��矮行星需满足：绕太阳公转、自身重力使其接近球形、但未能清空轨道附近的其他天体。它比大行星少最后一条要求，所以冥王星、谷神星、阋神星等都属此类。矮行星是太阳系小天体中的重要一类。�A dwarf planet must orbit the Sun, be roughly round under its own gravity, but have failed to clear its orbital neighborhood. It lacks only the last condition of a full planet, so Pluto, Ceres and Eris qualify. Dwarf planets are an important class of small solar-system bodies.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�5895b090e0e8�body��&日食发生在月球运行到太阳和地球之间，遮挡住太阳光，只在地球上狭窄的带状区域可见。月食则是地球运行到太阳和月球之间，地球影子投到月球上，使整面月球变暗，半个地球都能看到。日食必在新月，月食必在满月。�bA solar eclipse happens when the Moon passes between the Sun and Earth and blocks the Sun's light, visible only along a narrow path on Earth. A lunar eclipse occurs when Earth lies between the Sun and Moon and casts its shadow onto the Moon, dimming it so that half the Earth can see it. Solar eclipses occur at new Moon, and lunar eclipses at full Moon.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�5b77f154bde3�body�ٶ它把'银河系里能通讯的文明数量'拆成恒星形成率、宜居行星比例、演化出生命和技术的几率等因子相乘，是一个估算框架而非确定答案。ٸIt multiplies factors—star formation rate, fraction of habitable planets, odds of life and technology—to estimate communicating civilizations; it's a framework, not a fixed answer.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�5d628faeb226�body���折射望远镜用透镜聚光，反射望远镜用凹面镜聚光。大口径透镜会因自重变形并存在色差，因此现代大型望远镜几乎都采用反射式。反射镜可造得更大更轻，更适合专业天文观测。�Refracting telescopes use lenses to focus light, while reflectors use concave mirrors. Large lenses sag under their own weight and suffer chromatic aberration, so modern large telescopes are almost all reflectors. Mirrors can be built larger and lighter, suiting professional astronomy.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�6010c13fdfc6�body�ي当行星从恒星前方经过，恒星光穿过其大气，不同气体吸收特定波长，借此可分析大气成分如水和甲烷。ٜAs a planet transits, starlight passes through its atmosphere; different gases absorb specific wavelengths, revealing composition such as water and methane.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�6148fefebf34�body��*第一宇宙速度约为每秒7.9公里，是物体在地球表面附近绕地球做圆周运动所需的最小速度，也就是成为人造卫星的速度。低于它就会落回地面，达到它就能进入近地轨道。再快到第二宇宙速度（约11.2公里每秒）就能逃离地球。�&The first cosmic velocity is about 7.9 kilometers per second, the minimum speed needed to circle Earth near its surface and become a satellite. Below it the object falls back; at it, it enters low orbit. Faster still, at the second cosmic velocity of about 11.2 km/s, it escapes Earth entirely.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�61e91cd3d55c�body�٫土卫二南极的裂缝喷出含水的冰晶羽流，源自冰壳下的液态海洋，其中检测到有机物和氢气，暗示可能具备支持生命的化学条件。٬Fissures at Enceladus's south pole jet plumes of water-ice crystals from a subsurface ocean; organics and hydrogen detected there hint at chemistry that could support life.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�63df17fa7c55�body��#金星高空有厚厚的硫酸云，由火山释放的硫化物和阳光反应生成，使天空呈现黄白色。云中的液滴会以硫酸雨形式下落，但因高温在到达地面前就蒸发，形成『永不落地』的酸雨循环。这层云也是强温室效应的重要一环。�NVenus has thick sulfuric-acid clouds high up, formed from volcanic sulfur compounds reacting with sunlight, giving the sky a yellow-white hue. Droplets fall as acid rain but evaporate before reaching the surface because of the heat, creating a rain that never lands. This cloud deck is also a key part of the strong greenhouse effect.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�65489743a6f5�body��4约 39 亿到 30 亿年前，大型小天体撞击月球正面，留下巨大的盆地，随后月幔部分熔融产生的玄武岩熔岩沿着撞击裂缝上涌，把盆地填平，形成月海。玄武岩富含铁、钛，颜色比月陆的斜长岩暗得多，所以月海在夜空中呈现暗色斑块。�RBetween roughly 3.9 and 3.0 billion years ago, giant impacts on the Moon's near side left huge basins; basaltic lava from partial melting of the mantle then rose through fractures and flooded them, forming the maria. Basalt is rich in iron and titanium and much darker than the highlands' anorthosite, so the maria appear as dark patches.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�66371b3eb600�body��天体生物学研究生命在宇宙中的起源、演化、分布与未来，横跨天文学、生物学、地质学与化学。它既探索地球生命如何从非生命物质诞生，也评估火星、冰卫星与系外行星上出现生命的可能性。�Astrobiology studies the origin, evolution, distribution, and future of life in the universe, spanning astronomy, biology, geology, and chemistry. It explores both how Earth life emerged from non-living matter and whether life could arise on Mars, icy moons, or exoplanets.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�6667485352e7�body��事件视界是黑洞周围的一个边界，越过它任何物质或光都无法逃脱黑洞的引力，因此外部观测者看不到视界内的信息。它的半径（史瓦西半径）正比于黑洞质量，是黑洞「只进不出」这一特性的几何体现。�FThe event horizon is the boundary around a black hole beyond which nothing, not even light, can escape its gravity, so an outside observer cannot see any information from within. Its radius, the Schwarzschild radius, is proportional to the black hole mass and embodies the geometric nature of the black hole's one-way passage.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�669666a8e172�body�ٝFRB 是毫秒级的极强射电闪，多数来自银河系外，部分重复爆发已被定位到年轻磁星，但多数一次性暴的源头仍无定论。ٵFRBs are millisecond flashes of intense radio waves, mostly from beyond our galaxy; some repeaters trace to young magnetars, but the sources of most one-off bursts remain unsettled.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�6837a3e9f91f�body��恒星个头差距惊人。像史蒂文森2-18这样的红超巨星，半径约为太阳的2000倍，放到太阳的位置上会把土星轨道都吞进去；而中子星只有一座城市那么大，直径约二十公里。太阳在两者之间属于很普通的恒星。�>The spread in stellar size is astonishing. A red hypergiant like Stephenson 2-18 is roughly 2,000 times the Sun's radius, so placed where the Sun is it would engulf Saturn's orbit, while a neutron star spans only about twenty kilometres, the size of a city. The Sun sits between these extremes as a very ordinary star.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�68fc3ae78c30�body��地球同步卫星运行在赤道上空约36000公里处，轨道周期恰好等于地球自转周期（24小时），方向与地球自转相同。从地面看，它始终停在同一经度上空，犹如静止。通信、电视和气象卫星常采用这种轨道。�A geostationary satellite orbits about 36,000 kilometers above the equator with a period equal to Earth's 24-hour rotation and in the same direction. From the ground it appears fixed over one longitude, as if motionless. Communications, TV and weather satellites often use this orbit.�ans��src��x阿瑟·克拉克 1945 年《无线电世界》(Wireless World) 地球静止轨道设想；NASA 地球静止轨道说明�]Arthur C. Clarke's 1945 Wireless World geostationary-orbit proposal; NASA geostationary orbit��id�69d789108bc3�body���1859 年 9 月，一次超强太阳爆发引发史上最强地磁暴，地磁感应电流让低纬度的电报机起火，连加勒比海地区都能看到极光。当时世界主要依赖电报；今天电网、卫星导航和通信系统对地磁暴更加脆弱，科学家估计同样规模的超级磁暴可能造成巨大的经济损失，因此把它作为最坏情况来研究。��In September 1859 an extreme solar storm produced the strongest geomagnetic storm on record: induced currents set low-latitude telegraph systems on fire, and auroras were even seen in the Caribbean. The 1859 world depended mainly on telegraphs, while today's power grids, satellite navigation and communications are far more vulnerable, so scientists study a similar superstorm as a worst-case scenario given its potentially enormous economic cost.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�6a153c1f03d7�body��8从地球看，外行星在大部分时间顺行，但当地球从内侧追上并超过它时，相对视角变化使行星在星空背景上短暂向西逆行。这叫『行星逆行』，并非行星真的反向运动，而是地球更快的公转造成的视错觉。古代天文学家曾为此大伤脑筋。�'From Earth, outer planets usually move eastward, but when Earth overtakes one on the inside, the changing viewpoint makes it briefly drift westward against the stars. This 'retrograde motion' is not real reversal but an illusion from Earth's faster orbit. It puzzled ancient astronomers greatly.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�6a9f3b1db55e�body��土星的光环主要由无数冰块和岩石碎屑组成，颗粒大小从微小尘埃到几米大的石块不等。这些物质大多由水冰构成，所以能强烈反射阳光，使光环明亮可见。土星强大的潮汐力阻止了这些碎屑聚合成一颗卫星。�BSaturn's rings are made of countless pieces of ice and rock debris, ranging in size from tiny dust grains to boulders several meters across. Most of the material is water ice, which reflects sunlight strongly and makes the rings bright. Saturn's powerful tidal forces prevent the debris from clumping together into a moon.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�6be10b2069cf�body��卡西尼号探测器多次飞掠土卫二，发现其南极喷出含有水、盐和有机分子的羽状喷流，喷出物质中还有与海底热液活动相关的微粒。这些喷流的源头只能是一个位于冰壳之下、与岩石核接触的液态水海洋。�OThe Cassini spacecraft flew past Enceladus repeatedly and observed plumes jetting from its south pole that contain water, salts and organic molecules, including grains linked to hydrothermal activity on the seafloor. The only plausible source of these jets is a liquid-water ocean beneath the icy crust, in contact with the rocky core.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�6f6f0368f9d5�body��伽利略在1610年发现的四颗大卫星——木卫一至木卫四，各具特色：木卫一火山活跃，木卫二冰壳下疑似有海洋，木卫三最大且自带磁场，木卫四布满撞击坑。它们像一个小行星系统，是研究卫星演化的天然实验室。�?The four large moons Galileo found in 1610, Io through Callisto, are each distinctive: Io is volcanically active, Europa likely hides an ocean under ice, Ganymede is the largest with its own magnetic field, and Callisto is heavily cratered. They resemble a mini planetary system and are natural labs for moon evolution.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�712d3231a2d6�body��#超新星是大质量恒星生命末期发生的剧烈爆炸，短时间内亮度可超过整个星系。爆炸把恒星外层物质抛向太空，并合成许多重元素如金和铁。其中心往往留下中子星或黑洞，而抛出的物质会成为新一代恒星和行星的原料。�\A supernova is a violent explosion at the end of a massive star's life, briefly outshining an entire galaxy. The blast throws the star's outer layers into space and forges many heavy elements such as iron and gold. Its core often leaves behind a neutron star or black hole, while the ejected material becomes raw material for new stars and planets.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�7298aa1b8559�body��X埃德温·哈勃根据形状把星系分为椭圆星系、旋涡星系（包括棒旋星系）和不规则星系三大类。按形态从椭圆到旋涡的排列图状如音叉，故称“哈勃音叉图”；哈勃曾以为这是一种从椭圆到旋涡的演化序列，现在知道它主要反映的是星系结构和形成历史的差异。�\Edwin Hubble classified galaxies by shape into ellipticals, spirals (including barred spirals) and irregulars. Arranged by morphology, the diagram looks like a tuning fork, hence its name; Hubble once thought it was an evolutionary sequence from ellipticals to spirals, but it is now known to reflect differences in structure and formation history.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�730239cb1760�body��S南极-艾特肯盆地是月球上最大、最古老的确认撞击盆地，直径约 2500 公里，深达 8 公里以上，深坑暴露了月球深部地壳甚至可能的上地幔物质。嫦娥四号就在盆地内的冯·卡门撞击坑软着陆，直接探测那里的月表物质，为研究月球内部结构提供了独特样本。�hThe South Pole-Aitken basin is the Moon's largest and oldest confirmed impact basin, roughly 2,500 km across and more than 8 km deep, exposing deep crustal and possibly upper-mantle material. China's Chang'e-4 landed softly inside it at Von Karman crater and directly probes the surface material there, offering unique samples for studying the Moon's interior.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�73dec0f7483f�body��水星几乎没有大气来储存和传递热量，向阳面温度可超过400摄氏度，背阳面则降到约零下180摄氏度。它自转又慢，一个水星日相当于约176个地球日，昼夜持续时间极长。缺少大气调节是温差惊人的根本原因。�&Mercury has almost no atmosphere to store and move heat, so its dayside exceeds 400 degrees Celsius while the nightside drops to about minus 180. It also rotates slowly, with one Mercurian day lasting about 176 Earth days. The lack of an atmospheric blanket is the root cause of the huge swing.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�745c0c21ce0e�body���水星自转轴几乎不倾斜，两极有些永久阴影的撞击坑从未被阳光直射，温度低至约 -200℃，从彗星撞击带来的水或太阳风氢氧结合的水得以以冰的形式保存。��Mercury's axis is barely tilted, so some polar impact craters stay in permanent shadow and never receive direct sunlight, reaching about -200°C; water delivered by comet impacts or formed from solar-wind hydrogen and oxygen can survive there as ice.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�746f28d02ebe�body��2这被称为奥伯斯佯谬。一种解释是宇宙的年龄有限，远处星光还没来得及到达我们；同时宇宙在膨胀，遥远星光被红移削弱。再加上恒星数量虽多但并非无限，所以夜空总体是暗的。这一悖论引导人们认识到宇宙的有限年龄与膨胀。�EThis is Olbers' paradox. One resolution is that the universe is finitely old, so distant starlight has not yet arrived, and expansion redshifts and weakens far light. Also, while stars are many, they are not infinite in number, so the sky stays dark overall. The paradox helped reveal the universe's finite age and expansion.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�773a730e720f�body�ٜ太阳带电粒子被地球磁场引导，沿磁力线汇聚到南北磁极上空，与大气分子碰撞发光，所以极光多出现在高纬度地区。ٝSolar charged particles are steered by Earth's magnetic field to the magnetic poles, where they hit air molecules and glow—so auroras favor high latitudes.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�787ca72a7676�body��b单级火箭要把沉重的贮箱、发动机和壳体一路驮到入轨，绝大多数燃料都浪费在加速这些死重上。多级火箭燃料烧完就抛掉空壳体，让剩下的部分更轻，可以用同样多的燃料飞得更快。土星五号有三级，猎鹰九号也有两个大段，分级是航天上应对引力损失的标准做法。��A single-stage rocket would have to haul its heavy tanks, engines, and structure all the way to orbit, wasting most of its fuel on accelerating that dead weight. A multi-stage rocket drops the emptied shell once its fuel is spent, leaving a lighter vehicle that can fly faster with the same propellant. The Saturn V had three stages and the Falcon 9 has two big sections; staging is the standard way to beat the penalty of gravity.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�789fbf5424c9�body��赫罗图以恒星的光度（或绝对星等）对表面温度（或光谱型）作图，绝大多数恒星落在从左上到右下的主序带上。它直观展示了恒星的演化阶段与质量–光度的统计关系，是恒星天体物理学的基石工具。�The H–R diagram plots stellar luminosity (or absolute magnitude) against surface temperature (or spectral type); most stars lie on the diagonal main sequence. It reveals evolutionary stages and the mass–luminosity relation, forming a cornerstone of stellar astrophysics.�ans��src��LKippenhahn、Weigert 与 Weiss《恒星结构与演化》（Springer 2012）�MKippenhahn, Weigert & Weiss, Stellar Structure and Evolution (Springer, 2012)��id�79bad8abe6a2�body��	土星的平均密度约为每立方厘米0.69克，比水的密度还小，所以理论上若有足够大的水池，土星能漂浮。这是因为它主要由氢氦等轻质气体构成，没有致密固态表面。它的体积虽大，质量却相对『轻』。�Saturn's average density is about 0.69 grams per cubic centimeter, less than water, so in theory it would float in a large enough bath. This is because it is made mostly of light gases like hydrogen and helium with no dense solid surface. Despite its huge size, it is relatively 'light'.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�7a1e3222ead4�body�ل火星环境比别处更接近地球，研究它有助于了解行星演化，也可能在未来成为人类的“第二家园”。�|Mars is more Earth-like than other worlds; studying it informs planetary evolution and could make it a future 'second home'.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�7a36ec125866�body�٫空洞内物质稀少、引力很弱，周围纤维和星系团较强的引力会把星系从空洞边缘拉走，使空洞随时间膨胀、星系向高密度区汇聚。ٷVoids have little mass and weak gravity, while surrounding filaments and clusters pull galaxies away from void edges, so voids expand over time as galaxies flow toward denser regions.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�7b0c24b35a91�body�ٻ由于岁差，春分点已西移约30度，今天的'白羊座'时段其实太阳位于双鱼座；且各星座大小不均，十二宫只是人为等分，与真实星空并不吻合。ټBecause of precession the vernal point has shifted ~30°, so the 'Aries' period now finds the Sun in Pisces; the 12 signs are equal slices that don't match the unequal real constellations.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�7b5d935738ac�body��彗星靠近太阳时，冰升华产生气体和尘埃，形成彗发和彗尾。太阳风把离子吹向背离太阳的一侧，形成离子尾；尘埃受辐射光压也偏向远离太阳的方向，形成尘埃尾。因此无论彗星朝哪飞，尾巴都朝外。�$As a comet nears the Sun, its ices sublimate into gas and dust, forming a coma and tails. The solar wind blows ions away from the Sun into an ion tail, while radiation pressure pushes dust outward into a dust tail. So whichever way the comet travels, its tails always point away from the Sun.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�7dbb10832e08�body��小行星带主要位于火星和木星轨道之间，距太阳约2.2到3.2天文单位，聚集了数百万计的小天体。木星的强大引力阻止了它们聚合成一颗行星。虽然数量众多，但彼此间距很大，探测器穿越时并不危险。�The main asteroid belt lies between the orbits of Mars and Jupiter, about 2.2 to 3.2 astronomical units from the Sun, holding millions of small bodies. Jupiter's strong gravity prevented them from accreting into a planet. Though numerous, they are far apart, so probes cross safely.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�7e347c024bf3�body��l2017 年 IceCube 探测到一颗高能缪子中微子（IceCube-170922A），其到来方向指向耀变体 TXS 0506+056，而该天体当时正发生伽马射线耀发，多波段望远镜的协同观测显著提高了关联的可信度。此外回溯分析还发现该源在 2014–2015 年间曾有中微子超出，支持其作为宇宙线加速源的身份。��In 2017 IceCube detected a high-energy muon neutrino, IceCube-170922A, whose arrival direction pointed back to the blazar TXS 0506+056, which was then undergoing a gamma-ray flare, and coordinated multiwavelength observations strengthened the association. A retrospective analysis also found a neutrino excess from this source in 2014–2015, supporting its role as a cosmic-ray accelerator.�ans��src�پZhang, Petropoulou, Murase, Oikonomou,《A Neutral Beam Model for High-energy Neutrino Emission from the Blazar TXS 0506+056》,The Astrophysical Journal,2020 (DOI: 10.3847/1538-4357/ab659a)ټZhang, Petropoulou, Murase, Oikonomou, 'A Neutral Beam Model for High-energy Neutrino Emission from the Blazar TXS 0506+056', The Astrophysical Journal, 2020, DOI: 10.3847/1538-4357/ab659a��id�7eae269de5d4�body��]着陆要经历进入、下降和着陆三步。探测器以约每小时2万公里冲入稀薄大气，靠隔热罩减速，然后打开超声速降落伞进一步减速，最后阶段各任务各有招数：勇气号、机遇号靠气囊弹跳，好奇号和毅力号则用空中吊车，在最后几十米把火星车用缆绳缓缓放到地面。��Landing runs through entry, descent, and touchdown. The probe slams into the thin atmosphere at about 20,000 kilometres per hour, sheds speed with a heat shield, then deploys a supersonic parachute. The final stage differs by mission: Spirit and Opportunity bounced in airbags, while Curiosity and Perseverance used the sky crane, lowering each rover on cables over the last few dozen metres.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�7f12697b3b52�body��星云是太空中巨大而稀薄的气体和尘埃云，主要由氢组成。有些星云是恒星诞生的摇篮，有些则是恒星死亡后抛出的残骸。在望远镜中，它们常呈现红、蓝、绿等绚丽色彩。著名的猎户座大星云就是一处恒星育婴室。�0A nebula is a vast, thin cloud of gas and dust in space, made mainly of hydrogen. Some nebulae are nurseries where new stars are born, while others are the remnants ejected by dying stars. Through telescopes they often show vivid red, blue, and green colors. The famous Orion Nebula is a stellar nursery.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�8043880058dd�body��K地轴倾斜，地球公转时不同地区受日照强弱随季节变化。�?Earth's tilted axis changes sunlight strength through the year.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�80757995f72a�body��嗜极生物是在高温、高压、强酸、高盐或辐射等极端环境中存活的微生物，比如深海热泉口一百多摄氏度的水中生活的细菌。它们证明生命的耐受范围远比想象的大，从而大大拓宽了宇宙中可能存在生命的场所。�Extremophiles are microbes that thrive in extreme conditions such as high temperature, high pressure, strong acidity, high salinity or radiation, for example bacteria living in water above one hundred degrees Celsius at deep-sea hydrothermal vents. They show that life's tolerance is far broader than once thought, widening the range of places where life might exist in the universe.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�836fbe80fd59�body���太阳膨胀时，水星和金星会被吞没，地球即使因为太阳质量流失而把轨道向外推一些，也很可能被吞掉或被烤成焦炭。就算侥幸幸存，地表温度也会高得让海洋全部蒸发，生命早已无法存续。�;As the Sun swells, Mercury and Venus will be swallowed, and even if Earth's orbit drifts outward a little because the Sun loses mass, our planet will most likely be engulfed too or scorched to a cinder. Even if it survived, the surface would be far too hot, with every ocean boiled away, so life would be long gone.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�8403af597ec9�body��\变暗变亮主要有两类原因：一类是几何原因，比如食双星（如大陵五）中两颗星互相绕转，一颗星周期性遮住另一颗；另一类是恒星自身的物理变化，比如米拉这类长周期变星，其外层会周期性膨胀收缩，改变温度和光度。通过观测光变曲线可以区分这两种机制。�cThere are two main causes. Geometric ones occur in eclipsing binaries such as Algol, where two stars orbit each other and one periodically covers the other; physical ones occur in pulsating stars like Mira, whose outer layers rhythmically expand and contract, changing temperature and luminosity. Light curves allow the two mechanisms to be distinguished.�ans��src��*《天文学概论》（双星与变星）�IAU (variable stars)��id�840cf45582b9�body��特洛伊小行星聚集在行星轨道上的拉格朗日点 L4 与 L5 附近，与行星同步绕太阳运行而长期保持稳定。最著名的是木星特洛伊群，数量以十万计；2021 年露西号任务正是赴外太阳系探访这些早期太阳系的「化石」。�@Trojan asteroids cluster near the L4 and L5 Lagrange points of a planet's orbit, co-orbiting the Sun with the planet in long-term stable configurations. The best known are the Jupiter Trojans, numbering in the hundreds of thousands; NASA's 2021 Lucy mission was launched to visit these fossils of the early Solar System.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�841b0fe795ce�body��H星光穿过动荡的大气层时发生折射，看起来忽明忽暗。�=Starlight refracts through turbulent air, seeming to flicker.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�873c33f68ba8�body�ٳ2005 年发现的阋神星质量甚至略大于冥王星，说明外太阳系还有类似天体，促使天文学界重新定义行星，间接导致冥王星被归为矮行星。��Eris, found in 2005, is slightly more massive than Pluto, showing that similar bodies exist in the outer solar system; this pushed astronomers to redefine planet, indirectly demoting Pluto to a dwarf planet.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�892608fb368a�body��金星被浓密的二氧化碳大气和硫酸云包裹，大气压约为地球的 90 倍，温室效应使其表面温度高达约 460 摄氏度，比水星还热。金星的表面布满火山地貌和缓慢流动的熔岩平原，过去可能长期处于火山活动状态。�^Venus is wrapped in a dense carbon-dioxide atmosphere with sulfuric-acid clouds at about 90 times Earth's pressure; the runaway greenhouse effect heats its surface to about 460 degrees Celsius, hotter than Mercury. Its surface is covered with volcanic landforms and slowly moving lava plains, and it was probably volcanically active for long periods.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�89e9b484249e�body��$分子云局部密度涨落引发引力坍缩，角动量守恒使下落物质形成绕中心原恒星旋转的扁平盘。盘内尘埃与气体在冷区凝聚成星子，进而吸积成行星。太阳系约 46 亿年前也始于这样的原行星盘（陨石中保存了其成分记录）。�>Density fluctuations in a molecular cloud trigger gravitational collapse; angular-momentum conservation flattens infalling matter into a rotating disk around the protostar. Dust and gas condense into planetesimals that accrete into planets. The Solar System, ~4.6 Gyr ago, began in such a disk, recorded in meteorites.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�8a72e9e96d09�body�١岁差使地球自转轴进动，导致太阳沿黄道回到春分时，交点比上一年略向西（沿黄道逆向）挪动一点，约25800年绕天一周。ٯPrecession makes Earth's axis wobble, so the Sun's crossing back to the equinox shifts slightly westward along the ecliptic each year, completing a loop in about 25,800 years.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�8a734e68b20d�body�ٙ大爆炸是约138亿年前宇宙从一个极热极密状态开始膨胀冷却的起源事件，并非发生在某一点，而是空间本身的膨胀。ٹThe Big Bang is the origin about 13.8 billion years ago when the Universe began expanding and cooling from an extremely hot, dense state—not an explosion in space but of space itself.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�8b053f66992e�body���一次伽马暴在几秒到几分钟内释放的能量可堪比恒星一生的辐射，且集中于狭窄喷流，若在远处对准地球，瞬时亮度超过整个可见宇宙的其他天体总和。��A gamma-ray burst can release in seconds to minutes energy rivaling a star's whole lifetime, focused into narrow jets; if aimed at Earth from afar, its brief flash outshines everything else in the visible universe combined.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�8b9b63a16e94�body�ٟ火星表面富含氧化铁，也就是铁锈，使土壤和岩石呈现红色。火星大气层稀薄，表面有巨大的峡谷和太阳系最高的火山。٫Mars is rich in iron oxide, or rust, which gives its soil and rocks a red color. It has a thin atmosphere, enormous canyons, and the tallest volcanoes in the solar system.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�8cbda6087405�body��r春分和秋分时太阳光直射赤道，全球各地昼夜几乎等长，此后昼夜长短开始反向变化。َAt the equinoxes the Sun shines directly on the equator, so day and night are nearly equal everywhere, then their lengths shift the other way.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�8ce0d8fccd7a�body�ٓ有。在月球两极永久阴影的陨石坑里发现了水冰，这些水未来或可支持月球基地的饮用、呼吸与制造火箭燃料。وYes. Water ice has been found in permanently shadowed craters near the lunar poles, potentially useful for future bases and rocket fuel.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�8d62ceecbbeb�body��类星体本身不是黑洞，而是活动星系核中最明亮的一类，由中心超大质量黑洞吸积物质释放巨大能量所驱动。黑洞是看不见的引擎，而类星体是我们观测到的强烈辐射。它们本质上是同一系统的不同表现。�FA quasar is not the black hole itself but among the brightest class of active galactic nuclei, powered by a central supermassive black hole accreting matter and releasing enormous energy. The black hole is the invisible engine, while the quasar is the intense radiation we observe. They are different faces of the same system.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�8e49c3494439�body��是的，木星、天王星和海王星也都拥有行星环，只是不如土星环明亮壮观。这些环大多由冰和岩石碎屑组成，可能是被潮汐力撕碎的卫星残骸。土星环之所以最显眼，主要是因为它更宽更亮且含冰更多。��Yes, Jupiter, Uranus and Neptune all have rings, though none are as bright and grand as Saturn's. They are mostly ice and rock debris, possibly remnants of moons torn apart by tides. Saturn's rings stand out because they are wider, brighter and icier.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�8f56b03fcb83�body�٥柯伊伯带是位于海王星轨道外、由冰质小天体组成的盘状区域，短周期彗星源于此；奥尔特云是更遥远、近似球壳的彗星库。ټThe Kuiper Belt is a disk-shaped region of icy bodies beyond Neptune that supplies short-period comets, whereas the Oort Cloud is a far more distant, roughly spherical reservoir of comets.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�914b3f552b03�body�ٽ不一定。满月出现在月球、地球、太阳近似成直线的时刻，和农历日期并不严格对应，常落在十五或十六，民间有“十五的月亮十六圆”之说。ِNot always. Full moon occurs when Moon-Earth-Sun align, which doesn't exactly match the lunar calendar date; it often falls on the 15th or 16th.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�923257f6939f�body��宇宙微波背景是充满全天的微弱微波辐射，源自大爆炸后约38万年宇宙冷却到足以让光子自由穿行时释放的“余晖”。它温度约2.7开尔文，是大爆炸最直接的化石证据。其均匀性中的微小涨落孕育了后来的星系。�SThe cosmic microwave background is a faint microwave glow filling the sky, the “afterglow” released about 380,000 years after the Big Bang when the universe cooled enough for photons to travel freely. At about 2.7 kelvin, it is the most direct fossil evidence of the Big Bang. Tiny fluctuations in its uniformity seeded later galaxies.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�9256cf228198�body�٨自行是恒星在天球上相对于背景的横向位置变化，反映它穿越空间的实际运动，常与视差、径向速度一起构建恒星的立体运动。ٽProper motion is a star's transverse shift across the sky relative to the background, reflecting its true motion through space; with parallax and radial velocity it builds a full 3D motion.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�96b08523c108�body���旋涡星系保留丰富的冷气体与尘埃，持续形成年轻蓝星，旋臂清晰；椭圆星系则几乎耗尽冷气体，以年老、偏红的星族为主，形态光滑无旋臂。这反映了两者不同的并合与恒星形成历史。�Spiral galaxies retain rich cold gas and dust, host ongoing star formation with young blue stars, and show clear arms; ellipticals have exhausted cold gas, are dominated by old, redder populations, and are smooth and armless—reflecting different merger and star-formation histories.�ans��src��MBinney & Merrifield《银河天文学》（Princeton University Press 1998）�JBinney & Merrifield, Galactic Astronomy (Princeton University Press, 1998)��id�98d6623cd6e9�body��大多数行星自转方向与公转一致，金星却相反，而且转得非常慢，一个金星日约243个地球日。一种解释是它早期遭巨大天体撞击，把自转方向打乱。浓厚的云层和潮汐作用也可能后来进一步改变了它的转速。�Most planets spin the same way they orbit, but Venus spins the opposite way and very slowly, with a Venus day of about 243 Earth days. One explanation is a giant impact early on that flipped its rotation. Thick clouds and tidal effects may also have slowed and reversed it later.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�98fd39021405�body��$主要方法有两种：凌星法观察行星从恒星前方经过时造成的微小亮度下降，径向速度法则测恒星因行星引力产生的轻微摆动。此外还有直接成像、微引力透镜等方法。开普勒和TESS等空间望远镜主要靠凌星法批量发现行星。�sThe two main methods are the transit method, which catches the tiny dimming when a planet passes in front of its star, and the radial-velocity method, which measures the slight wobble a star makes under a planet's gravity. There are also direct imaging and microlensing techniques. Missions like Kepler and TESS largely rely on the transit method to find planets in bulk.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�98fded37c019�body��&彗星被称为『脏雪球』，主要由水冰、二氧化碳冰、甲烷冰混合岩石尘埃组成，核心直径通常几到几十公里。远离太阳时它只是一个冰封的核，靠近太阳才活跃起来喷出气体和尘埃。它们被认为是太阳系早期物质的活化石。�1Comets are 'dirty snowballs' of water, carbon-dioxide and methane ices mixed with rock and dust, with nuclei a few to tens of kilometers across. Far from the Sun they are frozen cores; only near the Sun do they wake up and vent gas and dust. They are thought to be frozen relics of the early solar system.�ans��src��K惠普尔 1950 年《天体物理学报》(ApJ) 彗星『脏雪球』模型�0Whipple (1950, ApJ) 'dirty snowball' comet model��id�9aaf4ec29448�body��;红巨星是低到中等质量恒星（约 8 倍太阳质量以内）离开主序后外层膨胀、表面冷却的结果；红超巨星则是大质量恒星演化晚期的更庞大阶段。二者膨胀程度主要由恒星初始质量与外层氢壳层的产能率决定，超巨星半径可达太阳的数百倍。�URed giants are the expanded, cooled envelopes of low-to-intermediate mass stars (within ~8 solar masses) after leaving the main sequence; red supergiants are the even larger late stage of massive stars. The extent of expansion is set mainly by initial mass and the hydrogen-shell burning rate—supergiants can reach hundreds of solar radii.�ans��src��LKippenhahn、Weigert 与 Weiss《恒星结构与演化》（Springer 2012）�MKippenhahn, Weigert & Weiss, Stellar Structure and Evolution (Springer, 2012)��id�9bd0331bfb28�body��>TRAPPIST-1 是一颗距地球约 40 光年的超冷红矮星，周围有七颗地球大小的岩石行星，其中多颗位于宜居带内。由于行星排布紧凑且频繁凌星，它成为韦伯望远镜用透射光谱逐个刻画大气成分的理想实验室，用于检验类地行星是否普遍拥有大气。�hTRAPPIST-1 is an ultracool red dwarf about 40 light-years away with seven Earth-sized rocky planets, several of them inside the habitable zone. Because the planets are tightly packed and transit frequently, it is an ideal laboratory for Webb to characterize atmospheric composition one by one and to test whether Earth-like planets commonly retain atmospheres.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�9f8ad784a1b4�body��暗能量是一种充满空间、产生排斥性引力并驱动宇宙加速膨胀的神秘成分，约占宇宙总能量的七成。它最简单的模型是爱因斯坦引入又放弃的“宇宙学常数”。其本质仍是当代物理学最大的未解之谜之一。�QDark energy is a mysterious component pervading space that produces repulsive gravity and drives the accelerated expansion, making up about 70 percent of the universe's energy. Its simplest model is the cosmological constant that Einstein introduced and later retracted. Its nature remains among the biggest unsolved problems in physics.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�a1aa0c2155a9�body���K2-18b 是一颗约 124 光年外的「Hycean」型亚海王星，韦伯 2023 年的透射光谱显示有甲烷和二氧化碳，并疑似存在二甲基硫醚（DMS），而 DMS 在地球上主要由海洋生物产生。但该信号统计显著性有限，且 DMS 的吸收与数据噪声及其他分子可能混淆，学界普遍认为还需更多观测才能确认，并将其视为「值得关注的候选」而非定论。��K2-18b is a Hycean-type sub-Neptune about 124 light-years away; Webb's 2023 transmission spectrum showed methane and carbon dioxide and a possible hint of dimethyl sulfide (DMS), a gas produced on Earth mainly by marine life. The signal has limited statistical significance and could be confused with noise or other molecules, so the community treats it as an intriguing candidate requiring more observations rather than a confirmed result.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�a28dec87179b�body�ٮ水星几乎没有大气层来重新分配热量，向阳面被烈日烤到约 430℃，背阳面热量迅速散失到太空，降至约 -180℃，因此昼夜温差极大。��Mercury has almost no atmosphere to redistribute heat; the sunlit side bakes to about 430°C while the night side radiates heat into space and drops to about -180°C, producing an enormous day-night swing.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�a2e983247ac2�body��)光谱是把光按波长展开后得到的彩虹状分布，其中包含暗线和亮线。每种元素只吸收或发射特定波长的光，因此光谱像指纹一样揭示天体的化学组成、温度和运动速度。没有光谱，我们就无法知道恒星和星系是由什么构成的。�BA spectrum is light spread out by wavelength into a rainbow-like pattern with dark and bright lines. Each element absorbs or emits only specific wavelengths, so the spectrum reveals a body's chemical makeup, temperature, and motion like a fingerprint. Without spectra we could not know what stars and galaxies are made of.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�a360fbc6cbe4�body��事件视界是黑洞周围的一条假想球面，也是逃逸速度恰好等于光速的边界。任何越过事件视界的物质或信息都无法再传回外界，因此视界之内对我们而言不可直接观测。视界的半径（史瓦西半径）与黑洞质量成正比。�@The event horizon is the imaginary spherical surface around a black hole where the escape velocity equals the speed of light. Anything that crosses it can never return information to the outside, so the interior is unobservable from beyond. Its radius, the Schwarzschild radius, is proportional to the black hole's mass.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�a45588c6e15e�body��o每年少算约0.24天，约每4年差近1天，上百年后同一日历日期会对应完全不同的季节。ُWithout it we'd lose ~0.24 day per year, drifting nearly a day every 4 years, so the same date would fall in different seasons after centuries.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�a6e0d18f1e0b�body��人马座A*是银河系中心的一个致密射电源，已被证实为一个约四百三十万太阳质量的超大质量黑洞。天文学家通过长期追踪绕其运行的恒星轨道，精确测定了它的质量。2022年事件视界望远镜发布了它的首张图像。�)Sagittarius A* is a compact radio source at the center of the Milky Way, confirmed as a supermassive black hole of about 4.3 million solar masses. Astronomers determined its mass precisely by tracking stars orbiting it over many years. In 2022 the Event Horizon Telescope released its first image.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�a6e2d342287f�body��)当系外行星从母恒星前方经过时，恒星光线会穿过行星大气的边缘薄层，大气中的原子和分子会吸收特定波长的光。对比凌星前后恒星光谱的差异，就能得到随波长变化的大气不透明度曲线，即透射光谱，用以识别大气成分。�\When an exoplanet transits in front of its host star, starlight filters through the thin limb of the planet's atmosphere, where atoms and molecules absorb specific wavelengths. Comparing the stellar spectrum before and during transit yields a wavelength-dependent opacity curve, the transmission spectrum, which reveals the atmospheric composition.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�a7387f6c9a88�body�٫月球自己不发光，我们看到的亮面是它被太阳照亮、且朝向地球的那部分；随着月球绕地位置变化，可见亮面从新月到满月循环。ٖThe Moon doesn't shine on its own; we see the sunlit part facing Earth, and as its position changes, the visible lit fraction cycles from new to full.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�a816f6fb00d8�body���主序星通过核心的氢核聚变（质子–质子链或 CNO 循环）将氢转化为氦，释放的能量以辐射压对抗引力坍缩，维持流体静力学平衡。太阳约 99% 的主序寿命都消耗在这一阶段。�+Main-sequence stars generate energy by core hydrogen fusion—the proton–proton chain or CNO cycle—converting hydrogen to helium. The released energy, as radiation pressure, balances gravity and maintains hydrostatic equilibrium. The Sun spends about 99% of its main-sequence life in this phase.�ans��src��XKippenhahn、Weigert 与 Weiss《恒星结构与演化》（Springer 2012，第 2 版）�VKippenhahn, Weigert & Weiss, Stellar Structure and Evolution (Springer, 2nd ed., 2012)��id�a85460b08f96�body�ـ旅行者1号和2号已飞出日球层、进入星际空间，是迄今飞得最远的人造物体，仍向地球传回数据。كVoyagers 1 and 2 have crossed the heliosphere into interstellar space—the farthest human-made objects—and still send data home.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�aa17a15f6521�body��/太阳活动以约 11 年为周期起伏，直接反映在黑子数量的变化上，从极小期到极大期再回落。太阳动力学天文台等卫星持续监测黑子、耀斑和磁场，还发现每隔约 22 年太阳整体磁场极性会完成一次翻转循环，因此称磁周期为 22 年。�iSolar activity rises and falls on a roughly 11-year cycle, most directly seen in sunspot counts, which climb from minimum to maximum and back. Satellites such as the Solar Dynamics Observatory continuously monitor sunspots, flares and magnetic fields, and also reveal that the Sun's overall magnetic polarity flips every 22 years or so, the full magnetic cycle.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�aa69d534d665�body���2006 年国际天文学联合会（IAU）定义行星须同时满足环绕太阳、呈流体静力平衡（近球形）并清空其轨道邻域。冥王星质量太小、轨道与海王星外天体群重叠，未清空轨道，故归为矮行星。��In 2006 the IAU defined a planet as orbiting the Sun, being in hydrostatic equilibrium (near-spherical), and having cleared its orbital neighborhood. Pluto is too small and shares its orbit with trans-Neptunian objects, so it is a dwarf planet.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�aa83a1150b04�body��.适度的温室效应是必要的，大气中的二氧化碳和水蒸气留住部分热量，使地表平均温度约15摄氏度，适宜生命。问题在于人类活动排放过多二氧化碳，增强了这种效应，导致全球变暖。所以温室效应本身不可或缺，过强才有问题。�nA moderate greenhouse effect is essential: carbon dioxide and water vapor trap some heat, keeping Earth's average temperature near 15 degrees Celsius, suitable for life. The problem is that human activity emits too much carbon dioxide and strengthens the effect, driving global warming. So the greenhouse effect itself is necessary; only an excessive one is harmful.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�aabf77833254�body��星际空间并非真空，而是充满极其稀薄的气体和尘埃，总称星际介质。气体以氢为主，尘埃是微米级的碳硅酸盐颗粒；星际介质约占银河系可见质量的百分之几，密度虽低，却决定了恒星如何形成和光线如何传播。�kInterstellar space is not a vacuum; it is filled with extremely tenuous gas and dust collectively called the interstellar medium. The gas is mostly hydrogen, and the dust consists of micrometer-scale carbon and silicate grains; though sparse, this medium makes up a few percent of the Milky Way's visible mass and shapes both star formation and how light travels.�ans��src��'《天文学概论》（星际介质）�ESO (interstellar medium)��id�abc418289aaf�body��暗物质是一种不发光、不与电磁波直接作用，却通过引力影响星系和宇宙大尺度结构的未知物质。它约占宇宙总质能的四分之一，远多于普通物质。其本质可能是尚未发现的基本粒子，如WIMP或轴子。�MDark matter is unknown matter that emits no light and does not interact directly with electromagnetic waves, yet exerts gravity shaping galaxies and large-scale structure. It makes up about a quarter of the universe's total mass-energy, far more than ordinary matter. Its nature may be undiscovered particles such as WIMPs or axions.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�ac25fd43d2a7�body�ن清明约在太阳到达黄经15度（春分之后的节气），冬至是太阳直射南回归线、北半球白昼最短的一天。ٛQingming is near 15° ecliptic longitude after the equinox; Dongzhi is when the Sun reaches the Tropic of Capricorn, the shortest day north of the equator.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�accb19af45b5�body���八大行星按组成分为类地行星（水星、金星、地球、火星）和巨行星（木星、土星、天王星、海王星）。类地行星体积小、以岩石为主，巨行星质量大、以气体或冰为主。��The eight planets fall into terrestrial planets (Mercury, Venus, Earth, Mars) and giant planets (Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, Neptune). Terrestrial planets are small and rocky, while giants are massive and made mostly of gas or ice.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�acfe43f60d40�body��可以。潮汐涨落带动大量水体运动，蕴含可观的机械能。人类在海湾或河口修筑潮汐电站，利用水位差驱动水轮发电，如法国的朗斯电站。潮汐规律而可预测，是稳定的清洁能源，但选址和生态影响较大。�2Yes. The rise and fall of tides move huge volumes of water, holding significant mechanical energy. People build tidal power plants in bays or estuaries that use the height difference to drive turbines, like France's Rance station. Tides are predictable clean energy, though siting and ecology are concerns.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�aea28536ee0a�body�٨流星是太空尘埃或小石块以每秒十几到几十公里闯入大气，与空气剧烈摩擦燃烧发光，通常在高空几秒内烧尽，留下短暂光迹。٘A meteor is dust or a pebble hitting the atmosphere at tens of km/s, burning up from friction and glowing for a few seconds before vanishing high above.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�aea9b0c55a07�body��&疏散星团由几百到几千颗年轻恒星组成，分布松散，多在银河系银盘里，如昴星团；球状星团则由几十万到上百万颗年老恒星挤成一个球体，分布在银晕中。两者的年龄和化学成分也不同，球状星团通常古老且金属含量低。�6Open clusters hold a few hundred to a few thousand young stars loosely spread through the galactic disk, such as the Pleiades; globular clusters pack hundreds of thousands to millions of old stars into a ball in the halo. Their ages and compositions also differ: globulars are typically ancient and metal-poor.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�aeabfceb343a�body��!哈勃于1990年升空，避开了大气扰动，拍摄了深场图像并精确测定了哈勃常数与宇宙年龄。它揭示了星系演化、恒星形成区以及系外行星大气透射光谱等众多发现。作为在轨三十余年的旗舰望远镜，它重塑了现代天文学。�?Launched in 1990, Hubble avoided atmospheric blur, captured deep-field images, and precisely measured the Hubble constant and cosmic age. It revealed galaxy evolution, star-forming regions, and exoplanet transmission spectra, among many findings. Operating in orbit for over three decades, it reshaped modern astronomy.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版天文分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�ZTen Thousand Whys: Astronomy volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�aedd5fc0df3e�body��火箭需要尽快穿过稠密的大气层以减少阻力和结构受力，垂直上升能最快获得高度。它还要加速到极高的水平速度才能入轨，垂直起飞便于随后逐步转向。若水平滑跑起飞，大气阻力和气动控制会困难得多。�/A rocket must climb through the dense lower atmosphere quickly to reduce drag and structural stress, and vertical ascent gains altitude fastest. It still needs huge horizontal speed to orbit, so it pitches over gradually after liftoff. Horizontal takeoff would face far harder drag and control problems.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�af5033ac4582�body�� 根据广义相对论，黑洞中心的物质会被无限压缩到一个体积为零、密度无穷大的点，这个点称为奇点。在奇点处，描述时空的几何量发散，现有物理定律失效。量子引力理论或许才能告诉我们奇点内部究竟发生了什么。�6According to general relativity, the matter at a black hole's center is compressed to a point of zero volume and infinite density, called the singularity. There the spacetime quantities diverge and known physical laws break down. A theory of quantum gravity may be needed to describe what truly happens inside.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�astro_19_002�body���毫秒脉冲星自转极其稳定,多年尺度的脉冲到达时刻可以预报到亚微秒精度。纳赫兹引力波会轻微拉伸和压缩地球与每颗脉冲星之间的时空,在各脉冲星的计时残差中留下符合背景预期角分布的相关信号。2023年6月,NANOGrav、EPTA、PPTA与中国脉冲星计时阵合作组联合报告了此类随机引力波背景存在的证据。��Millisecond pulsars rotate so steadily that their pulse arrival times can be predicted to sub-microsecond precision over many years. A passing nanohertz gravitational wave gently stretches and squeezes the spacetime between Earth and each pulsar, leaving correlated timing residuals whose angular pattern matches the expectation for a stochastic background. In June 2023 the NANOGrav, EPTA, PPTA and CPTA collaborations jointly reported evidence for exactly such a background.�ans��src�هAgazie 等(NANOGrav 合作组),2023年,The Astrophysical Journal Letters,951卷L8号:15年数据集中的纳赫兹引力波背景证据�Agazie et al. (NANOGrav Collaboration) 2023, ApJL, 951, L8 - Evidence for a gravitational-wave background in the 15 yr data set��id�astro_19_005�body���这条谱线来自氢原子基态的超精细结构跃迁,自发跃迁概率极低,但银河系中性氢的总质量巨大,足以产生明亮的可观测发射。21厘米处于射电波段,几乎不受尘埃消光影响,因而能看到光学手段无法触及的银道面远端。把谱线的多普勒位移代入银河系旋转曲线即可换算出距离,从而绘出旋臂的气体分布图。��The line originates in the hyperfine transition of the hydrogen ground state; its spontaneous rate is minuscule, yet the sheer mass of Galactic neutral hydrogen makes the emission bright. At 21 cm it sits in the radio band, so it suffers almost no dust extinction and reveals the far side of the Galactic plane that optical light cannot reach. Feeding the measured Doppler shifts into the Galactic rotation curve converts them into distances, mapping out the gas distribution along the arms.�ans��src��^Ewen 与 Purcell,1951年,Nature,168卷356页:银河系1420兆赫中性氢辐射的首次探测�hEwen & Purcell 1951, Nature, 168, 356 - Observation of a line in the galactic radio spectrum at 1420 MHz��id�astro_19_008�body���氢分子是同核双原子分子,没有永久偶极矩,电偶极转动能级跃迁被禁阻,而暗云只有约十开的温度,连它的四极跃迁也难以激发,因此自身近乎不可见。一氧化碳带有永久偶极矩,最低转动跃迁位于115吉赫,只需约五开就能激发,在冷分子气体中处处发出明亮谱线。借助丰度模型把一氧化碳强度折算成氢分子柱密度,就得到标准的天体物理转换因子方法。�CAs a homonuclear molecule, hydrogen lacks a permanent dipole moment, so its dipole rotational transitions are forbidden, and at the roughly ten-kelvin temperature of dark clouds even its quadrupole lines stay unexcited, leaving it effectively invisible. Carbon monoxide does carry a permanent dipole; its lowest rotational line at 115 GHz needs only about five kelvin to excite and shines brightly throughout cold molecular gas. Converting carbon-monoxide intensity into hydrogen column density through abundance models yields the standard astrophysical conversion factor method.�ans��src�ٙBolatto, Wolfire, Leroy,《The CO-to-H 2 Conversion Factor》,Annual Review of Astronomy and Astrophysics,2013 (DOI: 10.1146/annurev-astro-082812-140944)ٗBolatto, Wolfire, Leroy, 'The CO-to-H 2 Conversion Factor', Annual Review of Astronomy and Astrophysics, 2013, DOI: 10.1146/annurev-astro-082812-140944��id�astro_19_012�body���暴发生时相对论性外流以接近光速抛出，早期辐射来自内区致密物质相互碰撞产生的内激波，能流高但持续时间短。外流扫过星际介质后形成外激波，被加速的电子在磁场中同步辐射出X射线到射电波段。随着外流减速，激波能量注入率下降，同步特征频率和峰亮度一起降低，于是余辉流量按幂律随时间衰减。��The prompt emission comes from internal shocks in an ultra-relativistic outflow, which is luminous but brief. As the ejecta plows into the surrounding medium, an external shock accelerates electrons that synchrotron-radiate from X-ray to radio bands. The blast wave decelerates as it sweeps up material, lowering the energy injection rate and shifting the synchrotron peak downward, so the afterglow flux decays as a smooth power law in time.�ans��src���Mészáros,2002年,Annual Review of Astronomy and Astrophysics,40卷137页:伽马射线暴理论系统评述;Sari, Piran 与 Narayan,1998年,The Astrophysical Journal,497卷L17号:余辉多波段幂律衰减标准解١Meszaros 2002, ARA&A, 40, 137 - Theories of gamma-ray bursts; Sari, Piran & Narayan 1998, ApJ, 497, L17 - Diversity and variability of gamma-ray burst afterglows��id�astro_19_015�body���太阳内部较差自转会缠绕极向磁场，把纬向磁通管拉伸增强并抬升到光球，浮力使磁通管上浮穿透表面形成黑子对。发电机理论预言磁通管最易在中低纬度浮出：高纬区域剪切不足难以积累强场，赤道附近则因磁张力约束过强而不易浮现。因此黑子群集中在南北半球各约±15°至±30°的活动带内，并随周期推进逐渐向赤道迁移，形成蝴蝶图样。�Differential rotation inside the Sun winds up the poloidal field into strong toroidal flux tubes, which become buoyant and rise through the photosphere, emerging as bipolar sunspot pairs. Dynamo models show emergence is favored at mid-low latitudes: high latitudes lack enough shear to build strong fields, while very near the equator magnetic tension suppresses rise. Sunspot groups therefore cluster in belts near ±15°–30° latitude in each hemisphere and migrate equatorward through the cycle, producing the butterfly diagram.�ans��src���Babcock 1961年太阳发电机模型论文；Leighton,《A Magneto-Kinematic Model of the Solar Cycle》,The Astrophysical Journal,1969 (DOI: 10.1086/149943)；Hathaway,《The Solar Cycle》,Living Reviews in Solar Physics,2010 (DOI: 10.12942/lrsp-2010-1)��Babcock 1961 dynamo model paper; Leighton, 'A Magneto-Kinematic Model of the Solar Cycle', The Astrophysical Journal, 1969, DOI: 10.1086/149943; Hathaway, 'The Solar Cycle', Living Reviews in Solar Physics, 2010, DOI: 10.12942/lrsp-2010-1��id�astro_19_020�body���黑洞吸积盘与旋转黑洞提取的能量沿磁化准直通道加速等离子体，使其以接近甚至表观超光速的速度外流。喷流内部磁场抑制了与星际介质的横向交换，端部形成的终端热斑只耗散一小部分能量，主体得以维持准直推进数十万秒差距。X射线观测到的巨型瓣状辐射和空腔证实这些结构能把数百万倍太阳质量的等效能量注入星系团介质。�Energy extracted from the accretion disk and spinning black hole accelerates plasma along a magnetized, collimated channel to relativistic speeds, sometimes with apparent superluminal motion. Strong internal magnetic fields limit lateral exchange with the interstellar medium, and only modest energy is lost at the terminal hot spot, letting the jet stay collimated for hundreds of kiloparsecs. X-ray lobes and cavities inflated by these flows confirm injection of energy equivalent to millions of solar masses into the intracluster medium.�ans��src���Blandford & Znajek,《Electromagnetic extraction of energy from Kerr black holes》,Monthly Notices of the Royal Astronomical Society,1977 (DOI: 10.1093/mnras/179.3.433)；McNamara & Nulsen 2007年AGN空腔反馈综述��Blandford & Znajek, 'Electromagnetic extraction of energy from Kerr black holes', Monthly Notices of the Royal Astronomical Society, 1977, DOI: 10.1093/mnras/179.3.433; McNamara & Nulsen 2007 review of AGN cavities and feedback��id�astro_20_002�body���彗星本质上是混有尘埃的冰质天体,当它们进入距太阳约3–5个天文单位的区域时,水冰等挥发物直接升华,释放出的气体和尘埃在太阳辐射压与太阳风的作用下分别吹向背离太阳的方向,形成离子彗尾和尘埃彗尾。小行星主要形成于太阳系内区,挥发物早已耗尽或从未大量存在,因此表面只呈现反射光点。不过也存在双重身份的天体,例如主带彗星,说明两类天体之间的界限并不绝对。��Comets are ice-rich bodies mixed with dust; inside roughly 3-5 AU from the Sun, volatiles such as water ice sublimate, and the released gas and dust are pushed antisunward by solar radiation pressure and the solar wind, forming separate ion and dust tails. Asteroids formed mostly in the inner solar system where their volatiles were exhausted or never abundant, so they merely reflect sunlight. Objects like main-belt comets blur the boundary between the two populations.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�astro_20_005�body��␀流星雨源于彗星(少数来自小行星)在轨道上抛洒的尘埃颗粒带,当地球每年沿公转路径穿过这些颗粒云时,微粒高速进入高层大气烧蚀发光,便形成流星雨。由于母彗星的轨道是固定的,地球与其交会的时刻也基本固定,所以英仙座流星雨总是出现在8月中旬、双子座流星雨出现在12月中旬。辐射点的位置取决于地球运动方向与颗粒云相对速度的几何关系,这也是流星雨以其所在星座命名的原因。�Meteor showers come from dust streams shed by comets (occasionally asteroids). Each year Earth sweeps through these particle clouds along its orbit, and the grains burn up in the upper atmosphere to produce meteors. Because each parent body follows a fixed orbit, the crossing dates stay stable - hence the Perseids peak in mid-August and the Geminids in mid-December. The radiant direction is set by the geometry of Earth's motion relative to the stream, which is why showers take their names from constellations.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�astro_20_008�body���两颗行星个头确实相近——金星半径约比地球小5%、质量约小18%——但金星的二氧化碳大气压高达92个地球标准大气压,叠加强温室效应使表面温度维持在约740 K。金星几乎没有板块运动和磁场,水汽在早期被光解并经太阳风剥离,碳无法像地球上那样被硅酸盐风化和沉积循环封存。失控温室一旦启动,水丢失与碳积累相互加强,最终造就了今天的恶劣表面环境。�Venus is indeed close to Earth in size - about 5% smaller in radius and roughly 18% less massive - yet it sustains a 92-bar CO2 atmosphere whose runaway greenhouse keeps the surface near 740 K. Lacking plate tectonics and a strong magnetic field, Venus lost its water through photodissociation and solar-wind stripping, so carbon was never locked away by silicate weathering and carbonate deposition as on Earth. Once the runaway greenhouse started, water loss and carbon buildup reinforced each other, producing today's hostile surface.�ans��src��GBullock & Grinspoon 1996, Icarus 121, 149《金星气候的稳定性》�NBullock & Grinspoon 1996, Icarus 121, 149, "The Stability of Climate on Venus"��id�astro_20_012�body��N约46亿年前,一团分子云坍缩形成原太阳,角动量守恒使周围物质摊成一个旋转的原行星盘。行星在这个盘中由尘埃与气体聚集而成,自然继承了盘的平面和旋转方向。金星逆向自转和天王星侧躺等例外,一般归因于后期大碰撞或潮汐作用,而非盘本身的性质。��About 4.6 billion years ago a molecular cloud collapsed to form the proto-Sun, and conservation of angular momentum spread the surrounding material into a rotating protoplanetary disk. The planets grew from dust and gas within this disk, so they inherited its plane and sense of rotation. Exceptions like Venus's retrograde spin and Uranus's tilted axis are usually attributed to later giant impacts or tidal effects rather than to the disk itself.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�astro_20_015�body���哈雷彗星两千余年的每次回归都见于中国史册,使现代天文学家得以反推其历史轨道演化;连续的黑子记载是重建蒙德极小期等千年尺度太阳活动的唯一独立基线;而跨越千年的日月食记录为研究地球自转速率的长期变化提供了不可复测的数据。这些长基线档案是任何现代仪器都无法回溯补测的。��Every return of Halley's Comet for two millennia appears in Chinese chronicles, letting modern astronomers reconstruct its historical orbit; the continuous sunspot record is the only independent baseline for reconstructing millennium-scale solar activity such as the Maunder Minimum; and eclipse records spanning centuries anchor studies of long-term changes in Earth's rotation rate. Such long-baseline archives cannot be retroactively supplied by any modern instrument.�ans��src�ٔUsoskin 2017,《Living Reviews in Solar Physics》4卷3号;Stephenson,《Historical Eclipses and Earth's Rotation》,剑桥大学出版社1997年。��Usoskin IG, A history of solar activity over millennia, Living Reviews in Solar Physics 4: 3 (2017); Stephenson FR, Historical Eclipses and Earth's Rotation, Cambridge University Press (1997).��id�astro_21_002�body��d冷暗物质框架下的数值模拟表明,小型暗物质晕先形成,再经由持续的并合组装成更大的晕,寄居其中的星系随之成长。观测证据同样支持这一图像:哈勃深场拍摄到高红移宇宙中大量形状扭曲、正在并合的星系,近邻星系里的恒星流与增厚星盘则是远古并合留下的化石记录。��Numerical simulations in the cold-dark-matter framework show that small dark matter halos form first and assemble into ever larger ones through continuous merging, with their resident galaxies growing along the way. Observations back this picture up: the Hubble Deep Fields captured many distorted, actively merging galaxies in the high-redshift universe, and stellar streams plus thickened disks in nearby galaxies serve as fossil records of ancient mergers.�ans��src��iMo, van den Bosch & White《Galaxy Formation and Evolution》;哈勃深场(Hubble Deep Field)巡天观测�`Mo, van den Bosch & White, Galaxy Formation and Evolution; Hubble Deep Field survey observations��id�astro_21_005�body���韦伯主镜直径6.5米,由18片镀金铍镜拼接而成,工作在0.6至28微米红外波段;哈勃主镜2.4米,以可见光和紫外观测为主。为捕捉宇宙最早星系极其微弱的红外光,韦伯驻留于日地第二拉格朗日点,靠网球场大小的五层遮阳板把光学系统冷却到约40开尔文。其四大科学主题是第一代星系的诞生、星系的组装与演化、恒星与行星的形成,以及系外行星大气的表征。�TWebb's 6.5-meter primary mirror, built from 18 gold-coated beryllium segments, observes from 0.6 to 28 microns in the infrared, whereas the 2.4-meter Hubble works mainly at visible and ultraviolet wavelengths. To catch the extremely faint infrared glow of the earliest galaxies, Webb orbits the Sun-Earth L2 point, where a tennis-court-sized five-layer sunshield cools its optics to about 40 kelvin. Its four flagship science themes are the birth of the first galaxies, the assembly and evolution of galaxies, the formation of stars and planets, and the characterization of exoplanet atmospheres.�ans��src��vGardner J. P. et al., The James Webb Space Telescope, Space Science Reviews 123 (2006), DOI: 10.1007/s11214-006-8315-7�vGardner J. P. et al., The James Webb Space Telescope, Space Science Reviews 123 (2006), DOI: 10.1007/s11214-006-8315-7��id�astro_21_008�body��#一条路径利用普朗克卫星的微波背景辐射数据,在 ΛCDM 框架下从早期宇宙外推,得到 H0 约 67.4 千米每秒每百万秒差距;另一条路径由 SH0ES 团队用造父变星定标 Ia 型超新星,在近邻宇宙直接测得约 73.0,两者相差约五个标准差。超新星光度演化、造父零点校准等已知系统误差都不足以弥合分歧,所以被称为张力而非统计涨落。如果最终确认存在,可能的解释包括早期暗能量、额外的相对论性粒子等超出标准宇宙学的物理。��One route uses Planck cosmic microwave background data extrapolated from the early universe within the Lambda-CDM framework, giving H0 near 67.4 km/s/Mpc; the other route, pursued by the SH0ES team, calibrates Type Ia supernovae with Cepheid variables and measures about 73.0 directly in the local universe, a gap of roughly five sigma. Known systematics such as supernova luminosity evolution or Cepheid zero-point calibration cannot close the disagreement, hence the label tension rather than statistical fluctuation. If confirmed, candidate explanations include early dark energy or additional relativistic particle species beyond standard cosmology.�ans��src��gPlanck 合作组,Astronomy and Astrophysics 641:A6 (2020);Riess 等,Astrophysical Journal 908:L6 (2021)�sPlanck Collaboration, Astronomy and Astrophysics 641, A6 (2020); Riess et al., Astrophysical Journal 908, L6 (2021)��id�astro_21_012�body��=不同信使携带互补的物理信息:电磁波谱给出温度与化学成分,引力波直接反映致密天体并合时的动力学与质量,中微子能从不透明的恒星内部或极端加速区无损逃逸,宇宙线则记录最高能量的粒子过程。2017 年 GW170817 事件中,引力波探测与随后在多个波段找到的千新星光学对应体相结合,首次确证了双中子星并合是重元素(如锶)的主要产地之一。把各信使的时间戳、方向和能量放在一起分析,还能独立约束宇宙膨胀速率并检验广义相对论。��Different messengers carry complementary physics: the electromagnetic spectrum traces temperature and composition, gravitational waves reveal the dynamics and masses of compact-object mergers directly, neutrinos escape unscattered from opaque stellar interiors or extreme accelerators, and cosmic rays record the highest-energy particle processes. In the 2017 GW170817 event, combining the gravitational-wave detection with the kilonova counterpart found across multiple bands provided the first evidence that binary neutron star mergers are a major site for producing heavy elements such as strontium. Joint analysis of timing, sky position, and energy across messengers also independently constrains the Hubble constant and tests general relativity.�ans��src��Abbott et al.《Multi-messenger Observations of a Binary Neutron Star Merger》(ApJL 848, L12, 2017);LIGO-Virgo 科学合作组نAbbott et al., Multi-messenger Observations of a Binary Neutron Star Merger (ApJL 848, L12, 2017); LIGO-Virgo Scientific Collaboration��id�astro_21_015�body��>天体测量的核心是建立一个惯性参考系,并把恒星位置、视差和自行以毫角秒乃至微角秒精度锚定在其中。1989 年发射的依巴谷卫星首次从太空完成全天巡测,给出了约 11.8 万颗恒星的精密星表;欧空局的盖亚任务在此基础上对约二十亿颗恒星重复扫描,亮源的单星视差精度可达数十微角秒。这些数据不仅让距离阶梯的第一级——三角视差——变得系统可靠,还通过准星星表把光学参考系与河外射电源定义的国际天球参考系直接连接起来。��The core task of astrometry is to establish an inertial reference frame and anchor stellar positions, parallaxes, and proper motions within it at milliarcsecond or even microarcsecond precision. Launched in 1989, Hipparcos performed the first all-sky survey from space, delivering a precise catalog of about 118,000 stars; ESA's Gaia mission repeated this scanning scheme for roughly two billion stars, reaching parallax accuracies of tens of microarcseconds for bright sources. These data make the first rung of the distance ladder—trigonometric parallax—systematically reliable, and through quasar catalogs they tie the optical frame directly to the International Celestial Reference Frame defined by extragalactic radio sources.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�astro_22_002�body��}这些小球是多孔沉积岩中的结核：含铁地下水在岩石孔隙里绕核缓慢沉淀氧化铁，一层层长成毫米级球体，这一过程需要液态水长期存在。后来风蚀剥掉了较软的围岩，抗风化的赤铁矿球粒便成片露在地表。因此“蓝莓”是火星古代曾有地下水活动、局部环境一度湿润的直接矿物学证据。�␀The spheres are concretions grown inside porous sedimentary rock: iron-bearing groundwater slowly precipitated iron oxide around nuclei within the pores, building up millimetre-scale balls layer by layer - a process that requires long-lived liquid water. Later, wind erosion stripped away the softer host rock, leaving the resistant hematite spherules exposed in sheets on the surface. They therefore provide direct mineralogical evidence that ancient Mars hosted groundwater activity and locally wet conditions.�ans��src��fSquyres, S. W. 等《梅里迪亚尼平原古代含水环境的实地证据》Science 306, 1709 (2004)�S. W. Squyres et al., 'In Situ Evidence for an Ancient Aqueous Environment at Meridiani Planum, Mars', Science 306, 1709 (2004)��id�astro_22_008�body���造父变星是有规律地径向胀缩的黄超巨星，脉动由氦部分电离区充当阀门来驱动：压缩时电离度升高、不透明度变大，辐射能被暂时储存，膨胀时再释放出来，从而维持稳定的振荡。造父变星光度越大，脉动周期越长；因此只需测出光变周期就能推知光度，再与视亮度比较便得到距离，把距离测量从银河系延伸到邻近星系。��Cepheids are yellow supergiants that rhythmically swell and shrink, their pulsation driven because a partially ionized helium layer acts as a valve: compression raises ionization and opacity so radiation is stored momentarily, then released during expansion, sustaining a steady oscillation. More luminous Cepheids pulse with longer periods, so the observed period reveals the true luminosity; comparing it with apparent brightness yields the distance, extending measurements from our Galaxy to nearby ones.�ans��src��zLeavitt H. S., Periods of 25 Variable Stars in the Small Magellanic Cloud, Harvard College Observatory Circular 173 (1912)مHenrietta S. Leavitt, Periods of 25 Variable Stars in the Small Magellanic Cloud, Harvard College Observatory Circular No. 173 (1912)��id�astro_22_012�body���耀斑是日面局部磁能骤然释放形成的电磁辐射爆发，以光速约八分钟抵达地球，主要扰动电离层，干扰短波通信与导航。日冕物质抛射则是数十亿吨磁化等离子体被整体抛出，约一至四天到达，撞击地球磁场引发地磁暴，感应电流可损坏电网变压器并加重卫星轨道衰减。两者常相伴发生，但机理与时间尺度截然不同。�UA flare is a sudden release of electromagnetic radiation when magnetic energy on the Sun snaps; moving at light speed, it reaches Earth in about eight minutes and mainly disturbs the ionosphere, disrupting shortwave communication and navigation. A coronal mass ejection instead throws billions of tons of magnetized plasma into interplanetary space, arriving in one to four days; striking Earth's magnetic field, it triggers geomagnetic storms whose induced currents can damage grid transformers and increase satellite drag. The two often occur together but differ sharply in mechanism and timing.�ans��src��uSchwenn R., Space Weather: The Solar Perspective, Living Reviews in Solar Physics 3 (2006), DOI: 10.12942/lrsp-2006-2�uSchwenn R., Space Weather: The Solar Perspective, Living Reviews in Solar Physics 3 (2006), DOI: 10.12942/lrsp-2006-2��id�astro_22_018�body���轨道影像与火星车实地考察显示，火星保存着蜿蜒的曲流河道、冲积扇和注入盆地的三角洲，还有层状泥岩以及黏土等只能在与水长期接触下形成的含水矿物。盖尔坑内厚达数百米的沉积层自下而上记录了湖泊反复注满与干涸的历史，表明约35亿年前火星地表仍能使水体长期稳定存在，这些古湖床因此成为寻找生命印迹的优先目标。�Orbital imagery and rover fieldwork have revealed winding river channels, alluvial fans, and deltas feeding into basins, alongside layered mudstones and water-bearing clays that form only through prolonged contact with water. Within Gale crater, a sedimentary stack several hundred meters thick records lakes repeatedly filling and drying, showing that around 3.5 billion years ago the surface could sustain stable water bodies over long stretches of time. Such ancient lakebeds are now priority targets in searches for past-life signatures.�ans��src�١Grotzinger J. P. et al., Deposition, Exhumation, and Paleoclimate of an Ancient Lake Deposit, Gale Crater, Mars, Science 350 (2015), DOI: 10.1126/science.aac7575١Grotzinger J. P. et al., Deposition, Exhumation, and Paleoclimate of an Ancient Lake Deposit, Gale Crater, Mars, Science 350 (2015), DOI: 10.1126/science.aac7575��id�astro_22_020�body���太阳风持续挤压地球磁层，磁尾中的磁重联将电子加速，使其沿磁力线汇入南北半球高磁纬的高层大气。电子撞击氧原子与氮分子并令其激发，受激粒子回落时发出特征色光：约一两百千米高的原子氧贡献最常见的绿色，更高处的氧发出暗红光，氮则添上蓝紫色调。因粒子循磁力线聚集，极光呈现为环绕地磁极的明亮光带。�.The solar wind continually presses against Earth's magnetosphere, and reconnection in the magnetotail accelerates electrons that stream down field lines into the upper atmosphere at high magnetic latitudes. There they excite oxygen atoms and nitrogen molecules; as the energized particles relax, characteristic colors appear: atomic oxygen around 100–200 kilometers altitude gives the familiar green, oxygen higher up glows deep red, and nitrogen adds blue-purple shades. Channeled along magnetic fields, the light forms ovals around each geomagnetic pole.�ans��src��5Omholt A., The Optical Aurora, Springer-Verlag (1971)�5Omholt A., The Optical Aurora, Springer-Verlag (1971)��id�astro_23_002�body���同一星团的成员恒星近乎同时诞生且化学组成相同，演化快慢只取决于质量：大质量恒星燃烧快，先耗尽核心氢离开主序。色—星等图上仍留在主序的最亮恒星构成拐点，其位置直接标定年龄——年轻疏散星团拐点位于明亮的蓝端，百亿岁的球状星团则只剩类太阳质量的恒星还留在主序上。��Stars in a cluster are born together with a common composition, so their pace of evolution depends only on mass: massive stars burn fastest and leave the main sequence first. In the color–magnitude diagram, the brightest stars still on the sequence define the turnoff and fix the age directly—young open clusters turn off among luminous blue stars, whereas ten-billion-year-old globular clusters retain only roughly solar-mass stars on the main sequence.�ans��src�٘D. A. VandenBerg等：用改进的主序拐点法拟合等龄线测定55个球状星团的年龄，The Astrophysical Journal第775卷134号（2013年）كD. A. VandenBerg et al., ages of 55 globular clusters fitted from main-sequence turnoffs, The Astrophysical Journal 775, 134 (2013)��id�astro_23_005�body���行星引力随距离变化，天体近侧与远侧所受引力之差即潮汐力。在洛希极限以内，潮汐力超过冰质碎块的自引力，物质无法聚结成卫星，只能摊薄成环；越过极限后自引力重占上风，碎片便能吸积长大为卫星。土星明亮的主环恰位于其洛希极限之内，紧贴环系外缘的牧羊犬卫星正是这条分界线的直观标志。��A planet's pull weakens with distance, so the difference in gravity across a body—the tidal force—grows toward the planet. Inside the Roche limit this force exceeds the self-gravity binding icy rubble together, so material cannot coalesce into moons and spreads into rings instead; beyond the limit self-gravity wins and debris accretes into satellites. Saturn's bright main rings sit inside its Roche limit, and the shepherd moons hugging their outer edge neatly mark this boundary.�ans��src��YEsposito,《Planetary Rings》,剑桥大学出版社,2014 (DOI: 10.1017/cbo9781139236966)�\Esposito, 'Planetary Rings', Cambridge University Press, 2014, DOI: 10.1017/cbo9781139236966��id�astro_23_008�body���望远镜角分辨率约为波长除以口径，单台射电望远镜口径有限，长波下成像很粗。干涉技术把相距D的两台望远镜信号精确对时后相干叠加，等效于口径为D的望远镜，分辨率由波长除以基线长度决定。跨洲VLBI基线接近地球直径，分辨率达毫角秒级；事件视界望远镜在1.3毫米波段达到约20微角秒，首次拍到M87黑洞阴影。�)A telescope's angular resolution is roughly wavelength divided by aperture, so single radio dishes are intrinsically blurry at long wavelengths. Interferometry instead correlates the signals of two dishes separated by a baseline D with precise timing, synthesizing the resolution of a D-sized aperture set by wavelength over baseline. Transcontinental VLBI approaches Earth's diameter and resolves milliarcseconds, while the Event Horizon Telescope at 1.3 mm reached about 20 microarcseconds, imaging the shadow of the M87 black hole for the first time.�ans��src��XEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration, ApJL 875, L1 (2019), doi:10.3847/2041-8213/ab0ec7�nEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration, ApJL 875, L1 (2019), doi:10.3847/2041-8213/ab0ec7 (first image of M87*)��id�astro_23_012�body��B回归年长约365.24219天。儒略历四年一闰，年平均365.25天，每年比回归年多约11分钟，约128年便多出一整天。格里高利历去掉三个世纪闰年后，年平均为365.2425天，与回归年每年仅差约26秒，约3300年才累积一天，使春分日期长期稳定在3月21日附近。��The tropical year lasts about 365.24219 days. With a leap day every fourth year, the Julian calendar averages 365.25 days—about 11 minutes too long each year, gaining a whole day roughly every 128 years. Dropping three century leap years per 400 years brings the average down to 365.2425 days, within about 26 seconds of the tropical year, limiting the drift to one day in roughly 3,300 years and keeping the spring equinox near March 21.�ans��src��z《天文年历解释性附录》第3版，S. E. Urban 与 P. K. Seidelmann 主编，University Science Books，2012年。فExplanatory Supplement to the Astronomical Almanac, 3rd ed., eds. S. E. Urban & P. K. Seidelmann, University Science Books, 2012.��id�astro_23_015�body���吸积供能的天体存在辐射压上限：光度升高时，辐射对电离气体的外推力最终抵消引力，把气体驱散、掐断燃料，这一临界光度即爱丁顿光度，正比于中心质量，约合每太阳质量三万倍太阳光度。要在极小区域内稳定输出千亿倍太阳光度，只能依靠数亿倍太阳质量的致密黑洞在限下吸积，普通恒星集团无法胜任。�!Accretion-powered sources face a radiation-pressure ceiling: as luminosity rises, the outward push on ionized gas eventually balances gravity and would disperse the fuel altogether. This critical level, the Eddington luminosity, scales with central mass—about thirty thousand solar luminosities per solar mass. Steadily emitting hundreds of billions of solar luminosities from a tiny volume therefore demands a compact black hole of several hundred million solar masses accreting below that limit; a cluster of ordinary stars cannot manage it.�ans��src�هD. E. Osterbrock 与 G. J. Ferland，《气体星云与活动星系核天体物理学》第2版，University Science Books，2006年。نD. E. Osterbrock & G. J. Ferland, Astrophysics of Gaseous Nebulae and Active Galactic Nuclei, 2nd ed., University Science Books, 2006.��id�astro_23_018�body���蓝离散星位于主序拐点更亮更蓝的一侧；若按单星演化，达到该年龄的星团不应再有此类恒星。主流解释是它们由两颗星并合而成：双星间的物质转移或密近交会让恒星补充燃料，重新回到主序上段发光。它们的存在说明星团并非孤立单星的简单集合，双星作用与动力学交互持续重塑着成员星的命运。��Blue stragglers lie brighter and bluer than the main-sequence turnoff, a region single stars of the cluster's age should have vacated long ago. The accepted explanation is that two stars became one: mass transfer within a binary, or a merger during a close encounter, refuels the resulting star and returns it to the upper main sequence. Their very existence shows that binaries and dynamical encounters continuously rewrite the fates of cluster members.�ans��src�ْMcCrea,《Extended Main-Sequence of Some Stellar Clusters》,Monthly Notices of the Royal Astronomical Society,1964 (DOI: 10.1093/mnras/128.2.147)ٖW. H. McCrea, 'Extended Main-Sequence of Some Stellar Clusters', Monthly Notices of the Royal Astronomical Society, 1964, DOI: 10.1093/mnras/128.2.147��id�astro_24_002�body���关键证据是色散量:射电脉冲穿越星际等离子体时,低频比高频走得慢,延迟正比于路径上的自由电子总数。银河系内电子总量有限,而实测FRB的色散量远超银道面贡献,说明大部分路程发生在河外,距离动辄数十亿光年。在此距离上,毫秒级爆发的射电能量仍抵得上太阳数周乃至数月的全部输出,如此极端必须来自致密天体的剧烈过程。��The key is dispersion. Radio pulses crossing ionized interstellar plasma slow down at lower frequencies, the delay measuring the number of free electrons along the path. The Milky Way cannot supply enough electrons to match observed dispersion measures, so most of the journey is extragalactic — often billions of light-years. At those distances even milliseconds of radio emission rival the Sun's total output over weeks to months, demanding extreme physics around compact objects.�ans��src��aLorimer 等,《A Bright Millisecond Radio Burst of Extragalactic Origin》,Science 第318卷,2007�aD. R. Lorimer et al., A Bright Millisecond Radio Burst of Extragalactic Origin, Science 318, 2007��id�astro_26_003�body���它来自氢原子基态的超精细跃迁:电子与质子自旋由平行翻转为反平行时,会释放1420兆赫兹的射电光子。星际尘埃强烈吸收可见光,射电波却几乎畅行无阻,而中性氢又是星际介质的主要组分,所以这条谱线能穿透整个银河系,用来绘制氢气分布并测定星系自转曲线,1951年由Ewen与Purcell首次探测成功。��It arises from the hyperfine transition of the ground-state hydrogen atom: when the electron and proton spins flip from parallel to antiparallel alignment, a 1420 MHz radio photon is released. Interstellar dust strongly absorbs visible light while radio waves pass almost freely, and neutral hydrogen dominates the interstellar gas, so this line penetrates the entire galaxy, tracing hydrogen maps and galactic rotation curves; Ewen and Purcell first detected it in 1951.�ans��src�ْDraine 所著 Physics of the Interstellar and Intergalactic Medium,Princeton University Press,2011年;Ewen 与 Purcell,1951年,Nature,168卷356页ٶB.T. Draine, Physics of the Interstellar and Intergalactic Medium, Princeton University Press 2011; Ewen & Purcell 1951, Nature, 168, 356 - First detection of the galactic 21-cm line��id�astro_26_004�body��t通常分为四相:冷分子云约10至20K、冷原子气体约100K、暖气体约8000K、热电离气体达百万K量级。McKee与Ostriker的三相模型指出,超新星激波扫过星际空间时把低密度气体冲击加热到百万开尔文,形成充满热相的空腔;随后辐射冷却使部分气体重新凝聚为冷云,各相近似处于压力平衡中共存。��Conventionally four phases: cold molecular clouds near 10 to 20 K, cold atomic gas around 100 K, warm gas near 8000 K, and hot ionized gas of order a million kelvin. In the three-phase picture of McKee and Ostriker, supernova blast waves shock-heat tenuous gas to about a million kelvin, filling low-density cavities, while radiative cooling lets part of the gas condense back into cold clouds, the phases coexisting near pressure equilibrium.�ans��src���McKee, Ostriker,《A theory of the interstellar medium - Three components regulated by supernova explosions in an inhomogeneous substrate》,The Astrophysical Journal,1977 (DOI: 10.1086/155667)ٿMcKee, Ostriker, 'A theory of the interstellar medium - Three components regulated by supernova explosions in an inhomogeneous substrate', The Astrophysical Journal, 1977, DOI: 10.1086/155667��id�astro_26_006�body���关键在于暗能量的物态方程参数w。若w恒为-1,其密度不被膨胀稀释,宇宙将永久加速膨胀,恒星逐一燃尽、星系彼此远去,走向冰冷的“大冻结”;若w<-1,即幽灵暗能量,密度反而随膨胀增大,会在有限时间内依次撕开星系、恒星系统乃至原子,称为“大撕裂”;若暗能量日后衰减,膨胀还可能减慢甚至转为收缩。目前观测最接近第一种图景。�Everything hinges on the equation-of-state parameter w of dark energy. If w stays at -1, its density is never diluted and the universe accelerates forever, with stars burning out and galaxies receding into a cold big freeze; if w drops below -1, phantom energy instead grows with expansion and tears apart galaxies, star systems and eventually atoms within finite time, the big rip; should dark energy decay, expansion might slow and even turn into contraction. Present observations come closest to the first picture.�ans��src��R.R. Caldwell 等人,2003年,The Astrophysical Journal,594卷L25页:幽灵能量与大撕裂；F. Adams & G. Laughlin,《A dying universe: the long-term fate and evolutionof astrophysical objects》,Reviews of Modern Physics,1997 (DOI: 10.1103/revmodphys.69.337)�R.R. Caldwell, M. Kamionkowski & N.N. Weinberg 2003, ApJ, 594, L25 - Phantom energy and cosmic doomsday; F. Adams & G. Laughlin, 'A dying universe: the long-term fate and evolutionof astrophysical objects', Reviews of Modern Physics, 1997, DOI: 10.1103/revmodphys.69.337��id�astro_26_010�body��z由0.8至8倍太阳质量的恒星演化到渐近巨星支末期抛出外包层所致:裸露的炽热核心以强紫外辐射电离并激发周围气体发光,整个阶段仅延续约一万年。其名得自早期小型望远镜中这类天体呈如行星般的圆盘像,W. Herschel 据此命名,实则与行星毫无瓜葛;约五十亿年后太阳也将以同样方式谢幕。��It forms when a star of 0.8 to 8 solar masses sheds its envelope near the tip of the asymptotic giant branch; the bare, blazing core then floods the ejected gas with ultraviolet photons that ionize and excite it into glowing, a spectacle lasting only some ten thousand years. The name comes from the planet-like disks early small telescopes showed, a label applied by W. Herschel, though true planets play no role; the Sun will take the same curtain call in about five billion years.�ans��src�نD. Osterbrock 与 G. Ferland 所著 Astrophysics of Gaseous Nebulae and Active Galactic Nuclei,University Science Books,2006年第2版كD. Osterbrock & G. Ferland, Astrophysics of Gaseous Nebulae and Active Galactic Nuclei, 2nd edition, University Science Books, 2006��id�astro_26_015�body��因为它既小又善变:人马座A*的质量只有M87中心黑洞的千分之一上下,好在距离也近了两千倍,二者在天空中的张角相仿;但环绕物质的最快公转周期从M87的数天缩短到几分钟,在长达数小时的曝光里亮度与结构不断翻涌,成像好比拍摄一只不肯安静的小狗。前方银道面的等离子体散射屏还会抹糊细节,须按散射模型扣除,尘埃遮挡迫使观测改用毫米波段,最终依靠超级计算机处理和多支独立成像团队交叉验证才定稿。�xBecause it is both tiny and twitchy: Sagittarius A* carries only about a thousandth of M87's central black hole's mass yet lies nearly two thousand times closer, so the two subtend similar angles on the sky; but matter circling it completes an orbit in minutes rather than days, and brightness and structure churn throughout hours-long exposures, like photographing a puppy that refuses to sit still. A plasma scattering screen in the Galactic plane smears detail and must be modeled away, dust forces millimetre-wave observing, and only supercomputer processing cross-checked by independent imaging teams settled the final picture.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�b00d6d9759da�body�م海王星拥有太阳系最猛烈的风暴，风速可超过 2000 km/h，远超地球飓风，其能量来源至今未完全弄清。٦Neptune hosts the solar system's most violent winds, exceeding 2000 km/h—far faster than Earth's hurricanes—and their energy source is still not fully understood.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�b19a5a51e2fd�body�و水星几乎没有大气来储存和传递热量，加上自转缓慢、公转很快，向阳面可达430°C，背阳面降至-180°C。٩Mercury has almost no atmosphere to store or redistribute heat, and with slow rotation and fast orbit, its day side reaches 430°C while the night side drops to -180°C.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�b50fdbd8006c�body�٥即便存在文明，最近的也可能在数十到数百光年外，一次往返通讯要上百年；加上信号微弱、频率未知，彼此错过并不意外。��Even if civilizations exist, the nearest may be tens to hundreds of light-years away, making a round trip take centuries; faint signals and unknown frequencies make missing each other unsurprising.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�b54d13604230�body��旅行者1号和2号于1977年发射，借助行星引力先后飞掠木星、土星等外行星。它们现已飞出太阳风层、进入星际空间，成为人类送出最远的人造物体。探测器仍缓慢向地球发回关于星际介质的珍贵数据。�'Launched in 1977, Voyager 1 and 2 used planetary gravity to fly by outer planets like Jupiter and Saturn. They have now crossed the heliopause into interstellar space, becoming the most distant human-made objects. They still send back precious data about the interstellar medium, though faintly.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�b62066e7184a�body��小行星带位于火星和木星轨道之间，是数十万颗岩石和金属小天体的聚集区。这些天体是太阳系形成时未能聚合为行星的残余物质。虽然数量众多，但它们之间的空隙很大，探测器穿过时几乎不会碰到任何东西。�DThe asteroid belt lies between the orbits of Mars and Jupiter and is home to hundreds of thousands of small rocky and metallic bodies. These objects are leftovers from the Solar System's formation that never coalesced into a planet. Although numerous, they are far apart, so spacecraft pass through without hitting anything.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�b71cb7177301�body��按质量大致分为三类：恒星质量黑洞由大质量恒星坍缩形成，质量数倍到几十倍太阳；超大质量黑洞位于星系中心，质量达百万到数百亿倍太阳；中等质量黑洞介于两者之间。此外理论上还有质量极小的原初黑洞。�RBy mass they fall into three broad classes: stellar-mass black holes formed from collapsing massive stars, of a few to tens of solar masses; supermassive black holes at galactic centers, of millions to tens of billions of solar masses; and intermediate-mass black holes in between. In theory there may also be tiny primordial black holes.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�b939b733640a�body��宇宙网是暗物质和星系在引力作用下形成的纤维状网络，由密集的纤维丝连接星系团，其间是几乎空旷的宇宙空洞。它是宇宙物质分布的基本形态，反映了早期密度涨落在数十亿年引力增长下的演化结果。�DThe cosmic web is the filamentary network formed by dark matter and galaxies under gravity, with dense filaments linking galaxy clusters and nearly empty cosmic voids between them. It is the fundamental shape of cosmic matter distribution, reflecting how early density fluctuations grew under gravity over billions of years.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�b9c3b756e00b�body��潮汐锁定指一颗天体自转周期与公转周期同步，永远以同一面朝向主星，如月球对地球。它是长期潮汐摩擦的结果，在卫星中十分常见：冥卫一、木卫一等许多卫星都被母行星锁定。太阳系外也普遍如此。�<Tidal locking means a body's rotation period matches its orbital period so it always shows one face to its primary, as the Moon does to Earth. It arises from long-term tidal friction and is very common among moons: Charon, Io and many others are locked to their planets. It is widespread beyond the solar system too.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�ba337da4ff97�body�� 柯伊伯带位于海王星轨道外约 30–55 天文单位的盘状区域，主要由冰质天体（水、甲烷、氨冰）组成，是短周期彗星的源地。奥尔特云是延伸至数万天文单位的球壳，由更零散的冰彗体构成，被认为是长周期彗星储库。�The Kuiper Belt is a disk-like region ~30–55 AU beyond Neptune, made of icy bodies (water, methane, ammonia ices) and the source of short-period comets. The Oort Cloud is a spherical shell out to tens of thousands of AU of scattered icy comets, the reservoir of long-period comets.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�baaa2fa3cd7c�body�٤谷神星是小行星带中最大的天体，直径约 940 公里，自身引力使其接近球形，内部可能有盐水储层，表面还发现了明亮盐斑。��Ceres is the largest object in the asteroid belt, about 940 km across; its gravity shapes it nearly spherical, it may host a briny reservoir inside, and it shows bright salt spots on its surface.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�bb9dcfa3b4ff�body��8球状星团是由十万到百万颗老年恒星组成的致密球状系统，其恒星几乎同时诞生于星系形成的极早期，且化学丰度保留了当时原气体的成分。由于它们寿命极长且结构稳定，其年龄与金属丰度分布成为反推宿主星系组装历史的天然档案。��Globular clusters are dense spherical systems of a hundred thousand to a million old stars that formed almost simultaneously in the very early phase of galaxy formation, preserving the composition of the primordial gas in their chemical abundances. Because they are extremely long-lived and structurally stable, their ages and metallicity distributions serve as a natural archive for reconstructing the assembly history of their host galaxies.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�bbc0a7692482�body�ٽ通过轨道器和巡视器拍摄的干涸河床、三角洲、沉积岩层，以及探测器直接测到地下水冰和富含黏土矿物的岩石，都是古代液态水存在的证据。��Orbiters and rovers have found dried riverbeds, deltas, sedimentary layers, plus direct detection of subsurface water ice and clay minerals—all evidence that liquid water flowed on ancient Mars.�ans��src��ACarr M. H., The Surface of Mars, Cambridge University Press, 2006�FMichael H. Carr, The Surface of Mars, Cambridge University Press, 2006��id�bbcbe334c6ea�body��f大气层是天文观测的麻烦制造者：气流扰动让星象模糊抖动，水汽和臭氧又会吸收掉大部分紫外线以及部分红外线。升到太空后，哈勃摆脱了这些干扰，拍出的图像比地面清晰得多，还能观测到大气完全挡住的紫外线，1990年发射后它成为天文史上产出最多的望远镜之一。��The atmosphere is a nuisance for astronomers: turbulent air makes star images blurry and shimmer, while water vapour and ozone absorb most ultraviolet and much infrared light. Above it all, Hubble escapes both problems, imaging far more sharply than any ground telescope and opening the ultraviolet sky the atmosphere blocks entirely. Launched in 1990, it became one of the most productive instruments in astronomical history.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�be18bdec5730�body���拉尼亚凯亚超星系团是包含本星系群、室女座星系团等约十万个星系的引力归属区域，由星系共同流向巨引源的宇宙流划定边界。它刷新了人们对银河系在宇宙中邻里尺度的认识。��Laniakea is the supercluster containing the Local Group, the Virgo Cluster, and some 100,000 galaxies, delineated by the cosmic flow—galaxies' common motion toward the Great Attractor. It redefined our picture of the Milky Way's cosmic neighborhood.�ans��src��iTully, Courtois, Hoffman & Pomarède,《The Laniakea supercluster of galaxies》,Nature 513, 71-73 (2014)�vR. B. Tully, H. Courtois, Y. Hoffman & D. Pomarède, 'The Laniakea supercluster of galaxies', Nature 513, 71-73 (2014)��id�bf0bdf1d2773�body��w关键在于空间站和飞船都在同一高度的轨道上以同样的速度飞行，彼此几乎没有相对速度，所以追赶并不需要高速冲刺。飞船先进入略低的轨道靠更快角速度追上，再在合适时机爬升到同一高度，随后用小型推进器一点点调整，最后以每秒几厘米的相对速度靠近并锁定在对接端口上。��The key is that the station and the spacecraft both circle at the same altitude and speed, so their relative velocity is almost nil and no high-speed chase is needed. The ship first drops into a slightly lower, faster orbit to catch up, then climbs back to the same height at the right moment, fine-tunes with small thrusters, and finally approaches at a few centimetres per second to latch onto the docking port.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�bfb18de99df7�body��最先是潮汐力把他拉成面条一样的长条：脚端的引力比头端强得多，身体被两头拉伸。越靠近超大质量黑洞，视界附近反而越平缓，但一旦越过视界，就永远无法返回，外界的观察者也再也收不到他的任何信号。�6First, tidal forces stretch him into a long thin strand: gravity pulls harder on his feet than on his head, so the body is drawn out. Near a supermassive black hole the crossing at the horizon is actually gentle, but once past it there is no return, and outside observers receive no signal from him ever again.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�bffe0260ab90�body�٬约 46 亿年前一片分子云在引力下坍缩，中心形成太阳，周围盘中的尘埃和气体逐渐吸积成行星、卫星和小天体，这就是星云假说。��About 4.6 billion years ago a molecular cloud collapsed under gravity, forming the Sun at its center while dust and gas in the surrounding disk accreted into planets, moons, and small bodies—the nebular hypothesis.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�c1283efa04b7�body�ٖ水星是离太阳最近的行星，几乎没有大气层，昼夜温差极大。白天温度可达430摄氏度，夜晚可降至零下180摄氏度。ٰMercury is the closest planet to the Sun and has almost no atmosphere, leading to extreme temperature swings. Days can reach 430 degrees Celsius while nights drop to minus 180.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�c12e0d69adf4�body���极早期微小的密度涨落在引力下被放大，暗物质先成晕、再吸引普通物质形成星系和纤维，最终织成今天的宇宙网，这一过程可由模拟与观测对照检验。��Tiny early density ripples were amplified by gravity; dark matter formed halos first, then drew in ordinary matter to build galaxies and filaments into today's web—a process tested by comparing simulations with observations.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�c25fcb4d5945�body���天王星大气中含有甲烷，甲烷会吸收红光、反射蓝绿光，使星球呈现青蓝色。它的大气以氢氦为主，甲烷只占约2%，但足以决定颜色。低温也使它成为太阳系最冷的行星之一。�(Uranus has methane in its atmosphere, which absorbs red light and reflects blue-green light, giving the planet its cyan color. Its air is mostly hydrogen and helium with only about 2 percent methane, yet that is enough to set the hue. Its low temperature also makes it one of the coldest planets.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�c55b1383944f�body���月球质量小、表面引力弱，逃逸速度只有约每秒2.4公里，气体分子很容易达到逃逸速度飞散到太空。加上没有磁场和地质活动补充气体，任何大气都难以长期保留。因此月球表面几乎是真空。�!The Moon is small and weakly gravitational, with an escape velocity of only about 2.4 kilometers per second, so gas molecules easily reach it and drift into space. With no magnetic field or geology to replenish gas, any atmosphere cannot persist. The lunar surface is thus nearly a vacuum.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�c58623313573�body�ـ银河系是直径约10万光年的棒旋星系，包含上千亿颗恒星，太阳位于距银心约2.7万光年的旋臂上。٦The Milky Way is a barred spiral about 100,000 light-years across, with over a hundred billion stars; the Sun sits on an arm about 27,000 light-years from the center.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�cbad3ce4ea4c�body��e绝大多数彗星诞生在遥远的柯伊伯带或奥尔特云，原本只在太阳系边缘缓缓绕行。当行星的引力或者路过的恒星的扰动把它们推向内太阳系时，它们就沿着一端贴近日点、另一端伸向远方的极扁椭圆轨道飞进来。因此有的彗星几百年回来一次，有的几百万年才回来一次。��Most comets are born in the distant Kuiper belt or Oort cloud, originally creeping slowly around the fringes of the Solar System. When the gravity of the planets or a passing star nudges them inward, they plunge in along extremely elongated ellipses, with one end grazing the Sun and the other reaching far out. That is why some comets return every few hundred years and others every few million.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�cc2980005e03�body��$星系团引力势阱极深，落入其中的气体被激波与湍流加热到 10 的 7 次方至 8 次方开尔文，发出 X 射线，这就是星系团内介质。它包含的普通物质质量往往超过所有成员星系恒星的总和，是星系团质量的主要可见部分之一。�%Clusters have very deep gravitational wells; gas falling in is heated by shocks and turbulence to 10^7–10^8 K and emits X-rays—this is the intracluster medium. Its ordinary matter often exceeds the total stellar mass of all member galaxies and is a major visible component of cluster mass.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�ccb22d74c9c3�body�٢恒星颜色反映表面温度：蓝星最热（上万度），黄星如太阳居中，红星较冷（约三千度）；温度越高，发出的光越偏蓝白。ٰA star's color shows its surface temperature: blue stars are hottest (tens of thousands K), yellow like the Sun is mid, red is cooler (~3000 K); hotter means bluer-white light.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�cd70989e99e9�body��~它大致沿180度经线，向东跨过它日期减一天，向西跨过加一天，用来避免环球旅行时日期混乱。٘Roughly along the 180° meridian, crossing it eastward subtracts a day and westward adds one, preventing date confusion when traveling around the world.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�ce759fcdf5f4�body��潮汐主要由月球引力对地球不同部位拉扯不均造成：正对月球和背向月球的两侧海水被『抬高』形成涨潮。太阳的引力也会叠加影响，但月球的贡献约为太阳的两倍。地球自转使各地每天经历约两次涨落。�Tides are mainly caused by the Moon's uneven pull on different parts of Earth: water on the near and far sides bulges out into high tide. The Sun's gravity adds its own effect, but the Moon contributes about twice as much. Earth's rotation gives most places about two tides per day.�ans��src��t牛顿《自然哲学的数学原理》的引潮力理论；美国国家海洋和大气管理局 (NOAA) 潮汐说明�NNewton's tidal theory in Principia; NOAA Tides and Currents on tide generation��id�ce83b7bcf707�body�ف火星距离远、通信延迟长，大气稀薄难以减速着陆，且表面辐射和沙尘都会影响设备寿命与供电。ٖMars is far with long signal delays, its thin atmosphere makes landing hard to brake, and surface radiation and dust threaten power and hardware life.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�cefd9111dfab�body��5引力弹弓（也称引力助推）是利用行星的引力让探测器靠近时被加速或改变方向，从而节省燃料、飞向更远的目标。探测器从行星运动方向掠过时，会像被甩出的小球一样获得额外速度。旅行者号和许多行星任务都靠它完成长途旅行。�4A gravity assist uses a planet's gravity to speed up or redirect a passing spacecraft, saving fuel and reaching farther targets. When a probe swings by in the planet's direction of motion, it gains extra speed like a stone flung from a sling. Voyager and many planetary missions rely on it for long journeys.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d01938b2d9bd�body�١水星又小又热、表面引力弱，加上太阳风强劲，气体分子很容易逃逸到太空，所以留不住厚大气，只有极稀薄的'外逸层'。ِSmall, hot and weakly gravitating, with fierce solar wind, Mercury lets gas molecules escape easily, retaining only an extremely thin exosphere.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�d1b3fb71dd69�body�ٙ典型恒星经历分子云坍缩、主序星、红巨星（或红超巨星），最后以白矮星、中子星或黑洞收场，取决于初始质量。��A typical star passes through molecular-cloud collapse, the main sequence, a red giant (or supergiant) phase, and ends as a white dwarf, neutron star, or black hole depending on its initial mass.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�d4655d336232�body��当质量分布发生非对称的加速变化时，例如双黑洞或双中子星相互绕转并螺旋靠近，就会辐射引力波带走能量。超新星不对称爆发等剧烈事件也能产生。波的频率和强度取决于系统的质量和运动速度。�0Gravitational waves are emitted when a mass distribution accelerates asymmetrically, such as two black holes or neutron stars orbiting and spiraling inward, carrying away energy. Asymmetric supernova explosions can also produce them. The wave frequency and strength depend on the system's mass and speed.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�d48e5b98bd42�body��暗物质通过引力把物质拉到一起，促进星系和星系团的形成，是聚集性的成分；暗能量则表现为产生负压的宇宙学常数，驱动宇宙加速膨胀，是弥散性的排斥成分。两者都不与电磁波直接作用，故无法直接观测。�bDark matter pulls matter together through gravity and fosters the formation of galaxies and clusters—it is a clustering component. Dark energy behaves as a cosmological constant with negative pressure, driving accelerated expansion—a diffuse, repulsive component. Neither interacts directly with electromagnetic waves, so both evade direct detection.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�d57c3fd0a747�body��事件视界是时空中的单向边界，任何越过它的物质或光都无法返回。对于不带电、不旋转的史瓦西黑洞，视界半径为 2GM 除以 c 平方，正比于质量——太阳质量黑洞约 3 公里，而星系中心超大质量黑洞可达数光时尺度。�The event horizon is a one-way boundary in spacetime; nothing that crosses it, even light, can return. For a non-rotating Schwarzschild black hole, its radius is 2GM/c², proportional to mass—about 3 km for a solar-mass hole and up to light-hours for a supermassive one.�ans��src��GShapiro & Teukolsky《黑洞、白矮星与中子星》（Wiley 1983）�NShapiro & Teukolsky, Black Holes, White Dwarfs and Neutron Stars (Wiley, 1983)��id�d5c7493bce61�body��7再电离是指宇宙诞生数亿年后，第一代恒星和星系发出的紫外辐射把弥漫的中性氢重新电离成质子和电子的时期。它结束了宇宙的「黑暗时代」，使宇宙从对光不透明的迷雾变为透明的电离气体状态，这一过程约在红移 6–10 之间完成。�wReionization is the epoch, a few hundred million years after the Big Bang, when ultraviolet radiation from the first stars and galaxies reionized the pervasive neutral hydrogen into protons and electrons. It ended the cosmic dark ages, turning the Universe from an opaque fog into a transparent ionized medium, a process largely completed between redshifts of about 6 and 10.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�d6e9b1b04f1b�body�ٟ火星质量小、引力弱，加上早期核心冷却使全球磁场消失，太阳风长期剥离大气，导致气压极低、液态水难以稳定存在。��Mars is small and weakly gravity-bound; once its core cooled and its global magnetic field vanished, the solar wind steadily stripped away the atmosphere, leaving a very low pressure where liquid water cannot persist.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�d76046ca7fe4�body��当气体螺旋落入黑洞时，在吸积盘内因摩擦和引力压缩被剧烈加热到数百万度，从而发出X射线等高能辐射。越靠近黑洞，物质运动越快、温度越高，亮度也越集中。这正是活动星系核和X射线双星明亮的原因。�EAs gas spirals into a black hole, friction and gravitational compression heat the accretion disk to millions of degrees, emitting high-energy radiation such as X-rays. The closer to the hole, the faster the material moves and the hotter and brighter it becomes. This is why active nuclei and X-ray binaries shine so brightly.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�d77e2c1348cf�body�ِ按形态可分为旋涡星系、椭圆星系和不规则星系；旋涡星系有显著的旋臂，椭圆星系则呈椭球状、恒星较老。ّBy shape they divide into spiral, elliptical and irregular galaxies; spirals show clear arms, while ellipticals are ellipsoidal with older stars.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�d7b5435a6635�body��r主序星正处于稳定燃烧核心氢的阶段，占恒星寿命的约90%；太阳目前就是一颗主序星。ِA main-sequence star is steadily burning hydrogen in its core and spends about 90% of its life there; the Sun is currently a main-sequence star.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�d91203fe73f5�body��天王星的自转轴倾斜约98度，看起来像是横躺着绕太阳公转。科学家普遍认为它在形成早期曾遭一颗巨大天体撞击，被撞翻了过来。这种极端倾斜导致天王星的两极会各自经历长达数十年的连续白昼或黑夜。�-Uranus has an axial tilt of about 98 degrees, so it appears to roll on its side as it orbits the Sun. Scientists generally think a massive object struck it early in its formation and knocked it over. This extreme tilt gives Uranus poles that each experience decades of continuous daylight or darkness.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�da8879a2d9b6�body�ٓ金星浓厚的二氧化碳大气产生极强温室效应，把热量牢牢锁住，表面均温约465°C，反而超过离太阳更近的水星。ٿVenus's thick carbon-dioxide atmosphere creates a runaway greenhouse effect that traps heat, giving a surface average of about 465°C—hotter than Mercury despite being farther from the Sun.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�dc7d23f1a253�body��木星的成分和太阳一样以氢氦为主，也是靠引力收缩发热，但它质量还不够大，核心温度达不到点燃持续核聚变的程度。如果质量再大约80倍，它就能成为一颗恒星。所以木星像是没条件点亮的『迷你太阳』。�Jupiter, like the Sun, is made mostly of hydrogen and helium and radiates heat from gravitational contraction, but it is not massive enough for its core to ignite sustained fusion. About 80 times its mass would be needed to become a star. So Jupiter is like a mini-Sun that never lit up.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�dc968cba563f�body��逃逸速度是从某天体表面出发、无需后续动力就能摆脱其引力束缚所需的最小初速度。地球的逃逸速度约每秒11.2公里，月球仅约2.4公里每秒。质量越大、半径越小，逃逸速度越高，例如黑洞附近的逃逸速度超过光速。�(Escape velocity is the minimum starting speed needed to break free of a body's gravity without further thrust. For Earth it is about 11.2 km/s, but for the Moon only about 2.4 km/s. The larger the mass and the smaller the radius, the higher it is; near a black hole it exceeds the speed of light.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�ddac9ea3f75f�body��原理是撞击坑越多，表面就越古老：古老表面经历了更长时间的陨石轰击，坑密度更高。用月球上已经精确测定年代的岩石对撞击坑密度进行校准，就可以把火星、水星等天体表面的坑密度换算成绝对年龄。�!The principle is that more craters mean an older surface: ancient surfaces have endured bombardment longer and carry higher crater densities. By calibrating crater density against precisely dated lunar rocks, densities on Mars, Mercury and other bodies can be converted into absolute ages.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�ddfa331ec791�body�ٴ土星环几乎全由水冰碎块与岩石组成，大小从尘埃到巨石不等；它们离土星太近，处于洛希极限内，潮汐力阻止了这些物质聚集成卫星。ٸSaturn's rings are almost entirely water-ice chunks and rock, from dust to boulders. They lie inside the Roche limit, where tidal forces prevent the material from clumping into a moon.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�de3d862f2a81�body��大红斑是木星上一个持续了至少数百年的巨型风暴，比地球还要大。它是一个高速反气旋，云层顶端因化学物质和阳光作用呈现红褐色。木星强大的内部热源和快速自转使它上面的风暴可以维持极长时间。�AThe Great Red Spot is a giant storm on Jupiter that has lasted for at least several centuries and is larger than Earth. It is a high-speed anticyclone whose cloud tops appear reddish-brown due to chemicals and sunlight. Jupiter's strong internal heat and rapid rotation allow such storms to persist for very long periods.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�e0456df7fe69�body��那圈亮光来自黑洞外面的吸积盘。落向黑洞的气体一边旋转一边被压缩和摩擦，温度升到几百万度甚至更高，发出强烈的光、紫外线甚至X射线。我们看到的亮光其实是视界之外正在下坠的气体，而不是黑洞本身。�GThe brightness comes from the accretion disk outside the hole. Gas spiralling inward is compressed and heated by friction until it reaches millions of degrees, pouring out intense light, ultraviolet, and even X-rays. What we see glowing is the gas still falling in, just outside the event horizon — not the black hole itself.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�e0854a5a1df4�body��起决定作用的是它诞生时的质量。质量约在8倍太阳质量以下的恒星，死亡后留下白矮星；约8到20多倍太阳质量的恒星会以超新星收场，核心坍缩成中子星；更大的恒星核心则直接坍缩成黑洞。太阳属于白矮星那一类。�VThe deciding factor is the star's mass at birth. Stars below roughly eight solar masses end their lives as white dwarfs; stars of about eight to twenty-plus solar masses blow up as supernovae and their cores collapse into neutron stars; still more massive cores collapse straight into black holes. Our Sun belongs to the white-dwarf category.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�e173da238ddd�body��如果星系质量仅来自可见恒星和气体，外缘恒星的转速应随距离下降。但观测显示转速在很大半径内基本保持平坦，说明存在大量看不见的质量提供额外引力。这一证据是最早支持暗物质的观测之一。�If a galaxy's mass came only from visible stars and gas, outer stars' speeds should drop with distance. Instead, observations show flat rotation curves over large radii, implying unseen mass supplying extra gravity. This was among the earliest observational supports for dark matter.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�e1c1de1416af�body�ٟ恒星诞生于巨大的冷气体尘埃云中，当某一区域因引力坍缩、密度和温度升高到足以点燃核聚变时，一颗恒星就形成了。١Stars form in giant cold clouds of gas and dust; when a region collapses under gravity and becomes hot and dense enough to ignite nuclear fusion, a star is born.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�e1d58e5bc46c�body��7关键原因之一是火星失去大气：火星没有全球性磁场，太阳风能直接剥离大气分子，MAVEN 探测器证实大气正以每秒约 100 克的速度持续流失。随着大气变薄，温室效应减弱，地表液态水蒸发或冻结，火星演化成今天寒冷干燥的沙漠世界。�gOne key cause is that Mars lost its atmosphere: lacking a global magnetic field, the solar wind strips atmospheric molecules directly, and the MAVEN spacecraft has measured losses of roughly 100 grams per second. As the atmosphere thinned, the greenhouse effect weakened, surface water evaporated or froze, and Mars became the cold, dry desert world of today.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�e2bf3cd2fa37�body��千新星是双中子星或中子星—黑洞并合后产生的光学/红外暂现源，其亮度约为新星的一千倍而得名。并合抛出的富中子物质通过 r-过程合成大量金、铂等重元素，并在数天到数周内逐渐变红变暗。�iA kilonova is an optical and infrared transient produced after the merger of two neutron stars or a neutron star and a black hole, so named because its brightness is roughly a thousand times that of a classical nova. The neutron-rich ejecta forge large amounts of gold, platinum and other heavy elements via the r-process, glowing and fading over days to weeks.�ans��src��Abbott et al.《Multi-messenger Observations of a Binary Neutron Star Merger》(ApJL 848, L12, 2017);LIGO-Virgo 科学合作组نAbbott et al., Multi-messenger Observations of a Binary Neutron Star Merger (ApJL 848, L12, 2017); LIGO-Virgo Scientific Collaboration��id�e44b6e05602e�body��i金星自转方向与水星等多数行星相反（逆行），且自转极慢，一天比一年还长。هVenus spins backward (retrograde) compared with most planets, and it rotates so slowly that a single Venus day is longer than its year.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�e46bf7865d79�body��1仙女座星系是离银河系最近的大型旋涡星系，距离约250万光年，肉眼在晴朗夜空可见为一个模糊光斑。它比银河系略大，拥有约一万亿颗恒星。根据观测，仙女座星系正以每秒约110公里向银河系靠近，约40多亿年后两者将相撞合并。�qThe Andromeda Galaxy is the nearest large spiral galaxy to the Milky Way, about 2.5 million light-years away, visible to the naked eye as a faint smudge on clear nights. It is slightly larger than the Milky Way and hosts about a trillion stars. Observations show it approaching us at about 110 km/s and will collide and merge with the Milky Way in some 4 billion years.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�e47add25e673�body�ٱ高速自转使磁轴偏离自转轴，磁极区的加速带电粒子发出定向辐射束，每转一圈就扫过地球一次，于是我们接收到周期性的脉冲信号。ٱFast rotation tilts the magnetic axis from the spin axis, so the beam of radiation from the magnetic poles sweeps past Earth once per turn, giving the periodic pulses we detect.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�e6af2595aff2�body��x上弦和下弦月时，太阳与月球引力方向接近垂直，相互抵消一部分，潮差最小，称为小潮。كAt first and last quarter the Sun and Moon pull at right angles, partly canceling, producing the smallest tidal range—neap tides.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�e7a6d83a179b�body��<小行星采样返回任务让航天器飞到小行星上采集岩石和尘埃，再带回地球实验室做精细分析。日本的隼鸟号系列和美国的奥西里斯-REx任务都成功取回样本，帮助研究太阳系最原始的物质。这些样本比陨石更完整地保留了早期太阳系的成分。�yAn asteroid sample-return mission sends a spacecraft to collect rock and dust from an asteroid and bring it back to Earth labs for detailed analysis. Japan's Hayabusa series and NASA's OSIRIS-REx both succeeded in returning samples, helping study the Solar System's most primitive material. These samples preserve early-Solar-System composition more completely than meteorites.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�e8dff1ca32dc�body�ٱ金星温室失控表面460℃，火星太小留不住水和大气；地球恰好处在宜居带且有磁场与液态水，环境稳定了数十亿年，才给了生命机会。ټVenus suffered runaway greenhouse at 460°C; Mars was too small to hold water and air. Earth sat in the habitable zone with a magnetic field and liquid water, stable for billions of years.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�e9bfd58e6643�body�٧北极星几乎不动，是天然的'天轴'标记，便于定向、定季节和建立坐标；中国、印度、阿拉伯都把它作为星图与导航的基准点。ٻThe pole star barely moves, a natural mark of the sky's axis, handy for orientation, seasons and coordinates; China, India and Arabia all used it as a navigational and charting reference.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�eb708a6dc078�body�ِ气态巨行星（如木星、土星）主要由氢和氦组成，没有固体表面，体积巨大、拥有众多卫星和壮观的行星环。ٓGas giants like Jupiter and Saturn are made mostly of hydrogen and helium with no solid surface, are enormous, and often have many moons and rings.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�ebc9524a5907�body���FRB 是毫秒量级的强射电脉冲，色散量远超银河系贡献，表明源自河外甚至宇宙学距离。多数一次性爆发，少数（如 FRB 121102）为重复暴。其物理起源至今未明，磁星被认为是最可能的来源之一。�FRBs are millisecond-duration strong radio pulses with dispersion measures far exceeding the Milky Way's, indicating extragalactic or cosmological distances. Most are one-off; a few (e.g., FRB 121102) repeat. Their origin is unknown, with magnetars among the leading candidates.�ans��src�ٕLorimer、Bailes、McLaughlin 与 Narkevic,《A Bright Millisecond Radio Burst of Extragalactic Origin》,Science,2007 (DOI: 10.1126/science.1147532)ُLorimer, Bailes, McLaughlin & Narkevic, 'A Bright Millisecond Radio Burst of Extragalactic Origin', Science, 2007, DOI: 10.1126/science.1147532��id�ec01f36a4c3d�body��宇宙在最初约四亿年缺乏发光天体、充满中性氢，被称为黑暗时代。结束它的主要是第一代恒星（星族 III）、早期星系与年轻的类星体，它们释放的紫外光子逐步电离周围气体，最终汇成全宇宙的再电离。�YFor the first roughly four hundred million years the Universe lacked luminous objects and was filled with neutral hydrogen, the so-called dark ages. They were ended chiefly by the first stars (Population III), early galaxies, and young quasars, whose ultraviolet photons progressively ionized the surrounding gas and eventually the whole cosmos.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�ec6f752f7837�body��太阳活动周期约为 11 年，表现为太阳黑子数量与耀斑、日冕物质抛射等活动此消彼长地起伏。它源于太阳内部磁场的周期性翻转，两个 11 年周期（约 22 年）才完成一次完整的磁场极性回复，即海尔周期。�FThe solar activity cycle lasts about 11 years, marked by the rise and fall of sunspot numbers along with flares and coronal mass ejections. It originates from the periodic reversal of the Sun's internal magnetic field, and it takes two 11-year cycles (about 22 years) for the magnetic polarity to fully return, the Hale cycle.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�ec73cfad24df�body��'褐矮星是质量介于最大行星和最小恒星之间的天体，约为13到80倍木星质量，不足以在核心持续进行氢核聚变。它们只能短暂燃烧较重的氘，发出暗弱的红外光，常被称为失败的恒星。褐矮星帮助研究恒星与行星之间的过渡。�JA brown dwarf is an object between the largest planets and the smallest stars, about 13 to 80 times Jupiter's mass, too light to sustain hydrogen fusion in its core. It only briefly burns heavier deuterium and glows faintly in infrared, often called a failed star. Brown dwarfs help study the transition between stars and planets.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�ee93c2f930b8�body��;适居带也叫宜居带，指距离恒星远近合适、液态水能在岩石行星表面稳定存在的一片范围。距离太近会像金星那样热到失控，太远则像火星一样寒冷。但它只考虑距离这一个因素，大气、磁场和地质活动同样重要，所以带内并不保证宜居。�cThe habitable zone is the ring of distances around a star where liquid water can stay stable on a rocky planet's surface. Too close, and the planet overheats like Venus; too far, and it freezes like Mars. But the zone considers only distance; atmosphere, magnetic field, and geology matter just as much, so being inside it is no guarantee of habitability.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�eeeb22b705cd�body�ٷ凌星法看恒星亮度是否被遮挡（测行星半径），径向速度法看恒星因行星引力产生的光谱周期性红蓝移（测行星质量），两者常配合使用。��The transit method watches for dimming by a planet's silhouette (measuring radius), while radial velocity tracks periodic red/blue shifts in stellar spectra from the planet's pull (measuring mass); they are often used together.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�f0e61f61380c�body��2射电望远镜接收天体发出的无线电波而非可见光，通常用巨大的抛物面天线把信号汇聚到接收机。它能穿透尘埃看到被遮挡的星际区域，也用于探测脉冲星、星系和宇宙微波背景。著名的 FAST 天眼就是世界最大的单口径射电望远镜。�WA radio telescope receives radio waves rather than visible light from celestial objects, usually with a large dish that focuses signals to a receiver. It can see through dust into hidden regions of the galaxy and detect pulsars, galaxies, and the cosmic microwave background. The famous FAST is the world's largest single-dish radio telescope.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�f23466b2ec22�body�٥木星主要由氢和氦组成，但质量只有太阳的约千分之一，远未达到氢核聚变所需的核心温度和压力，因此只是行星而非恒星。��Jupiter is mostly hydrogen and helium, but at only about 1/1000 of the Sun's mass it never reached the core temperature and pressure needed for sustained hydrogen fusion, so it is a planet, not a star.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�f32e8671b759�body��,多信使天文学指同时利用引力波、电磁辐射、中微子和宇宙线等多种「信使」来观测同一天体事件的研究方法。通过比对不同信使携带的信息，科学家能更完整地还原天体物理过程的物理本质，例如并合与爆发事件的内部机制。�cMultimessenger astronomy observes the same astrophysical event through multiple messengers such as gravitational waves, electromagnetic radiation, neutrinos, and cosmic rays. By comparing the information each messenger carries, scientists can reconstruct the physical nature of events like mergers and explosions far more completely than with light alone.�ans��src��Abbott et al.《Multi-messenger Observations of a Binary Neutron Star Merger》(ApJL 848, L12, 2017);LIGO-Virgo 科学合作组نAbbott et al., Multi-messenger Observations of a Binary Neutron Star Merger (ApJL 848, L12, 2017); LIGO-Virgo Scientific Collaboration��id�f4d10ace756a�body��太阳耀斑是太阳表面突发的强烈能量释放，伴随高速带电粒子和强X射线。强烈的耀斑可能干扰地球无线电通信、使卫星姿态失控，并威胁宇航员安全。极端情况下还可能引发地磁暴，损坏电网设备。�.A solar flare is a sudden burst of intense energy from the Sun's surface, accompanied by high-speed charged particles and strong X-rays. Strong flares can disrupt radio communications, disturb satellites and endanger astronauts. In extreme cases they trigger geomagnetic storms that damage power grids.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�f74ce9962935�body���本初子午线（0°经线）定的是时刻起点，而日期变更线为避免把同一个国家分到两天、绕开陆地，特意在180°附近弯折，主要关乎'哪天'而非'几点'。٥The prime meridian sets the time origin, but the date line bends near 180° to avoid splitting countries and crossing land—it's about 'which day,' not 'what hour.'�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�f89a06405835�body�ٵ事件视界望远镜是分布在地球上的射电望远镜阵列，通过甚长基线干涉模拟出地球大小的望远镜，2019年首次拍到M87星系中心黑洞的影子。��The Event Horizon Telescope is an array of radio dishes worldwide using very-long-baseline interferometry to mimic an Earth-sized telescope; in 2019 it first imaged the shadow of the black hole in galaxy M87.�ans��src��'事件视界望远镜合作组（EHT）�+Event Horizon Telescope (EHT) Collaboration��id�fb407970ef45�body��这一序列按恒星表面温度从高到低排列（O 最热、蓝，M 最冷、红），由吸收线特征决定：O 型以电离氦线为主，F/G 型见氢与金属的精细线，M 型则由分子带（如氧化钛）主导。它是哈佛分类法的核心。�!The sequence orders stars by decreasing surface temperature (O hottest/blue to M coolest/red), diagnosed by absorption-line features: O shows ionized helium, F/G show hydrogen and metal lines, and M is dominated by molecular bands (e.g., TiO). It is the core of the Harvard classification.�ans��src��HGray《恒星光球的观测与分析》（Cambridge University Press）�WGray, The Observation and Analysis of Stellar Photospheres (Cambridge University Press)��id�fb761ec004b1�body��星系团是由引力束缚在一起的成百上千个星系的集合，例如室女座星系团。多个星系团再聚成更大尺度的超星系团，如包含银河系的本星系群所在的拉尼亚凯亚超星系团。这些结构是宇宙大尺度纤维状网络中的节点。�8A galaxy cluster is a gravitationally bound collection of hundreds to thousands of galaxies, such as the Virgo Cluster. Clusters in turn group into even larger superclusters, like Laniakea, which contains our Local Group including the Milky Way. These structures are nodes in the universe's vast filamentary web.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�fbc02db505f4�body��月球并非完全只露正面，由于『天平动』，它绕地球运动时会有轻微摆动和倾斜，使边缘区域轮流露出。综合几种天平动，我们累计能看到的月面约59%而非严格的50%。其余约41%确实永远背对地球。�The Moon does not show only its near side; thanks to 'libration', slight wobbles and tilts as it orbits let edge regions appear in turn. Combined, the effects let us see about 59 percent of the lunar surface rather than exactly half. The remaining 41 percent truly stays hidden.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�fc2901dab7fc�body�٣II型来自大质量恒星核心坍缩，富含氢；Ia型来自白矮星吸积到钱德拉塞卡极限后的热核爆炸，几乎不含氢且亮度高度一致。��Type II comes from the core collapse of a massive star and is hydrogen-rich; Type Ia is a thermonuclear explosion of a white dwarf reaching the Chandrasekhar limit, nearly hydrogen-free with a very uniform brightness.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�fe50dad9b342�body��*最常用的方法是凌星透射光谱：当行星从恒星前方经过时，部分星光穿过其大气边缘，特定分子会在光谱上留下吸收线。此外也可用发射光谱和反射光谱研究大气的温度与成分。地面和空间望远镜（如JWST）都能开展这类观测。�jThe most common method is transit transmission spectroscopy: as a planet passes in front of its star, some starlight filters through the atmosphere's limb, where specific molecules imprint absorption lines. Emission and reflection spectra also reveal temperature and composition. Both ground- and space-based telescopes, such as JWST, perform these observations.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�ff220fa712e1�body�ي太阳风是太阳持续抛出的带电粒子流，与地球磁场相互作用会产生极光，强爆发时还会干扰卫星和电网。ٺThe solar wind is a steady stream of charged particles from the Sun; interacting with Earth's magnetic field it creates auroras, and strong bursts can disrupt satellites and power grids.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�ffbe17b58ec0�body��/宇宙线能谱在约 10 的 15 次方电子伏处斜率变陡称为膝，通常解释为银河系内加速源能量上限；在约 10 的 18 次方电子伏处斜率再次变平称为踝，常被视为河外宇宙线开始主导、并反映宇宙微波背景对极高能质子的 GZK 截断前过渡。�	The cosmic-ray spectrum steepens at ~10^15 eV (the knee), usually interpreted as the energy limit of Galactic accelerators; it flattens again at ~10^18 eV (the ankle), often seen as extragalactic cosmic rays taking over, before the GZK cutoff from CMB interactions.�ans��src��:皮埃尔·奥杰天文台（Auger）宇宙线能谱测量�8Pierre Auger Observatory cosmic-ray spectrum measurement��id�08d3d84bab2e�body�٧σ8描述宇宙中物质成团的程度；CMB预测的成团性强于今日星系巡天实测，这一“结构增长”差异与H0张力同为现代宇宙学难题。��σ8 measures how clumpy matter is; the CMB predicts more clustering than today's galaxy surveys observe—this 'structure growth' mismatch joins the H0 tension as a modern cosmological puzzle.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�1c5ded7635ed�body�ٽ它是首个被确认的星际天体，形状细长、缺少彗星气体尾，且出现非引力加速，有人猜测是氢冰或光帆，但更朴素解释是释气；其起源仍是谜。��It was the first confirmed interstellar object—elongated, with no gas tail, and showing non-gravitational acceleration. Some speculated hydrogen ice or a light sail, but outgassing is the simpler explanation; its origin remains mysterious.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�1cbdf4517b1d�body��;大碰撞假说认为约 45 亿年前一颗火星大小的天体（Theia）撞击早期地球，溅出的物质盘聚成了月球。关键证据包括地月氧、钛、钨同位素几乎一致（说明同源）、月球挥发性元素匮乏且铁核极小，以及月球岩石年龄与地球最古老矿物相符。��The giant-impact hypothesis holds that about 4.5 billion years ago a Mars-sized body (Theia) struck the early Earth and the debris disk coalesced into the Moon. Key evidence includes the near-identical oxygen, titanium and tungsten isotopes of Earth and Moon (showing common origin), the Moon's depletion in volatile elements and tiny iron core, and lunar rock ages matching Earth's oldest minerals.�ans��src�كCanup, Asphaug,《Origin of the Moon in a giant impact near the end of the Earth's formation》,Nature,2001 (DOI: 10.1038/35089010)فCanup, Asphaug, 'Origin of the Moon in a giant impact near the end of the Earth's formation', Nature, 2001, DOI: 10.1038/35089010��id�295bb3ca12be�body��{它与日常感觉和当时权威的地球中心宇宙观冲突，也缺少直接证据，直到后来观测才被证实。وIt clashed with everyday experience and the accepted Earth-centered view, and lacked direct proof until later observations confirmed it.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�2c47be5d496f�body�ق它离我们约1300光年，是肉眼可见的恒星诞生区，用小型望远镜就能看到粉红色的云气和年轻恒星。�o~1300 light-years away, it's a visible stellar nursery; even small telescopes show pinkish gas and young stars.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�3d6bec11ee14�body��差别在数目、年龄和位置。疏散星团只有几百颗星，束缚松散、形状不规则，是近期由星际云坍缩而成，重元素偏多，多在银盘与旋臂上；球状星团有几十万到上百万颗，被自身引力压成致密球形，金属丰度低，年龄接近银河系本身，在银晕里。易混的是疏散星团终会瓦解：恒星逐个逃逸，加上与分子云擦肩的潮汐扰动，几亿年就散干净，所以太阳的出生星团早已不见；球状星团势阱深才撑到现在。�3The differences lie in membership, age and location. An open cluster holds only a few hundred stars, loosely bound and irregular in shape; it condensed from interstellar gas relatively recently, is comparatively rich in heavy elements, and mostly sits in the galactic disk and spiral arms. A globular cluster may contain hundreds of thousands to over a million stars, compressed by its own gravity into a dense sphere, metal-poor and nearly as old as the Galaxy itself, orbiting in the halo. What gets mixed up is that open clusters are doomed to disperse: stars leak away one by one and tidal shocks from passing molecular clouds strip the rest, so a few hundred million years is enough to scatter them, which is why the Sun's birth cluster is long gone; globulars survive because their deeper potential wells hold on.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�3f557ad8ddee�body��1912 年勒维特在小麦哲伦云中发现造父变星的光变周期越长、本征亮度越亮，建立起可定标的周光关系。哈勃随后用它测出仙女座星系的距离，证明宇宙远超银河系，从而把星系确立为河外岛屿。�cIn 1912 Leavitt found in the Small Magellanic Cloud that Cepheid variables with longer pulsation periods are intrinsically brighter, establishing a calibratable period–luminosity relation. Hubble later used it to measure the distance to Andromeda, proving the universe extends far beyond the Milky Way and establishing galaxies as extragalactic islands.�ans��src��RLeavitt, H.S. 1912, 哈佛天文台通报第 173 号（造父变星周光关系）�YLeavitt, H.S. 1912, Harvard College Observatory Circular, 173 (Cepheid period-luminosity)��id�3ffb75e7993a�body��w根据广义相对论，大质量天体弯曲途经的光线，使背景星系的像被放大、拉伸成弧甚至多像。通过建模透镜的质量分布，可以绘出本身不可见的暗物质团块；强透镜还能把极遥远星系增亮到可被光谱分析的程度。哈勃空间望远镜利用这一效应发现了许多原本无法观测的早期宇宙天体。��General relativity says massive objects bend passing light, magnifying and stretching background galaxies into arcs or multiple images. Modeling the lens mass distribution maps invisible dark-matter clumps, while strong lensing brightens very remote galaxies enough for spectroscopy. The Hubble Space Telescope has used this effect to reveal early-universe objects otherwise too faint to study.�ans��src��kEinstein《Lens-like action of a mass》（1936，Science）；NASA 哈勃空间望远镜引力透镜计划�oEinstein, Lens-like action of a mass (1936, Science); NASA Hubble Space Telescope gravitational lensing program��id�462ef5532cc8�body���手机的指南针和加速度计判断镜头朝向，App 再结合你的位置与时刻，把当时头顶那片天区画到屏幕上，星座连线、行星位置都能实时对齐，等于一张随身星图。用它要注意两件事：金属支架和磁铁会让磁传感器失准，得按提示晃动校准；屏幕上能点出的暗星远多于城市夜空里的肉眼极限，亮度对不上多半是光污染和暗适应的问题，不是它算错了。�#The phone's compass and accelerometer tell the app which way the lens points, and with your location and the time it draws the patch of sky overhead, lining up constellation lines and planet positions as they really are—a pocket star chart. Two things to watch: metal mounts and magnets throw the magnetic sensor off, so shake it to recalibrate when the app asks; and the dim stars it can plot are far more than your naked eye picks out over a city, so a brightness mismatch usually means light pollution and dark adaptation, not bad arithmetic.�ans��src��<Terence Dickinson,《NightWatch》第4版,Firefly Books,2006�nT. Dickinson, NightWatch: A Practical Guide to Viewing the Universe, 4th ed., Firefly Books, 2006; Chinese ed.��id�4f826b1f9682�body��H帕克太阳探测器借助金星引力助推逐步俯冲到距日面仅数百万公里的近日点，直接采样太阳风与原初磁场。它发现日冕中存在翻转的磁性结构（磁开关），并测到比预期更快的加热与加速。这些观测检验了帕克1958年提出的日冕与太阳风动力学理论。�wThe Parker Solar Probe uses repeated Venus gravity assists to dive to perihelia just millions of kilometers above the solar surface, directly sampling the solar wind and pristine magnetic field. It found magnetic switchbacks in the corona and measured faster-than-expected heating and acceleration. These observations tested Parker's 1958 theory of the corona and solar wind.�ans��src��nParker《Dynamics of the interplanetary gas》（1958，ApJ）；NASA 帕克太阳探测器（2018年发射）�_Parker, Dynamics of the interplanetary gas (1958, ApJ); NASA Parker Solar Probe (launched 2018)��id�545ad3682dd3�body�ٲ用宇宙微波背景（普朗克）推算的膨胀率约67 km/s/Mpc，而用局部距离阶梯（造父+Ia）测得约73，两者差异超出误差，暗示可能有新物理。ٻThe expansion rate inferred from the CMB (Planck) is about 67 km/s/Mpc, while the local distance ladder (Cepheids + Ia) gives about 73; the gap exceeds errors and may hint at new physics.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�598806a04f08�body���1610 年伽利略用望远镜看到四颗卫星绕着木星转，其意义不在「多了几颗卫星」，而是当场给出了一个不以地球为中心的引力系统的实物样本: 有四颗天体明显不绕地球，地心说的「一切天体都绕地球」就被证伪了。这也回答了当时反对日心说的最强物理质疑——「如果地球在动，月亮为什么没被甩下？」: 木星带着卫星一起跑，说明被拖着的系统可以正常运作。同一批观察还显示卫星位置随时间规律变化，为后来开普勒第三定律在天文尺度上的成立提供了证据，也是牛顿用同一套引力定律统一天地的一次检验。�gWhat Galileo saw in 1610 - four bodies orbiting Jupiter - mattered not for the extra moons but because it put a real non-geocentric gravitational system on the table: four objects demonstrably did not orbit Earth, which falsified the claim that everything does. It also answered the strongest physical objection to heliocentrism, 'if Earth moves, why is the Moon not left behind?': Jupiter plainly drags its moons along, so a carried system works fine. The regular motion of those moons later gave evidence that Kepler's third law holds at scales beyond Earth, and gave Newton a second arena for one law of gravity.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�6544f34a7638�body�ٺ当前数据基本兼容爱因斯坦的宇宙常数Λ，但也可能暗能量密度随时间变化（w不等于-1）；DESI等巡天正用重子声学振荡检验其是否“演化”。ٿData mostly fit Einstein's cosmological constant Λ, but dark energy could evolve in density (w≠-1); surveys like DESI use baryon acoustic oscillations to test whether it changes with time.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�6d2fdd059192�body��I日冕物质抛射是太阳抛出的数十亿吨带电粒子云，若撞击地球会压缩磁层并引发地磁暴。强烈的地磁暴可扰乱卫星运行、通信与电网，并在高纬度地区产生极光。NASA的SOHO与STEREO卫星通过实时成像追踪抛射物的轨迹，为地球提供数小时到数天的预警。��A coronal mass ejection is a cloud of billions of tons of charged particles hurled from the Sun, and if it hits Earth it compresses the magnetosphere and triggers geomagnetic storms. Strong storms can disrupt satellites, communications, and power grids and produce auroras at high latitudes. NASA's SOHO and STEREO spacecraft track these ejections in real time, giving hours to days of warning for Earth.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�72466f0ae4d2�body�٠星系团是由成百上千个星系在引力下聚集成的更大结构，其间充斥着高温X射线气体和大量暗物质，是宇宙中的“城市”。ٞA galaxy cluster is a gravitationally bound collection of hundreds to thousands of galaxies, filled with hot X-ray gas and dark matter—cities of the cosmos.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�7dc968f3f266�body��q柯伊伯带是位于海王星轨道之外的盘状区域，包含冥王星等冰质天体，是短周期彗星的源地。奥尔特云则是包围太阳系的球壳状云团，距太阳可达数万天文单位，由长周期彗星组成。柯伊伯带由原位形成的残余星子构成，而奥尔特云天体被认为是被巨行星散射到远处的原始物质。��The Kuiper Belt is a disk-shaped region beyond Neptune holding icy bodies like Pluto and serving as the source of short-period comets. The Oort Cloud is a spherical shell tens of thousands of astronomical units away, populated by long-period comets. The Kuiper Belt consists of leftover planetesimals that formed in place, whereas Oort Cloud objects are thought to be primordial material scattered outward by the giant planets.�ans��src�ٲJewitt 与 Luu《Discovery of the Kuiper Belt》（1993，Nature）；Oort《The structure of the cloud of comets》（1950，Bulletin of Astron. Institutes of the Netherlands）�qJewitt & Luu, Discovery of the Kuiper Belt (1993, Nature); Oort, The structure of the cloud of comets (1950, BAN)��id�8602eea5c5f2�body��i韦伯望远镜以6.5米镀金主镜工作于红外波段，其主仪器包括近红外相机NIRCam、近红外光谱仪NIRSpec和中红外仪器MIRI。NIRCam负责高灵敏度成像，NIRSpec能同时对上百个目标做光谱，MIRI则覆盖更长的中红外并自带日冕仪。这些仪器共同让望远镜能回望宇宙再电离时期的早期星系。��The Webb telescope uses a 6.5-meter gold-coated primary mirror operating in the infrared, with principal instruments NIRCam, NIRSpec, and MIRI. NIRCam provides high-sensitivity imaging, NIRSpec obtains simultaneous spectra of more than a hundred targets, and MIRI covers longer mid-infrared wavelengths with a coronagraph. Together they let the telescope look back at the earliest galaxies of the reionization era.�ans��src��vGardner J. P. et al., The James Webb Space Telescope, Space Science Reviews 123 (2006), DOI: 10.1007/s11214-006-8315-7�vGardner J. P. et al., The James Webb Space Telescope, Space Science Reviews 123 (2006), DOI: 10.1007/s11214-006-8315-7��id�89160c5dd276�body��M每种元素在光谱中留下固定位置的明线或暗线，构成天体的化学指纹。当星系远离我们时，这些特征线整体向长波方向平移，红移量通过多普勒效应换算成退行速度。斯里弗和哈勃的早期观测首次把这种红移与距离联系起来，成为宇宙膨胀的直接证据。�`Each element leaves spectral lines at fixed wavelengths, forming a chemical fingerprint of the object. As a galaxy recedes, those features shift toward longer wavelengths, and the redshift converts to recession speed through the Doppler effect. Slipher and Hubble first linked such redshifts to distance, providing direct evidence for cosmic expansion.�ans��src�يSlipher《The Radial Velocity of the Andromeda Nebula》（1913，Lowell Observatory Bulletin）；NASA/ESA 哈勃空间望远镜光谱仪نSlipher, The Radial Velocity of the Andromeda Nebula (1913, Lowell Observatory Bulletin); NASA/ESA Hubble Space Telescope spectrograph��id�8ae41d26e127�body���按质量可分为恒星级黑洞（数倍至数十倍太阳质量）、中等质量黑洞和位于星系中心的超大质量黑洞（百万至百亿倍太阳质量）；还有理论上的原初黑洞。��By mass: stellar-mass (a few to tens of Suns), intermediate-mass, and supermassive black holes at galaxy centers (millions to tens of billions of Suns); primordial black holes are also theorized.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�8c87fc2ecf66�body�٢当恒星过于靠近超大质量黑洞会被潮汐力撕裂，部分物质旋入形成短暂耀发，TDE是研究沉睡黑洞和吸积物理的天然实验室。��When a star strays too close to a supermassive black hole it is torn apart by tides, and some matter spirals in to flare briefly; TDEs are natural labs for dormant black holes and accretion physics.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�8f7a2f1f5580�body��GIa 型超新星来自白矮星达到钱德拉塞卡极限后的热核爆发，其峰值光度高度一致，可校准为绝对星等约 −19.3。比对它们的红移与视亮度后，观测发现遥远的超新星比匀速膨胀模型预期的更暗，说明自约 50 亿年前起膨胀在加速，通常归因为暗能量。��A Type Ia supernova comes from the thermonuclear disruption of a white dwarf near the Chandrasekhar limit, giving a remarkably uniform peak luminosity calibrated to an absolute magnitude near −19.3. Comparing their redshifts with apparent brightness showed distant supernovae fainter than a constant-expansion model predicts, implying acceleration that began roughly 5 billion years ago and is attributed to dark energy.�ans��src��@Riess 等 1998, AJ 116, 1009；Perlmutter 等 1999, ApJ 517, 565�GRiess et al. 1998, AJ, 116, 1009; Perlmutter et al. 1999, ApJ, 517, 565��id�b3c5b573d229�body��~大气会扭曲星光、吸收某些波段并带来光污染，太空里没有这些干扰，能看到更暗更清的天体。�{Atmosphere blurs light, blocks bands and adds glow; in space there's no such interference, seeing fainter, clearer objects.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�b466f87f7e47�body��
开普勒第一定律说行星的轨道是椭圆，太阳坐在其中一个焦点上，圆只是偏心率等于零的特例。平方反比引力下的束缚解本来就是圆锥曲线，椭圆是其中不逃逸的那一类。多数行星的偏心率小于 0.1，看着几乎正圆，偏心率最大的水星也才 0.2 出头。易混的是：太阳在焦点而非中心，行星到太阳的距离在一年里确有变化，但季节并不来自它；何况行星互相摄动，真实轨道也不是闭合的完美椭圆。��Kepler's first law says the orbit of a planet is an ellipse with the Sun at one of its two foci, and a circle is only the special case of zero eccentricity. The bound solutions of an inverse-square gravitational force are conic sections anyway, the ellipse being the class that does not escape. Most planets have eccentricities below 0.1, so their orbits look almost circular, and even Mercury, the most eccentric of them, is just over 0.2. The easy mistake: the Sun sits at a focus rather than the center, so a planet's distance from the Sun really does change over a year, but the seasons do not come from that; and since the planets perturb one another, a real orbit is not a perfectly closed ellipse either.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�b51317db10ec�body��J火星引力较弱且缺乏全球磁场，太阳风粒子能直接剥蚀高层大气。NASA的MAVEN任务测量到火星仍在以每秒约100克的速度损失大气，主要是二氧化碳与水的离子被带电粒子带走。同位素比值显示轻的氩、氢流失更快，证实古代曾拥有更厚、更温暖的大气。��Mars has weak gravity and no global magnetic field, so the solar wind can strip its upper atmosphere directly. NASA's MAVEN mission measured the planet still losing about 100 grams of atmosphere per second, mainly ionized carbon dioxide and water carried off by charged particles. Isotopic ratios show lighter argon and hydrogen escaped faster, confirming an ancient thicker, warmer atmosphere.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�b77a4c21e08f�body��h1998年两个超新星巡天小组通过测量遥远Ia型超新星的亮度，发现它们比无加速度的宇宙模型预期的更暗。这说明宇宙膨胀不但在继续，而且在加速，需要一种具有负压强的能量成分来解释。这一发现后来获得诺贝尔物理学奖，并确立了暗能量约占宇宙能量密度七成的图景。��In 1998 two supernova survey teams found that distant Type Ia supernovae appeared dimmer than expected in a universe expanding without acceleration. This implied that cosmic expansion is not merely continuing but accelerating, requiring an energy component with negative pressure. The result earned a Nobel Prize and established the picture in which dark energy makes up roughly 70 percent of the cosmic energy density.�ans��src�لPerlmutter、Schmidt 与 Riess《超新星宇宙学计划》（1998/1999）；NASA 威尔金森微波各向异性探测器（WMAP）�vPerlmutter, Schmidt & Riess, Supernova Cosmology Project (1998/1999); NASA Wilkinson Microwave Anisotropy Probe (WMAP)��id�be875c423587�body��g宇宙微波背景是宇宙诞生约38万年后、物质与辐射退耦时释放的光子，今天冷却成约2.7开尔文的微波。它的温度涨落只有十万分之一的量级，却记录了原初密度扰动，是宇宙大尺度结构形成的种子。这些各向异性被精确测量后，成为检验宇宙学模型最有力的观测证据之一。��The cosmic microwave background is the relic radiation released about 380,000 years after the Big Bang, when matter and radiation decoupled, now cooled to a nearly uniform 2.7 kelvin microwave glow. Its tiny temperature fluctuations, at the level of one part in 100,000, encode the primordial density variations that seeded all later cosmic structure. The precise mapping of these anisotropies provides one of the strongest observational tests of cosmological models.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�c585b7d19702�body��海卫一沿与海王星自转方向相反的逆行轨道运行，且轨道几乎为正圆。这种不寻常的轨道表明它并非与海王星同时形成，而是一颗被海王星引力捕获的柯伊伯带天体，捕获过程剧烈改变了它的轨道。��Triton orbits Neptune backwards (retrograde) yet on a nearly circular path. Such an unusual orbit indicates it did not form with Neptune but is a captured Kuiper Belt object, with a violent capture reshaping its orbit.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�c766c17f7b9c�body���磁星是一类拥有极强磁场（约10¹⁴–10¹⁵高斯，比普通中子星强千倍）的中子星。其磁场能量偶尔重组会引发剧烈爆发，表现为软伽马重复暴和异常的 X 射线耀发，是宇宙中最强磁场的天体。�IMagnetars are neutron stars with extraordinarily strong magnetic fields (about 10¹⁴–10¹⁵ gauss, a thousand times stronger than ordinary neutron stars). Occasional rearrangements of that field energy unleash violent outbursts—soft gamma repeaters and anomalous X-ray flares—making them the most magnetic objects known.�ans��src��,Duncan 与 Thompson（1992，磁星模型）�(Duncan & Thompson (1992, magnetar model)��id�da97cf934d90�body�٤早期暗能量假说认为宇宙极早期曾存在一段额外的暗能量，加速膨胀以解决H0和σ8张力，是近年热门但尚无定论的修正方案。ٷEarly dark energy hypothesizes an extra episode of dark energy in the very early Universe that briefly sped expansion, proposed to ease the H0 and σ8 tensions—popular but unproven.�ans��src���Gómez-Valent, Zheng, Amendola, Pettorino,《Early and not so early dark energy. What do cosmological observations tell us about them?》,The Sixteenth Marcel Grossmann Meeting,2023 (DOI: 10.1142/9789811269776_0135)��Gómez-Valent, Zheng, Amendola, Pettorino, 'Early and not so early dark energy. What do cosmological observations tell us about them?', The Sixteenth Marcel Grossmann Meeting, 2023, DOI: 10.1142/9789811269776_0135��id�f49b0e7de5a3�body��赫罗图以恒星的光度（或绝对星等）对表面温度（或光谱型）作图，主序、巨星支、白矮星等序列自然浮现，揭示恒星演化阶段。星团在 H–R 图上的主序拐点位置可用来反推其年龄，是恒星定龄的核心方法。�fThe H–R diagram plots stellar luminosity (or absolute magnitude) against surface temperature (or spectral type), and the main sequence, giant branch and white dwarfs emerge as natural sequences revealing evolutionary stage. The main-sequence turnoff position of a star cluster on the diagram lets astronomers infer its age, a core method of stellar dating.�ans��src��<Russell, H.N. 1913, Popular Astronomy 21, 549（赫罗图）�>Russell, H.N. 1913, Popular Astronomy, 21, 549 (H–R diagram)��id�fb4b14686b05�body���原初黑洞是宇宙极早期由密度涨落直接坍缩形成的黑洞，若质量分布合适可贡献部分暗物质，但微引力透镜与微波背景约束已排除了多数质量窗口。ٽPrimordial black holes formed from density fluctuations in the very early Universe could account for some dark matter, but microlensing and CMB constraints have ruled out most mass windows.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�fe95f67a680d�body��e人马座A*是银河系中心质量约400万倍太阳的超大质量黑洞，长期通过周围恒星的轨道被精确认证。事件视界望远镜把全球射电望远镜组成相当于地球大小的干涉阵列，在1.3毫米波长捕捉到环绕黑洞阴影的发光环。2022年公布的影像直接验证了广义相对论在强引力区的预言。��Sagittarius A* is the Milky Way's central supermassive black hole, about 4 million solar masses, confirmed for decades through the orbits of nearby stars. The Event Horizon Telescope linked radio dishes worldwide into an Earth-sized interferometer and captured the glowing ring around the black hole's shadow at 1.3 mm wavelength. The 2022 image directly tested general relativity in the strong-gravity regime.�ans��src�ك事件视界望远镜合作组《First Sagittarius A* image》（2022，ApJL）；Genzel 与 Ghez（2020年诺贝尔物理学奖）�{Event Horizon Telescope Collaboration, First Sagittarius A* image (2022, ApJL); Genzel & Ghez (Nobel Prize in Physics 2020)��id�0022bdc99f2a�body��自行指恒星相对于太阳在天空平面上的表观横向运动，需长期精确观测才能察觉。自行最大的已知恒星是巴纳德星，每年在天空中移动约10.3角秒，是距离我们仅约6光年的红矮星，几百年的观测就足以看出明显位移。�(Proper motion is a star's apparent sideways drift across the sky relative to the Sun, detectable only with long, precise observations. The fastest known is Barnard's Star, moving about 10.3 arcseconds per year; a red dwarf just ~6 light-years away whose shift becomes obvious over mere centuries.�ans��src��mE. E. Barnard,《A small star with large proper-motion》,The Astronomical Journal,1916 (DOI: 10.1086/104156)�eBarnard, 'A small star with large proper-motion', The Astronomical Journal, 1916, DOI: 10.1086/104156��id�00f152c61cf4�body��K2022 年 9 月，DART 探测器以约 6.1 公里每秒的速度主动撞击了近地小行星迪莫波斯，这是人类首次改变小天体轨道的实验。观测确认撞击使迪莫波斯绕迪迪莫斯的轨道周期缩短了约 33 分钟，远超过预期，验证了“动能撞击”这一行星防御手段的可行性。�`In September 2022, the DART spacecraft deliberately slammed into the near-Earth asteroid Dimorphos at about 6.1 km/s, the first human attempt to alter an asteroid's orbit. Measurements confirmed the impact shortened Dimorphos' orbit around Didymos by about 33 minutes, far more than expected, validating kinetic impact as a planetary defense technique.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�017b1dea64aa�body��>生物印记是指可由生命活动产生、且在无生命过程中难以维持的观测特征，典型例子是大气中氧与甲烷同时存在的化学不平衡。在透射光谱中检测到这类气体的异常富集，会被视为潜在生命信号，但必须由非生物学机制严格排除后才能确认。��A biosignature is an observable feature that living processes can produce and that is hard to maintain without life, a classic example being the chemical disequilibrium of oxygen and methane coexisting in an atmosphere. Detecting such anomalous gas enrichments in transmission spectra would be taken as a possible sign of life, but only after non-biological mechanisms are rigorously excluded.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions